  ('874026324015088136', 'Deep In Love', 2025, 'Drama, Family, Soap', 'Nehir Erdem, Ayse Ferda Eryilmaz', 'Ayse Ferda Eryilmaz, Nehir Erdem', 'Ulaş Tuna Astepe, Deniz Baysal, Ava Yaman, Burak Yörük, Yeşim Ceren Bozoğlu, Onur Dilber, Erdem Şanlı, Burcu Cavrar', null, 'In a land where people are accustomed to battling fierce waves and constant storms, the story of a woman who stands tall on her feet, with all her emotional strength, resilience and endurance, and a man who is passionate about his "love" and who competes with the storms of the Black Sea and struggles with its waves, comes to the screens with an effective script... The ups and downs of the mountains, the sea and the human soul are told through the eyes of a stranger who finds himself in the middle of the endless war between two mortal enemies...', 'In a land where people are accustomed to battling fierce waves and constant storms, the story of a woman who stands tall on her feet, with all her emotional strength, resilience and endurance, and a man who is passionate about his "love" and who competes with the storms of the Black Sea and struggles with its waves, comes to the screens with an effective script... The ups and downs of the mountains, the sea and the human soul are told through the eyes of a stranger who finds himself in the middle of the endless war between two mortal enemies...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHIOTJXN9nNTc51WyunL43Fvge3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:302063'),
  ('224703198836663150', 'Deep Insanity: The Lost Child', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Hiro Shimono, Ami Koshimizu, Kohsuke Toriumi, Yuya Hirose, Ruriko Noguchi, Kaede Hondo, Takako Tanaka', 'TV-14', 'Madness and unawakening sleep, Randolph syndrome. This new illness is slowly but steadily approaching humanity, caused by the huge underground world Asylum that appeared in Antarctica. There are strange creatures different from the earth, and unknown resources. People bet their lives on the depths of the mysterious new world to get huge wealth, organizational plots, or their own ambitions. And here alone, a young man with a wish in his heart is trying to challenge the front line of Asylum.', 'Madness and unawakening sleep, Randolph syndrome. This new illness is slowly but steadily approaching humanity, caused by the huge underground world Asylum that appeared in Antarctica. There are strange creatures different from the earth, and unknown resources. People bet their lives on the depths of the mysterious new world to get huge wealth, organizational plots, or their own ambitions. And here alone, a young man with a wish in his heart is trying to challenge the front line of Asylum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msYpjVD5wLRfZDdBTbnSej4tvTC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128118'),
  ('1014393733784519273', 'Deep Night', 2024, 'Drama', 'Guy Suwannaroj', null, 'Paramee Thesdaroon, Piyangkull Saohin, Teerapat Angkanit, Bhurichon Khumsiri, Chalarm Siam Pipatcharoenwong, Dan Aaron Ramnarong, Sun Tananat Lertrungvichien, Tanyares Engtrakul', null, 'Khemthis, heir to the dazzling Deep Night Club, is drawn to Wela, the star host. Yet, their growing closeness is fraught with unexpected challenges.', 'Khemthis, heir to the dazzling Deep Night Club, is drawn to Wela, the star host. Yet, their growing closeness is fraught with unexpected challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TpdCDOZ5dtVwnhFzS24qaUnA2S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234901'),
  ('590997134716014955', 'Deep Space 69', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Daniel Katz', null, 'Richard Gordon, Jeff Lualdi, Kevin McDonald', 'TV-MA', 'Deep Space 69 is an animated sci-fi comedy starring Jay, the horniest alpha man in the universe and his last-of-his-species space koala sidekick, Hamilton. Together they pilot the OGC-1 transport ship for hire across the galaxies, spectacularly failing the simplest of missions and finding romance in the most unexpected corners of space.', 'Deep Space 69 is an animated sci-fi comedy starring Jay, the horniest alpha man in the universe and his last-of-his-species space koala sidekick, Hamilton. Together they pilot the OGC-1 transport ship for hire across the galaxies, spectacularly failing the simplest of missions and finding romance in the most unexpected corners of space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dgMstu4lbtR9hznDYFhU7QR8cZr.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:57777'),
  ('743748009915353318', 'Deep State', 2018, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Matthew Parkhill, Simon Maxwell', null, 'Walton Goggins, Anastasia Griffith, Karima McAdams, Shaleeni Ranchhod', 'TV-MA', 'What happens when a man who believes he has retired from MI6 is called back to do one more job to regain his life, only to discover that this job may mean he has no life to go back to.', 'What happens when a man who believes he has retired from MI6 is called back to do one more job to regain his life, only to discover that this job may mean he has no life to go back to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJgUIqASiJg5nTp8SsKcqTzBpqk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:74712'),
  ('223567595609945619', 'Deep Water', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Shawn Seet', null, 'Noah Taylor, Yael Stone, William McInnes, Jeremy Lindsay Taylor, Craig McLachlan, Ben Oxenbould, George H. Xanthis, Dan Spielman', null, 'Detectives Tori Lustigman and Nick Manning are assigned a brutal murder case in Bondi, where they begin to uncover mounting evidence to suggest the killing is connected to a spate of unexplained deaths, "suicides" and disappearances of gay men throughout the 80s and 90s. Haunted by the disappearance of her teenage brother, Tori''s fascination with the case soon turns to fixation. When more ritualistic murders occur with the same bizarre signature, Tori and Nick will need to put their relationships, their careers and their lives on the line to finally reveal the truth.', 'Detectives Tori Lustigman and Nick Manning are assigned a brutal murder case in Bondi, where they begin to uncover mounting evidence to suggest the killing is connected to a spate of unexplained deaths, "suicides" and disappearances of gay men throughout the 80s and 90s. Haunted by the disappearance of her teenage brother, Tori''s fascination with the case soon turns to fixation. When more ritualistic murders occur with the same bizarre signature, Tori and Nick will need to put their relationships, their careers and their lives on the line to finally reveal the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYY1UWXA8leWG8TNRjMLzTiyeM4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68123'),
  ('1083821838307446544', 'Deep Water', 2019, 'Drama, Documentary', null, null, 'Anna Friel, Rosalind Eleazar, Sinéad Keenan, Leo Ashton', 'TV-MA', 'Follow three women as they each make life-changing mistakes regarding their children and husbands, which lead to unpredictable criminal consequences. Based on Paula Daly''s best selling novel, Windermere.', 'Follow three women as they each make life-changing mistakes regarding their children and husbands, which lead to unpredictable criminal consequences. Based on Paula Daly''s best selling novel, Windermere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WmHTpRCY0yKRgtxVvmT4B3g1eE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92426'),
  ('429227555032910889', 'Deepa & Anoop', 2022, 'Kids, Animation', 'Munjal Shroff, Lisa Goldman, Heather Kenyon', null, 'Pavan Bharaj, Sebastian Billingsley-Rodriguez, Adam Nurada, Zac Siewert', 'TV-Y', 'Joined by her color-changing pet elephant, a joyful little girl creates music, merriment and mischief at her Indian family''s Mango Manor hotel.', 'Joined by her color-changing pet elephant, a joyful little girl creates music, merriment and mischief at her Indian family''s Mango Manor hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLl1rMu0fWHqlVlzeFLWiTwTZjq.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:158697'),
  ('351811188827179664', 'Defendant', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Ji Sung, Uhm Ki-joon, Kwon Yu-ri, Oh Chang-seok, Uhm Hyun-kyung, Son Yeo-eun, Shin Rin-a, Seong Byeong-suk', null, 'Park Jung-Woo is a prosecutor at Seoul Central District Prosecutors'' Office. One day, he wakes up and finds himself in locked up at the police station. He has temporary amnesia. Park Jung-Woo is falsely accused and is sentenced to death. He must struggle to prove his innocence.', 'Park Jung-Woo is a prosecutor at Seoul Central District Prosecutors'' Office. One day, he wakes up and finds himself in locked up at the police station. He has temporary amnesia. Park Jung-Woo is falsely accused and is sentenced to death. He must struggle to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoFTJi6b5Q5eNOArLOTe1Hi1fui.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68890'),
  ('33275928469717911', 'Defenders of the Earth', 1986, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Lee Falk', null, 'Lou Richards, Peter Mark Richman, Peter Renaday, Buster Jones, Ron Feinberg, Loren Lester, Sarah Partridge, Dion Williams', null, 'Defenders of the Earth is an American animated television series produced in 1986, featuring characters from three comic strips distributed by King Features Syndicate—Flash Gordon, The Phantom, and Mandrake the Magician—opposing Ming the Merciless in the year 2015. Supporting characters include their children Rick Gordon, Jedda Walker, Kshin, Mandrake''s assistant Lothar, and Lothar''s son L.J. The show lasted for 65 episodes; there was also a short-lived comic book series published by Star Comics, created by Gerry Conway, Ross Andru and John Romita, Sr.. The closing credits credit Rob Walsh and Tony Pastor for the main title music, and Stan Lee for the lyrics. The series was later shown in reruns on the Sci Fi Channel as part of Sci Fi Cartoon Quest.', 'Defenders of the Earth is an American animated television series produced in 1986, featuring characters from three comic strips distributed by King Features Syndicate—Flash Gordon, The Phantom, and Mandrake the Magician—opposing Ming the Merciless in the year 2015. Supporting characters include their children Rick Gordon, Jedda Walker, Kshin, Mandrake''s assistant Lothar, and Lothar''s son L.J. The show lasted for 65 episodes; there was also a short-lived comic book series published by Star Comics, created by Gerry Conway, Ross Andru and John Romita, Sr.. The closing credits credit Rob Walsh and Tony Pastor for the main title music, and Stan Lee for the lyrics. The series was later shown in reruns on the Sci Fi Channel as part of Sci Fi Cartoon Quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuRklKSdUyQOSI9WR2BxAkRylAf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1794'),
  ('427321141451831352', 'Defending Jacob', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Mark Bomback', null, 'Chris Evans, Jaeden Martell, Michelle Dockery, Cherry Jones, Pablo Schreiber, J.K. Simmons, Daniel Henshall, Betty Gabriel', 'TV-MA', 'A family''s lives are irreparably disrupted when the 14-year-old son is accused of murdering a fellow classmate.', 'A family''s lives are irreparably disrupted when the 14-year-old son is accused of murdering a fellow classmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JTmkzwSDRiS9nvSPwpDB9fmZj2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87784'),
  ('200537851658424804', 'Defending the Guilty', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Kieron Quirke, Alex McBride', null, 'Gwyneth Keyworth, Prasanna Puwanarajah, Hugh Coles, Katherine Parkinson, Will Sharpe', null, 'Will Packham is an idealistic pupil barrister - or idealistic for now. Can Will hold onto his principles and prove he has what it takes?', 'Will Packham is an idealistic pupil barrister - or idealistic for now. Can Will hold onto his principles and prove he has what it takes?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3D6jADtVbX5MdGBIQxYE33MObye.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85222'),
  ('425458724375580661', 'Defiance', 2013, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Rockne S. O''Bannon, Michael Taylor, Kevin Murphy', null, 'Grant Bowler, Julie Benz, Stephanie Leonidas, Tony Curran, Jaime Murray', 'TV-14', 'In the near future, planet Earth is permanently altered following the sudden—and tumultuous—arrival of seven unique alien races. In the boom-town of Defiance, the newly-formed civilization of humans and aliens must learn to co-exist peacefully.', 'In the near future, planet Earth is permanently altered following the sudden—and tumultuous—arrival of seven unique alien races. In the boom-town of Defiance, the newly-formed civilization of humans and aliens must learn to co-exist peacefully.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Xo2D2MX8v4FoHi70Y9jEghJGUI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:51704'),
  ('60061604291438052', 'Defying Destiny', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Daniel Toro, Marggy Selene Valdiris López, Paola González, Karent Hinestroza, Indhira Serrano', null, 'This is the story of María, a leader whose face will become the icon of the social class struggle to grant legal status to domestic workers who, for years, worked without labor rights in her country.', 'This is the story of María, a leader whose face will become the icon of the social class struggle to grant legal status to domestic workers who, for years, worked without labor rights in her country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOyut12kjJ6q1KVuTMgluWzTbg2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:310070'),
  ('389318409327282821', 'Defying Gravity', 2009, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'James D. Parriott', null, 'Laura Harris, Ron Livingston, Christina Cox, Peter Howitt, Malik Yoba, Eyal Podell, Maxim Roy, Andrew Airlie', null, 'In the very near future, a team of eight astronauts embarking on a six-year journey to explore Venus and other planets in the solar system, find their lives and destinies intertwined and carefully directed, not only by Mission Control officials on Earth, but also by an unseen force which is much closer and far more powerful.', 'In the very near future, a team of eight astronauts embarking on a six-year journey to explore Venus and other planets in the solar system, find their lives and destinies intertwined and carefully directed, not only by Mission Control officials on Earth, but also by an unseen force which is much closer and far more powerful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cH8U50mHJ9JkhF5lJktHOvV30pP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8607'),
  ('308902396122335980', 'Degrassi', 2001, 'Drama, Soap', 'Yan Moore, Linda Schuyler', null, 'Aislinn Paul, A.J. Saudin, Demetrius Joyette, Cristine Prosperi, Luke Bilyk, Sarah Fisher, Ana Golja, Lyle Lettau', 'TV-14', 'The life of a group of adolescents going through the trials and tribulations of teendom at Degrassi Community School.', 'The life of a group of adolescents going through the trials and tribulations of teendom at Degrassi Community School.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AfqQ4lZAi9LWyhnHm3VCpm2hLpB.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:1948'),
  ('505688924215954039', 'Degrassi High', 1989, 'Drama', 'Linda Schuyler, Kit Hood', null, 'Siluck Saysanasy, Stacie Mistysyn, Anais Granofsky, Stefan Brogren, Amanda Stepto, Kirsten Bourne, Cathy Keenan, Neil Hope', null, 'Degrassi High is the third television show in the Degrassi series of teen dramas about the lives of a group of teenagers living on or near De Grassi Street in Toronto, Ontario, Canada. It first aired from 1989 to 1991 and followed the young people from The Kids of Degrassi Street and Degrassi Junior High through high school. The show was filmed in downtown Toronto and at Centennial College. Much like its predecessor, Degrassi High dealt with controversial issues ranging from AIDS, abortion, abuse, alcoholism, cheating, sex, death and suicide, dating, depression, bullying, gay rights, homophobia, racism, the environment, drugs, and eating disorders. The show''s impact on Canadian identity is discussed in the September 2007 issue of u''re Magazine.', 'Degrassi High is the third television show in the Degrassi series of teen dramas about the lives of a group of teenagers living on or near De Grassi Street in Toronto, Ontario, Canada. It first aired from 1989 to 1991 and followed the young people from The Kids of Degrassi Street and Degrassi Junior High through high school. The show was filmed in downtown Toronto and at Centennial College. Much like its predecessor, Degrassi High dealt with controversial issues ranging from AIDS, abortion, abuse, alcoholism, cheating, sex, death and suicide, dating, depression, bullying, gay rights, homophobia, racism, the environment, drugs, and eating disorders. The show''s impact on Canadian identity is discussed in the September 2007 issue of u''re Magazine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3Lt9pSBVpLUx1ck4rlF8z7n5p2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4457'),
  ('688496458219632998', 'Degrassi Junior High', 1987, 'Drama', 'Linda Schuyler, Kit Hood', null, 'Billy Parrott, Roger Montgomery, Cathy Keenan, Stefan Brogren, Angela Deiseach, Deborah Lobban, Irene Courakos, Amanda Stepto', null, 'Degrassi Junior High is a Canadian CBC Television teen drama series that was produced from 1987-1989 as part of the Degrassi series. The show followed the lives of a group of students attending the titular fictional school. Many episodes tackled difficult topics such as drug use, child abuse, teenage pregnancy, homosexuality, homophobia, racism, and divorce, and the series was acclaimed for its sensitive and realistic portrayal of the challenges of teenage life. The cast comprised mainly non-professional actors, which added to the show''s sense of realism. The series featured many of the same actors who had starred on The Kids of Degrassi Street a few years earlier, including Stacie Mistysyn, Neil Hope, Anais Granofsky, Sarah Charlesworth and others. However, their character names and family situations had been changed, so Degrassi Junior High cannot, therefore, be considered a direct spinoff. The legal counsel for all the episodes was Stephen Stohn who later became the executive producer of Degrassi: The Next Generation. The series was filmed at the unused Vincent Massey Public School in Etobicoke, Ontario.', 'Degrassi Junior High is a Canadian CBC Television teen drama series that was produced from 1987-1989 as part of the Degrassi series. The show followed the lives of a group of students attending the titular fictional school. Many episodes tackled difficult topics such as drug use, child abuse, teenage pregnancy, homosexuality, homophobia, racism, and divorce, and the series was acclaimed for its sensitive and realistic portrayal of the challenges of teenage life. The cast comprised mainly non-professional actors, which added to the show''s sense of realism. The series featured many of the same actors who had starred on The Kids of Degrassi Street a few years earlier, including Stacie Mistysyn, Neil Hope, Anais Granofsky, Sarah Charlesworth and others. However, their character names and family situations had been changed, so Degrassi Junior High cannot, therefore, be considered a direct spinoff. The legal counsel for all the episodes was Stephen Stohn who later became the executive producer of Degrassi: The Next Generation. The series was filmed at the unused Vincent Massey Public School in Etobicoke, Ontario.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYetgZI5fkmIFsxUGqzryGmql8G.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:173'),
  ('278003463684504642', 'Degrassi: Next Class', 2016, 'Drama', 'Linda Schuyler, Yan Moore', null, 'Eric Osborne, Sara Waisglass, Ricardo Hoyos, Olivia Scriven, Ehren Kassam, Lyle Lettau, André Dae Kim, Ana Golja', 'TV-PG', 'Follow a group of high school freshmen, sophomores, juniors, and seniors from Degrassi Community School, a fictional school in Toronto, Ontario, as they encounter some of the typical issues and challenges common to a teenager''s life.', 'Follow a group of high school freshmen, sophomores, juniors, and seniors from Degrassi Community School, a fictional school in Toronto, Ontario, as they encounter some of the typical issues and challenges common to a teenager''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSbSrFvnLkHeT7XGW68lEjcEaGG.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:65152'),
  ('663602660834275103', 'Dejémonos de Vargas', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Daniel Samper Pizano, Bernardo Romero Pereiro', 'Guido Jácome', 'Carlos Camacho, Margarita Muñoz, Andrea Guzmán, Aco Pérez, Nataly Umaña, Emmanuel Saldarriaga, Melissa Cabrera, Laura Flórez', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0bthLld2QnL0qAoeSkfDa639pz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206164'),
  ('1126784326323302160', 'Dekalog', 1989, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Piesiewicz, Krzysztof Kieślowski', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'The Ten Commandments, exact and uncompromising, literally cast in stone, continues to provide a source of moral conflict in contemporary society. In the ten part epic masterpiece, The Decalogue, Krzysztof Kieslowski examines the dilemma of fundamental sin in the lives of ordinary Warsaw citizens.', 'The Ten Commandments, exact and uncompromising, literally cast in stone, continues to provide a source of moral conflict in contemporary society. In the ten part epic masterpiece, The Decalogue, Krzysztof Kieslowski examines the dilemma of fundamental sin in the lives of ordinary Warsaw citizens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v390wlQKSVpnuGuM3ynruH6PX7x.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42699'),
  ('122774905964743204', 'Delayed Input', 2021, null, 'Kyle Bosman', null, 'Kyle Bosman', null, 'Delayed Input revolves around thoughtful, sometimes humorous, and always engaging takes on the gaming industry, including game reviews, industry trends, and deeper reflections on gaming culture.', 'Delayed Input revolves around thoughtful, sometimes humorous, and always engaging takes on the gaming industry, including game reviews, industry trends, and deeper reflections on gaming culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zPvGj5rEvyeGt91bKiY5eO6TYQ.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:302295'),
  ('898999773575441359', 'Delayed Justice', 2020, 'Drama', 'Park Sang-kyu, Jung Woong-in, Kim Kap-su', 'Park Sang-kyu', 'Kwon Sang-woo, Kim Joo-hyun, Jung Woong-in, Kim Eung-soo, Cho Seong-ha, Kim Kap-soo, Lee Won-jong, Park Ji-il', null, 'A reporter and a public defender fight for judicial victims who are falsely accused.', 'A reporter and a public defender fight for judicial victims who are falsely accused.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3flPPTmIbl4FouKzwoZ7iIdsno.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112322'),
  ('1101244552059018909', 'dele', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Takayuki Yamada, Masaki Suda, Kumiko Aso', null, 'Freelance programmer Sakagami is paralyzed in the lower half of his body and confined to a wheelchair. He sets up a company called dele.LIFE in partnership with a law firm established by his late father. At the request of clients, Sakagami works together with a freelance jack-of-all-trades Mashiba to delete all unfavorable digital records of their clients left in their computers and smartphones after they die. They are not supposed to see inside the files but when they feel something strange in the client’s death, they cannot help getting involved.', 'Freelance programmer Sakagami is paralyzed in the lower half of his body and confined to a wheelchair. He sets up a company called dele.LIFE in partnership with a law firm established by his late father. At the request of clients, Sakagami works together with a freelance jack-of-all-trades Mashiba to delete all unfavorable digital records of their clients left in their computers and smartphones after they die. They are not supposed to see inside the files but when they feel something strange in the client’s death, they cannot help getting involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uj9WKJ0jIZFnJWznfSOImaQR7Ke.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81181'),
  ('1049040549122908723', 'Delete', 2013, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Keir Gilchrist, Erin Karpluk, Ryan Robbins, Gil Bellows, Seth Green, Matt Frewer, Janet Kidder, Andrew Airlie', 'TV-MA', 'Delete imagines a disaster in our all-too-fragile digital world where all computers could become dangerously self-aware with one systematic purpose–to destroy mankind. Faced with possible extinction, there is only one way out–create a second artificial intelligence, just as alive, just as intelligent and just as dangerous.', 'Delete imagines a disaster in our all-too-fragile digital world where all computers could become dangerously self-aware with one systematic purpose–to destroy mankind. Faced with possible extinction, there is only one way out–create a second artificial intelligence, just as alive, just as intelligent and just as dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLuGgssJPijVIjJnr49PjSrKyYc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63822'),
  ('720008702284212876', 'Delete', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama', null, null, 'Nat Kitcharit, Natara Nopparatayapon, Sarika Sathsilpsupa, Chutimon Chuengcharoensukying, Charlette Wasita Hermenau, Jinjett Wattanasin, Nopachai Jayanama, Sompob Benjathikul', null, 'A pair of lovers having an extramarital affair plot a new life together after discovering a phone that can erase other people from existence.', 'A pair of lovers having an extramarital affair plot a new life together after discovering a phone that can erase other people from existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEbf9llYilJuBQ5406Fh7JKenq9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218994'),
  ('414514209867578133', 'Delete Me', 2021, 'Drama', 'Marie Kleivdal Kristiansen', 'Marie Kleivdal Kristiansen', 'Sofia Tjelta, Nicoline Devik, Happy Jankell, Erik Enge', null, 'Two best friends Marion and Marit are about to finish high school and in a world where status is everything, they learn that an innocent little joke can go viral and change their lives forever.', 'Two best friends Marion and Marit are about to finish high school and in a world where status is everything, they learn that an innocent little joke can go viral and change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEq2gecfSew8PNGATX6yfnYVHl0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:119039'),
  ('176876582392219875', 'Delhi Crime', 2019, 'Crime', 'Richie Mehta', null, 'Shefali Shah, Rasika Dugal, Avijit Dutt, Adil Hussain, Yashaswini Dayama, Rajesh Tailang, Jaya Bhattacharya, Gopal Datt', 'TV-MA', 'Following the police force as they investigate high-profile crimes in Delhi, this series has seasons inspired by both real and fictional events.', 'Following the police force as they investigate high-profile crimes in Delhi, this series has seasons inspired by both real and fictional events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkpkTj6KGsjSaet0VQaq0aTn31D.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:87508'),
  ('432008700609210581', 'Deli Boys', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Abdullah Saeed', null, 'Asif Ali, Saagar Shaikh, Poorna Jagannathan', 'TV-MA', 'When their convenience store-magnate father suddenly dies, a pair of pampered Pakistani American brothers lose everything and are forced to reckon with their Baba''s secret life of crime as they attempt to take up his mantle in the underworld.', 'When their convenience store-magnate father suddenly dies, a pair of pampered Pakistani American brothers lose everything and are forced to reckon with their Baba''s secret life of crime as they attempt to take up his mantle in the underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MOIHM9P4CqYiSeOQM4PbhXzA8z.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:226346'),
  ('283019010485540358', 'Delicacies Destiny', 2022, 'Drama', 'Yang Le', null, 'He Ruixian, Wang Xingyue, Pan Binlong, Liu Min, Jackie Li, Ji Jiahe, Feng Man, Bu Guanjin', 'TV-14', 'A talented and kind chef, Ling Xiaoxiao, is accepted into the delicacy role of chef in an Imperial palace thanks to the appreciative appetite of the Crown Prince, Zhu Shoukui. Set on becoming the best Imperial Chef, with the Prince''s help, Ling tries to navigate the pitfalls of palace life while remaining true to her goals in the face of forbidden love.', 'A talented and kind chef, Ling Xiaoxiao, is accepted into the delicacy role of chef in an Imperial palace thanks to the appreciative appetite of the Crown Prince, Zhu Shoukui. Set on becoming the best Imperial Chef, with the Prince''s help, Ling tries to navigate the pitfalls of palace life while remaining true to her goals in the face of forbidden love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zVa92V94K9RNF2Odci4CRvtPd1X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197107'),
  ('1063080850166844708', 'Delicious', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dan Sefton', null, 'Dawn French, Emilia Fox, Tanya Reynolds, Aaron Anthony, Vincent Regan, Rhashan Stone, Sheila Hancock, Iain Glen', 'TV-PG', 'Gina is a Cornish chef who is suddenly forced to evaluate her closest relationships. A comedic drama series about food, love and infidelity in Cornwall.', 'Gina is a Cornish chef who is suddenly forced to evaluate her closest relationships. A comedic drama series about food, love and infidelity in Cornwall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hx3EgLAlnxkdJAeNpTyWdILfhYk.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:69370'),
  ('465039398209726234', 'Delicious in Dungeon', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kentaro Kumagai, Sayaka Senbongi, Asuna Tomari, Hiroshi Naka', 'TV-MA', 'Dungeons, dragons... and delicious monster stew!? Adventurers foray into a cursed buried kingdom to save their friend, cooking up a storm along the way.', 'Dungeons, dragons... and delicious monster stew!? Adventurers foray into a cursed buried kingdom to save their friend, cooking up a storm along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9t3DYdGxK3i4WRzKvIZwJd4kBnr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:207784'),
  ('626458143948427242', 'Delicious Party Precure', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Family', null, null, 'Hana Hishikawa, Risa Shimizu, Yuka Iguchi, Ai Kayano, Natsumi Takamori, Natsumi Hioka, Tomoe Hanba, Yuma Uchida', null, 'The mysterious, delicious world of CooKingdom, which rules over all the cuisine in this world. CooKingdom has closely guarded the Recipe-Bon, in which it''s written how to prepare any dish. But, oh no! One day, it gets stolen by the Bundoru Gang! The Bundoru Gang plans to monopolize everything for themselves, and their next target is the Cuisine Fairy Recipeppi... The Energy Fairies have come to Oishi-Na Town in the human world in search of the Recipe-Bon. With their help, an unexpected turn of events leads to three ordinary girls transforming into Pretty Cures!', 'The mysterious, delicious world of CooKingdom, which rules over all the cuisine in this world. CooKingdom has closely guarded the Recipe-Bon, in which it''s written how to prepare any dish. But, oh no! One day, it gets stolen by the Bundoru Gang! The Bundoru Gang plans to monopolize everything for themselves, and their next target is the Cuisine Fairy Recipeppi... The Energy Fairies have come to Oishi-Na Town in the human world in search of the Recipe-Bon. With their help, an unexpected turn of events leads to three ordinary girls transforming into Pretty Cures!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRGlBWKNWdrFfW0VN9DwuSdJfJa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156197'),
  ('207309361413256122', 'Delicious Proposal', 2001, 'Drama', null, 'Kim In Young', 'Son Ye-jin, So Ji-sub, Kwon Sang-woo, So Yoo-jin, Jung Jun, Ji Sung, Park Kwang-jung, Hong Soo-hyun', null, 'Hyo Dong, the son of a struggling Chinese restaurant owner, falls in love with Hee Ae, who, unbeknownst to Hyo Dong, is the daughter of a ruthless rival who is out to destroy his father''s restaurant. Hyo Dong and Hee Ae are in the same cooking class as Shin Ae, a poor girl who dreams of owning a successful restaurant despite having a tough life.', 'Hyo Dong, the son of a struggling Chinese restaurant owner, falls in love with Hee Ae, who, unbeknownst to Hyo Dong, is the daughter of a ruthless rival who is out to destroy his father''s restaurant. Hyo Dong and Hee Ae are in the same cooking class as Shin Ae, a poor girl who dreams of owning a successful restaurant despite having a tough life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1G0dCFcHIaaXk5sj7zEThJnOTH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:2943'),
  ('58379064057565023', 'Delicious Rendezvous', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Yang Se-hyung, Paik Jong-won, Choi Won-young, Kwak Dong-yeon, Choi Ye-bin', 'TV-14', 'Baek Jong Won is here again to help out an industry. This time, he goes all out to promote local food. He visits various regions and learn about their local produce. By creating different meals with these ingredients, Mr. Baek is able to sell them in rest stops. Yang Se Hyeong, Kim Hee Chul, and Kim Dong Jin are here to assist.', 'Baek Jong Won is here again to help out an industry. This time, he goes all out to promote local food. He visits various regions and learn about their local produce. By creating different meals with these ingredients, Mr. Baek is able to sell them in rest stops. Yang Se Hyeong, Kim Hee Chul, and Kim Dong Jin are here to assist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMaDXIIe6FvPbMebp0L5uPBlt0h.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93853'),
  ('463993078021358625', 'Delico''s Nursery', 2024, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Masakazu Morita, Katsuyuki Konishi, Hiro Shimono, Takuya Sato, Rina Hidaka, Konomi Kohara, Ayasa Ito, Yuu Wakui', 'TV-14', 'Hailing from a prestigious noble house, Dali Delico is an elite member of the Blood Pact Council, the highest governing body of the Vamps. Yet, Dali flatly refuses a mission the Vamps assign him. As Dali’s motives and possible connection to mysterious murders begin to mount, council members Gerhard, Dino, and Henrique visit him in hopes he’ll reconsider, but find him soothing an infant child!', 'Hailing from a prestigious noble house, Dali Delico is an elite member of the Blood Pact Council, the highest governing body of the Vamps. Yet, Dali flatly refuses a mission the Vamps assign him. As Dali’s motives and possible connection to mysterious murders begin to mount, council members Gerhard, Dino, and Henrique visit him in hopes he’ll reconsider, but find him soothing an infant child!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bbE584icNWcdcoEkIVePmjHI0V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232252'),
  ('842818483843803717', 'Delightfully Deceitful', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Lee Soo-hyun, Han Woo-joo', null, 'Chun Woo-hee, Kim Dong-wook, Yoon Park, Park So-jin, Lee Yeon, Yoo Hee-je, Hong Seung-bum, Kim Tae-hun', null, 'After a decade behind bars, a brilliant con artist teams up with an empathetic lawyer — and together, they dig into the case that changed her life.', 'After a decade behind bars, a brilliant con artist teams up with an empathetic lawyer — and together, they dig into the case that changed her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsGHK1Hf3vdD56XPe0d5N7HRa15.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210218'),
  ('69237200034178633', 'Delirium', 2014, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Emma Roberts, Billy Campbell, Gregg Sulkin, Ian Anthony Dale, Michael Michele, Erin Cahill, Melinda McGraw, Jeanine Mason', null, 'Set in a world where love is deemed illegal and can be eradicated with a special procedure. With 95 days to go until her scheduled treatment, Lena Holoway does the unthinkable, she falls in love.', 'Set in a world where love is deemed illegal and can be eradicated with a special procedure. With 95 days to go until her scheduled treatment, Lena Holoway does the unthinkable, she falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ognhEEPaAmki6G0qx9Jn06cn2CL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:84274'),
  ('236756935610845489', 'Delirium', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Estefania Piñeres, Juan Pablo Raba, Juan Pablo Urrego, Paola Turbay, José Julián Gaviria, Jacobo Diez, Salvador del Solar, Fernando Bocanegra Delgado', 'TV-MA', 'When his wife Agustina falls into delirium, a professor delves into her dark past to piece together her story and uncover the cause of her madness.', 'When his wife Agustina falls into delirium, a professor delves into her dark past to piece together her story and uncover the cause of her madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19zFTSlEkgBOVJT4xSrb5gGyB7s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:294282'),
  ('467922328633228816', 'Deliver Me', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Jhullian Carlsson, Ane Dahl Torp, Henrik Norlén, Ardalan Esmaili, Mahmut Suvakci, Yusra Warsama, Solomon Njie, Yasir Hassan', null, 'When teenagers Billy and Dogge are recruited by a local gang, the friends face a violent world they are too young to protect themselves from.', 'When teenagers Billy and Dogge are recruited by a local gang, the friends face a violent world they are too young to protect themselves from.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqKS18KIHwoLpBVKgqqAPfAIat.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231738'),
