  ('340580215925906002', 'Deputy', 2020, 'Western, Drama, Crime', 'Will Beall', null, 'Stephen Dorff, Yara Martinez, Brian Van Holt, Bex Taylor-Klaus, Shane Paul McGhie, Mark Moses, Danielle Moné Truitt, Valeria Jauregui', 'TV-14', 'When the Los Angeles County’s Sheriff dies, an arcane rule forged back in the Wild West thrusts the most unlikely man into the job: a fifth-generation lawman, more comfortable taking down bad guys than navigating a sea of politics, who won’t rest until justice is served.', 'When the Los Angeles County’s Sheriff dies, an arcane rule forged back in the Wild West thrusts the most unlikely man into the job: a fifth-generation lawman, more comfortable taking down bad guys than navigating a sea of politics, who won’t rest until justice is served.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dlnbNP169odKEYKCfzBipRrUDdk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89498'),
