  ('135588549072804240', 'Destined with You', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Nam Ki-hoon, Noh Ji-sul', null, 'Rowoon, Cho Bo-ah, Ha Jun, Yura, Lee Pil-mo, Lee Bong-ryeon, Hyun Bong-sik, Song Young-gyu', 'TV-MA', 'A lawyer bound by a centuries-old curse becomes entangled with a civil servant who holds the key to his freedom — igniting an unexpected romance.', 'A lawyer bound by a centuries-old curse becomes entangled with a civil servant who holds the key to his freedom — igniting an unexpected romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e21UFBbQStpqSkU4iyWwVJsb8DZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:215001'),
  ('869173163447932365', 'Destiny of the Shrine Maiden', 2004, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayako Kawasumi, Tomo Shigematsu, Ai Nonaka, Omi Minami, Yukiko Tagami, Junji Majima, Mamiko Noto, Chinami Nishimura', null, 'There is a small town somewhere in Japan, which is surrounded by nature. In this town, there is a large and gorgeous school, Otobashi Gakuen; which was founded to make the students familiar with nature. This story starts off with Kurusugawa Himeko. She is a normal student who goes to Otobashi Gakuen. She leads bright and enjoyable school days with her two friends, Himekawa Chikane and Oogami Souma. Chikane is the only daughter of a distinguished family. She excels at both academics and sports. She is also kind and beautiful, making her very popular among the other students. Oogami Souma is Himeko’s childhood friend. He has problems expressing his emotions directly, but he is very sincere. On Himeko''s 16th birthday, a dark moon blocks out the sun, and the Orochi come forth to destroy the world. But why are they targetting Himeko...?', 'There is a small town somewhere in Japan, which is surrounded by nature. In this town, there is a large and gorgeous school, Otobashi Gakuen; which was founded to make the students familiar with nature. This story starts off with Kurusugawa Himeko. She is a normal student who goes to Otobashi Gakuen. She leads bright and enjoyable school days with her two friends, Himekawa Chikane and Oogami Souma. Chikane is the only daughter of a distinguished family. She excels at both academics and sports. She is also kind and beautiful, making her very popular among the other students. Oogami Souma is Himeko’s childhood friend. He has problems expressing his emotions directly, but he is very sincere. On Himeko''s 16th birthday, a dark moon blocks out the sun, and the Orochi come forth to destroy the world. But why are they targetting Himeko...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUveLutu5d9nbJr94XyyF0QjOzh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46423'),
  ('109633427698070316', 'Destiny River', 2010, 'Soap, Drama, Family', 'Walther Negrão', 'Jackie Vellego, Renato Modesto, Fausto Galvão', 'Murilo Rosa, Milena Toscano, Cleo, Lima Duarte, Júlia Lemmertz, Thiago Fragoso, Suzana Pires, Raphael Viana', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ichhlfiSApoFlaIeuZkK3nKIszq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46145'),
  ('966532006577867264', 'Destiny Seeker', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Chiffon_cake', null, 'Nuttawatt Thanathaveeprasert, Chitsanupong Soeksiri, Nattapat Suwanich, Natthaphon Musikanan, Supanut Sudjinda, Bhurichon Khumsiri, Chawanakorn Donmongkol, Lissa Wonson', null, 'Generational dorm rivalries force two engineering students to act as foes, even as they struggle with hidden feelings and painful jealousy.', 'Generational dorm rivalries force two engineering students to act as foes, even as they struggle with hidden feelings and painful jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5eOKoiDyQoArUktTbMOVVgtvKB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220398'),
  ('581746786146368370', 'Desus & Mero', 2016, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, 'Desus Nice, The Kid Mero', 'TV-MA', 'The Bronx''s very own Desus Nice and The Kid Mero, aka the Bodega Boys, give you their takes on politics, sports, entertainment and other subjects they don''t really know about. The brand is strong! Watch this because Mero has mad kids and Desus loves sneakers and they’re funny and the other late night shows are corny AF.', 'The Bronx''s very own Desus Nice and The Kid Mero, aka the Bodega Boys, give you their takes on politics, sports, entertainment and other subjects they don''t really know about. The brand is strong! Watch this because Mero has mad kids and Desus loves sneakers and they’re funny and the other late night shows are corny AF.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dU33kLbobmzwWTk8XhmkbMgR0sc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68319'),
  ('1035796104843626679', 'Desus & Mero', 2019, 'Talk, Comedy', null, null, 'Desus Nice, The Kid Mero', 'TV-MA', 'The first ever weekly late-night talk show on Showtime features popular TV and podcast personalities Desus and Mero speaking off the cuff and chatting with guests at the intersection of pop culture, sports, music, politics and more.', 'The first ever weekly late-night talk show on Showtime features popular TV and podcast personalities Desus and Mero speaking off the cuff and chatting with guests at the intersection of pop culture, sports, music, politics and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dORUJPK1JSprVK8vkfejtZ2HiQ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:84970'),
  ('674062213628791751', 'Detatoko Princess', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuko Miyamura, Akio Otsuka, Aya Hisakawa, Eriko Kawasaki, Maria Kawamura, Michiko Neya, Mika Kanai, Shiho Niiyama', null, 'After a prank gone wrong, Princess Lapis must undergo a long journey back home to the Diamond Palace. With her for this adventure are a young sprite, a directionally challenged immortal, and her math tutor. Armed with the powerful magic eraser, and an unmatched love of pudding, Lapis continues forth righting the injustices of the world and defeating magical foes.', 'After a prank gone wrong, Princess Lapis must undergo a long journey back home to the Diamond Palace. With her for this adventure are a young sprite, a directionally challenged immortal, and her math tutor. Armed with the powerful magic eraser, and an unmatched love of pudding, Lapis continues forth righting the injustices of the world and defeating magical foes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZVyAdYSThBJi0Cb3MPFIIlYaWS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44938'),
  ('350685705211567408', 'Detective Academy', 2019, 'Reality, Mystery', 'Violet He', null, 'Stefan Guo, Qi Sijun, Shao Ming Ming, Tang Jiuzhou, Vincent Cao, Huo Shu, Lee Jinye', null, '"Detective College", as a derivative of the fifth season of "Who''s the Murderer", is a star reasoning variety show where selected detective assistants launched by Mango TV. The star guests determine the number of advances by rolling the dice on the checkerboard. When the game is triggered, the corresponding game needs to be completed. The first guest to reach the end becomes the current No.1. The program combines the form of team battles and individual battles to inspire the star guests ’IQ and Contest of logical ability. No. 1 selected in the show will appear on the scene of the fifth season of "Who''s the Murderer". "Detective College" consists of Pu Yixing, Zhou Junwei, Tang Jiuzhou, Qi Sijun, Shi Kai, Guo Wentao, Shao Mingming, etc., and premiered on November 3, 2019.', '"Detective College", as a derivative of the fifth season of "Who''s the Murderer", is a star reasoning variety show where selected detective assistants launched by Mango TV. The star guests determine the number of advances by rolling the dice on the checkerboard. When the game is triggered, the corresponding game needs to be completed. The first guest to reach the end becomes the current No.1. The program combines the form of team battles and individual battles to inspire the star guests ’IQ and Contest of logical ability. No. 1 selected in the show will appear on the scene of the fifth season of "Who''s the Murderer". "Detective College" consists of Pu Yixing, Zhou Junwei, Tang Jiuzhou, Qi Sijun, Shi Kai, Guo Wentao, Shao Mingming, etc., and premiered on November 3, 2019.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuUvhZ2WLqX1z0b1NXkapWoov9j.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:114473'),
  ('1014828807343173253', 'Detective Anna', 2016, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', 'Pavel Kim, Mariya Kretinina, Sergei Golubev', null, 'Alexandra Nikiforova, Dmitry Frid, Sergey Druzyak, Boris Khvoshnyanskiy, Irina Sidorova, Andrey Ryklin, Algis Arlauskas, Elena Polyakova', null, 'Nineteen-year-old Anna, living at the end of the nineteenth century in the town of Zatonsk, unexpectedly discovers that she possesses supernatural powers. The spirits of the dead literally haunt her, begging to help. Aided by her visions, Anna manages to investigate and solve a number of mysterious crimes which have baffled the police. An experienced detective, 37-year-old Yakov Shtolman, who is assigned to the police department and teams up with Anna and becomes her partner in hunting down criminals.', 'Nineteen-year-old Anna, living at the end of the nineteenth century in the town of Zatonsk, unexpectedly discovers that she possesses supernatural powers. The spirits of the dead literally haunt her, begging to help. Aided by her visions, Anna manages to investigate and solve a number of mysterious crimes which have baffled the police. An experienced detective, 37-year-old Yakov Shtolman, who is assigned to the police department and teams up with Anna and becomes her partner in hunting down criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahDG2t2iy3GppnYrX2TsBmBEl4r.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:70218'),
  ('824264098908567011', 'Detective Chinatown', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Chen Sicheng', 'Chen Sicheng', null, null, 'Strange crimes occur in Thailand as the ranking for the world''s best detective sees a shift. New detectives come into the picture to tackle three difficult cases.', 'Strange crimes occur in Thailand as the ranking for the world''s best detective sees a shift. New detectives come into the picture to tackle three difficult cases.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIFUJnpJhs4RjG0LHlyHj3wVb5K.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:97317'),
  ('79110165824664443', 'Detective Club', 2017, 'Reality, Crime, Mystery', 'He Chen, Yan Ji', null, 'He Jiong, Wowkie Zhang, Qi Sijun', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFAf5vcVYg5hM3H3pPn3NW0U3gx.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:219497'),
  ('1081773881282246192', 'Detective Conan', 1996, 'Animation, Crime, Mystery, Comedy', null, null, 'Minami Takayama, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wakana Yamazaki, Akira Kamiya, Rikiya Koyama, Megumi Hayashibara, Kenichi Ogata, Yukiko Iwai', 'TV-14', 'The son of a world famous mystery writer, Jimmy Kudo, has achieved his own notoriety by assisting the local police as a student detective. He has always been able to solve the most difficult of criminal cases using his wits and power of reason.', 'The son of a world famous mystery writer, Jimmy Kudo, has achieved his own notoriety by assisting the local police as a student detective. He has always been able to solve the most difficult of criminal cases using his wits and power of reason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRIEFvHRy01OYzmXQBbGeW0Qilc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30983'),
  ('93992055955005734', 'Detective Forst', 2024, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, 'Agata Malesińska, Jacek Markiewicz', 'Borys Szyc, Andrzej Bienias, Zuzanna Saporznikow, Kamilla Baar, Szymon Wróblewski, Piotr Franasowicz, Aleksandra Grabowska, Artur Barciś', 'TV-MA', 'Atop a Polish mountain, a gruff detective with unusual methods investigates the bizarre murder of an unpopular professor.', 'Atop a Polish mountain, a gruff detective with unusual methods investigates the bizarre murder of an unpopular professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytup0GuAcb2jjuux2IgPAMSqVNN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217522'),
  ('1150476759643415846', 'Detective Hole', 2026, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Jo Nesbø', null, 'Tobias Santelmann, Joel Kinnaman', 'TV-MA', 'When a series of ritualistic murders hits Oslo, a gifted detective must navigate a puzzle of patterns, corruption and his own demons to catch the killer.', 'When a series of ritualistic murders hits Oslo, a gifted detective must navigate a puzzle of patterns, corruption and his own demons to catch the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j61dmzEq4aRWJZk5tPyjzpHj8T2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249597'),
  ('729992340778028323', 'Detective Investigation Files', 1995, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Louis Koo, Jessica Hsuan, Sunny Chan Kam-Hung, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Lee San-San, Maggie Shiu, Andy Tai Chi-Wai, Samuel Kwok Fung', null, '"Detective Investigation Files" revolves around the professional and meticulous investigations carried out by a group of dedicated police officers. As they delve into mysterious deaths with unclear causes, they tirelessly work towards maintaining peace and security for the people. However, their demanding job often comes at the expense of personal happiness. Cheung Dai Yong, a brilliant and astute police officer, has a track record of solving crucial cases. His trusted colleague, Lee Chung Yee, stands by his side, and together they tackle challenging and complex cases. Amidst their work, Dai Yong encounters Ko Jit, a tenacious journalist. Despite their initial conflicts, a deepening connection blossoms between them. However, Ko Jit already has a romantic partner.', '"Detective Investigation Files" revolves around the professional and meticulous investigations carried out by a group of dedicated police officers. As they delve into mysterious deaths with unclear causes, they tirelessly work towards maintaining peace and security for the people. However, their demanding job often comes at the expense of personal happiness. Cheung Dai Yong, a brilliant and astute police officer, has a track record of solving crucial cases. His trusted colleague, Lee Chung Yee, stands by his side, and together they tackle challenging and complex cases. Amidst their work, Dai Yong encounters Ko Jit, a tenacious journalist. Despite their initial conflicts, a deepening connection blossoms between them. However, Ko Jit already has a romantic partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wivAFRPJJTvV8nloc2HjcwdeWxh.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71971'),
  ('654223298170817719', 'Detective Ke Chen', 2019, 'Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Wu Gang, Huang Zhizhong, Zuo Xiaoqing, Sha Yi, Ke Lan, Tan Kai, King Shih-chieh, Bai Zhidi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGqTevE4TGfcllEa4tcUNhnqv5v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90597'),
  ('61107449497858167', 'Detective Lovesick', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Tomoya Nagase, Toma Ikuta, Mika Nakashima, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa, Jun Kaname, Ken Yahagi, Bandō Mitsugorō X, Toshiyuki Nishida', null, 'He was the pride of his police department as the number one armed robbery buster... until he had his heart broken by the sudden flight of a fiancee from his life. Now "Detective Lovesick" finds his crime-fighting mojo and his chance at rising through the police hierarchy slipping away. Spending his days in a desperate search for the love of his life, Detective Lovesick is a man in love with himself and idolizes his drinking buddy, who is a romance psychologist. He loses himself to love easily, even at work, falling for every femme fatale he investigates and after a lot of hair pulling, ending each case with a marriage proposal. "Marry me or be under arrest." But will any woman accept such a proposal? Suspense, comedy and romance all converge in a libido-rich police drama unlike any you''ve ever seen.', 'He was the pride of his police department as the number one armed robbery buster... until he had his heart broken by the sudden flight of a fiancee from his life. Now "Detective Lovesick" finds his crime-fighting mojo and his chance at rising through the police hierarchy slipping away. Spending his days in a desperate search for the love of his life, Detective Lovesick is a man in love with himself and idolizes his drinking buddy, who is a romance psychologist. He loses himself to love easily, even at work, falling for every femme fatale he investigates and after a lot of hair pulling, ending each case with a marriage proposal. "Marry me or be under arrest." But will any woman accept such a proposal? Suspense, comedy and romance all converge in a libido-rich police drama unlike any you''ve ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2Rr5OjatGBXYRD5ICipzBfUK8C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48324'),
  ('1087559020768926381', 'Detective Opera Milky Holmes', 2010, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Suzuko Mimori, Mikoi Sasaki, Izumi Kitta, Satomi Akesaka, Sora Tokui', null, 'Set in a futuristic world, there exist "Toys" which grant people superhuman abilities. This is responsible for a wave of crimes and necessitates employing Toy-using detectives to help solve them. Opera Kobayashi runs a detective agency, Milky Holmes, staffed by four aspiring young girl detectives who attend the Holmes Detective Academy, and each girl possesses their own unique Toy.', 'Set in a futuristic world, there exist "Toys" which grant people superhuman abilities. This is responsible for a wave of crimes and necessitates employing Toy-using detectives to help solve them. Opera Kobayashi runs a detective agency, Milky Holmes, staffed by four aspiring young girl detectives who attend the Holmes Detective Academy, and each girl possesses their own unique Toy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tUE9wZXIurCa8ioPiLKsrT1pRC.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:51492'),
  ('1102586352770777996', 'Detective School Q', 2003, 'Animation, Mystery', null, null, 'Hikaru Midorikawa, Megumi Ogata, Houko Kuwashima, Shin-ichiro Miki, Hideyuki Tanaka', null, 'The story began in a classroom of a middle school. Our main character, Kyu, when called by the guidance counselor, declared that he wanted to be a detective. He took the entrance exam to Dan Detective School where talented people from the whole country gather. He passed the difficult entrance exam for the so-called "Q Class" (Q = qualified), which is personally instructed by the founder and head master of the school, the legendary famous detective, Dan Morihiko. There he got to know Minami Megumi with her photographic memory ability, Touyama Kintarou - the descendant of Kin-san from Touyama, Narusawa Kazuma - a genius programmer, and Amakusa Ryu - the weird Tokyo University student. The five of them work together, as well as competing each other, heading towards graduation.', 'The story began in a classroom of a middle school. Our main character, Kyu, when called by the guidance counselor, declared that he wanted to be a detective. He took the entrance exam to Dan Detective School where talented people from the whole country gather. He passed the difficult entrance exam for the so-called "Q Class" (Q = qualified), which is personally instructed by the founder and head master of the school, the legendary famous detective, Dan Morihiko. There he got to know Minami Megumi with her photographic memory ability, Touyama Kintarou - the descendant of Kin-san from Touyama, Narusawa Kazuma - a genius programmer, and Amakusa Ryu - the weird Tokyo University student. The five of them work together, as well as competing each other, heading towards graduation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJrCoN29kfPictHxThvbPGU14Hr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:24912'),
  ('1098605578522921167', 'Detective School Q', 2007, 'Mystery, Kids', null, null, 'Ryunosuke Kamiki, Mirai Shida, Jun Kaname, Katsumi Wakaba, Ryosuke Yamada, Taro Yamamoto, Takanori Jinnai, Shigeru Saiki', null, 'The city is filled with countless urban legends. Strange incidents that occur in the midst of these legends lead people into a labyrinth... It is the five young detective hatchlings who take on these difficult cases. Overflowing with intellectual curiosity, they make the most of their abilities. They are full of intellectual curiosity and show their abilities to the fullest as they run through the city and get to the bottom of the mystery. And what lurks behind the scenes is a professional criminal planner... Through fierce battles with the enemy and encounters with various people, they are sometimes hurt, but they gradually grow up. This is a pop youth mystery that depicts the friendship and adventures of a group of talented detectives.', 'The city is filled with countless urban legends. Strange incidents that occur in the midst of these legends lead people into a labyrinth... It is the five young detective hatchlings who take on these difficult cases. Overflowing with intellectual curiosity, they make the most of their abilities. They are full of intellectual curiosity and show their abilities to the fullest as they run through the city and get to the bottom of the mystery. And what lurks behind the scenes is a professional criminal planner... Through fierce battles with the enemy and encounters with various people, they are sometimes hurt, but they gradually grow up. This is a pop youth mystery that depicts the friendship and adventures of a group of talented detectives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJy2MMF67EeZoQPUEAl5O6pSZpy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92780'),
  ('586691300344008528', 'Detectives These Days Are Crazy!', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Junichi Suwabe, Kana Hanazawa, Kengo Kawanishi, Tomokazu Sugita', null, 'Once a legendary detective, Nagumo Keiichiro now stumbles through middle age baffled by smartphones and modern life. His quiet decline gets disrupted when Mashiro, a bold high school girl, bursts into his office demanding to become his apprentice. Though he’s rusty and set in his ways, her relentless enthusiasm drags him back into detective work. Now the gap-bridging detective duo is on the case!', 'Once a legendary detective, Nagumo Keiichiro now stumbles through middle age baffled by smartphones and modern life. His quiet decline gets disrupted when Mashiro, a bold high school girl, bursts into his office demanding to become his apprentice. Though he’s rusty and set in his ways, her relentless enthusiasm drags him back into detective work. Now the gap-bridging detective duo is on the case!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hv51RYVvaCrKJKuwFEWm17V0QaD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262377'),
  ('683433989528734361', 'Detectorists', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Mackenzie Crook', 'Mackenzie Crook', 'Mackenzie Crook, Toby Jones, Rachael Stirling, Gerard Horan, Divian Ladwa, Laura Checkley, Pearce Quigley, Sophie Thompson', 'TV-14', 'The lives of two eccentric metal detectorists, who spend their days plodding along ploughed tracks and open fields, hoping to disturb the tedium by unearthing the fortune of a lifetime.', 'The lives of two eccentric metal detectorists, who spend their days plodding along ploughed tracks and open fields, hoping to disturb the tedium by unearthing the fortune of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BCQaZ8HrLjq6diLsIQxZuzXqiK.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61828'),
  ('302090535714368662', 'Detention', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Shiang-An Chuang, Su I-hsuan, Liu Yi', 'Han Ning, Lee Ling-wei, Akira Huang, Jack Yao, David Chao, Na Kwang-hoon, Carol Cheng Chia-yu, Tsai Jui-hsueh', 'TV-MA', 'During the period of martial law in 1960s Taiwan, some teachers and students from Cui Hua High School were arrested for possessing banned books. A female student fell to her death and rumors spread of a ghost haunting the campus. Thirty years later, the draconian culture of the school remains unchanged as a new transfer student uncovers the dark secrets behind the school’s haunting.', 'During the period of martial law in 1960s Taiwan, some teachers and students from Cui Hua High School were arrested for possessing banned books. A female student fell to her death and rumors spread of a ghost haunting the campus. Thirty years later, the draconian culture of the school remains unchanged as a new transfer student uncovers the dark secrets behind the school’s haunting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cVC8EPHuLFVOwgcjDOrdYyWAaM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:105555'),
  ('707827524637140023', 'Detentionaire', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Kids, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Daniel Bryan Franklin, Charles Johnston', null, 'Jonathan Tan, Zachary Bennett, Seán Cullen, Marjorie Chan, Fab Filippo, Ryan Belleville, Krystal Meadows, Melanie Leishman', 'TV-G', 'No student likes having to spend time in detention so you can only imagine how Lee Ping feels. The freshman at A Nigma High has been sentenced to a year in detention after being accused of pulling off the biggest prank in high-school history. The problem is that Lee is innocent. Now, in order to clear his name, Lee must escape from the highly fortified detention room every day, infiltrate a new social clique, and unravel another piece of the gigantic prank puzzle to try to figure out who actually pulled off the epic stunt.', 'No student likes having to spend time in detention so you can only imagine how Lee Ping feels. The freshman at A Nigma High has been sentenced to a year in detention after being accused of pulling off the biggest prank in high-school history. The problem is that Lee is innocent. Now, in order to clear his name, Lee must escape from the highly fortified detention room every day, infiltrate a new social clique, and unravel another piece of the gigantic prank puzzle to try to figure out who actually pulled off the epic stunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVX7vadsZNEfUzHXPkNbFdjfvk5.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:46357'),
  ('435940826318995852', 'Detonator Orgun', 1991, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Norio Wakamoto, Emi Shinohara, Toshihiko Seki, Masashi Ebara, Yumi Touma, Toshiya Ueda, Koichi Yamadera, Hiroko Kasahara', null, 'Fleeing from his own race, Orgun—an alien being with superhuman abilities and unearthly weapons—travels to Earth to find an answer to his origin. There, he bonds with a young man named Tomoru to defend Earth against the Evoluders, who seek nothing but destruction of other civilizations.', 'Fleeing from his own race, Orgun—an alien being with superhuman abilities and unearthly weapons—travels to Earth to find an answer to his origin. There, he bonds with a young man named Tomoru to defend Earth against the Evoluders, who seek nothing but destruction of other civilizations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h52zXBX4bcOQcwaYjnXm6pwFrPE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80239'),
  ('206829307498101155', 'Detroit 1-8-7', 2010, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jason Richman', null, 'Michael Imperioli, Jon Michael Hill, James McDaniel, Shaun Majumder, Natalie Martinez, D.J. Cotrona, Erin Cummings, Megan Dodds', 'TV-14', 'What does it take to be a detective in one of America''s toughest cities? Follow one homicide unit as Detroit''s finest unearth the crisis and revelation, heartbreak and heroism of these inner city cops in Detroit, Michigan.', 'What does it take to be a detective in one of America''s toughest cities? Follow one homicide unit as Detroit''s finest unearth the crisis and revelation, heartbreak and heroism of these inner city cops in Detroit, Michigan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2Nt3lxMz082lqQQzea3yB1XBNU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32776'),
  ('361379556999140170', 'Detroit Metal City', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Kiminori Wakasugi', null, 'Yuji Ueda, Takashi Matsuyama, Kenichi Matsuyama, Riki Takeuchi, Makoto Yasumura, Ai Kobayashi, Shugo Nagashima, Masami Nagasawa', 'TV-MA', 'Dominating the world of indie music, Detroit Metal City (DMC) is a popular death metal band known for its captivatingly dark and crude style. Its extravagant lead singer, Johannes Krauser II, is especially infamous as a demonic being who has risen from the fiery pits of hell itself in order to bring the world to its knees and lord over all mortals—or at least that''s what he''s publicized to be. Unbeknownst to his many worshippers, Krauser II is just the alter ego of an average college graduate named Souichi Negishi. Although he is soft-spoken, peace-loving, and would rather listen to Swedish pop all day, he must participate in DMC''s garish concerts in order to make ends meet. Detroit Metal City chronicles Negishi''s hilarious misadventures as he attempts to juggle his hectic band life, a seemingly budding romance, and dealing with his incredibly obsessive and dedicated fans.', 'Dominating the world of indie music, Detroit Metal City (DMC) is a popular death metal band known for its captivatingly dark and crude style. Its extravagant lead singer, Johannes Krauser II, is especially infamous as a demonic being who has risen from the fiery pits of hell itself in order to bring the world to its knees and lord over all mortals—or at least that''s what he''s publicized to be. Unbeknownst to his many worshippers, Krauser II is just the alter ego of an average college graduate named Souichi Negishi. Although he is soft-spoken, peace-loving, and would rather listen to Swedish pop all day, he must participate in DMC''s garish concerts in order to make ends meet. Detroit Metal City chronicles Negishi''s hilarious misadventures as he attempts to juggle his hectic band life, a seemingly budding romance, and dealing with his incredibly obsessive and dedicated fans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWPhuRsUdJWskvNUd1aCndjFZIl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43066'),
  ('741246399792259480', 'Detroiters', 2017, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Sam Richardson, Tim Robinson', 'TV-14', 'Best friends and fledgling ad men Sam and Tim may not have the money, connections or talent that the big guys do, but they have ambition out the wazoo. Together, they’re out to build a local advertising empire and restore their home city of Detroit to its former glory in this new show from executive producers Lorne Michaels and Jason Sudeikis.', 'Best friends and fledgling ad men Sam and Tim may not have the money, connections or talent that the big guys do, but they have ambition out the wazoo. Together, they’re out to build a local advertising empire and restore their home city of Detroit to its former glory in this new show from executive producers Lorne Michaels and Jason Sudeikis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hBxeoEzVola4LyhW3C7FjseFeWm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69866'),
  ('819710712290448255', 'Deudas', 2021, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Daniel Écija', null, 'Carmen Maura, Salva Reina, Carmen Ruiz, Miguel Ángel Martínez, Mona Martínez, Ibrahim Al Shami, Ana Verónica Schultz, Javi Coll', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3sfXTzFNn8i9Dk8PxmF3d1xP4q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:115502'),
  ('991220023001389066', 'Deus Salve o Rei', 2018, 'Soap, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Daniel Adjafre', 'Daniel Adjafre, Cláudia Gomes, Sérgio Marques', 'Bruna Marquezine, Marina Ruy Barbosa, Romulo Estrela, Johnny Massaro, Marco Nanini, Tatá Werneck, Ricardo Pereira, José Fidalgo', null, 'An heir to a throne in love with a commoner. An inconsequential prince, who thinks only of taking advantage of royal patronage. An ambitious princess, capable of everything to get what she wants.', 'An heir to a throne in love with a commoner. An inconsequential prince, who thinks only of taking advantage of royal patronage. An ambitious princess, capable of everything to get what she wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUZOL8XVxRuoaNcaR9ov6QbSIPF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75768'),
  ('37543855956019757', 'Deutschland', 2015, 'Drama', 'Anna Winger, Jörg Winger', null, 'Jonas Nay, Maria Schrader, Svenja Jung, Sylvester Groth, Carina Wiese, Lavinia Wilson, Sonja Gerhardt, Alexander Beyer', 'TV-MA', 'A gripping coming-of-age story set against the real culture wars and political events of Germany in the 1980s. The drama follows Martin Rauch as the 24 year-old East Germany native is pulled from the world as he knows it and sent to the West as an undercover spy for the Stasi foreign service. Hiding in plain sight in the West German army, he must gather the secrets of NATO military strategy. Everything is new, nothing is quite what it seems and everyone he encounters is harboring secrets, both political and personal.', 'A gripping coming-of-age story set against the real culture wars and political events of Germany in the 1980s. The drama follows Martin Rauch as the 24 year-old East Germany native is pulled from the world as he knows it and sent to the West as an undercover spy for the Stasi foreign service. Hiding in plain sight in the West German army, he must gather the secrets of NATO military strategy. Everything is new, nothing is quite what it seems and everyone he encounters is harboring secrets, both political and personal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6N8H9As0ZvFHUhvJpwwm8EvzD4Y.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:62681'),
  ('358593640376103416', 'Deutschland sucht den Superstar', 2002, 'Family, Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Deutschland sucht den Superstar is a German reality talent show, also commonly known by its initials DSDS. Part of the Idol franchise, it was created by English media mogul Simon Fuller as a spin-off from the British show Pop Idol, of which two series were broadcast between the years of 2001 and 2003. Debuting to mediocre ratings in October 2002 on the RTL network, the show has since become one of the most successful shows on German television. The program aims to discover the best singer in the country through a series of nationwide auditions in which viewer voting determines the winner. Voting is done through telephone and SMS text voting.', 'Deutschland sucht den Superstar is a German reality talent show, also commonly known by its initials DSDS. Part of the Idol franchise, it was created by English media mogul Simon Fuller as a spin-off from the British show Pop Idol, of which two series were broadcast between the years of 2001 and 2003. Debuting to mediocre ratings in October 2002 on the RTL network, the show has since become one of the most successful shows on German television. The program aims to discover the best singer in the country through a series of nationwide auditions in which viewer voting determines the winner. Voting is done through telephone and SMS text voting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRdvhqNtCn6tkCP90crUD7jDgVs.jpg', 22, 'tmdb:tv:6124'),
  ('862752165730032048', 'Devadesátky', 2022, 'Crime', null, 'Matěj Podzimek', null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbNRVtZ1sPMCBMvmYPaJoAyyjWw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155277'),
  ('555295356664397241', 'Devil Beside You', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Mike He, Rainie Yang, Kingone Wang, Fan Hsiao-Fan, Joyce Tsai, Fu Hsiao-Yun, Masuyama Yuki, Figaro Tseng', null, 'Devil Beside You is a 2005 Taiwanese drama starring Mike He, Rainie Yang and Kingone Wang. It is based on Japanese manga Akuma de Sourou, The Devil Does Exist, written by Mitsuba Takanashi. It was produced by Comic Ritz International Production with Chai Zhi Ping as producer and directed by Lin He Long. The series was first broadcast in Taiwan on free-to-air China Television from 26 June to 18 September 2005 and cable TV Eastern Television for 20 episodes.', 'Devil Beside You is a 2005 Taiwanese drama starring Mike He, Rainie Yang and Kingone Wang. It is based on Japanese manga Akuma de Sourou, The Devil Does Exist, written by Mitsuba Takanashi. It was produced by Comic Ritz International Production with Chai Zhi Ping as producer and directed by Lin He Long. The series was first broadcast in Taiwan on free-to-air China Television from 26 June to 18 September 2005 and cable TV Eastern Television for 20 episodes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVikN7mFetzgvx2WPImF9palDNU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6411'),
  ('551290294839976336', 'Devil Hunter Yohko', 1990, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', 'Jûzô Mutsuki', null, 'Aya Hisakawa, Konami Yoshida, Chieko Honda, Hiromi Tsuru, Kappei Yamaguchi, Mika Doi, Naoko Matsui, Show Hayami', null, 'Yohko Mono is a regular girl making her way through high school--until she learns that she is the successor to a line of warriors charged with defending the earth against demons.', 'Yohko Mono is a regular girl making her way through high school--until she learns that she is the successor to a line of warriors charged with defending the earth against demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkC0v3ya7svybQLQxfXmWNNerkR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43564'),
  ('135674203374354131', 'Devil in Disguise: John Wayne Gacy', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'Patrick Macmanus', null, 'Michael Chernus, Gabriel Luna, James Badge Dale, Michael Angarano, Chris Sullivan, Marin Ireland', 'TV-MA', 'When a teenager goes missing, it becomes clear that many young men and boys have disappeared at the hands of John Wayne Gacy, the prime suspect.', 'When a teenager goes missing, it becomes clear that many young men and boys have disappeared at the hands of John Wayne Gacy, the prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsXSxLYsAq0VsjWIMRpQGorjLjh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:257534'),
  ('1053391216444371896', 'Devil In Law', 2023, 'Drama', 'Nantana Weerachon', null, 'Nawasch Phupantachsee, Nuttanicha Dungwattanawanich, Butsakorn Wongpuapan, Pitchapa Phanthumchinda, Lorena Schuett, Paswitch Boorananut, Chartayodom Hiranyatithi, Fundee Junyatanakron', null, 'Srikanda, Phawinee''s sister, is a beautiful woman whose father is very proud of her. She fell in love with Nopphanai and despite her father''s disapproval, they decided to elope. One day, Phawinee meets Srikanda by chance and notices how she looks thinner and depressed. She eventually gets ill and passes away. Phawinee is angry after finding out how her sister was bullied by her mother and sister-in-law, so she decides to sign a marriage certificate with Nopphanai with a deal of "no touch", in order to take care of her nephew. Afterward, Phawinee moves in where her sister lived and starts to fight with his mother and sister. She doesn''t give in to them as her sister had, and so her revenge begins.', 'Srikanda, Phawinee''s sister, is a beautiful woman whose father is very proud of her. She fell in love with Nopphanai and despite her father''s disapproval, they decided to elope. One day, Phawinee meets Srikanda by chance and notices how she looks thinner and depressed. She eventually gets ill and passes away. Phawinee is angry after finding out how her sister was bullied by her mother and sister-in-law, so she decides to sign a marriage certificate with Nopphanai with a deal of "no touch", in order to take care of her nephew. Afterward, Phawinee moves in where her sister lived and starts to fight with his mother and sister. She doesn''t give in to them as her sister had, and so her revenge begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utwtmVGVbvcqawzLMzIwZdEF1xF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218930'),
  ('1060036512577074609', 'Devil in Ohio', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Daria Polatin', null, 'Emily Deschanel, Madeleine Arthur, Xaria Dotson, Sam Jaeger, Gerardo Celasco, Alisha Newton, Naomi Tan, Evan Ellison', 'TV-MA', 'Determined to protect a young patient who escaped a mysterious cult, a psychiatrist takes the girl in, putting her own family — and life — in danger.', 'Determined to protect a young patient who escaped a mysterious cult, a psychiatrist takes the girl in, putting her own family — and life — in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AsdjYB61U8zVAsEyQgOebAjCoUN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:133700'),
  ('29756354809157478', 'Devil in the Family: The Fall of Ruby Franke', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Ruby Franke, Chad Franke, Shari Franke, Kevin Franke', 'TV-MA', 'When popular vlogger Ruby Franke is arrested for child abuse in August 2023, it quickly becomes one of the biggest trending stories in America. For years, the Frankes'' YouTube channel had documented a wholesome, happy family life, with nearly 3 million subscribers tuning in at its peak. But as the cracks began to show, the family turned to counselor Jodi Hildebrandt for guidance – and rapidly found themselves trapped in a nightmare.', 'When popular vlogger Ruby Franke is arrested for child abuse in August 2023, it quickly becomes one of the biggest trending stories in America. For years, the Frankes'' YouTube channel had documented a wholesome, happy family life, with nearly 3 million subscribers tuning in at its peak. But as the cracks began to show, the family turned to counselor Jodi Hildebrandt for guidance – and rapidly found themselves trapped in a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPE2Urjd1ut4fdOioyPj1CdRTnN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281371'),
  ('222449516978695385', 'Devil Lady', 1998, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Junko Iwao, Kisho Taniyama, Hochu Otsuka, Kaoru Shimamura, Kazusa Murai, Ryusei Nakao, Takumi Yamazaki, Naoya Uchida', null, 'The beautiful and successful supermodel Jun Fudou meets a woman named Lan Asuka, who confronts her with a werewolf monster, which she calls a devil beast. As a result, unimagined powers awaken in Jun, and she manages to defeat the monster. She, just like this werewolf, is part of the next step in human evolution: humans who can mutate into beast-like monsters and then mercilessly terrorise civilisation. Unlike the other devil beasts, however, she can retain her humanity, which is her undoing because Lan Asuka is a high-ranking employee of the government and of the “Anti-Beast Special Squad”, which wants to abuse her powers and train her to mercilessly hunt down her own species. Caught between these extremes and her weak self, the question arises: what fate will Jun meet? Will she ever be able to decide it for herself?', 'The beautiful and successful supermodel Jun Fudou meets a woman named Lan Asuka, who confronts her with a werewolf monster, which she calls a devil beast. As a result, unimagined powers awaken in Jun, and she manages to defeat the monster. She, just like this werewolf, is part of the next step in human evolution: humans who can mutate into beast-like monsters and then mercilessly terrorise civilisation. Unlike the other devil beasts, however, she can retain her humanity, which is her undoing because Lan Asuka is a high-ranking employee of the government and of the “Anti-Beast Special Squad”, which wants to abuse her powers and train her to mercilessly hunt down her own species. Caught between these extremes and her weak self, the question arises: what fate will Jun meet? Will she ever be able to decide it for herself?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6weUapeEfBsQIHjiMn9KNdMhiAv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45610'),
  ('29372744173412671', 'Devil May Care', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Doug Goldstein', null, 'Alan Tudyk, Asif Ali, Pamela Adlon, Stephanie Beatriz, Fred Tatasciore', null, 'Beans, a Gen Z kid, is sent to a newly gentrified and urban hell, where he works as Devil''s social media manager as the two navigate their personal lives while forming an unlikely friendship and making hell the best place to live in the universe.', 'Beans, a Gen Z kid, is sent to a newly gentrified and urban hell, where he works as Devil''s social media manager as the two navigate their personal lives while forming an unlikely friendship and making hell the best place to live in the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p5G4ne8Ri5c4qs7E8J3hs5u9FKn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117744'),
  ('801025696296350324', 'Devil May Cry', 2007, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Hideki Kamiya', null, 'Toshiyuki Morikawa, Misato Fukuen, Akio Otsuka, Fumiko Orikasa, Atsuko Tanaka, Nachi Nozawa, Aya Hisakawa', 'TV-14', 'The adventures of the demon hunter Dante who himself is half demon and half human.', 'The adventures of the demon hunter Dante who himself is half demon and half human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDGxMQk24gt4proydCyxddPzTIG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12577'),
  ('970600645381056993', 'Devil May Cry', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Adi Shankar', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'When a mysterious villain threatens to open the gates of Hell, a devilishly handsome demon hunter could be the world''s best hope for salvation.', 'When a mysterious villain threatens to open the gates of Hell, a devilishly handsome demon hunter could be the world''s best hope for salvation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mX9tqfpjqwreONJHhap7SnSSowe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:235930'),
  ('399220226223083489', 'Devil Sister', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Pechaya Wattanamontree, Metawin Opas-iamkajorn, Kanyarat Ruangrung, Suphakorn Sriphotong, Ploi Horwang', null, 'Irin is said to be hot-tempered and fearless — "The Devil". It''s all an act, though; she puts up a mean front to build up her younger sister, Inn, by contrast. However, her young vet and neighbour Namcha couldn''t care less. No matter how catty she behaves, his love persists. He''s loved her ever since they were students and has no plans of changing his heart. In fact, they used to date until Irin broke things off without any explanation. Namcha has never forgotten his first love, but Irin doesn''t believe his feelings are unchanged; Namcha makes it his mission to prove it to her. Love should come easy for the two, but family, work, and even friends all seem primed to tear them apart.', 'Irin is said to be hot-tempered and fearless — "The Devil". It''s all an act, though; she puts up a mean front to build up her younger sister, Inn, by contrast. However, her young vet and neighbour Namcha couldn''t care less. No matter how catty she behaves, his love persists. He''s loved her ever since they were students and has no plans of changing his heart. In fact, they used to date until Irin broke things off without any explanation. Namcha has never forgotten his first love, but Irin doesn''t believe his feelings are unchanged; Namcha makes it his mission to prove it to her. Love should come easy for the two, but family, work, and even friends all seem primed to tear them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xg300K8M2nb0zc2pzxD49dSNuIH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:197911'),
  ('113348198440054232', 'Devil Survivor 2: The Animation', 2013, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Ami Koshimizu, Aya Uchida, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Junichi Suwabe, Hiroshi Kamiya, Takahiro Sakurai', null, 'The countdown to extinction begins on Sunday with the arrival of the Septentriones, otherworldly invaders set on the eradication of mankind. Caught in the crossfire, Hibiki Kuze and his friends join in the war for humanity''s survival by signing contracts with demons to become "Devil Summoners." Soon, their abilities attract the attention of JP''s, an underground agency led by Yamato Houtsuin. Once recruited into JP''s, Hibiki and his friends fight and bond alongside other ordinary citizens who are Devil Summoners. However, with each new day, another Septentrione appears to wreak havoc upon Japan. Even if many lives are lost in the process, before that night ends, the young summoners must defeat the invaders at all costs.', 'The countdown to extinction begins on Sunday with the arrival of the Septentriones, otherworldly invaders set on the eradication of mankind. Caught in the crossfire, Hibiki Kuze and his friends join in the war for humanity''s survival by signing contracts with demons to become "Devil Summoners." Soon, their abilities attract the attention of JP''s, an underground agency led by Yamato Houtsuin. Once recruited into JP''s, Hibiki and his friends fight and bond alongside other ordinary citizens who are Devil Summoners. However, with each new day, another Septentrione appears to wreak havoc upon Japan. Even if many lives are lost in the process, before that night ends, the young summoners must defeat the invaders at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gK6fR3u7rMjjWwbsAqD8ShH4VoS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:54933'),
  ('926987011568094390', 'Devil''s Diner', 2025, 'Mystery', 'Ham Tran', null, 'Lê Quốc Nam, Kiều Trinh, Võ Tấn Phát, Võ Điền Gia Huy, Ma Ran Đô, Thiếu Lan', 'TV-MA', 'In a secluded part of town, a mysterious chef cooks up supernatural meals that grant his guests'' deepest desires – if they''re willing to pay the price.', 'In a secluded part of town, a mysterious chef cooks up supernatural meals that grant his guests'' deepest desires – if they''re willing to pay the price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHNRlPuBJrd5u3h74u21fFDM0Hs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283022'),
  ('173743242985203726', 'Devil''s Kiss', 1993, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yoshie Okuyama, Eri Fukatsu, Takako Tokiwa, Gitan Ohtsuru, Yasufumi Terawaki, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Mari Natsuki, Toru Masuoka', null, 'Three childhood friends from a small town arrive in Tokyo, only to be consumed by "devilish" obsessions, from desire and debt to prostitution, drugs, sexual violence, and manipulative cults, pushing their dreams and friendship to the breaking point.', 'Three childhood friends from a small town arrive in Tokyo, only to be consumed by "devilish" obsessions, from desire and debt to prostitution, drugs, sexual violence, and manipulative cults, pushing their dreams and friendship to the breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/abrYuDkjVct508o1xcwGtLh8w0O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233756'),
  ('154300842888377501', 'Devilish Joy', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Choi Ji-Yeon', 'Choi Ji-Yeon', 'Choi Jin-hyuk, Song Ha-yoon, Lee Ho-won, Lee Ju-yeon, Lee Su-ji, Yang Byeong-yeol, Kim Min-sang, Kim Ji-young', null, 'The strange but beautiful love story of a genius doctor who suffers from "Cinderella Memory Disorder" in which the memories of the previous day disappear at twelve o''clock and a washed-up actress.', 'The strange but beautiful love story of a genius doctor who suffers from "Cinderella Memory Disorder" in which the memories of the previous day disappear at twelve o''clock and a washed-up actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v77XkTIW2UfyClmQX6H2zHgOhxs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82102'),
  ('750603475479007256', 'Devilman', 1972, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryoichi Tanaka, Hidekatsu Shibata, Kazuko Sawada, Ichiro Nagai, Joji Yanami, Keiko Yamamoto, Sumie Sakai', null, 'Devilman features Akira Fudo, a shy and timid teenager who has gone mountain climbing in the Himalayas with his father. While in the middle of the expedition, both father and son are killed in a tragic accident. Akira''s body is found and possessed by the demon soldier Devilman, who uses his new human form as a disguise in order to fulfill his mission of causing chaos on Earth in order to pave the way for a demonic invasion of the planet. Before his mission can begin in earnest, Devilman meets Akira''s childhood friend Miki Makimura and quickly falls in love with her. Devilman resolves to protect Miki and humanity as a whole by battling against his fellow demons. Demon Tribe leader Zennon becomes greatly angered at Devilman''s betrayal and is quick to send Devilman''s former comrades to destroy him. The other demons soon learn that Miki is precious to Devilman and he must now work to protect her, as well as protect himself. Will the power of love be able to overcome that of true evil?', 'Devilman features Akira Fudo, a shy and timid teenager who has gone mountain climbing in the Himalayas with his father. While in the middle of the expedition, both father and son are killed in a tragic accident. Akira''s body is found and possessed by the demon soldier Devilman, who uses his new human form as a disguise in order to fulfill his mission of causing chaos on Earth in order to pave the way for a demonic invasion of the planet. Before his mission can begin in earnest, Devilman meets Akira''s childhood friend Miki Makimura and quickly falls in love with her. Devilman resolves to protect Miki and humanity as a whole by battling against his fellow demons. Demon Tribe leader Zennon becomes greatly angered at Devilman''s betrayal and is quick to send Devilman''s former comrades to destroy him. The other demons soon learn that Miki is precious to Devilman and he must now work to protect her, as well as protect himself. Will the power of love be able to overcome that of true evil?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaWCutFNLIsg5a76G7uEDi76kK5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68586'),
  ('235881025539233859', 'Devilman', 1987, null, 'Go Nagai', null, 'Show Hayami, Alan Marriott, Yu Mizushima, Adam Matalon, Jun Konomaki, Larissa Murray, Tessyo Genda, Naoya Uchida', null, 'Akira is just another normal kid in modern-day Tokyo, until an old friend of his, Ryo, shows up and turns his world upside down. Akira learns that there is an upcoming war of demons on humanity and he has just been enlisted for a major tour of duty. But the only way to fight a demon is with their power, so Akira and Ryo risk a dangerous ceremony in an attempt to create humanity''s only hope: the powerful Devilman.', 'Akira is just another normal kid in modern-day Tokyo, until an old friend of his, Ryo, shows up and turns his world upside down. Akira learns that there is an upcoming war of demons on humanity and he has just been enlisted for a major tour of duty. But the only way to fight a demon is with their power, so Akira and Ryo risk a dangerous ceremony in an attempt to create humanity''s only hope: the powerful Devilman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szI80h4CuBOxgLhe2IyDJXPIyrw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127611'),
  ('855603426044908235', 'Devilman Crybaby', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Go Nagai', null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Ayumu Murase, Megumi Han, Ami Koshimizu, KEN THE 390, Subaru Kimura, Masato Obara, Sayaka Kobayashi', 'TV-MA', 'Akira Fudo learns from his best friend Ryo Asuka that demons will revive and reclaim the world from humans. With humans hopeless against this threat, Ryo suggests combining with a demon. With this, Akira becomes Devilman, a being with the power of demon but with a human heart.', 'Akira Fudo learns from his best friend Ryo Asuka that demons will revive and reclaim the world from humans. With humans hopeless against this threat, Ryo suggests combining with a demon. With this, Akira becomes Devilman, a being with the power of demon but with a human heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pQ9xfgDa3L3QpoXfkNhISby2R4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75208'),
  ('700424887324419443', 'Devils', 2020, 'Drama', 'Alessandro Sermoneta, Mario Ruggeri, Elena Bucaccio', null, 'Alessandro Borghi, Patrick Dempsey, Li Jun Li, Joel de la Fuente, Clara Rosager, Malachi Kirby, Pia Mechler, Paul Chowdhry', 'TV-14', 'After being implicated in a deadly scandal, a trader at a leading London bank fights to clear his name, but instead uncovers an intercontinental conspiracy masterminded by powerful forces operating in the shadows.', 'After being implicated in a deadly scandal, a trader at a leading London bank fights to clear his name, but instead uncovers an intercontinental conspiracy masterminded by powerful forces operating in the shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4Pl7APWpRANULCirWTrcMPfdIl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99741'),
  ('59450018235431566', 'Devils'' Line', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yui Ishikawa, Ryohei Kimura, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Miyuki Sawashiro, Takahiro Sakurai, Hiroshi Kamiya, Nao Toyama', 'TV-14', 'Tsukasa, a college student, is rescued from an attack by a devil, one of many vampires that can blend in among the human population. Anzai, her savior, is a half-devil who exploits his supernatural gifts as a member of a shadowy police task force that specializes in devil-related crime in Tokyo. As Anzai continues to keep guard over Tsukasa, the two quickly forge a tentative bond—one that Anzai fears will test his iron-clad rule of never drinking human blood...', 'Tsukasa, a college student, is rescued from an attack by a devil, one of many vampires that can blend in among the human population. Anzai, her savior, is a half-devil who exploits his supernatural gifts as a member of a shadowy police task force that specializes in devil-related crime in Tokyo. As Anzai continues to keep guard over Tsukasa, the two quickly forge a tentative bond—one that Anzai fears will test his iron-clad rule of never drinking human blood...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tz6rfssj7rGmveOaPshPLd20VS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:78462'),
  ('303120658136011132', 'Devious Maids', 2013, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Marc Cherry', null, 'Ana Ortiz, Dania Ramirez, Roselyn Sánchez, Judy Reyes, Rebecca Wisocky, Tom Irwin, Nathan Owens, Sol Rodriguez', null, 'The series centers on four Latina maids working in the homes of Beverly Hills’ wealthiest and most powerful families, and a newcomer who made it personal after a maid was murdered and determined to uncover the truth behind her demise, and in the process become an ally in their lives.', 'The series centers on four Latina maids working in the homes of Beverly Hills’ wealthiest and most powerful families, and a newcomer who made it personal after a maid was murdered and determined to uncover the truth behind her demise, and in the process become an ally in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gn61HHk9KRa9RKeFCz476EqLR61.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:44242'),
  ('619689223464257667', 'Devon Ke Dev...Mahadev', 2011, 'Drama', null, null, 'Mohit Raina, Mouni Roy, Sonarika Bhadoria, Saurabh Raj Jain, Darshan Kumaar, Piyush Sahdev, Shalini Kapoor, Pankaj Dheer', 'TV-14', 'He is the supreme being and the destroyer of evil. Witness lord Shiva''s story, his avatars, and a union that shaped the universe - his marriage to Parvati.', 'He is the supreme being and the destroyer of evil. Witness lord Shiva''s story, his avatars, and a union that shaped the universe - his marriage to Parvati.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oMzXcYsUVIt6pQEODc6FRe8IBug.jpg', 36, 'tmdb:tv:42316'),
  ('930031492293409351', 'Devotion, a Story of Love and Desire', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Elisa Amoruso, Laura Colella, Alessandro Fabbri', 'Michele Riondino, Lucrezia Guidone, Alice Arcuri, Carolina Sala, Maria Paiato, Leonardo Pazzagli, Gianluca Gobbi, Elisa Di Eusanio', 'TV-MA', 'A seemingly happy marriage begins to dissolve when the husband''s faithfulness is called into question, and both spouses become tempted by other desires.', 'A seemingly happy marriage begins to dissolve when the husband''s faithfulness is called into question, and both spouses become tempted by other desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RdEzEl8TrLeJpTOsKdfsky64y7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155795'),
  ('241582579146810199', 'Devs', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Alex Garland', null, 'Sonoya Mizuno, Nick Offerman, Jin Ha, Cailee Spaeny, Stephen McKinley Henderson, Alison Pill, Zach Grenier', 'TV-MA', 'Young computer engineer Lily Chan investigates the secretive development division of her employer, a cutting-edge tech company based in San Francisco, which she believes is behind the murder of her boyfriend.', 'Young computer engineer Lily Chan investigates the secretive development division of her employer, a cutting-edge tech company based in San Francisco, which she believes is behind the murder of her boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uv63iNWOh69bSJYJQZjiX6n8B3m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81349'),
  ('991578747686215915', 'Dexter', 2006, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'James Manos Jr.', null, 'Michael C. Hall, Jennifer Carpenter, Geoff Pierson, David Zayas, James Remar, Aimee Garcia, Desmond Harrington, C.S. Lee', 'TV-MA', 'Dexter Morgan, a blood spatter pattern analyst for the Miami Metro Police also leads a secret life as a serial killer, hunting down criminals who have slipped through the cracks of justice.', 'Dexter Morgan, a blood spatter pattern analyst for the Miami Metro Police also leads a secret life as a serial killer, hunting down criminals who have slipped through the cracks of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8dWfc4JwQuv3HayIZeO84jAXED.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1405'),
  ('638528338361209915', 'Dexter: Early Cuts', 2009, 'Animation, Crime, Drama', 'Lauren Gussis', 'Scott Reynolds', 'Michael C. Hall', null, 'Tales of vigilante serial killer Dexter Morgan’s earlier kills and how exactly the dark defender came to perfect his craft following the death of his adoptive father, Harry.', 'Tales of vigilante serial killer Dexter Morgan’s earlier kills and how exactly the dark defender came to perfect his craft following the death of his adoptive father, Harry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMfOoSAB7q3xclhUEavyv5MR5iU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:49530'),
  ('1047528105029713366', 'Dexter: New Blood', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Clyde Phillips', null, 'Michael C. Hall, Jack Alcott, Julia Jones, Johnny Sequoyah, Clancy Brown, Jennifer Carpenter, Alano Miller', 'TV-MA', '10 years after Dexter went missing in the eye of Hurricane Laura, we find him living under an assumed name in the small town of Iron Lake, New York. Dexter may be embracing his new life, but in the wake of unexpected events in this close-knit community, his Dark Passenger beckons.', '10 years after Dexter went missing in the eye of Hurricane Laura, we find him living under an assumed name in the small town of Iron Lake, New York. Dexter may be embracing his new life, but in the wake of unexpected events in this close-knit community, his Dark Passenger beckons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EBKgrFIsCFSV1RZKWhYUdbtGiv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131927'),
  ('12607434180923438', 'Dexter: Original Sin', 2024, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Clyde Phillips', null, 'Patrick Gibson, Christian Slater, Molly Brown, James Martinez, Christina Milian, Alex Shimizu, Reno Wilson, Patrick Dempsey', 'TV-MA', 'In 1991 Miami, Dexter Morgan transitions from student to avenging serial killer. When his bloodthirsty urges can''t be ignored any longer, Dexter must learn to channel his inner darkness. With the guidance of his father, Harry, he adopts a Code designed to help him find and kill people who deserve to be eliminated from society without getting on law enforcements'' radar. This is a particular challenge for young Dexter as he begins a forensics internship at the Miami Metro Police Department.', 'In 1991 Miami, Dexter Morgan transitions from student to avenging serial killer. When his bloodthirsty urges can''t be ignored any longer, Dexter must learn to channel his inner darkness. With the guidance of his father, Harry, he adopts a Code designed to help him find and kill people who deserve to be eliminated from society without getting on law enforcements'' radar. This is a particular challenge for young Dexter as he begins a forensics internship at the Miami Metro Police Department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5bP7spdfS0NpDLKDlqJYyJPi1j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219937'),
  ('771053345440623864', 'Dexter: Resurrection', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Clyde Phillips', null, 'Michael C. Hall, Jack Alcott, Uma Thurman, David Zayas, James Remar, Peter Dinklage, Ntare Guma Mbaho Mwine, Kadia Saraf', 'TV-MA', 'Dexter Morgan awakens from a coma to find Harrison gone without a trace. Realizing the weight of what he put his son through, Dexter sets out for New York City, determined to find him and make things right. But closure won''t come easy. When Miami Metro''s Angel Batista arrives with questions, Dexter realizes his past is catching up to him fast. As father and son navigate their own darkness in the city that never sleeps, they soon find themselves deeper than they ever imagined - and that the only way out is together.', 'Dexter Morgan awakens from a coma to find Harrison gone without a trace. Realizing the weight of what he put his son through, Dexter sets out for New York City, determined to find him and make things right. But closure won''t come easy. When Miami Metro''s Angel Batista arrives with questions, Dexter realizes his past is catching up to him fast. As father and son navigate their own darkness in the city that never sleeps, they soon find themselves deeper than they ever imagined - and that the only way out is together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEHZfSZhZKDot4wqurgIzMUNq1W.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:259909'),
  ('872659030533934430', 'Dexter''s Laboratory', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Genndy Tartakovsky', null, 'Candi Milo, Kat Cressida, Jeff Bennett, Kath Soucie', 'TV-G', 'Dexter, a boy-genius with a secret laboratory, constantly battles his sister Dee Dee, who always gains access despite his best efforts to keep her out, as well as his arch-rival and neighbor, Mandark.', 'Dexter, a boy-genius with a secret laboratory, constantly battles his sister Dee Dee, who always gains access despite his best efforts to keep her out, as well as his arch-rival and neighbor, Mandark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inJJn8lUPWdvdy2h259UnoHWVqC.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4229'),
  ('857810438668302035', 'Deyun Laughter Club', 2020, 'Reality, Talk, Comedy, Family', 'Guo Degang, Yu Qian, Yue Yunpeng', null, 'Guo Degang, Yu Qian, Yue Yunpeng, Meng Hetang, Zhang Helun, Yunping Luan, Jiuling Zhang, Jiulong Wang', null, 'Deyun Laughter Club is an unprecedented internal assessment launched by Guo Degang, the leader of Deyun Club. Under the leadership of Guo Degang and Yu Qian, young crosstalk actors of Deyun Club will get a task in each episode and create a crosstalk about the task. Their partners will be reorganized in each episode and the person graded last will be eliminated on a regular basis. Let’s see who will dominate Deyun in this fall and become Deyun''s rising star.', 'Deyun Laughter Club is an unprecedented internal assessment launched by Guo Degang, the leader of Deyun Club. Under the leadership of Guo Degang and Yu Qian, young crosstalk actors of Deyun Club will get a task in each episode and create a crosstalk about the task. Their partners will be reorganized in each episode and the person graded last will be eliminated on a regular basis. Let’s see who will dominate Deyun in this fall and become Deyun''s rising star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYciJEzamrt49QI8mDcALz6hxAu.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:108371'),
  ('363030778519897166', 'Dharma & Greg', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Chuck Lorre', null, 'Jenna Elfman, Thomas Gibson, Alan Rachins, Mimi Kennedy, Mitchell Ryan, Susan Sullivan, Joel Murray, Shae D''Lyn', 'TV-PG', 'Dharma & Greg is an American television sitcom that aired from September 24, 1997, to April 30, 2002. It stars Jenna Elfman and Thomas Gibson as Dharma and Greg Montgomery, a couple who got married on their first date despite being complete opposites. The series is co-produced by Chuck Lorre Productions, More-Medavoy Productions and 4 to 6 Foot Productions in association with 20th Century Fox Television for ABC. The show''s theme song was written and performed by composer Dennis C. Brown. Created by executive producers Dottie Dartland and Chuck Lorre, the comedy took much of its inspiration from so-called culture-clash "fish out of water" situations. The show earned eight Golden Globe nominations, six Emmy Award nominations, and six Satellite Awards nominations. Elfman earned a Golden Globe in 1999 for Best Actress.', 'Dharma & Greg is an American television sitcom that aired from September 24, 1997, to April 30, 2002. It stars Jenna Elfman and Thomas Gibson as Dharma and Greg Montgomery, a couple who got married on their first date despite being complete opposites. The series is co-produced by Chuck Lorre Productions, More-Medavoy Productions and 4 to 6 Foot Productions in association with 20th Century Fox Television for ABC. The show''s theme song was written and performed by composer Dennis C. Brown. Created by executive producers Dottie Dartland and Chuck Lorre, the comedy took much of its inspiration from so-called culture-clash "fish out of water" situations. The show earned eight Golden Globe nominations, six Emmy Award nominations, and six Satellite Awards nominations. Elfman earned a Golden Globe in 1999 for Best Actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmafXjaQphnyHZ8oF3Q51DDIRWZ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:3461'),
  ('236998626651620009', 'Dhevaprom', 2024, 'Drama, Soap', null, null, 'Kanawut Traipipattanapong, Mike Theodor Platte, Henry Myron, Kongthap Yuttapichai, Noppakao Dechaphatthanakun, Duangta Toongkamanee, Suppapong Udomkaewkanjana, Siriam Pakdeedumrongrit', null, 'Dhevaprom is a Thai lakorn based on the novel of the same name and written by the same writers as its preceding story ... The Five Brothers series, that aired in 2013. Dhevaprom consists of Laorchan, Kwanruetai, Jaiphisut, Dujapsorn and Porncheewan.', 'Dhevaprom is a Thai lakorn based on the novel of the same name and written by the same writers as its preceding story ... The Five Brothers series, that aired in 2013. Dhevaprom consists of Laorchan, Kwanruetai, Jaiphisut, Dujapsorn and Porncheewan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtTjfnK4OYphmzzRuTXIo4owoHz.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:237952'),
  ('370601723469707054', 'Dhindora', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bhuvan Bam', null, 'Bhuvan Bam, Gayatri Bhardwaj, Jeeveshu Ahluwalia, Rajesh Tailang, Badri Chavan, Anup Soni, Arun Kushwah, Ishtiyak Khan', null, 'The story revolves around Bhuvan and his family''s everyday lives, when an unexpected purchase leads to a series of events and depicts every common man''s larger than life dreams.', 'The story revolves around Bhuvan and his family''s everyday lives, when an unexpected purchase leads to a series of events and depicts every common man''s larger than life dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVaqEhiRPtnWzZVNZu9iaJHsoVE.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:275204'),
  ('874342590037889933', 'Dhootha', 2023, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Vikram Kumar', 'Poorna Prajna, Naveen George Thomas, Vikram Kumar', 'Naga Chaitanya Akkineni, Parvathy Thiruvothu, Priya Bhavani Shankar, Prachi Desai, Rohini, Anish Kuruvilla, Jayaprakash, Pasupathy', null, 'Journalist Sagar''s life turns thrilling as he unravels dark secrets behind newspaper clippings predicting tragedies. He becomes a murder suspect, racing against time to clear his name and solve the enigma and faces dangerous twists. Suspense builds in this roller-coaster ride.', 'Journalist Sagar''s life turns thrilling as he unravels dark secrets behind newspaper clippings predicting tragedies. He becomes a murder suspect, racing against time to clear his name and solve the enigma and faces dangerous twists. Suspense builds in this roller-coaster ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMegWqCj8z58na8RG8ytlPJ7gGm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:200946'),
  ('974213774783774040', 'Di Gi Charat Nyo!', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family', null, 'Hiroaki Sakurai', 'Kenji Nojima, Miyuki Sawashiro, Kaori Nazuka, Omi Minami, Megumi Hayashibara, Yoshiko Kamei, Chihiro Suzuki, Asami Sanada', null, 'Di Gi Charat (a.k.a. Dejiko) - along with Petit Charat (a.k.a. Puchiko) and Gema - travels to Earth as part of her training to become a full-fledged princess. They crash on a small town in Japan, where they meet the Omocha brothers (who spend most of their time thinking how cute Puchiko is) and Mr. & Mrs. Ankoro (an elderly couple that makes Japanese sweets).', 'Di Gi Charat (a.k.a. Dejiko) - along with Petit Charat (a.k.a. Puchiko) and Gema - travels to Earth as part of her training to become a full-fledged princess. They crash on a small town in Japan, where they meet the Omocha brothers (who spend most of their time thinking how cute Puchiko is) and Mr. & Mrs. Ankoro (an elderly couple that makes Japanese sweets).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dL5W3MdndSsQXBulHnH5fduAH0R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9639'),
  ('205402439421275300', 'DI Ray', 2022, 'Crime', 'Maya Sondhi', null, 'Parminder Nagra, Gemma Whelan, Sam Baker Jones, Peter Bankolé, Steve Oram, Ian Puleston-Davies, Witney White', null, 'DI Ray is set in Birmingham and follows Leicester-born Rachita Ray, a police officer who takes on a case that forces her to confront a lifelong personal conflict between her British identity and her South Asian heritage.', 'DI Ray is set in Birmingham and follows Leicester-born Rachita Ray, a police officer who takes on a case that forces her to confront a lifelong personal conflict between her British identity and her South Asian heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vc1smKAqlaqwxfxjaTfsEcSGHU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:196586'),
  ('89265147892786894', 'Di4ries', 2022, 'Kids, Family, Drama', null, 'Mariano Di Nardo, Simona Ercolani, Angelo Pastore', 'Andrea Arru, Favia Leone, Biagio Vendetti, Liam Nicolosi, Pietro Sparvoli, Rossella Celati, Sofia Nicolini, Federica Franzellitti', 'TV-PG', 'First crushes, first kisses, fun with friends — and feuds with rivals. In the halls of Galileo Galilei Middle School, every day is full of surprises!', 'First crushes, first kisses, fun with friends — and feuds with rivals. In the halls of Galileo Galilei Middle School, every day is full of surprises!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slaBZ9hzYXT9hvZJOHbYC2S84sT.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:202306'),
  ('384880603650561244', 'Diablero', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'José Manuel Cravioto, Pablo Tébar', null, 'Gisselle Kuri, Christopher Von Uckermann, Horacio García Rojas, Fátima Molina', 'TV-MA', 'A young priest enlists the help of a demon hunter and a paranormal expert to search for a kidnapped girl in the underworld of Mexico City.', 'A young priest enlists the help of a demon hunter and a paranormal expert to search for a kidnapped girl in the underworld of Mexico City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWc0wt0tgRQiiSR4QzE4WfMTiF4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83300'),
  ('703384855986816046', 'Diablo Guardián', 2018, 'Drama', null, null, 'Paulina Gaitán, Andrés Almeida, Adrián Ladrón, Leonardo Ortizgris, Armando Espitia, Rodrigo Murray', 'TV-MA', 'The story of Violetta, a young woman who flees her native Mexico to start anew in New York City. But instead of a living a dream, Violetta is awoken to a harsh reality when she runs out of money, sending her into the arms of the villainous Nefastófeles.', 'The story of Violetta, a young woman who flees her native Mexico to start anew in New York City. But instead of a living a dream, Violetta is awoken to a harsh reality when she runs out of money, sending her into the arms of the villainous Nefastófeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aPeosEyu2axBCRoFJ9osO4mEPo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:58347'),
  ('1051553024068080234', 'Diabolik Lovers', 2013, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Rie Suegara, Hiroko Ushida, Yuuko Sasamoto, Takashi Kondo, Kaoru Sasajima, Kaori Mizuhashi, Yuka Nishigaki', 'TV-MA', 'Based on a visual novel of the same name by Rejet and Otomate, for the female market. Komori Yui is a positive-thinking girl who nevertheless is troubled by seeing spirits and experiencing poltergeist phenomena. In her second year in high school, she transfers to a new school — a night school for entertainers and celebrities — due to her father''s work. There are rumours that vampires exist among the student body, and Yui ends up living with the six sadistic Sakamaki vampire brothers.', 'Based on a visual novel of the same name by Rejet and Otomate, for the female market. Komori Yui is a positive-thinking girl who nevertheless is troubled by seeing spirits and experiencing poltergeist phenomena. In her second year in high school, she transfers to a new school — a night school for entertainers and celebrities — due to her father''s work. There are rumours that vampires exist among the student body, and Yui ends up living with the six sadistic Sakamaki vampire brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJ0Y0W0koYMEhLmCFj9g0bdD3OK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61512'),
  ('481002998456108592', 'Diagnosis', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Lisa Sanders', null, 'Dr. Lisa Sanders crowdsources diagnoses for mysterious and rare medical conditions in a documentary series based on her New York Times Magazine column.', 'Dr. Lisa Sanders crowdsources diagnoses for mysterious and rare medical conditions in a documentary series based on her New York Times Magazine column.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KYUwDjSDpXkPNcQW20OhKlwNrm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91701'),
  ('297846904161633636', 'Diagnosis: Murder', 1993, 'Drama, Family, Mystery, Crime', 'Joyce Burditt', null, 'Dick Van Dyke, Barry Van Dyke, Charlie Schlatter, Victoria Rowell', 'TV-PG', 'Dr. Mark Sloan is a good-natured, offbeat physician who is called upon to solve murders.', 'Dr. Mark Sloan is a good-natured, offbeat physician who is called upon to solve murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yhozeY2KgYXQQE9kfbiIyypYiI.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:2625'),
  ('557918850417253935', 'Diamond Lover', 2015, 'Comedy', null, 'Li Jie', 'Rain, Tang Yan, Luo Jin, Dilraba Dilmurat, Yao Yichen, Hao Shuang, Chen Qianduo', null, 'Xiao Liang is the CEO of the world''s biggest Diamond company. He''s reserved, strict and counts every penny while doing business. He also chooses to close himself off from people, insisting relationships are of no worth in his life. Everything turns upside down when he meets Mi Dou, a woman who changes his views in life and teaches him what it means to be alive and happy.', 'Xiao Liang is the CEO of the world''s biggest Diamond company. He''s reserved, strict and counts every penny while doing business. He also chooses to close himself off from people, insisting relationships are of no worth in his life. Everything turns upside down when he meets Mi Dou, a woman who changes his views in life and teaches him what it means to be alive and happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zXoDAIGyJENjhGL9Pi56roAN4C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63360'),
  ('48825915683528430', 'Diarra from Detroit', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Diarra Kilpatrick', null, 'Diarra Kilpatrick, Morris Chestnut, Phylicia Rashād, Dominique Perry, Claudia Logan, Bryan Terrell Clark, Shannon Wallace, Jon Chaffin', 'TV-MA', 'A divorcing, overworked teacher finds herself drawn into a cold case after a dating app matches her with a man she suspects is the adult version of a boy abducted in the 90s.', 'A divorcing, overworked teacher finds herself drawn into a cold case after a dating app matches her with a man she suspects is the adult version of a boy abducted in the 90s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82h6c3yOXvaty7s0VNIFV8Fc3We.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:247796'),
  ('249868947148073345', 'Diary of a Ditched Girl', 2025, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Carla Sehn, Moah Madsen, Dilan Apak, Malou Marnfeldt, Zahraa Aldoujaili, Mads Korsgaard, Amadeus Gustafsson', null, 'Amanda and her friends face the complexities of modern dating on apps and in bars, meeting a wide array of men but struggling to move past first dates.', 'Amanda and her friends face the complexities of modern dating on apps and in bars, meeting a wide array of men but struggling to move past first dates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKs19HQJgsLWXmw8uT0aADlSfQ9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283390'),
  ('720071233433726277', 'Diary of a Future President', 2020, 'Comedy, Kids', 'Ilana Peña', null, 'Tess Romero, Charlie Bushnell, Selenis Leyva, Michael Weaver', 'TV-PG', 'Told from the narration of her diary, 12-year-old Cuban-American Elena navigates the ups and downs of middle school and begins her journey to become the future president of the United States.', 'Told from the narration of her diary, 12-year-old Cuban-American Elena navigates the ups and downs of middle school and begins her journey to become the future president of the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rYfQOHZ3xVZP3usi2Q8TR9aVrv.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94761'),
  ('1128008609147781475', 'Diary of a Gigolo', 2022, 'Drama', 'Sebastián Ortega', 'Alejandra Quesada, Silvina Frejdkes', 'Jesús Castro, Victoria White, Fabiola Campomanes, Francisco Denis, Begoña Narváez, Eugenia Tobal, Alosian Vivancos, Adriana Barraza', 'TV-MA', 'A male escort''s life begins to unravel when he gets involved in a client''s family affairs and breaks the cardinal rule of his work: Don''t fall in love.', 'A male escort''s life begins to unravel when he gets involved in a client''s family affairs and breaks the cardinal rule of his work: Don''t fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuqszO6iQXqBsD4kP2xhlBN5ggc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208925'),
  ('700080700932102273', 'Diary of a Prosecutor', 2019, 'Drama', 'Park Yeon-seon', null, 'Lee Sun-kyun, Jung Ryeo-won, Lee Sung-jae, Kim Kwang-kyu, Jeon Seong-woo, Lee Sang-hee, Baek Hyun-joo, Kang Ye-seo', null, 'The stories of overworked prosecutors''s daily lives in Seoul. A drama depicting the mundane daily routine of overworked prosecutors staying up all night to tackle all the different cases handed over by the police.', 'The stories of overworked prosecutors''s daily lives in Seoul. A drama depicting the mundane daily routine of overworked prosecutors staying up all night to tackle all the different cases handed over by the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smVnwTqUfdjDCySFOdRd99eXp7p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95231'),
  ('864101575791169392', 'Diary of Our Days at the Breakwater', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kanon Takao, Natsumi Kawaida, Yu Sasahara, Satomi Akesaka', 'TV-14', 'Hina Tsurugi and her family have just moved to a quaint seaside town. Hoping to savor the sight of the peaceful ocean, Hina stumbles upon a girl named Yuuki Kuroiwa—an upperclassman at her new school—who invites Hina to join her in fishing. Hina reels in an octopus, which falls onto her; being afraid of bugs and big creatures, she panics and begs Yuuki to remove it from her. Yuuki sees this as an opportunity to force Hina to join the school''s Breakwater Club—a club where members gather, catch, and eat various types of marine life as their main activity. Although her attempts to refuse to join fail, Hina slowly begins to discover the hidden joy in fishing. Her view on the sport changes, now looking forward to all the delightful experiences she can take part in alongside her fellow club members.', 'Hina Tsurugi and her family have just moved to a quaint seaside town. Hoping to savor the sight of the peaceful ocean, Hina stumbles upon a girl named Yuuki Kuroiwa—an upperclassman at her new school—who invites Hina to join her in fishing. Hina reels in an octopus, which falls onto her; being afraid of bugs and big creatures, she panics and begs Yuuki to remove it from her. Yuuki sees this as an opportunity to force Hina to join the school''s Breakwater Club—a club where members gather, catch, and eat various types of marine life as their main activity. Although her attempts to refuse to join fail, Hina slowly begins to discover the hidden joy in fishing. Her view on the sport changes, now looking forward to all the delightful experiences she can take part in alongside her fellow club members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htP11RpdXdOjPRsXjjpFsPU24gf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94631'),
  ('1097125042890314773', 'Diary of Tootsies', 2016, 'Family, Comedy, Drama, News', 'Teerthwit Setthachai', null, 'Paopetch Charoensook, Thongchai Thongkanthom, Ratthanant Janyajirawong, Pattarasaya Kreursuwansiri, Kritsanapoom Pibulsonggram, Gunn Svasti, Oak Smith Arayaskul', null, 'After simultaneous heartbreaks, online diary writer Gus and his squad of queer BFFs navigate the ins and outs of dating to find true love.', 'After simultaneous heartbreaks, online diary writer Gus and his squad of queer BFFs navigate the ins and outs of dating to find true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BiOUhNu3gcVhk2cxaRhbveiGLl.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:72273'),
