  ('553736151532216998', 'Dice', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Scot Armstrong', null, 'Andrew Dice Clay, Kevin Corrigan, Natasha Leggero, Kurt Koehler, Eugene Kim, Chris Williams', 'TV-MA', 'Hickory, dickory, dock — the Dice Man''s back and he''s ready to rock. The semi-true stories of Andrew Dice Clay, whose unique brand of humor often gets him in trouble. Once on top, the comedian now must work to resurrect his career, pay his gambling debts, manage his sons’ rock band, fend off old fans and keep his family afloat.', 'Hickory, dickory, dock — the Dice Man''s back and he''s ready to rock. The semi-true stories of Andrew Dice Clay, whose unique brand of humor often gets him in trouble. Once on top, the comedian now must work to resurrect his career, pay his gambling debts, manage his sons’ rock band, fend off old fans and keep his family afloat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKTVOH9DonnjKzj4UOPYEIilvmI.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66094'),
  ('456472794878787403', 'Dicey Business', 2006, 'Drama', null, null, 'Bobby Au-Yeung Tsan-Wah, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Jessica Hsuan, Bosco Wong Chung-Chak, Tavia Yeung, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Florence Kwok Siu-Wan, Law Lok-Lam', null, 'Chai Foon-Cheung has not won a single game since his defeat in the World Poker Championship twenty years ago. It is the bad luck he has had all these years that has earned him a job in the casino. Ironically, the man who hires him is one of his then competitors Kiu Ching-Cho.', 'Chai Foon-Cheung has not won a single game since his defeat in the World Poker Championship twenty years ago. It is the bad luck he has had all these years that has earned him a job in the casino. Ironically, the man who hires him is one of his then competitors Kiu Ching-Cho.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvcpdufUx3JpgIt9IdwzplHPn3k.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5072'),
