  ('697647709826945102', 'Dick Powell''s Zane Grey Theatre', 1956, 'Western, Drama', 'Robert Florey, Dick Powell', null, 'Dick Powell', null, 'Dick Powell''s Zane Grey Theatre, sometimes simply called Zane Grey Theatre, is an American Western anthology series which ran on CBS from 1956 to 1961.', 'Dick Powell''s Zane Grey Theatre, sometimes simply called Zane Grey Theatre, is an American Western anthology series which ran on CBS from 1956 to 1961.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kY1GfRiVJI6pT5BdJmtJ5jtT6bh.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:14328'),
  ('594518999236336746', 'Dickensian', 2015, 'Drama', null, null, 'Alexandra Moen, Ned Dennehy, Stephen Rea, Pauline Collins, Peter Firth, Phoebe Dynevor, Omid Djalili, Zaak Conway', 'TV-PG', 'Dickensian intertwines the realm of fictional characters in Charles Dickens’ novels—including Scrooge, Fagin and Miss Havisham—in half-hour episodes, as their lives intertwine in 19th century London. The Old Curiosity Shop sits next door to The Three Cripples Pub, while Fagin’s Den is hidden down a murky alley off a bustling Victorian street.', 'Dickensian intertwines the realm of fictional characters in Charles Dickens’ novels—including Scrooge, Fagin and Miss Havisham—in half-hour episodes, as their lives intertwine in 19th century London. The Old Curiosity Shop sits next door to The Three Cripples Pub, while Fagin’s Den is hidden down a murky alley off a bustling Victorian street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zR4KnPuMAyyew16YdmwvXrLPUQd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63033'),
  ('650908691003552285', 'Dickinson', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alena Smith', 'Francis Weiss Rabkin, R. Eric Thomas', 'Hailee Steinfeld, Toby Huss, Adrian Enscoe, Anna Baryshnikov, Ella Hunt, Amanda Warren, Chinaza Uche, Jane Krakowski', 'TV-14', 'Emily Dickinson. Poet. Daughter. Total rebel. In this coming-of-age story, Emily’s determined to become the world''s greatest poet.', 'Emily Dickinson. Poet. Daughter. Total rebel. In this coming-of-age story, Emily’s determined to become the world''s greatest poet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDdcAfHBZ6Aalv53iR6o35CSLWA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:89901'),
  ('805303345837895620', 'Dicte', 2013, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kasper Barfoed, Elsebeth Egholm', null, 'Iben Hjejle, Lars Brygmann, Lærke Winther, Emilie Kruse, Dar Salim, Lars Ranthe, Søren Malling, Stine Stengade', null, 'Newly divorced journalist returns to her hometown to restart her life and work through her past.', 'Newly divorced journalist returns to her hometown to restart her life and work through her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDJ1wQtvJhlRVkAnc1hTNjriemE.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:51828'),
  ('634067274276302281', 'Didn''t I Say to Make My Abilities Average in the Next Life?!', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Azumi Waki, Sora Tokui, Fumiko Uchimura, Masumi Tazawa, Wataru Hatano, Hiyori Kouno, Maki Kawase, Kiyono Yasuno', 'TV-14', 'Kurihara Misato was a little more capable than other high school girls, and as a result, she was always alone and couldn''t live her life the way she wanted. When she was reincarnated in another world after a tragic accident, she wanted a chance to make normal friends and live a normal life. So she asked God for one thing... "Give me abilities that are average for that world!" But the abilities God gave her were not "average" at all... And now this girl, who''s been reborn in a world where magic is real, struggles to find simple, ordinary happiness!', 'Kurihara Misato was a little more capable than other high school girls, and as a result, she was always alone and couldn''t live her life the way she wanted. When she was reincarnated in another world after a tragic accident, she wanted a chance to make normal friends and live a normal life. So she asked God for one thing... "Give me abilities that are average for that world!" But the abilities God gave her were not "average" at all... And now this girl, who''s been reborn in a world where magic is real, struggles to find simple, ordinary happiness!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/I5ba54dxd7EqW0JMeAlftMEyXd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:91547'),
