  ('994522473680516006', 'Die Byl', 2016, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Elmarie Botha, Herman Binge', 'Elmarie Botha, Berdene Burger, Lorraine Burger', 'Waldemar Schultz, Lika Berning, Marvin-Lee Beukes, Milan Murray, Amalia Uys, Tyrone Keogh, Marcel Van Heerden', null, 'The unit specializes in the investigation of serial murders and is led by Van der Bijl, a former murder and robbery detective who gained fame for his handling of several high-profile cases. Each episode focuses on a serial killer. The main character, Colonel Piet van der Bijl, also known as Die Byl, is loosely modeled on the famous ex-detective Piet Byleveld.', 'The unit specializes in the investigation of serial murders and is led by Van der Bijl, a former murder and robbery detective who gained fame for his handling of several high-profile cases. Each episode focuses on a serial killer. The main character, Colonel Piet van der Bijl, also known as Die Byl, is loosely modeled on the famous ex-detective Piet Byleveld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kghfAPIlsBKK2xO7kAQpTxYBoQX.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:231404'),
