  ('594743297419208642', 'Dispatches from Elsewhere', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jason Segel', 'Patti Harrison, Jeff Hull, Spencer McCall', 'Jason Segel, André 3000, Sally Field, Richard E. Grant, Eve Lindley, Ceci Balagot', 'TV-14', 'A group of ordinary people who stumble onto a puzzle hiding just behind the veil of everyday life come to find that the mystery winds far deeper than they ever imagined.', 'A group of ordinary people who stumble onto a puzzle hiding just behind the veil of everyday life come to find that the mystery winds far deeper than they ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWskCna5DnRutdc66XERYFGek5s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81241'),
  ('300758859357236593', 'Distilling Love', 2007, 'Drama, Soap', 'Fernando Gaitán', 'Kary Fajer, Gerardo Luna', 'Angélica Rivera, Eduardo Yáñez, Sergio Sendel, Chantal Andere, Martha Julia, Ana Martín, Ana Patricia Rojo, Alejandro Tommasi', 'TV-14', 'Destilando Amor is a 2007 Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa and Nicandro Díaz. It stars Angélica Rivera and Eduardo Yáñez as the main protagonists and was set primarily in Tequila, Jalisco. It is a remake of the 1994 Colombian telenovela Café, con aroma de mujer, and was nominated for twelve Premios TVyNovelas of which it won ten including Best Telenovela of the Year.', 'Destilando Amor is a 2007 Mexican telenovela produced by Televisa and Nicandro Díaz. It stars Angélica Rivera and Eduardo Yáñez as the main protagonists and was set primarily in Tequila, Jalisco. It is a remake of the 1994 Colombian telenovela Café, con aroma de mujer, and was nominated for twelve Premios TVyNovelas of which it won ten including Best Telenovela of the Year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/L3MPoQSvfbHZAJEdskXTM1vdHi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12568'),
