  ('739186132873608277', 'Dive Club', 2021, 'Drama', 'Steve Jaggi', null, 'Georgia-May Davis, Mercy Cornwall, Aubri Ibrag, Sana''a Shaik, Miah Madden, Veronica Neave, John McNeill, Kate Peters', null, 'On the shores of Cape Mercy, a skillful group of teen divers investigate a series of secrets and signs after one of their own mysteriously goes missing.', 'On the shores of Cape Mercy, a skillful group of teen divers investigate a series of secrets and signs after one of their own mysteriously goes missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0pmXgbBepjIcE93g5OeqdCfZ60.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131830'),
  ('990302574698524625', 'Divine Gate', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Tetsuya Kakihara, Soma Saito, Yuichi Nakamura, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Ayana Taketatsu, Kanae Itou, Sora Amamiya', 'TV-14', 'The Divine Gate ushered in an era of chaos. Now, a select few have gathered to attempt to reach the Gate and remake the world.', 'The Divine Gate ushered in an era of chaos. Now, a select few have gathered to attempt to reach the Gate and remake the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHjODQq2sOK9kGhO09XtBgToxzQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66730'),
  ('816958143687036425', 'Divorce', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sharon Horgan', null, 'Sarah Jessica Parker, Thomas Haden Church, Molly Shannon, Talia Balsam, Charlie Kilgore, Sterling Jerins, Becki Newton', 'TV-MA', 'A middle-aged couple experience the pain, the relief and the trials and tribulations of a divorce in this dry, witty comedy.', 'A middle-aged couple experience the pain, the relief and the trials and tribulations of a divorce in this dry, witty comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1guXVT5XwvDTBjsvrFpk1p2E9Fd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67280'),
  ('729831415407138642', 'Divorce Attorney Shin', 2023, 'Drama', 'Yu Young-ah, Lee Jae-hoon', null, 'Cho Seung-woo, Han Hye-jin, Kim Sung-kyun, Jung Moon-sung, Lee Eun-jae, Kang Mal-geum, Jeon Bae-soo, Cha Hwa-yeon', 'TV-MA', 'Driven by a personal tragedy, a pianist-turned-lawyer navigates the complex world of divorce — fighting for his clients to win by any means necessary.', 'Driven by a personal tragedy, a pianist-turned-lawyer navigates the complex world of divorce — fighting for his clients to win by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjHkZNIzoiAvZMgpw9CaV1U86ux.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204241'),
  ('281150365427211222', 'Divorce Lawyer', 2004, 'Drama', null, null, 'Yuki Amami, Tetsuji Tamayama, Kuranosuke Sasaki, Mimura, Masahiko Tsugawa, Takanori Jinnai', null, 'Takako Mamiya is a lawyer who quits her job at a prestigious law firm and establishes her own office. She confidently sets out to build her business, but soon her former firm is putting up obstacles and interfering, causing Takako''s employees and clients to drift away. She finally puts together a new staff consisting of a college student who knows little about the law, a girl who applied for the job in hopes of meeting a rich guy, a hard-nosed lawyer, and a paralegal who hasn''t passed the bar exam yet. Takako reluctantly handles divorce cases with her incompetent crew. For an elite lawyer like her, divorce cases are the most boring and unrewarding cases that exist. Through clashing with her employees and clients, Takako soon becomes a very mature and tough lawyer. "Divorce Lawyer" also tells the story of how difficult it is to judge love and relationships in legal terms.', 'Takako Mamiya is a lawyer who quits her job at a prestigious law firm and establishes her own office. She confidently sets out to build her business, but soon her former firm is putting up obstacles and interfering, causing Takako''s employees and clients to drift away. She finally puts together a new staff consisting of a college student who knows little about the law, a girl who applied for the job in hopes of meeting a rich guy, a hard-nosed lawyer, and a paralegal who hasn''t passed the bar exam yet. Takako reluctantly handles divorce cases with her incompetent crew. For an elite lawyer like her, divorce cases are the most boring and unrewarding cases that exist. Through clashing with her employees and clients, Takako soon becomes a very mature and tough lawyer. "Divorce Lawyer" also tells the story of how difficult it is to judge love and relationships in legal terms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zh8KKAa8pFB6oqtPgQc9SLhISdU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:54607'),
  ('866700331572206367', 'Diya Aur Baati Hum', 2011, 'Drama, Family', 'Shashi Mittal, Sumeet Hukamchand Mittal', 'Seema Mantri', 'Deepika Singh Goyal, Anas Rashid, Neelu Vaghela, Ashok Lokhande, Kanika Maheshwari', 'TV-14', 'Diya Aur Baati Hum is an Indian television soap opera, broadcast on Star Plus channel from 29 August 2011. It stars Deepika Singh and Anas Rashid as the main protagonists.Set on the backdrop of Pushkar, Rajasthan, Diya Aur Baati Hum focused on breaking the stereotypical image of women in rural India by showing the inspirational journey of Sandhya Rathi, whose ambition is to become an IPS officer. She achieves her goal with the help of her husband, Sooraj, by going against all odds', 'Diya Aur Baati Hum is an Indian television soap opera, broadcast on Star Plus channel from 29 August 2011. It stars Deepika Singh and Anas Rashid as the main protagonists.Set on the backdrop of Pushkar, Rajasthan, Diya Aur Baati Hum focused on breaking the stereotypical image of women in rural India by showing the inspirational journey of Sandhya Rathi, whose ambition is to become an IPS officer. She achieves her goal with the help of her husband, Sooraj, by going against all odds', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/co0mUDxZjto9IBvYjLxu1LVE5NH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40382'),
  ('990409120836708173', 'DJ Mehdi: Made in France', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Thibaut de Longeville', null, 'DJ Mehdi, Abdelkarim Brahmi-Benalla, Pedro Winter, Gaspard Augé, Xavier de Rosnay', null, 'Self-taught composer, turntable prodigy, and visionary producer, DJ Mehdi was the only French artist to bridge the gap between two seemingly opposing worlds: rap and electro. Thirteen years after his sudden passing, this documentary series, directed by his childhood friend Thibaut de Longeville, sheds light on the role of this free spirit in the rise of these two musical scenes in France during the 1990s and 2000s.', 'Self-taught composer, turntable prodigy, and visionary producer, DJ Mehdi was the only French artist to bridge the gap between two seemingly opposing worlds: rap and electro. Thirteen years after his sudden passing, this documentary series, directed by his childhood friend Thibaut de Longeville, sheds light on the role of this free spirit in the rise of these two musical scenes in France during the 1990s and 2000s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hquWQzp0Ac8pzzS5ksKgi7fmXYt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:270751'),
  ('94249956746525446', 'Django', 2023, 'Western', 'Leonardo Fasoli, Maddalena Ravagli', 'Maddalena Ravagli, Leonardo Fasoli', 'Matthias Schoenaerts, Lisa Vicari, Nicholas Pinnock, Noomi Rapace, Jyuddah Jaymes, Eric Kole, Benny O. Arthur', 'TV-MA', 'In the Wild West in the 1860s and 1870s, Sarah and John have founded New Babylon, a city of outcasts of all backgrounds. Haunted by the murder of his family eight years earlier, Django is still looking for his daughter, believing she may have survived the killing. When Django shockingly finds her in Babylon, about to marry John, Sarah - now a grown woman - wants Django to leave fearing he''ll put Babylon in jeopardy. But Django, believing the city is in danger, is adamant that he will not lose his daughter twice.', 'In the Wild West in the 1860s and 1870s, Sarah and John have founded New Babylon, a city of outcasts of all backgrounds. Haunted by the murder of his family eight years earlier, Django is still looking for his daughter, believing she may have survived the killing. When Django shockingly finds her in Babylon, about to marry John, Sarah - now a grown woman - wants Django to leave fearing he''ll put Babylon in jeopardy. But Django, believing the city is in danger, is adamant that he will not lose his daughter twice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQ4GRmP0EEkxjwlPbZlVn7HLoZp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:125359'),
  ('756212438467693096', 'DMD Friendship The Reality', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'A group of artist trainees compete in a reality show to develop skills and find the perfect partner to win a lead role in a new Domundi BL series.', 'A group of artist trainees compete in a reality show to develop skills and find the perfect partner to win a lead role in a new Domundi BL series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfL2rOmWXOJQwjDS4lua4Z0HiqO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:244370'),
  ('1010054295436076395', 'DMV', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Dana Klein', null, 'Harriet Dyer, Tim Meadows, Molly Kearney, Alex Tarrant, Tony Cavalero, Gigi Zumbado', 'TV-PG', 'A single camera workplace comedy set at the place everyone dreads going most: the DMV. Our quirky and lovable characters are making minimum wage, doing a thankless job where customers are annoyed before they even walk in the door. Good thing they have each other.', 'A single camera workplace comedy set at the place everyone dreads going most: the DMV. Our quirky and lovable characters are making minimum wage, doing a thankless job where customers are annoyed before they even walk in the door. Good thing they have each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLCpxH7BhFwP50lF0VFpxeeFjmM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:289567'),
  ('590563084336915428', 'DMZ', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Roberto Patino', null, 'Rosario Dawson, Benjamin Bratt, Hoon Lee, Freddy Miyares, Mamie Gummer, Jordan Preston Carter, Venus Ariel, Amandla Jahava', 'TV-MA', 'In the near future after a bitter civil war leaves Manhattan a demilitarized zone (DMZ), destroyed and isolated from the rest of the world, fierce medic Alma Ortega sets out on a harrowing journey to find the son she lost in the evacuation of New York City at the onset of the conflict. Standing in her way are gangs, militias, demagogues and warlords, including Parco Delgado, the popular — and deadly — leader of one of the most powerful gangs in the DMZ.', 'In the near future after a bitter civil war leaves Manhattan a demilitarized zone (DMZ), destroyed and isolated from the rest of the world, fierce medic Alma Ortega sets out on a harrowing journey to find the son she lost in the evacuation of New York City at the onset of the conflict. Standing in her way are gangs, militias, demagogues and warlords, including Parco Delgado, the popular — and deadly — leader of one of the most powerful gangs in the DMZ.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnug9DhsenurS5dWCypjZSRFnH6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113566'),
  ('57467787646389802', 'DNA', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Torleif Hoppe', 'Torleif Hoppe', 'Anders W. Berthelsen, Olivia Joof Lewerissa, Charlotte Rampling, Zofia Wichłacz, Johanne Louise Schmidt, Sigurd Holmen le Dous', null, 'Five years after his daughter disappeared, a mistake in the National Police''s DNA register makes it possible for the officer Rolf to finally find out what happened to her.', 'Five years after his daughter disappeared, a mistake in the National Police''s DNA register makes it possible for the officer Rolf to finally find out what happened to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9nznsSr4DNObllAnI3Lqeg5S7Q6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93286'),
  ('674829000719478652', 'DNA Says Love You', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lin Hui-min, Hsin-Hao Huang, Wei-jie Lin, Yu-chen Kuo, Tannie Huang', null, 'Years after losing touch with his best friend, Le Jian meets a cryptic fan who leads him to a place that shouldn''t exist—Guilai Abbey.', 'Years after losing touch with his best friend, Le Jian meets a cryptic fan who leads him to a place that shouldn''t exist—Guilai Abbey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4iUohJhz8Xooe4VRuAXuens5xCR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154083'),
  ('45919865662052089', 'DNA²', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Keiichi Nanba, Mina Tominaga, Hiroko Kasahara, Megumi Hayashibara, Takehito Koyasu, Hekiru Shiina, Ryusuke Ohbayashi', 'TV-14', 'Karin, a DNA operator from the future, is on a mission to change the course of History by stopping Junta Momonari from becoming the Mega-Playboy who fathered 100 children and led to the overpopulation of the world. But Junta is no playboy; in fact he is allergic to girls. But when Karin shoots him with the wrong DNA-altering bullet, he starts sporadically becoming the Mega-Playboy capable of charming any woman. Karin must try to restore the situation to normal before the change to Mega-Playboy becomes irreversible.', 'Karin, a DNA operator from the future, is on a mission to change the course of History by stopping Junta Momonari from becoming the Mega-Playboy who fathered 100 children and led to the overpopulation of the world. But Junta is no playboy; in fact he is allergic to girls. But when Karin shoots him with the wrong DNA-altering bullet, he starts sporadically becoming the Mega-Playboy capable of charming any woman. Karin must try to restore the situation to normal before the change to Mega-Playboy becomes irreversible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6JFx2Tzio2BId8ZUBdFlQpZUY2w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43384'),
  ('687114100383268620', 'Do Dil Mil Rahe Hai', 2023, null, null, 'Reshu Nath', null, null, 'He repels love , she resembles it ! Rishi and Pihu are worlds apart but unaware of the past that connects them . Will fate lead the duo down the road to true love ?', 'He repels love , she resembles it ! Rishi and Pihu are worlds apart but unaware of the past that connects them . Will fate lead the duo down the road to true love ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juYg1PQzCmDJYyGtrW0Xbvke1jx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228627'),
  ('808978167524419260', 'Do Do Sol Sol La La Sol', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Min-gyeong, Oh Ji-young', 'Oh Ji-young', 'Go Ara, Lee Jae-wook, Kim Ju-hun, Shin Eun-soo, Ye Ji-won, Lee Soon-jae, Moon Hee-kyung, Seo Yi-sook', null, 'A riches-to-rags pianist who loses everything but her smile is guided by twinkling little stars to a small town where she finds hope, home and love.', 'A riches-to-rags pianist who loses everything but her smile is guided by twinkling little stars to a small town where she finds hope, home and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2LOL5NLuHivBhOQ1ybEBgyAVpC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106465'),
  ('810496851100025323', 'Do Duniya, Ek Dil', 2026, null, null, null, null, null, 'Honest tech visionary Shivaay grows averse to technology after a scam. When he falls for digital influencer Aadhya, two worlds clash, albeit with love!', 'Honest tech visionary Shivaay grows averse to technology after a scam. When he falls for digital influencer Aadhya, two worlds clash, albeit with love!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7uXxv7zBdk78kxN1KlEUU4xifx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316230'),
  ('907394852466542888', 'Do It Yourself!!', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Konomi Inagaki, Kana Ichinose, Ayane Sakura, Azumi Waki, Karin Takahashi, Nichika Omori, Yumi Kakazu', 'TV-14', 'Building furniture and friendships have a lot in common. Intention, effort, and hard work are needed for both crafts. This is a story of girls in a DIY club building both as they carve out their futures. None of it comes easy, but that doesn’t stop any of ’em. Furniture, friendships, and the future—they’re building it all with their own hands!', 'Building furniture and friendships have a lot in common. Intention, effort, and hard work are needed for both crafts. This is a story of girls in a DIY club building both as they carve out their futures. None of it comes easy, but that doesn’t stop any of ’em. Furniture, friendships, and the future—they’re building it all with their own hands!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7hcg0gUvKaLHshVH3WG4CTTrT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121702'),
  ('117204817254899542', 'Do No Harm', 2013, 'Drama', 'David Schulner', null, 'Steven Pasquale, Phylicia Rashād, Ruta Gedmintas, Alana de la Garza, Michael Esper, John Carroll Lynch, Lin-Manuel Miranda', null, 'Jason Cole, a brilliant neurosurgeon has to battle with his own alter-ego, Ian Price, in order to live a normal life in this modern take on Jekyll and Hyde.', 'Jason Cole, a brilliant neurosurgeon has to battle with his own alter-ego, Ian Price, in order to live a normal life in this modern take on Jekyll and Hyde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHXUJU81QEThgz7LMNvT9UnZ2cT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45046'),
  ('686591831099191545', 'Do You Like Big Girls?', 2026, 'Animation', null, null, 'Rin Hinishi, Sui Mizushirou, Kanna Natsuki, Hana Mameshiba, Reika Fujisawa, Aki Nagatsuki, Noel Kanzaki', null, 'Sota was suddenly made dorm manager and coach of the Hokuei University Women''s Volleyball Club as prompted by his older sister, Kaori. There, he had a fateful reunion with Ayano, his first love... In the girls'' dorm! In the gym! In a hotel?! What awaited him were days of being bossed around by girls bigger than him! A Happy Harem Rom-Com of Size Differences♡ Born Huge on the Northern Plains!!', 'Sota was suddenly made dorm manager and coach of the Hokuei University Women''s Volleyball Club as prompted by his older sister, Kaori. There, he had a fateful reunion with Ayano, his first love... In the girls'' dorm! In the gym! In a hotel?! What awaited him were days of being bossed around by girls bigger than him! A Happy Harem Rom-Com of Size Differences♡ Born Huge on the Northern Plains!!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJPsDqnk0kjTelnO2f832KN1RA6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316715'),
  ('526363445100858418', 'Do You Like Brahms?', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ryu Bo-ri', 'Ryu Bo-ri', 'Park Eun-bin, Kim Min-jae, Kim Sung-cheol, Park Ji-hyun, Lee You-jin, Bae Da-bin, Ye Su-jeong, Kim Jong-tae', 'TV-PG', 'A drama about the dreams and love of classical music students who find their own happiness after wandering between talent and reality.', 'A drama about the dreams and love of classical music students who find their own happiness after wandering between talent and reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kuSIA9uXZJE8LHePszDEYPSSLP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101857'),
  ('886539770087066655', 'Do You Love Your Mom and Her Two-Hit Multi-Target Attacks?', 2019, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ai Kayano, Haruki Ishiya, Sayumi Suzushiro, Sayaka Harada, Lynn, Satomi Arai', null, 'Just when Masato thought that a random survey conducted in school was over, he got involved in a secret Government scheme. As he was carried along with the flow, he ended up in a Game world! As if that wasn''t enough, shockingly, his mother was there as well! It was a little different from a typical transported to another world setting, but after some bickering, "Mom wants go on an adventure together with Maa-kun. Can mom become Maa-kun''s companion?" With that, Masato and Mamako began their adventure as a mother and son pair. They met Porta, a cute traveling merchant, and Wise, a regrettable philosopher. Along with their new party members, Masato and co. start on their journey.', 'Just when Masato thought that a random survey conducted in school was over, he got involved in a secret Government scheme. As he was carried along with the flow, he ended up in a Game world! As if that wasn''t enough, shockingly, his mother was there as well! It was a little different from a typical transported to another world setting, but after some bickering, "Mom wants go on an adventure together with Maa-kun. Can mom become Maa-kun''s companion?" With that, Masato and Mamako began their adventure as a mother and son pair. They met Porta, a cute traveling merchant, and Wise, a regrettable philosopher. Along with their new party members, Masato and co. start on their journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w97kujliFaiddVCZhc2k2qJxkI0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88808'),
  ('288836388930105383', 'Do Your Best Genki', 1980, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Yû Koyama', null, 'Toshiko Fujita, Katsuji Mori, Makio Inoue, Kazuko Sugiyama, Shuichi Ikeda, Hiroshi Masuoka, Keiko Han, Hiroshi Otake', null, 'Do Your Best Genki is a sports manga by Yū Koyama about Horiguchi Genki, a boy who is raised by a single father, and who wants to be a boxer like him. It was adapted as an anime television series by Toei Animation. The manga received the Shogakukan Manga Award for shōnen in 1977.', 'Do Your Best Genki is a sports manga by Yū Koyama about Horiguchi Genki, a boy who is raised by a single father, and who wants to be a boxer like him. It was adapted as an anime television series by Toei Animation. The manga received the Shogakukan Manga Award for shōnen in 1977.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suWDMXbqdY767ZYfKmaoih7Lpoe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43223'),
  ('430767900835598264', 'Doc', 2001, 'Drama, Family', 'Gary R. Johnson, Dave Alan Johnson', null, 'Billy Ray Cyrus, Tyler Posey, Derek McGrath, Ron Lea, Ruth Marshall, Andrea C. Robinson, Tracy Shreve, Richard Leacock', 'TV-G', 'Doc is a medical drama/family drama with strong Christian undertones starring Billy Ray Cyrus as Dr. Clint "Doc" Cassidy, a Montana doctor who takes a job in a New York City medical clinic. It ran from March 11, 2001 to November 28, 2004 on PAX. Although set in New York City, all the episodes were shot in and around Toronto, Ontario, Canada.', 'Doc is a medical drama/family drama with strong Christian undertones starring Billy Ray Cyrus as Dr. Clint "Doc" Cassidy, a Montana doctor who takes a job in a New York City medical clinic. It ran from March 11, 2001 to November 28, 2004 on PAX. Although set in New York City, all the episodes were shot in and around Toronto, Ontario, Canada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hNOf5ulemoI7EqYg8fDVIclFzq.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:10042'),
  ('111291718070489151', 'Doc', 2020, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Viola Rispoli, Francesco Arlanch', null, 'Luca Argentero, Matilde Gioli, Pierpaolo Spollon, Sara Lazzaro, Simona Tabasco, Alberto Boubakar Malanchino, Elisa Di Eusanio, Giovanni Scifoni', 'NR', 'When Doctor Andrea Fanti loses 12 years of memories from a brain injury, he finds himself adjusting to a world full of strangers.', 'When Doctor Andrea Fanti loses 12 years of memories from a brain injury, he finds himself adjusting to a world full of strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yFfvnYMGXYmGbtmiIrRuRzJzUU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:101048'),
  ('751286985227736951', 'Doc', 2025, 'Drama', 'Barbie Kligman', null, 'Molly Parker, Omar Metwally, Amirah Vann, Jon Ecker, Anya Banerjee, Charlotte Fountain-Jardim, Patrick Walker, Felicity Huffman', 'TV-14', 'Dr. Amy Larsen must navigate an unfamiliar world after a brain injury erases the last eight years of her life. She can rely only on her estranged 17-year-old daughter, whom she remembers as a 9-year-old, and a handful of devoted friends, as she struggles to continue practicing medicine, despite having lost nearly a decade of knowledge and experience.', 'Dr. Amy Larsen must navigate an unfamiliar world after a brain injury erases the last eight years of her life. She can rely only on her estranged 17-year-old daughter, whom she remembers as a 9-year-old, and a handful of devoted friends, as she struggles to continue practicing medicine, despite having lost nearly a decade of knowledge and experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYHrPWM6qGq2XSbaWUONckBgUir.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:255055'),
  ('130213800743921019', 'DOC', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Juan Pablo Medina, Gabriela de la Garza, Stephanie Cayo, Iván Sánchez, Macarena García, Martín Saracho, Nicolasa Ortíz Monasterio, José Ramón Barreto', null, 'After an attack wipes 12 years of memories, a brilliant doctor must relearn his past, navigate tangled romances and a looming scandal over a new medication.', 'After an attack wipes 12 years of memories, a brilliant doctor must relearn his past, navigate tangled romances and a looming scandal over a new medication.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pG7oNCHSjuajUFXpqjJ76fac5J7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314006'),
  ('508975429554555553', 'Doc Martin', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dominic Minghella', null, 'Martin Clunes, Caroline Catz, Joe Absolom, Ian McNeice, Selina Cadell, Ben Miller', 'TV-14', 'Doc Martin is a British television comedy drama series starring Martin Clunes in the title role. It was created by Dominic Minghella after the character of Dr. Martin Bamford in the 2000 comedy film Saving Grace. The show is set in the fictional seaside village of Portwenn and filmed on location in the village of Port Isaac, Cornwall, England, with most interior scenes shot in a converted local barn. Five series aired between 2004 and 2011, together with a feature-length special that aired on Christmas Day 2006. Series 6 began airing on ITV on 2 September 2013.', 'Doc Martin is a British television comedy drama series starring Martin Clunes in the title role. It was created by Dominic Minghella after the character of Dr. Martin Bamford in the 2000 comedy film Saving Grace. The show is set in the fictional seaside village of Portwenn and filmed on location in the village of Port Isaac, Cornwall, England, with most interior scenes shot in a converted local barn. Five series aired between 2004 and 2011, together with a feature-length special that aired on Christmas Day 2006. Series 6 began airing on ITV on 2 September 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmd4ZpdXWnjKVrenqvYyYstOkwK.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:2430'),
  ('804407604396833631', 'Doc McStuffins', 2012, 'Animation, Kids, Family', 'Chris Nee', null, 'Kiara Muhammad, Kimberly Brooks, Gary Anthony Williams, Loretta Devine, Jess Harnell, Robbie Rist, Lara Jill Miller, Jaden Betts', 'TV-G', 'A young African-American girl aspires to be a doctor like her mom.', 'A young African-American girl aspires to be a doctor like her mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeGWJaFkxX0vvOFFpNFXrh9QVxl.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:46262'),
  ('472388504145580544', 'Doctor Bahu', 2026, 'Drama', 'Mehreen Jabbar', null, 'Kubra Khan, Shuja Asad, Shahzad Nawaz, Saba Hameed, Hajra Yamin, Mira Sethi, Adeel Husain, Atiqa Odho', null, 'With compassion in her heart and courage in her decision. She heals lives in the hospital and fights expectations at home. Starring Kubra Khan and Shuja Asad. Dr. Bahu, where dreams meet responsibility.', 'With compassion in her heart and courage in her decision. She heals lives in the hospital and fights expectations at home. Starring Kubra Khan and Shuja Asad. Dr. Bahu, where dreams meet responsibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFC3vhiFyLpl3UcAPbNzAIRBa5m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317817'),
  ('423426300000143618', 'Doctor Castor', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Marco Antônio Araújo', 'Marco Antônio Araújo', 'Castor de Andrade, Dé Aranha', null, 'Powerful boss of the "jogo do bicho" (an illegal and very popular lottery of numbers associated to animals), Castor de Andrade used football and carnival to legitimize his image. Seductive, charismatic and violent, he built an empire of crimes in the city of Rio de Janeiro.', 'Powerful boss of the "jogo do bicho" (an illegal and very popular lottery of numbers associated to animals), Castor de Andrade used football and carnival to legitimize his image. Seductive, charismatic and violent, he built an empire of crimes in the city of Rio de Janeiro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j11ZZgDJtr2TdAB0N2v2IByx54Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118585'),
  ('774090827350310986', 'Doctor Cha', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Dae-jin, Jung Yeo-rang', null, 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Kim Byong-chul, Myung Se-bin, Min Woo-hyuk, Song Ji-ho, Jo A-ram, Baek Joo-hee, Park Joon-geum', 'TV-14', 'Twenty years after leaving her medical career, a housewife returns as a first-year resident — struggling to find her footing in a job full of surprises.', 'Twenty years after leaving her medical career, a housewife returns as a first-year resident — struggling to find her footing in a job full of surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgQQeiy2zyfla5y2yiZJGGU4y1I.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214997'),
  ('227056831963893884', 'Doctor Climax', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Kongdej Jaturanrasmee', 'Chantavit Dhanasevi, Arachaporn Pokinpakorn, Chermawee Suwanpanuchoke, Tonhon Tantivejakul, Chaiwat Thongsaeng, Somlek Sakdikul, Nimit Luksameepong, Uthumporn Silaphan', 'TV-MA', 'In 1970s Thailand, a dermatologist unexpectedly starts a mass sexual awakening after becoming Doctor Climax, a taboo-defying newspaper columnist.', 'In 1970s Thailand, a dermatologist unexpectedly starts a mass sexual awakening after becoming Doctor Climax, a taboo-defying newspaper columnist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJlrXHd6NSW87u1ZOLqgpZUWush.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:251309'),
  ('608802831427515922', 'Doctor Detective', 2023, 'Mystery', null, null, 'Nadech Kugimiya, Kimberly Ann Voltemas, Alexander Rendell, Phulita Supinchompoo, Sanya Kunakorn, Kathaleeya McIntosh, Songsit Rungnopakunsi, Phollawat Manuprasert', null, 'When a deadly infectious disease resembling the Ebola virus ravages a small village, a team of epidemiologists led by Doctor Khunkhao races against time to investigate the source of the outbreak and contain the spread.', 'When a deadly infectious disease resembling the Ebola virus ravages a small village, a team of epidemiologists led by Doctor Khunkhao races against time to investigate the source of the outbreak and contain the spread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHLvs6yUv7V0gfTCUGZM22ydIEA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232834'),
  ('999796632441272343', 'Doctor Doctor', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alan Harris, Tony McNamara, Claudia Karvan', null, 'Rodger Corser, Nicole da Silva, Ryan Johnson, Hayley McElhinney, Belinda Bromilow, Tina Bursill, Matt Castley, Chloe Bayliss', 'NR', 'The story of Hugh Knight, a rising heart surgeon who is gifted, charming and infallible. He is a hedonist who, due to his sheer talent, believes he can live outside the rules. His "work hard, play harder" philosophy is about to come back and bite him.', 'The story of Hugh Knight, a rising heart surgeon who is gifted, charming and infallible. He is a hedonist who, due to his sheer talent, believes he can live outside the rules. His "work hard, play harder" philosophy is about to come back and bite him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cop35HdXqbrPDc9ClyrOmv3sJV2.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:67728'),
  ('114767033213547538', 'Doctor Elise: The Royal Lady with the Lamp', 2024, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yui Ishikawa, Yohei Azakami, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Satoshi Hino, Daisuke Ono, Hiro Shimono, Megumi Han, Soma Saito', 'TV-14', 'Making up for her sins in a past life as the evil princess Elise, Aoi Takamoto dedicates her life to saving people as a doctor. But a fatal accident cuts her atonement short, and suddenly, she''s back to her previous life, 10 years before her death! Will her foresight and medical brilliance help her change her past ways and heal an ailing empire, or is fate doomed to repeat itself?', 'Making up for her sins in a past life as the evil princess Elise, Aoi Takamoto dedicates her life to saving people as a doctor. But a fatal accident cuts her atonement short, and suddenly, she''s back to her previous life, 10 years before her death! Will her foresight and medical brilliance help her change her past ways and heal an ailing empire, or is fate doomed to repeat itself?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYqcim8IjD8TNoae9SAcYrRmVXi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221310'),
  ('307059261750204935', 'Doctor Foster', 2015, 'Drama', 'Mike Bartlett', null, 'Suranne Jones, Bertie Carvel, Clare-Hope Ashitey, Isabelle Estelle Corbusier, Thusitha Jayasundera, Martha Howe-Douglas, Jodie Comer, Tom Taylor', null, 'A woman suspects her husband of having an affair. After following several lines of enquiries far more unravels including a streak of violence below the surface.', 'A woman suspects her husband of having an affair. After following several lines of enquiries far more unravels including a streak of violence below the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJiaterDM3tZ2yioR24RzJpLhzD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:63913'),
  ('721973758042307731', 'Doctor John', 2019, 'Drama', 'Jo Soo-won', 'Kim Ji-woon', 'Ji Sung, Lee Se-young, Oh Hyun-joong, Lee Kyoo-hyung, Kim Hye-eun, Shin Dong-mi, Jeon No-min, Uhm Hyo-seop', null, 'Cha Yo-Han—an arrogant but genius doctor of anesthesiology—and Kang Shi-Young—a smart, warm resident of anesthesiology—work together to help people with mysterious cases of acute or chronic pain.', 'Cha Yo-Han—an arrogant but genius doctor of anesthesiology—and Kang Shi-Young—a smart, warm resident of anesthesiology—work together to help people with mysterious cases of acute or chronic pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EtZ91FzsFRe3FFtAr29ESgW9QK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90706'),
  ('1126789276515518091', 'Doctor Lawyer', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', null, 'Jang Hong-cheol', 'So Ji-sub, Shin Sung-rok, Im Soo-hyang, Lee Ju-bin, Lee Kyung-young, Lee Dong-ha, Woo Hyun-ju, Kim Ho-jung', null, 'The heartwarming story of a genius surgeon who becomes a lawyer specializing in medical crimes after losing a patient to a surgical malpractice. Cathartic and suspenseful, this medical and legal drama paints the courtroom like an operating room, where a life may end or be given a fresh start.', 'The heartwarming story of a genius surgeon who becomes a lawyer specializing in medical crimes after losing a patient to a surgical malpractice. Cathartic and suspenseful, this medical and legal drama paints the courtroom like an operating room, where a life may end or be given a fresh start.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/scDumcueQr2Cy5nh2s7xI6hTYOk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196906'),
  ('1078030364563695070', 'Doctor Odyssey', 2024, 'Drama', 'Ryan Murphy, Jon Robin Baitz, Joe Baken', null, 'Joshua Jackson, Phillipa Soo, Sean Teale, Don Johnson', 'TV-14', 'Max is the new on-board doctor for a luxury cruise ship where the small but mighty medical team navigate unique medical crises and each other, miles from shore.', 'Max is the new on-board doctor for a luxury cruise ship where the small but mighty medical team navigate unique medical crises and each other, miles from shore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78KamrNZE0ZzPLBjEug16BASJ5M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249695'),
  ('1109891048377824710', 'Doctor Prisoner', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Park Kye-ok', 'Namkoong Min, Kwon Na-ra, Kim Byong-chul, Choi Won-young, Park Eun-seok, Lee Da-in, Lee Min-young, Lee Jun-hyeok', null, 'An ace doctor in a university hospital is wrongfully accused of a medical malpractice incident and gets ousted from the hospital. He then applies to work at a prison, where he plans to make personal connections with all the big shots in prison with the ultimate goal of getting revenge against the hospital that kicked him out.', 'An ace doctor in a university hospital is wrongfully accused of a medical malpractice incident and gets ousted from the hospital. He then applies to work at a prison, where he plans to make personal connections with all the big shots in prison with the ultimate goal of getting revenge against the hospital that kicked him out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PgxMS7rl3GaVlW7ZJgCSeV6jZM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87187'),
  ('929058277840818523', 'Doctor Shin', 2026, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Im Sung-han', 'Im Sung-han', 'Jung E-chan, Baek Seo-ra, An Woo-yeon, Joo Se-Bin, Chun Young-min, Song Ji-in, Jeon No-min, Gee Young-san', null, 'A medical thriller melodrama depicting the events that unfold between a genius doctor and the woman he loves after a chance accident.', 'A medical thriller melodrama depicting the events that unfold between a genius doctor and the woman he loves after a chance accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6aFUObSFb0zItRg6gow7T88kIm5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314669'),
  ('445262032350725722', 'Doctor Slump', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Oh Hyun-jong, Paek Sun-woo', null, 'Park Shin-hye, Park Hyung-sik, Yoon Park, Kong Seong-ha, Park Won-ho, Hyun Bong-sik, Jang Hye-jin, Youn Sang-hyun', 'TV-14', 'Once rivals in school, two brilliant doctors reunite by chance — each facing life’s worst slump and unexpectedly finding solace in each other.', 'Once rivals in school, two brilliant doctors reunite by chance — each facing life’s worst slump and unexpectedly finding solace in each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOWmbZEbhvrYyWm6O4W3oHf2S9B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222233'),
  ('232506816110293421', 'Doctor Snuggles', 1981, 'Animation, Family, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jeffrey O''Kelly', null, 'Peter Ustinov, Kurt Zips, Michael Ande, Peter Capell, Lambert Hamel, Elisabeth Wiedemann, Ulli Philipp', 'TV-G', 'Doctor Snuggles is an animated television series created by Jeffrey O''Kelly based on original artwork by Nick Price, about a friendly and optimistic inventor named Doctor Snuggles who has unusual adventures with his friends. The show featured fantastical scenarios which usually involved Doctor Snuggles inventing something outlandish such as a robot helper or diamond-making machine, and had a variety of supporting characters who were mostly anthropomorphic animals.', 'Doctor Snuggles is an animated television series created by Jeffrey O''Kelly based on original artwork by Nick Price, about a friendly and optimistic inventor named Doctor Snuggles who has unusual adventures with his friends. The show featured fantastical scenarios which usually involved Doctor Snuggles inventing something outlandish such as a robot helper or diamond-making machine, and had a variety of supporting characters who were mostly anthropomorphic animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPPycrOUzvBdwTamPasTllCksfb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3133'),
  ('465885716495817006', 'Doctor Stranger', 2014, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Park Jin-Woo', 'Lee Jong-suk, Park Hae-jin, Jin Se-yeon, Kang So-ra, Jeon Kuk-hwan, Lee Il-hwa, Choi Jung-woo, Kim Ji-young', 'NR', 'As a child, Park Hoon and his dad were kidnapped and taken to North Korea. He grew up there, learning to be a doctor just like his father. When Park Hoon escapes back to South Korea and begins work at a prestigious hospital, he makes it his goal to earn enough money to go back to North Korea to rescue his true love. He''ll do anything to find her, but then he meets and falls for a mysterious woman who looks exactly like her.', 'As a child, Park Hoon and his dad were kidnapped and taken to North Korea. He grew up there, learning to be a doctor just like his father. When Park Hoon escapes back to South Korea and begins work at a prestigious hospital, he makes it his goal to earn enough money to go back to North Korea to rescue his true love. He''ll do anything to find her, but then he meets and falls for a mysterious woman who looks exactly like her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odH9cebqUNHKh1p6BKVSs0gsD34.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60956'),
  ('116600968276499611', 'Doctor Thorne', 2016, 'Drama', 'Julian Fellowes', 'Julian Fellowes', 'Tom Hollander, Stefanie Martini, Harry Richardson, Rebecca Front, Richard McCabe, Alison Brie, Janine Duvitski, Ian McShane', 'TV-14', 'The story of the penniless Mary Thorne, who grows up with her rich aunt/cousins at Greshamsbury Park estate.', 'The story of the penniless Mary Thorne, who grows up with her rich aunt/cousins at Greshamsbury Park estate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9ni5ueY1tiKOBPOObH7KxyZKZL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65805'),
  ('120975208999622079', 'Doctor Who', 1963, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'C. E. Webber, Donald Wilson, Verity Lambert', null, 'Sylvester McCoy, Sophie Aldred', 'TV-PG', 'The adventures of The Doctor, a time-traveling humanoid alien known as a Time Lord. He explores the universe in his TARDIS, a sentient time-traveling spaceship. Its exterior appears as a blue British police box, which was a common sight in Britain in 1963 when the series first aired. Along with a succession of companions, The Doctor faces a variety of foes while working to save civilizations, help ordinary people, and right many wrongs.', 'The adventures of The Doctor, a time-traveling humanoid alien known as a Time Lord. He explores the universe in his TARDIS, a sentient time-traveling spaceship. Its exterior appears as a blue British police box, which was a common sight in Britain in 1963 when the series first aired. Along with a succession of companions, The Doctor faces a variety of foes while working to save civilizations, help ordinary people, and right many wrongs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xinqAmYrZ1TEwowcQhgTkZVtVE0.jpg', 26, 'tmdb:tv:121'),
  ('46208428596283258', 'Doctor Who', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Sydney Newman, C. E. Webber, Donald Wilson', null, 'Jodie Whittaker, Mandip Gill, John Bishop', 'TV-PG', 'The Doctor is a Time Lord: a 900 year old alien with 2 hearts, part of a gifted civilization who mastered time travel. The Doctor saves planets for a living—more of a hobby actually, and the Doctor''s very, very good at it.', 'The Doctor is a Time Lord: a 900 year old alien with 2 hearts, part of a gifted civilization who mastered time travel. The Doctor saves planets for a living—more of a hobby actually, and the Doctor''s very, very good at it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8enSKCf6Zm0topeQ2XPccDqsqp.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:57243'),
  ('296315210332552343', 'Doctor Who', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ncuti Gatwa, Varada Sethu', 'TV-PG', 'The Doctor and his companion travel across time and space encountering incredible friends and foes.', 'The Doctor and his companion travel across time and space encountering incredible friends and foes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JP6NSmBwxg75uTcIHiv5R8PpPi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:239770'),
  ('66102620139550877', 'Doctor Who Confidential', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Gillane Seaborne, Russell T Davies', null, 'Matt Smith, Karen Gillan, Russell Tovey, Arthur Darvill', null, 'Doctor Who Confidential is a documentary to complement the revival of the long-running British science fiction television series Doctor Who. Each episode was broadcast on BBC Three on Saturdays, immediately after the broadcast of the weekly television episode on BBC One. The running time of the first two series was 30 minutes, being extended to 45 minutes in the third. BBC Three also broadcast a cut-down edition of the programme, lasting 15 minutes, shown after the repeats on Sundays and Fridays and after the weekday evening repeats of earlier seasons.', 'Doctor Who Confidential is a documentary to complement the revival of the long-running British science fiction television series Doctor Who. Each episode was broadcast on BBC Three on Saturdays, immediately after the broadcast of the weekly television episode on BBC One. The running time of the first two series was 30 minutes, being extended to 45 minutes in the third. BBC Three also broadcast a cut-down edition of the programme, lasting 15 minutes, shown after the repeats on Sundays and Fridays and after the weekday evening repeats of earlier seasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TAO5VgSyICVTL5Hvv6L4V12nig.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:1056'),
  ('753607008060236867', 'Doctor Zhivago', 2002, 'Drama', 'Andrew Davies', null, 'Hans Matheson, Keira Knightley, Celia Imrie, Alexandra Maria Lara, Sam Neill, Hugh Bonneville, Kris Marshall, Bill Paterson', null, 'Young and beautiful Lara is loved by three men: a revolutionary, a mogul, and a doctor. Their lives become intertwined with the drama of Russian revolution. Doctor Zhivago is still married when he meets Lara. Their love story is unfolding against the backdrop of revolution which affects the doctor''s career, his family, and his love to Lara.', 'Young and beautiful Lara is loved by three men: a revolutionary, a mogul, and a doctor. Their lives become intertwined with the drama of Russian revolution. Doctor Zhivago is still married when he meets Lara. Their love story is unfolding against the backdrop of revolution which affects the doctor''s career, his family, and his love to Lara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqQRFtJmXrTJWjuZvtKJZawagWb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11203'),
  ('696220536017412122', 'Doctor-X: Surgeon Michiko Daimon', 2012, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Ryoko Yonekura, Yuki Uchida, Kenichi Endo, Ittoku Kishibe, Toshiyuki Nishida, Kosuke Suzuki, Masanobu Katsumura, Mio Imada', null, 'Daimon Michiko is a 37-year-old freelance surgeon who is part of a questionable “doctor placement service” that has her wander from hospital to hospital. The harsh environment at the hospitals led many doctors to retire from their positions, forcing hospitals to make use of said program to fill the empty spots at least temporary. However, Michiko doesn’t look like a doctor at all with her flashy clothes and eccentric attitude. In the first episode she raises objections to a certain operation which is planned to be done by the head of a hospital who hasn’t performed an operation for a very long time. This causes Michiko to incur odium at the hospital, however, everyone becomes frozen when Michiko points out the outdated skills of the director. She also holds a scrupulous compliance when it comes to her working hours, never does any unnecessary chores that don’t require a medical license, and couldn’t care less about the power struggles within the hospitals. Nobody knows how she acquired such a top-level skill that allows her to claim exorbitant sums as reward, but her private life is an even greater mystery to everyone around her. Tanaka plays a rookie surgeon, Uchida an anesthetist, Kishibe the head of the placement service, and Ito the head of the surgical department of this institution.', 'Daimon Michiko is a 37-year-old freelance surgeon who is part of a questionable “doctor placement service” that has her wander from hospital to hospital. The harsh environment at the hospitals led many doctors to retire from their positions, forcing hospitals to make use of said program to fill the empty spots at least temporary. However, Michiko doesn’t look like a doctor at all with her flashy clothes and eccentric attitude. In the first episode she raises objections to a certain operation which is planned to be done by the head of a hospital who hasn’t performed an operation for a very long time. This causes Michiko to incur odium at the hospital, however, everyone becomes frozen when Michiko points out the outdated skills of the director. She also holds a scrupulous compliance when it comes to her working hours, never does any unnecessary chores that don’t require a medical license, and couldn’t care less about the power struggles within the hospitals. Nobody knows how she acquired such a top-level skill that allows her to claim exorbitant sums as reward, but her private life is an even greater mystery to everyone around her. Tanaka plays a rookie surgeon, Uchida an anesthetist, Kishibe the head of the placement service, and Ito the head of the surgical department of this institution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DjPvjvhDCyy6fH8Ko7Fkq0Zbiw.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:46052'),
  ('1091721420428846184', 'Doctor: In Another Life', 2026, 'Drama', 'Pınar Bulut, Onur Koralp', null, 'İbrahim Çelikkol, Sıla Türkoğlu, Şebnem Hassanisoughi, Bertan Asllani, Güven Murat Akpınar, Ferit Aktuğ, Eylül Tumbar, Berk Özgür', null, 'After surviving a severe attack, Prof. Dr. İnan Kural, the distinguished chief physician of Umutpark Medical Foundation Hospital, returns to life with no memory of the past 12 years. He finds himself in a world that feels completely unfamiliar. The years he lived are far from even being memories for him, and he struggles to recognize even himself. Surrounded by unfamiliar relationships, incomprehensible bonds, and unanswered questions, he is forced to rebuild his life from scratch.', 'After surviving a severe attack, Prof. Dr. İnan Kural, the distinguished chief physician of Umutpark Medical Foundation Hospital, returns to life with no memory of the past 12 years. He finds himself in a world that feels completely unfamiliar. The years he lived are far from even being memories for him, and he struggles to recognize even himself. Surrounded by unfamiliar relationships, incomprehensible bonds, and unanswered questions, he is forced to rebuild his life from scratch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0upbqBdvweAch5jW2dj6RVYu0s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:310430'),
  ('799585517005974888', 'Doctor''s Diary', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Bora Dağtekin', null, 'Diana Amft, Florian David Fitz, Kai Schumann, Peter Prager, Ursela Monn, Annette Strasser, Zsá Zsá Inci Bürkle, Julia Koschitz', null, 'Doctor’s Diary is a German-Austrian medical drama, that aired for three seasons from 2008 to 2011 on RTL in a coproduction with ORF. The focus of the series is the young doctor Margarete "Gretchen“ Haase, who wants to make a career in a hospital. It was directed by Bora Dağtekin and shown from the June 23, 2008 to February 14 2011 on German television, RTL Television. In Canada, it was shown starting August 31, 2010 on Séries+ television. In France, from June 8, 2011 on TF1 television and starting March 31, 2013 on HD1 television.', 'Doctor’s Diary is a German-Austrian medical drama, that aired for three seasons from 2008 to 2011 on RTL in a coproduction with ORF. The focus of the series is the young doctor Margarete "Gretchen“ Haase, who wants to make a career in a hospital. It was directed by Bora Dağtekin and shown from the June 23, 2008 to February 14 2011 on German television, RTL Television. In Canada, it was shown starting August 31, 2010 on Séries+ television. In France, from June 8, 2011 on TF1 television and starting March 31, 2013 on HD1 television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6qHOqpFwZy7MEKPQzyWqCxTYqJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:41255'),
  ('541202532578401580', 'Doctors', 2000, 'Soap, Drama', 'Chris Murray', 'William Armstrong', 'Elisabeth Dermot Walsh, Dex Lee, Adrian Lewis Morgan, Ian Midlane, Bharti Patel', 'NR', 'Set in the fictional Midlands town of Letherbridge, defined as being close to the city of Birmingham, this soap opera follows the staff and families of a doctor''s surgery.', 'Set in the fictional Midlands town of Letherbridge, defined as being close to the city of Birmingham, this soap opera follows the staff and families of a doctor''s surgery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhEHvxUd5zuySUGhNFngkC4NacQ.jpg', 24, 'tmdb:tv:5080'),
  ('31553374113717026', 'Doctors', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ha Myung-hee', 'Ha Myung-hee', 'Kim Rae-won, Park Shin-hye, Yoon Kyun-sang, Lee Sung-kyung, Kim Min-seok, Jang Hyun-sung, Yoo Da-in, Baek Sung-hyun', null, 'A recalcitrant, delinquent teen girl meets a compassionate teacher, who inspires her to alter her path and become a street-savvy neurosurgeon.', 'A recalcitrant, delinquent teen girl meets a compassionate teacher, who inspires her to alter her path and become a street-savvy neurosurgeon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/peqebnxcF1IjvdrL3K97cCbJNnk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66329'),
  ('740678688948995002', 'DOCTORS: The Ultimate Surgeon', 2011, 'Drama', null, 'Yasushi Fukuda', 'Ikki Sawamura, Masanobu Takashima, Ran Ito, Manami Higa, Tomoka Kurokawa, Yoko Nogiwa, Bokuzo Masana, Yoichiro Saito', null, 'Donoue General Hospital runs into a budget deficit, even though the doctors drive expensive imported cars and live an outlandish lifestyle. Office manager Momoi finds surgeon Kosuke Sagara through a medical website. Kosuke Sagara arrives at the hospital and tells the director of the general hospital to decide on his pay after watching his work. Kosuke Sagara informs the hospital that he had previously quit his job at a university hospital and taken a year sabbatical.', 'Donoue General Hospital runs into a budget deficit, even though the doctors drive expensive imported cars and live an outlandish lifestyle. Office manager Momoi finds surgeon Kosuke Sagara through a medical website. Kosuke Sagara arrives at the hospital and tells the director of the general hospital to decide on his pay after watching his work. Kosuke Sagara informs the hospital that he had previously quit his job at a university hospital and taken a year sabbatical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WWs7vTSzRyjYgDdxA6ja5SK4eD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:45811'),
  ('155174838084590154', 'Document 72 Hours', 2006, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'An unusual documentary series that delves into human dramas through chance encounters with ordinary people at selected spots. Filmed over 72 hours in a single location, the show captures glimpses into people''s lives as they open up and share their stories.', 'An unusual documentary series that delves into human dramas through chance encounters with ordinary people at selected spots. Filmed over 72 hours in a single location, the show captures glimpses into people''s lives as they open up and share their stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQO83tdISeenWmtG3wp6EteuGfZ.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:74277'),
  ('317017362197834834', 'Documentary Now!', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Seth Meyers, Bill Hader, Fred Armisen', null, 'Fred Armisen, Helen Mirren', 'TV-14', 'Loving parodies of some of the world''s best-known documentaries. Each episode is shot in a different style of documentary filmmaking, and honors some of the most important stories that didn''t actually happen.', 'Loving parodies of some of the world''s best-known documentaries. Each episode is shot in a different style of documentary filmmaking, and honors some of the most important stories that didn''t actually happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqj9BRWRHa0sX7o1qvHGirQ8TNe.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:63593'),
  ('452115353598175727', 'Does It Count If You Lose Your Innocence to an Android?', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ayaka Shimizu, Marika Hayase, Komaru Kurikoma', 'TV-MA', 'Office Lady Tsuda Akane, age 28, seems like she''s got it all together. Beautiful, brainy, and an indispensable office worker for a robotics manufacturer, Akane''s admired at work...because her colleagues can''t see her at home. Privately, Akane''s a hot mess with an apartment that looks more like a landfill than a living space. Good thing she drunkenly ordered a new android named Nadeshiko to help her clean up! Well, maybe not good, because the beautiful lady android that arrives is a horny hottie. Akane''s about to get more service than she expected!', 'Office Lady Tsuda Akane, age 28, seems like she''s got it all together. Beautiful, brainy, and an indispensable office worker for a robotics manufacturer, Akane''s admired at work...because her colleagues can''t see her at home. Privately, Akane''s a hot mess with an apartment that looks more like a landfill than a living space. Good thing she drunkenly ordered a new android named Nadeshiko to help her clean up! Well, maybe not good, because the beautiful lady android that arrives is a horny hottie. Akane''s about to get more service than she expected!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gBgvOoYmnImpQ1pPx3u1xryNIn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:291414'),
  ('740414738505042089', 'Dog', 2015, 'Mystery, Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Viktor Prikhodko', null, 'Nikita Panfilov, Andrii Saminin, Mykhailo Zhonin, Denys Rodnianskyi', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oB9S8RxmG8tsyliCCr2mLNdo93j.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:83611'),
  ('227170183618292742', 'Dog & Scissors', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Takahiro Sakurai, Marina Inoue, Kana Asumi, Shizuka Itoh', 'TV-MA', 'A nonsense comical mystery. Kazuhito Harumi is a high school boy who loves books and is a fan of novelist Kirihime Natsuno. One day, he finds Kirihime writing at a cafe, about to be shot by a robber. He protects her from the attack but is killed instead. Through the supernatural power of a book-worm, he is reincarnated as a dachshund dog. Kazuhito (as a dog) writhes in a painful bookless life, when a sadistic woman carrying a pair of scissors offers him help. She is Kirihime herself.', 'A nonsense comical mystery. Kazuhito Harumi is a high school boy who loves books and is a fan of novelist Kirihime Natsuno. One day, he finds Kirihime writing at a cafe, about to be shot by a robber. He protects her from the attack but is killed instead. Through the supernatural power of a book-worm, he is reincarnated as a dachshund dog. Kazuhito (as a dog) writhes in a painful bookless life, when a sadistic woman carrying a pair of scissors offers him help. She is Kirihime herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BAVA7wKnkz8liwqlQMZY3WZFS3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:49464'),
  ('678287052902120982', 'Dog and Beth: On the Hunt', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'Leland Chapman, Selena Sevy, Duane ''Dog'' Chapman', null, 'Each week, the Chapmans and their son Leland will fly from their Da Kine Bail Bonds headquarters in Hawaii to various bail bondsmen businesses around the United States as they assist in apprehending criminals. The series will also encompass the group as they improve the bail bondsmen businesses techniques on how to run more efficiently, from the writing of bonds to the tedious task of tracking criminals and technological device training.', 'Each week, the Chapmans and their son Leland will fly from their Da Kine Bail Bonds headquarters in Hawaii to various bail bondsmen businesses around the United States as they assist in apprehending criminals. The series will also encompass the group as they improve the bail bondsmen businesses techniques on how to run more efficiently, from the writing of bonds to the tedious task of tracking criminals and technological device training.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9P0RCZP4jz5iJsaFPpjibMp593.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:58647'),
  ('425966713891937078', 'Dog City', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jim Henson', null, 'Ron White, Elizabeth Hanna, John Stocker, Stuart Stone, Kevin Clash, Joey Mazzarino, Brian Meehl, Tabitha St. Germain', null, 'This animated-live action puppet series follows the adventures of Ace Hart, a canine PI, and Eliot Shag, his ''real-life'' German Shepherd animator.', 'This animated-live action puppet series follows the adventures of Ace Hart, a canine PI, and Eliot Shag, his ''real-life'' German Shepherd animator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/os6GwUmy0UQ9DWARv4Zmohl9WN8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:10500'),
  ('647504507260277155', 'Dog Days', 2011, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Mamoru Miyano, Yui Horie, Ayana Taketatsu, Ami Koshimizu, Takehito Koyasu', 'TV-14', 'Dog Days takes place in the world of Flonyard, an alternate world where its inhabitants look like humans but with animal ears. When Cinque Izumi suddenly gets summoned to this alternate world he is appointed as a Hero. How will he lead his life and interact with the various characters in this new world?', 'Dog Days takes place in the world of Flonyard, an alternate world where its inhabitants look like humans but with animal ears. When Cinque Izumi suddenly gets summoned to this alternate world he is appointed as a Hero. How will he lead his life and interact with the various characters in this new world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/htSW5V0UpFZpVjldYnr8BvTe2T0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:44314'),
  ('268117225098628786', 'Dog love', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Aurelio Valcárcel Carrol', 'Juana Uribe', 'Ana Lucía Domínguez, Carlos Ponce, Maritza Rodríguez, Khotan Fernández, Maritza Bustamante, Zully Montero, Elluz Peraza, Víctor Cámara', 'TV-14', 'Perro Amor is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by the United States-based television network Telemundo that originally ran in the United States from January to July 2010. This is a Colombian soap opera remake of the 1998 Cenpro Televisión daily telenovela Perro Amor, written by Natalia Ospina & Andrés Salgado. As with most of its other soap operas, Telemundo broadcast English subtitles as closed captions on CC3.', 'Perro Amor is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by the United States-based television network Telemundo that originally ran in the United States from January to July 2010. This is a Colombian soap opera remake of the 1998 Cenpro Televisión daily telenovela Perro Amor, written by Natalia Ospina & Andrés Salgado. As with most of its other soap operas, Telemundo broadcast English subtitles as closed captions on CC3.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmTjLtjQbl7RyNRf6E1yvvpGXCz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21756'),
  ('493275938282222546', 'Dog the Bounty Hunter', 2004, null, null, null, 'Duane ''Dog'' Chapman, Leland Chapman, Beth Chapman, Lyssa ''Baby'' Chapman', null, 'Dog the Bounty Hunter was an American reality television series on A&E which chronicled Duane "Dog" Chapman''s adventures as a fugitive recovery agent, or bounty hunter. With a few exceptions, the series took place in Hawaii or Dog''s home state of Colorado. On May 21, 2012, A&E cancelled the series after eight seasons, citing the popular phrase: "Every dog has its day".', 'Dog the Bounty Hunter was an American reality television series on A&E which chronicled Duane "Dog" Chapman''s adventures as a fugitive recovery agent, or bounty hunter. With a few exceptions, the series took place in Hawaii or Dog''s home state of Colorado. On May 21, 2012, A&E cancelled the series after eight seasons, citing the popular phrase: "Every dog has its day".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTy6Gcprfib9GDaXa6bKKPmWBgn.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1883'),
  ('276846193461955696', 'Dog Whisperer', 2004, 'Family, Reality', null, null, 'Cesar Millan', 'TV-G', 'Cesar Millan has been called the Dr. Phil for Dogs. With an uncanny ability to rehabilitate problem dogs of all shapes and sizes. Each episode of the Dog Whisperer documents the remarkable transformations that take place under Cesar''s guidance and teaching, helping dogs and their owners live happier lives together.', 'Cesar Millan has been called the Dr. Phil for Dogs. With an uncanny ability to rehabilitate problem dogs of all shapes and sizes. Each episode of the Dog Whisperer documents the remarkable transformations that take place under Cesar''s guidance and teaching, helping dogs and their owners live happier lives together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mRtOuQZmfyCKyjeBlcsY2hXNmV9.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:6326'),
  ('359695472131026179', 'Dog with a Blog', 2012, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Michael B. Kaplan, Philip Stark', null, 'Blake Michael, Stephen Full, Genevieve Hannelius, Francesca Capaldi, Regan Burns, Beth Littleford', 'TV-G', 'Avery Jennings and Tyler James are step-siblings who are complete opposites. The family faces an even bigger adjustment when their new dog, Stan, can talk and also has a blog, unbeknownst to the family. Stan uses his blog to discuss the happenings in the Jennings-James household. Avery and Tyler later learn of Stan''s talking ability and agree to keep it a secret from their parents.', 'Avery Jennings and Tyler James are step-siblings who are complete opposites. The family faces an even bigger adjustment when their new dog, Stan, can talk and also has a blog, unbeknownst to the family. Stan uses his blog to discuss the happenings in the Jennings-James household. Avery and Tyler later learn of Stan''s talking ability and agree to keep it a secret from their parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MOm5Yxtm2h4c6ZtBVBhTTNpBn3.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43775'),
  ('1041860789781210688', 'Dog: Impossible', 2019, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'Dog behavior specialist Matt Beisner and his team help owners learn how to handle their aggressive and misunderstood animals, and rescue and rehabilitate dogs from local shelters that have been turned away by other facilities.', 'Dog behavior specialist Matt Beisner and his team help owners learn how to handle their aggressive and misunderstood animals, and rescue and rehabilitate dogs from local shelters that have been turned away by other facilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQdybIqPILuOc3bCfMbsCpkR2pu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:93422'),
  ('192944746562462791', 'Dog''s Most Wanted', 2019, null, null, null, 'Duane ''Dog'' Chapman, Beth Chapman, David Robinson', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjWrDHnTQJVBadvL4fsaq5RVEN2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93294'),
  ('127676441900169697', 'Doggystyle', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Katrine Nørregaard, Anna Emma Haudal, Christoffer Barfred Krustrup', 'Josephine Park, Rosemarie Mosbæk', null, 'About the fight for being something, and become something, but especially about standing at the edge and discover that you forgot to be someone. About the fear of feeling indifferent, and the need to belong somewhere. We follow 21-year-old Asta, who "temporarily" returns to her parents'' home in the countryside, after living in Copenhagen. That means a reunion, but also a whole new meeting, with family and friends, both new as well as old. The "hillbilly"s shows up in her life again and confronts the prejudices. The meeting with her hometown turns Asta''s relationship with herself, her family, friends and especially love upside down. It forces her to take responsibility and challenges her to discover who and what is hiding behind the Instagram filter.', 'About the fight for being something, and become something, but especially about standing at the edge and discover that you forgot to be someone. About the fear of feeling indifferent, and the need to belong somewhere. We follow 21-year-old Asta, who "temporarily" returns to her parents'' home in the countryside, after living in Copenhagen. That means a reunion, but also a whole new meeting, with family and friends, both new as well as old. The "hillbilly"s shows up in her life again and confronts the prejudices. The meeting with her hometown turns Asta''s relationship with herself, her family, friends and especially love upside down. It forces her to take responsibility and challenges her to discover who and what is hiding behind the Instagram filter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4UTpqknrB0G6XDXQGISK3HUvyP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:84246'),
  ('599582682834497764', 'Dogs', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Amy J. Berg', null, 'Carly, Corinne, Beth', 'TV-PG', 'These six intimate stories explore the abiding emotional bonds that form between dogs and their caregivers, no matter the circumstances.', 'These six intimate stories explore the abiding emotional bonds that form between dogs and their caregivers, no matter the circumstances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dz4fP4l01VTwqa3FZFslDf2GfDD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83602'),
  ('451329527918120108', 'Dogs in Space', 2021, 'Comedy, Animation, Action & Adventure, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Jeremiah Cortez', null, 'Haley Joel Osment, Sarah Chalke, Kimiko Glenn, Chris Parnell, David López, William Jackson Harper, Stephanie Beatriz', 'TV-Y7', 'In the not-so-distant future, genetically enhanced dogs are sent across the universe in search of a new home for the human race. It’s a giant cosmic game of fetch, as the canines seek a planet that will save humanity and - more importantly - let them return to their beloved owners.', 'In the not-so-distant future, genetically enhanced dogs are sent across the universe in search of a new home for the human race. It’s a giant cosmic game of fetch, as the canines seek a planet that will save humanity and - more importantly - let them return to their beloved owners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyrX626w311nbLfmG2JXewUjmFi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:136752'),
  ('103124542769946943', 'Dogs of Berlin', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Christian Alvart', 'Erol Yesikaya', 'Felix Kramer, Fahri Yardım, Katharina Schüttler, Anna Maria Mühe, Urs Rechn, Kais Setti, Samy Abdel Fattah, Deniz Orta', 'TV-MA', 'A politically sensitive murder forces two disparate detectives into a battle with the Berlin underworld and a confrontation with their own corruption.', 'A politically sensitive murder forces two disparate detectives into a battle with the Berlin underworld and a confrontation with their own corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOeA0fPtZfNfljUUMFdgl8Lt9La.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76652'),
  ('924268679813822898', 'Dogtanian and the Three Muskehounds', 1981, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Claudio Biern Boyd', 'Akira Nakahara, Taku Sugiyama, Yoshihiro Kimura', 'Eduardo Jover, Gloria Cámara, Manuel Peiró, Jesús Nieto, José Luis Gil, Javier Dotú, María Luisa Rubio, Rafael de Penagos', null, 'France, 17th century, under the reign of Louis XIII. Dogtanian is an impetuous and innocent peasant from Gascony, as well as a skilled swordsman, who travels to Paris with the purpose of making his dream come true: to join the Corps of Muskehounds of the Royal Guard.', 'France, 17th century, under the reign of Louis XIII. Dogtanian is an impetuous and innocent peasant from Gascony, as well as a skilled swordsman, who travels to Paris with the purpose of making his dream come true: to join the Corps of Muskehounds of the Royal Guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHFBZgPpgHIXFz1jP5xdZlkmPqu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5341'),
  ('734123078975796206', 'Doğu', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Doğu Demirkol', 'Doğu Demirkol, Murat Özsoy', 'Doğu Demirkol', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZAQbYIG2bHblv2lGapfFS6TmkX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:122186'),
  ('514069833173346894', 'Dokgo Rewind', 2018, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', null, null, 'Sehun, Kang Mi-na, Cho Byeong-kyu, Ahn Bo-hyun, Lee Beom-kyu, Shin Won-ho, Kim Chae-eun, Lee Je-yeon', null, '"Dokgo Rewind" is based on webtoon of the same name, and it is prequel to the webtoon "Dokgo". The story begins one year before "Dokgo" (before Kang Hyuk seeks revenge for his twin brother). Kang Hyuk and his mischievous friends meet Kim Gyu Soon and decide to help him protect his sister. Things escalate and Kang Hyuk and his friends end up fighting against high school delinquent gangs.', '"Dokgo Rewind" is based on webtoon of the same name, and it is prequel to the webtoon "Dokgo". The story begins one year before "Dokgo" (before Kang Hyuk seeks revenge for his twin brother). Kang Hyuk and his mischievous friends meet Kim Gyu Soon and decide to help him protect his sister. Things escalate and Kang Hyuk and his friends end up fighting against high school delinquent gangs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVjNAt4RHawNUVK5ZgFgIpQcc6G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83836'),
  ('281037257884953092', 'Doki', 2013, 'Animation, Kids', null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'Doki''s a dog with a lot of questions about science and nature, and he and his explorer friends travel the globe and beyond to get the answers.', 'Doki''s a dog with a lot of questions about science and nature, and he and his explorer friends travel the globe and beyond to get the answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0q9mIlDva0D18AQBeLedX0c34A.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:94075'),
  ('1065458074089667432', 'Doll & Em', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Emily Mortimer, Dolly Wells', null, 'Emily Mortimer, Dolly Wells', null, 'Doll & Em is a British comedy series starring real-life friends Emily Mortimer (Em) and Dolly Wells (Doll), filmed in the style of a reality TV show. After a breakup, Doll heads to Hollywood to be with her childhood best friend Em, who''s now a successful actress.', 'Doll & Em is a British comedy series starring real-life friends Emily Mortimer (Em) and Dolly Wells (Doll), filmed in the style of a reality TV show. After a breakup, Doll heads to Hollywood to be with her childhood best friend Em, who''s now a successful actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YEt7xPz9kZ1sG1mfvOSUOz3Zec.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:61059'),
  ('734862980098684827', 'Dollface', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Jordan Weiss', null, 'Kat Dennings, Shay Mitchell, Esther Povitsky, Brenda Song', 'TV-MA', 'After being dumped by her longtime boyfriend, a young woman must deal with her own imagination in order to literally and metaphorically re-enter the world of women, and rekindle the female friendships she left behind.', 'After being dumped by her longtime boyfriend, a young woman must deal with her own imagination in order to literally and metaphorically re-enter the world of women, and rekindle the female friendships she left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bksxsGXrhsMyOsvsEbtlFH1zMTh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:84584'),
  ('827489757740552123', 'Dollhouse', 2009, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Joss Whedon', null, 'Eliza Dushku, Fran Kranz, Olivia Williams, Dichen Lachman, Enver Gjokaj, Tahmoh Penikett, Harry Lennix', 'TV-14', 'Echo is a member of a highly illegal and underground group of individuals whose personalities have been wiped clean so they can be imprinted with any number of new personas. Confined between missions to a secret facility known as the Dollhouse, the "Actives" are hired by the wealthy, powerful and connected to wholly become—with mind, personality and physiology—whomever the client wants or needs them to be. They know no other life than the specific engagements they are in at that time—or do they?', 'Echo is a member of a highly illegal and underground group of individuals whose personalities have been wiped clean so they can be imprinted with any number of new personas. Confined between missions to a secret facility known as the Dollhouse, the "Actives" are hired by the wealthy, powerful and connected to wholly become—with mind, personality and physiology—whomever the client wants or needs them to be. They know no other life than the specific engagements they are in at that time—or do they?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oq5WPzUn7R0YcIk7QGwpXqvgSWO.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:14956'),
  ('1007142101822773856', 'Dolls'' Frontline', 2022, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, War & Politics', null, null, 'Haruka Tomatsu, Nozomi Yamane, Emiri Kato, Yukari Tamura, Mikako Komatsu, Nao Toyama, Hitomi Nabatame, Kaya Okuno', 'TV-14', 'In the fallout of nuclear war, the last of humanity survives with the help of life-like androids known as Dolls. Built to serve, some fight in wars as Tactical Dolls or T-Dolls. Now, an elite team comprised of T-Dolls are sent to face a new rogue threat, Sangvis Ferri. Leading them into battle is their new human commander, M4A1.', 'In the fallout of nuclear war, the last of humanity survives with the help of life-like androids known as Dolls. Built to serve, some fight in wars as Tactical Dolls or T-Dolls. Now, an elite team comprised of T-Dolls are sent to face a new rogue threat, Sangvis Ferri. Leading them into battle is their new human commander, M4A1.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ip5Zx3RWxzNuRUDYpPwPrjsPOo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117310'),
  ('251458754294000157', 'Dolly Parton''s Heartstrings', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Dolly Parton', 'TV-14', 'Eight stories celebrating family, faith, love and forgiveness come to life in this series inspired by Dolly Parton''s iconic country music catalog.', 'Eight stories celebrating family, faith, love and forgiveness come to life in this series inspired by Dolly Parton''s iconic country music catalog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jW41XQ28sRYf7WDTtPuQaymlOxW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86456'),
  ('888161429351165507', 'Dolmen', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Marie-Anne Le Pezennec, Nicole Jamet', null, 'Ingrid Chauvin, Bruno Madinier, Yves Rénier, Xavier Deluc, Jean-Louis Foulquier, Manuel Gélin, Martine Sarcey, Luc Thuillier', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofoA0rotaOFUUkeUBghwF2Rwkv5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43385'),
  ('616709376257800840', 'Dom', 1980, 'Drama', null, 'Jerzy Janicki, Andrzej Mularczyk', 'Halina Rowicka, Tomasz Borkowy, Jan Englert, Stefan Szmidt, Zbigniew Buczkowski, Barbara Sołtysik, Helena Kowalczykowa, Marek Bukowski', null, 'The story of the residents of a tenement house on Złota Street in Warsaw from 1945 to 1980.', 'The story of the residents of a tenement house on Złota Street in Warsaw from 1945 to 1980.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGhqldvAL7xxWMSRjoGxNCernDn.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:48406'),
  ('737553613048101523', 'DOM', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Breno Silveira', null, 'Gabriel Leone, Flávio Tolezani, Filipe Bragança, Raquel Villar, Isabella Santoni, Antonio Carrara, Felipe Frazão', 'TV-MA', 'A father who never stopped fighting against drugs. A son who never stopped using them. Two sides of the same coin. Victor is a cop who has fought all his life to curb cocaine trafficking. His son is a drug addict who has become one of the most wanted burglars in Rio de Janeiro. Will a father’s love be enough to save his son’s life?', 'A father who never stopped fighting against drugs. A son who never stopped using them. Two sides of the same coin. Victor is a cop who has fought all his life to curb cocaine trafficking. His son is a drug addict who has become one of the most wanted burglars in Rio de Janeiro. Will a father’s love be enough to save his son’s life?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sd7gQpzRMM6WMj2n6RJLsSZGFRP.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:123377'),
  ('50413369828881493', 'Dom-2', 2004, 'Reality', 'Valeri Komissarov', null, null, null, 'The contestants are tasked with constructing a house while trying to find a partner. Couples then compete for the house itself.', 'The contestants are tasked with constructing a house while trying to find a partner. Couples then compete for the house itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypacHKx86LcsQyVfoneGoxsC8cf.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:12560'),
  ('755962693388245383', 'Doménica Montero', 2025, 'Drama', 'Inés Rodena, Carlos Bardasano', null, 'Angelique Boyer, Marcus Ornellas, Scarlet Gruber, Brandon Peniche, Diego Amozurrutia, Gonzalo Peña, Alejandro Ávila, Javier Ponce', 'TV-14', 'A respected and renowned businesswoman and philanthropist, considered one of the most sought-after brides in the country, who is left at the altar on her wedding day. Humiliated, betrayed, and turned into a target of public scrutiny, Doménica decides to flee and take refuge in one of her parents’ old estates. There, marked by pain, she faces new challenges and meets Luis Fernando, the owner of the neighboring estate, who also carries a painful past. Between them, an explosive relationship develops, marked by pride, misunderstandings, and growing attraction, where land disputes intertwine with their shared desire to rebuild, heal, and give new meaning to their lives.', 'A respected and renowned businesswoman and philanthropist, considered one of the most sought-after brides in the country, who is left at the altar on her wedding day. Humiliated, betrayed, and turned into a target of public scrutiny, Doménica decides to flee and take refuge in one of her parents’ old estates. There, marked by pain, she faces new challenges and meets Luis Fernando, the owner of the neighboring estate, who also carries a painful past. Between them, an explosive relationship develops, marked by pride, misunderstandings, and growing attraction, where land disputes intertwine with their shared desire to rebuild, heal, and give new meaning to their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A02M5F5DcQ3glHrvBUSGnzTlvW1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:307423'),
  ('1062165540280581431', 'Domestic Girlfriend', 2019, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Maaya Uchida, Yoko Hikasa, Taku Yashiro', 'TV-MA', 'Natsuo is a high school boy who is experiencing the crushing despair of unrequited love. To make matters worse, the person he is in love with is his teacher, Hina. In an attempt to lift his spirits, he attends a mixer where he meets a girl named Rui. The two sleep together, expecting never to see one another again, but fate has other plans. His life suddenly becomes more complicated when his father comes home and announces he has remarried a woman with two daughters whom Natsuo has met before: Hina and Rui!', 'Natsuo is a high school boy who is experiencing the crushing despair of unrequited love. To make matters worse, the person he is in love with is his teacher, Hina. In an attempt to lift his spirits, he attends a mixer where he meets a girl named Rui. The two sleep together, expecting never to see one another again, but fate has other plans. His life suddenly becomes more complicated when his father comes home and announces he has remarried a woman with two daughters whom Natsuo has met before: Hina and Rui!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yT5HNeqQaoF4TmmQi3RMj8P7uwZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83103'),
  ('747768491817434905', 'Domina', 2021, 'Drama', 'Simon Burke', null, 'Kasia Smutniak, Matthew McNulty, Liah O''Prey, Darrell D''Silva, Alex Lanipekun, Benjamin Isaac, Joelle, Ewan Horrocks', 'TV-MA', 'The extraordinary rise of Livia Drusilla, who overcame adversity to become the most powerful woman in the world. Follow Livia’s journey from a naïve young girl whose world crumbles in the wake of Julius Caesar’s assassination, to Rome’s most powerful and influential Empress.', 'The extraordinary rise of Livia Drusilla, who overcame adversity to become the most powerful woman in the world. Follow Livia’s journey from a naïve young girl whose world crumbles in the wake of Julius Caesar’s assassination, to Rome’s most powerful and influential Empress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0VBBiQmmYmskL4FVnOi9EsMxkD.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:106734'),
  ('433430722620162977', 'Dominator of Martial Gods', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Zhan Yu, Chen Yiying, Wu Shunji, Luan Leiying, Wang Luetao, Zhang Jiayuan, Wang Junren, Chen Sixu', null, 'It tells the story of the rebirth of Qin Chen, a man who experiences the betrayal of both his best friend and lover and sets off on the road of hegemony once more. Qin Chen was once a legendary being in the Wu Continent, but he has fallen due to the painful betrayal of his friend and former lover. Three hundred years later, he has reincarnated into the body of an illegitimate son of the royal family. Relying on his previous attainments, he then hones his skills to go up against the sky.', 'It tells the story of the rebirth of Qin Chen, a man who experiences the betrayal of both his best friend and lover and sets off on the road of hegemony once more. Qin Chen was once a legendary being in the Wu Continent, but he has fallen due to the painful betrayal of his friend and former lover. Three hundred years later, he has reincarnated into the body of an illegitimate son of the royal family. Relying on his previous attainments, he then hones his skills to go up against the sky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLsMYvzIVzZV2SCNzalSvCIJD0R.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228707'),
  ('429174666868103616', 'Domingão com Huck', 2021, 'Talk', null, null, 'Luciano Huck', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/569LRJdSiSwAuisahIjhF5EGTid.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:208716'),
  ('636478886928504422', 'Dominion', 2014, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Scott Stewart, Vaun Wilmott', null, 'Christopher Egan, Tom Wisdom, Roxanne McKee, Alan Dale, Anthony Stewart Head, Luke Allen-Gale, Shivani Ghai, Carl Beukes', 'TV-MA', 'Based on characters from the hit theatrical film ‘Legion’ (2010), ‘Dominion’ is an epic supernatural drama set in the year 25 A.E. In this transformed post–apocalyptic future an army of lower angels, assembled by the archangel Gabriel, has waged a war of possession against mankind. The archangel Michael, turning against his own kind, has chosen to side with humanity against Gabriel. Rising out of the ashes of the 25-year-long battle are newly fortified cities which protect the human survivors. In Vega (formerly Las Vegas), the largest of these cities, two houses vie for control and the stage is set for political upheaval and a dangerous power shift. Meanwhile, a rebellious young soldier begins a perilous journey as the war between the human race and the fallen angels hellbent on their domination escalates.', 'Based on characters from the hit theatrical film ‘Legion’ (2010), ‘Dominion’ is an epic supernatural drama set in the year 25 A.E. In this transformed post–apocalyptic future an army of lower angels, assembled by the archangel Gabriel, has waged a war of possession against mankind. The archangel Michael, turning against his own kind, has chosen to side with humanity against Gabriel. Rising out of the ashes of the 25-year-long battle are newly fortified cities which protect the human survivors. In Vega (formerly Las Vegas), the largest of these cities, two houses vie for control and the stage is set for political upheaval and a dangerous power shift. Meanwhile, a rebellious young soldier begins a perilous journey as the war between the human race and the fallen angels hellbent on their domination escalates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rBiS2m5hZbTSxorXQmUcbt2cTU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:60685'),
  ('188172553219122274', 'Dominion Tank Police', 1988, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Nina Kumagaya, Rei Sakuma, Hiroyuki Shibamoto, Yusaku Yara, Aya Hisakawa', 'TV-14', 'Leona Ozaki joins Newport City''s infamous Tank Police division. With aid of Al and her newly built mini-tank, Bonaparte, she wages war on Buaku and his cohorts, the Puma Sisters.', 'Leona Ozaki joins Newport City''s infamous Tank Police division. With aid of Al and her newly built mini-tank, Bonaparte, she wages war on Buaku and his cohorts, the Puma Sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPSNUPKQG79Rk2jWzuCgYPEe6sA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45137'),
  ('986914040195644332', 'Domino Day', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Lauren Sequeira', 'Lauren Sequeira', 'Siena Kelly, Poppy Lee Friar, Babirye Bukilwa, Alisha Bailey, Molly Harris, Sam Howard Sneyd, Percelle Ascott, Christopher Jeffers', null, 'A young witch with extraordinary powers, Domino desperately seeks a community to help her understand who she is. Still, she doesn’t need to look far, as a coven of witches is already tracking her every move, convinced they must stop her before her powers destroy everyone and everything around her.', 'A young witch with extraordinary powers, Domino desperately seeks a community to help her understand who she is. Still, she doesn’t need to look far, as a coven of witches is already tracking her every move, convinced they must stop her before her powers destroy everyone and everything around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPDxgmngzLqqwMz9xNl9hrZCwg5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:238128'),
  ('208719528435644166', 'Don Dracula', 1982, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Osamu Tezuka', 'Osamu Tezuka', 'Kenji Utsumi, Saeko Shimazu, Tomie Kataoka, Junpei Takiguchi, Takao Oyama, Michie Kita, Kaneta Kimotsuki, Jomeri Pozzoli', null, 'This is a horror comedy in which a Western-style house in Romania is bought and brought to Tokyo, with the inhabitants still inside. They are Don Dracula the vampire, his daughter Chocola and his servant Igor.', 'This is a horror comedy in which a Western-style house in Romania is bought and brought to Tokyo, with the inhabitants still inside. They are Don Dracula the vampire, his daughter Chocola and his servant Igor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yFG7uMomcVQrqvVogdXYP9VdOE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16576'),
  ('414576639866008559', 'Don Quijote de la Mancha', 1979, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Cruz Delgado Sánchez, José Javier Romagosa', 'Gustavo Alcalde', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Antonio Ferrandis, Rafael de Penagos, Amelia Jara, Teófilo Martínez, Eduardo Moreno, Luis Varela', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DWPzIiCrQq8tnEHvjIRdwjzahQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66407'),
  ('1077655151464512313', 'Don''t Call It Mystery', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Hiroaki Matsuyama, Tomoko Aizawa', null, 'Masaki Suda, Sairi Ito, Matsuya Onoe, Michitaka Tsutsui, Eita Nagayama, Mai Shiraishi, Kosuke Suzuki, Mugi Kadowaki', null, 'University student Kuno Totono is the type who constantly questions what is taken for granted in society and develops his own theories based on his vast knowledge and unique set of values. One day in autumn, the police come to see him. His university schoolmate has been murdered at a park nearby and the police apparently regard Totono with suspicion. He is asked to come with them for questioning. In the interrogation room, the police are manipulated by Totono who tends to digress from the topic and poke at their contradictions. He even correctly guesses that one of them is troubled about not getting along with the wife and ends up giving advice. However, Totono’s fingerprints are eventually discovered on the murder weapon.', 'University student Kuno Totono is the type who constantly questions what is taken for granted in society and develops his own theories based on his vast knowledge and unique set of values. One day in autumn, the police come to see him. His university schoolmate has been murdered at a park nearby and the police apparently regard Totono with suspicion. He is asked to come with them for questioning. In the interrogation room, the police are manipulated by Totono who tends to digress from the topic and poke at their contradictions. He even correctly guesses that one of them is troubled about not getting along with the wife and ends up giving advice. However, Totono’s fingerprints are eventually discovered on the murder weapon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0eQQyELfNe9c0MN0lHtqKGV5uI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:126849'),
  ('136602015106237932', 'Don''t Come Home', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Thananuj Ebrahim', null, 'Woranuch Bhirombhakdi, Pitchapa Phanthumchinda, Cindy Sirinya Bishop, Ploypaphas Fonkaewsiwaporn, Pariit Thimthong, Theerapat Sajakul, Partith Pisitkul, Sahatchai Chumrum', 'TV-MA', 'A mother and her young daughter flee to their family''s abandoned mansion but soon find themselves haunted by paranormal incidents that lead to the little girl''s mysterious disappearance.', 'A mother and her young daughter flee to their family''s abandoned mansion but soon find themselves haunted by paranormal incidents that lead to the little girl''s mysterious disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtIm0qbFnQ3oqqDrVpPTJDS6EZK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273081'),
  ('788398293980727950', 'Don''t Ever Wipe Tears Without Gloves', 2012, 'Drama', 'Simon Kaijser da Silva', 'Jonas Gardell', 'Björn Kjellman, Simon J. Berger, Adam Pålsson, Carl Lindquist, Adam Lundgren, Emil Almén, Michael Jonsson, Christoffer Svensson', null, 'Based on the Sweden novelist Jonas Gardell''s novel Love, the story of the struggle the homosexual community had with AIDS, during which time a lot of people who were lovers and family members died. The story is also about family and society''s refusing to accept the gay community during that time.', 'Based on the Sweden novelist Jonas Gardell''s novel Love, the story of the struggle the homosexual community had with AIDS, during which time a lot of people who were lovers and family members died. The story is also about family and society''s refusing to accept the gay community during that time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4CnT7XKrUgiSnZHbrZq2ht6ZnH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:51665'),
  ('633728351531234551', 'Don''t F**k with Cats: Hunting an Internet Killer', 2019, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Mark Lewis', 'Mark Lewis', 'Deanna Thompson, John Green', 'TV-MA', 'A twisted criminal''s gruesome videos drive a group of amateur online sleuths to launch a risky manhunt that pulls them into a dark underworld.', 'A twisted criminal''s gruesome videos drive a group of amateur online sleuths to launch a risky manhunt that pulls them into a dark underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Crc4XkhLddMTNJfj1iLca0w1Bb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96129'),
  ('601189838532983588', 'Don''t Forget the Driver', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime', null, null, 'Toby Jones, Claire Rushbrook, Marcia Warren, Danny Kirrane, Erin Kellyman, Luwam Teklizgi, Joni Ayton-Kent, Bharti Patel', 'NR', 'Coach driver and single dad Peter Green leads a life of ordinary routine until the discovery of a dead body on the docile Bognor shoreline and an unsettling meeting with a new arrival in town throws his life into chaos.', 'Coach driver and single dad Peter Green leads a life of ordinary routine until the discovery of a dead body on the docile Bognor shoreline and an unsettling meeting with a new arrival in town throws his life into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sb4NlWptU4IHxKtv4BEnXTHwuPg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88258'),
  ('433161664643999671', 'Don''t Hug Me I''m Scared', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Becky Sloan, Joseph Pelling, Baker Terry', null, 'Joseph Pelling, Baker Terry, Baker Terry', 'TV-14', 'Follow Red Guy, Yellow Guy and Duck, who live in the town of Clayhill. In each episode they encounter a song which teaches them about an aspect of life. Whilst the episodes start wholesome and sunny, each episode invariably ends in a dark and disturbing place.', 'Follow Red Guy, Yellow Guy and Duck, who live in the town of Clayhill. In each episode they encounter a song which teaches them about an aspect of life. Whilst the episodes start wholesome and sunny, each episode invariably ends in a dark and disturbing place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7Yixnyo1Hy3No8hTx1yC4lSFh0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86328'),
  ('858085369931768378', 'Don''t Hug Me I''m Scared', 2022, 'Mystery, Animation, Comedy', 'Joseph Pelling, Baker Terry, Becky Sloan', 'Sam Campbell, Megan Ganz, Natasha Hodgson', 'Joseph Pelling, Adam Mayne, Joss Carter, Baker Terry', 'TV-MA', 'Join Red Guy, Yellow Guy and Duck as they learn everything there is to know with the help of some friendly talking objects, in this comedy-horror puppet show based off the popular YouTube web series.', 'Join Red Guy, Yellow Guy and Duck as they learn everything there is to know with the help of some friendly talking objects, in this comedy-horror puppet show based off the popular YouTube web series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8nblOde4ZT3H088hRcwfETf50p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:206013'),
  ('1146065086536782393', 'Don''t Hurt Me, My Healer!', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Takuya Sato, Aguri Oonishi, Asuna Tomari, Hiroshi Shirokuma, Show Hayami, Saori Hayami', 'TV-14', 'The misadventures of a knight and a healer begin in this new fantasy comedy series!', 'The misadventures of a knight and a healer begin in this new fantasy comedy series!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cevHZjtp3DRdNtPnOoqYdoPxOwz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123250'),
  ('338546243849664962', 'Don''t Leave Me', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Maddalena Ravagli, Leonardo Fasoli', 'Giovanni Galassi, Maddalena Ravagli, Leonardo Fasoli', 'Vittoria Puccini, Alessandro Roja, Sarah Felberbaum, Sergio Albelli, Federica Girardello, Eugenio Franceschini, Gianmaria Martini, Massimo Rigo', 'TV-14', 'Police officer Elena deals with cyber crimes and violence against children. The discovery of a young boy''s body in the Venetian Lagoon brings her back to the city she left twenty years earlier.', 'Police officer Elena deals with cyber crimes and violence against children. The discovery of a young boy''s body in the Venetian Lagoon brings her back to the city she left twenty years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qaDpRl7lbOiiqjkSvZSFjTCYFz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:139552'),
  ('439910610575007533', 'Don''t Let Go of My Hand', 2018, 'Family, Drama', 'Nilüfer Özçelik, Volkan Yazıcı', null, 'Alina Boz, Alp Navruz, Dolunay Soysert, Seray Gözler, Emre Bey, Ebru Aykaç, Burak Tamdoğan, Hazal Şenel', null, 'The story revolves around a girl named Azra who is studying abroad in America to be a professional cook like her father. She met Cenk, the grandson of Ferida Celen, on the plane and took his bag instead of hers at the airport by mistake. Cenk who was expelled from his university in America and struggling to choose his own destiny will get to witness the huge turn in Azra''s life when her father dies in a fire accident leaving her and his autistic son with his greedy wife.', 'The story revolves around a girl named Azra who is studying abroad in America to be a professional cook like her father. She met Cenk, the grandson of Ferida Celen, on the plane and took his bag instead of hers at the airport by mistake. Cenk who was expelled from his university in America and struggling to choose his own destiny will get to witness the huge turn in Azra''s life when her father dies in a fire accident leaving her and his autistic son with his greedy wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/budGPvu6oms8qvMWSxjqL4HAis3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:80229'),
  ('196532336569135416', 'Don''t Look Back: The Legend of Orpheus', 2013, 'Drama', null, 'Kim Ji-woo', 'Son Ye-jin, Kim Nam-gil, Yeon Jun-seok, Gyeong Su-jin, Lee Soo-hyuk, Nam Bo-ra, Kim Kyu-chul, Ha Seok-jin', null, 'After his father’s demise at the hand of Gaya Hotel Group, Han Yi Soo (Kim Nam Gil) has lived for one thing only: Vengeance. Ready to hatch a plan to bring down his nemesis once and for all, Yi Soo goes to extremes in not only changing his identity, but also his face. But there''s a huge obstacle in Yi Soo''s way: his inconvenient love for Jo Hae Woo (Son Ye Jin), the heiress to Gaya Hotel Group. Along with being enmeshed within an ill-fated love, Yi Soo''s cover gets blown, which has him running for his life like his father once did. You either sink or you swim, but what if the water is full of sharks?', 'After his father’s demise at the hand of Gaya Hotel Group, Han Yi Soo (Kim Nam Gil) has lived for one thing only: Vengeance. Ready to hatch a plan to bring down his nemesis once and for all, Yi Soo goes to extremes in not only changing his identity, but also his face. But there''s a huge obstacle in Yi Soo''s way: his inconvenient love for Jo Hae Woo (Son Ye Jin), the heiress to Gaya Hotel Group. Along with being enmeshed within an ill-fated love, Yi Soo''s cover gets blown, which has him running for his life like his father once did. You either sink or you swim, but what if the water is full of sharks?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aU583FGWRjU092i2GdgGzqBlmQ1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50961'),
  ('329627456658147095', 'Don''t Look Deeper', 2020, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Charlotte McDonnell, Jeffrey Lieber', null, 'Helena Howard, Don Cheadle, Emily Mortimer, Tyler Ghyzel, Bryan Christensen, Hartlyn Hilsman, Ema Horvath, Jan Luis Castellanos', 'TV-MA', 'In near-future California, high school senior Aisha learns a dark secret about herself. She goes from dreams of graduation and college...to suddenly running for her life.', 'In near-future California, high school senior Aisha learns a dark secret about herself. She goes from dreams of graduation and college...to suddenly running for her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1bZu7mjkiDwTweN7S98pUB3hEm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90319'),
  ('787792846146227342', 'Don''t Mess with the Angel', 2008, 'Drama, Soap', 'Delia Fiallo', 'Carlos Romero, María Antonieta Gutiérrez, Delia Fiallo', 'Maite Perroni, William Levy, Helena Rojo, Ana Patricia Rojo, Laura Zapata, Nailea Norvind, Michelle Vieth, Ricardo Blume', null, 'Cuidado Con El Ángel is a Telenovela distributed by Televisa starring Maite Perroni and William Levy. The telenovela, a production of Nathalie Lartilleux, premiered on June 9, 2008 and finished its broadcast March 6, 2009. It had millions of viewers worldwide, and broke records in America.', 'Cuidado Con El Ángel is a Telenovela distributed by Televisa starring Maite Perroni and William Levy. The telenovela, a production of Nathalie Lartilleux, premiered on June 9, 2008 and finished its broadcast March 6, 2009. It had millions of viewers worldwide, and broke records in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lVsyvIfxEDYUfZTZ3weIwQCu6j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5459'),
  ('381433740789185593', 'Don''t Say No', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'MAME', null, 'Phachara Suansri, Chalongrat Nobsamrong, Pongsapak Rachaporn, Chisanupong Puangmanee, Suphaksin Wijitwerot, Sinsophak Wijitwerot, Putthanat Chayaaphinanthakul, Phunthida Phairuangkij', null, 'Best friends since childhood, Leo and Fiat must face the confusing line between friendship and something more.', 'Best friends since childhood, Leo and Fiat must face the confusing line between friendship and something more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNFCbSZxEnrAvmv50MFwY1igk1P.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:128567'),
  ('770638436810118272', 'Don''t Start the Murmur', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Kostas Sousoulas, Constantine Ganosis', 'Panagiotis Christopoulos, Gogo Fotou, Constantine Ganosis', 'Vladimiros Kiriakidis, Eleni Kokkidou, Antonis Antoniou, Errieta Manouri, Stathis Koikas, Parthena Horozidou, Maria Katsandri, Anni Theoxari', null, 'The premise of the series revolves around the daily lives of different couples of all ages from 20 to 65, but who are not connected to each other. Each couple has their own space where they live, while the story of each couple in each episode is not connected to the stories of the other couples.', 'The premise of the series revolves around the daily lives of different couples of all ages from 20 to 65, but who are not connected to each other. Each couple has their own space where they live, while the story of each couple in each episode is not connected to the stories of the other couples.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwg5aqUOrPWIbdllC19Cp9FjD8a.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:83275'),
  ('488354171598728955', 'Don''t Tell Anyone', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, News, Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The story behind the crime that occurred in the summer of 2016 in Pioz, a small town in La Alcarria, where the lifeless bodies of a Brazilian couple and their two children were found.', 'The story behind the crime that occurred in the summer of 2016 in Pioz, a small town in La Alcarria, where the lifeless bodies of a Brazilian couple and their two children were found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/br6puCna8vdaMyzPvLh2OTrByUU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211688'),
  ('273955142459350170', 'DON''T TOY WITH ME, MISS NAGATORO', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Sumire Uesaka, Daiki Yamashita', 'TV-14', '"A girl in a lower grade just made me cry!" One day, Senpai visits the library after school and becomes the target of a super sadistic junior! The name of the girl who teases, torments, and tantalizes Senpai is "Nagatoro!" She''s annoying yet adorable. It''s painful, but you still want to be by her side. This is a story about an extremely sadistic and temperamental girl and you''ll feel something awaken inside of you.', '"A girl in a lower grade just made me cry!" One day, Senpai visits the library after school and becomes the target of a super sadistic junior! The name of the girl who teases, torments, and tantalizes Senpai is "Nagatoro!" She''s annoying yet adorable. It''s painful, but you still want to be by her side. This is a story about an extremely sadistic and temperamental girl and you''ll feel something awaken inside of you.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogXmggjfiDHBOBwA3JyuEzCr814.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:105556'),
  ('1072699080301669707', 'Don''t Trust the B---- in Apartment 23', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Nahnatchka Khan', null, 'Krysten Ritter, Dreama Walker, James Van Der Beek, Michael Blaiklock, Eric André, Ray Ford', 'TV-14', 'After a naive Midwestern girl''s big city dreams are dashed her first week in New York, she finds herself living with her worst nightmare in this hilarious, contemporary comedy about a female odd couple who are surrounded by an outrageous cast of characters.', 'After a naive Midwestern girl''s big city dreams are dashed her first week in New York, she finds herself living with her worst nightmare in this hilarious, contemporary comedy about a female odd couple who are surrounded by an outrageous cast of characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ice3QRGMPs7JpwV8Fb8BpfWtYxP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:39331'),
