  ('1115658269639709445', 'Doubutsu Sentai Zyuohger', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Masaki Nakao, Miki Yanagi, Shohei Nanba, Tsurugi Watanabe, Haruka Tateishi, Naoki Kunishima, Susumu Terajima, Kazuhiko Inoue', null, 'The human world is attacked by the space outlaw group the Dethgaliens who have chosen the Earth to be the site of their 100th Blood Game. One human and 4 anthropomorphic Zyumans awaken their instincts to become the Zyuohgers and fight to protect all living things.', 'The human world is attacked by the space outlaw group the Dethgaliens who have chosen the Earth to be the site of their 100th Blood Game. One human and 4 anthropomorphic Zyumans awaken their instincts to become the Zyuohgers and fight to protect all living things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jT9659PA30AL6Kd6Fkn79sR6Wpp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68695'),
