  ('628420090761588630', 'Duck Dynasty', 2012, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Willie Robertson, Korie Robertson, Jase Robertson, Kay Robertson, Si Robertson, Phil Robertson', 'TV-PG', 'At first glance the Robertsons look like a typical Louisiana family who lives for duck hunting season. A closer look, however, reveals they live very well because of duck hunting season. The Robertsons own and operate Duck Commanders, which specializes in fabricating duck calls and decoys out of salvaged swamp wood. The company has grown from a mom-and-pop operation to a multimillionaire sporting empire, established in 1973 by family patriarch Phil (aka the Duck Commander) and now run by his business-savvy son, Willie. "Duck Dynasty" follows the Robertsons and their booming business, which also employs Willie''s wife, Korie, his brother Jase and Uncle Si, a Vietnam vet and colorful character who keeps the guys in the workshop occupied with his many stories.', 'At first glance the Robertsons look like a typical Louisiana family who lives for duck hunting season. A closer look, however, reveals they live very well because of duck hunting season. The Robertsons own and operate Duck Commanders, which specializes in fabricating duck calls and decoys out of salvaged swamp wood. The company has grown from a mom-and-pop operation to a multimillionaire sporting empire, established in 1973 by family patriarch Phil (aka the Duck Commander) and now run by his business-savvy son, Willie. "Duck Dynasty" follows the Robertsons and their booming business, which also employs Willie''s wife, Korie, his brother Jase and Uncle Si, a Vietnam vet and colorful character who keeps the guys in the workshop occupied with his many stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTXJFP9E9jo5SsGbhFs5L3WWUNX.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:42738'),
  ('1121475031747079319', 'Duck Dynasty: The Revival', 2025, 'Reality', null, null, 'Si Robertson, Sadie Robertson, Kay Robertson', 'TV-PG', '“Duck Dynasty: The Revival” follows Willie and Korie and their growing family of adult children and grandchildren, the next generation of Robertsons living on the family homestead in Louisiana. With their dynasty expanding into more than just ducks, Willie and Korie will bring their signature humor and family fun as they grapple with mapping out the future of Duck Commander, watching the kids navigate marriage, children and businesses of their own, and passing down the family legacy.', '“Duck Dynasty: The Revival” follows Willie and Korie and their growing family of adult children and grandchildren, the next generation of Robertsons living on the family homestead in Louisiana. With their dynasty expanding into more than just ducks, Willie and Korie will bring their signature humor and family fun as they grapple with mapping out the future of Duck Commander, watching the kids navigate marriage, children and businesses of their own, and passing down the family legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdj5B7mmNILb9vIa6lccv9x3ii2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:283874'),
  ('583725922422021909', 'Duckman', 1994, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Everett Peck', null, 'Jason Alexander, Gregg Berger, Nancy Travis, Dweezil Zappa, Dana Hill, E. G. Daily, Pat Musick', 'TV-PG', 'Together with Cornfed, his portly, porcine partner in crime solving, this defective detective amazingly manages to solve crimes and be a single parent to his hilariously dysfunctional sons at the same time.', 'Together with Cornfed, his portly, porcine partner in crime solving, this defective detective amazingly manages to solve crimes and be a single parent to his hilariously dysfunctional sons at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUSieKYAFqgb8x4UZjqOtjkh16y.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1260'),
  ('711490023188757925', 'DuckTales', 1987, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Kids', 'Jymn Magon', null, 'Alan Young, Russi Taylor, Terence McGovern, Chuck McCann, Frank Welker, Hal Smith, Joan Gerber, Brian Cummings', 'TV-Y7', 'Scrooge McDuck finds his hands full at home when nephews Huey, Dewey and Louie move to Duckburg. Joined by their loyal pals Launchpad McQuack, Gyro Gearloose and Mrs. Beakley, the DuckTales gang never fails to deliver a wealth of adventure. Get ready for a fortune of fun with DuckTales!', 'Scrooge McDuck finds his hands full at home when nephews Huey, Dewey and Louie move to Duckburg. Joined by their loyal pals Launchpad McQuack, Gyro Gearloose and Mrs. Beakley, the DuckTales gang never fails to deliver a wealth of adventure. Get ready for a fortune of fun with DuckTales!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muplnM90daPCQ5Bn1olcwN1EO22.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:720'),
  ('849404422872556290', 'DuckTales', 2017, 'Family, Comedy, Animation', 'Francisco Angones, Matt Youngberg', null, 'David Tennant, Danny Pudi, Ben Schwartz, Bobby Moynihan, Kate Micucci, Beck Bennett, Toks Olagundoye, Paget Brewster', 'TV-Y7', 'The adventures of billionaire Scrooge McDuck and his nephews Huey, Dewey and Louie, their famous uncle Donald Duck, pilot extraordinaire Launchpad, Mrs. Beakly, Webby and Roboduck. Adventures and hidden treasures are everywhere, in their hometown Duckburg and all around the world.', 'The adventures of billionaire Scrooge McDuck and his nephews Huey, Dewey and Louie, their famous uncle Donald Duck, pilot extraordinaire Launchpad, Mrs. Beakly, Webby and Roboduck. Adventures and hidden treasures are everywhere, in their hometown Duckburg and all around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3klapeIKLp9IBy4uHo7szTeMTdQ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:72350'),
