  ('799365453229261404', 'Dudes', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Billuka is a renowned Fintech company created and managed altogether by Julian and his friends Ricardo, Simón, Santiago, Tomas, Daniel and Mafe. On the other hand, Antonia, daughter of a very important businessman, arrives to Colombia in hopes to make a fresh start. When Julian meets Antonia is love at first sight. Later, Julian entangles himself on a series of conflicts between love and business.', 'Billuka is a renowned Fintech company created and managed altogether by Julian and his friends Ricardo, Simón, Santiago, Tomas, Daniel and Mafe. On the other hand, Antonia, daughter of a very important businessman, arrives to Colombia in hopes to make a fresh start. When Julian meets Antonia is love at first sight. Later, Julian entangles himself on a series of conflicts between love and business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkWnjOb2QvA2b8onBbEKf9o2JKw.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:220663'),
  ('1078168398273531676', 'Dudes', 2025, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Tom Beck, Moritz Führmann, Serkan Kaya, David Rott, Mona Pirzad, Franziska Machens, Valentina Leone, Marleen Lohse', null, 'In the midst of a masculinity crisis, four friends in their forties are losing their throne, privileges and identity; years ago, they would have been alpha males in charge of their lives, but they have had to live in the era of equality.', 'In the midst of a masculinity crisis, four friends in their forties are losing their throne, privileges and identity; years ago, they would have been alpha males in charge of their lives, but they have had to live in the era of equality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbKdopUfpIjLJOEUWoxrx3FVdh1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:298699'),
  ('1056331697346328871', 'Due South', 1994, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Paul Haggis', null, 'Paul Gross, Beau Starr, Callum Keith Rennie, Tony Craig, Camilla Scott, Ramona Milano, Gordon Pinsent, Tom Melissis', 'TV-PG', 'Constable Benton Fraser, an officer of the Royal Canadian Mounted Police, is attached to the Canadian consulate but works with Chicago Police Department to solve crimes.', 'Constable Benton Fraser, an officer of the Royal Canadian Mounted Police, is attached to the Canadian consulate but works with Chicago Police Department to solve crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5j0mNks65Py4fW1GeYpGHe7BN3V.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1527'),
  ('1122196054947251275', 'Duel', 2017, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Lee Jong-jae, Kim Yoon-joo', 'Kim Yoon-joo, Yunju Kim', 'Lee Yea-eun, Jung Jae-young, Kim Jung-eun, Yang Se-jong, Seo Eun-soo, Yoon Kyung-ho, Lee Na-Yoon, Kim Ki-doo', null, 'Jang Deuk-Cheon is the chief of a crime squad. At home, he is kind and friendly father to his daughter. He meets a human clone and gets involved in a shocking case. A battle takes place between human clones.', 'Jang Deuk-Cheon is the chief of a crime squad. At home, he is kind and friendly father to his daughter. He meets a human clone and gets involved in a shocking case. A battle takes place between human clones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slU4E2wHaGNs6ZoqpdEq3mUK4cQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71564'),
  ('199812017490643015', 'Duel Masters', 2002, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, null, 'TV-Y7', 'A mysterious organization is interested in fledging duelist Shobu Kirifuda''s ability to bring Duel Master creatures to life. With the support of his friends, Shobu duels with passion, discipline, and heart as he strives to be like his father and become the next Kaijudo master.', 'A mysterious organization is interested in fledging duelist Shobu Kirifuda''s ability to bring Duel Master creatures to life. With the support of his friends, Shobu duels with passion, discipline, and heart as he strives to be like his father and become the next Kaijudo master.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5ijeKzOukACRktUfbjuMIlqwfr.jpg', 21, 'tmdb:tv:46392'),
  ('18361079162134794', 'Duel of landscape gardener', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'Eva Brenner', null, 'In this docutainment format, two garden professionals develop ideas for every garden and apply for the contract from the owners. Eva Brenner provides advice to the families.', 'In this docutainment format, two garden professionals develop ideas for every garden and apply for the contract from the owners. Eva Brenner provides advice to the families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYHx1YpY6YCpVG0vTBUOKM1blfL.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:120526'),
  ('94929810575919843', 'Duel on Mount Hua', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Louis Cha', 'Cao Xiaotian', 'Zhou Yiwei, Gao Weiguang, Peter Ho, Ming Dao, Yu Jinwei, Pei Jiaxin, Una You', null, '«Jin Yong Wuxia Universe» (金庸武侠世界 / The Legend of Heroes) is a martial arts series based on the novels of Jin Yong, with «The Legend of the Condor Heroes» as its main plotline. The series weaves together two dramatic stories – «Hot Blooded» (30 episodes) and «Duel on Mount Hua» (30 episodes), the latter encompassing four character arcs: «Nine Yin True Sutra» (8 episodes), «Eastern Heretic and Western Venom» (8 episodes), «Southern Emperor and Northern Beggar» (8 episodes), and «Five Great Masters» (6 episodes).', '«Jin Yong Wuxia Universe» (金庸武侠世界 / The Legend of Heroes) is a martial arts series based on the novels of Jin Yong, with «The Legend of the Condor Heroes» as its main plotline. The series weaves together two dramatic stories – «Hot Blooded» (30 episodes) and «Duel on Mount Hua» (30 episodes), the latter encompassing four character arcs: «Nine Yin True Sutra» (8 episodes), «Eastern Heretic and Western Venom» (8 episodes), «Southern Emperor and Northern Beggar» (8 episodes), and «Five Great Masters» (6 episodes).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwHpqRxpe0o0pDmDZK7V8RVMhTJ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:296834'),
  ('305169716586647367', 'Dug Days', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Bob Peterson, Pete Docter', null, 'Bob Peterson, Ed Asner', 'TV-G', 'A series of shorts that follows the humorous misadventures of Dug, the lovable dog from Disney and Pixar’s “Up.” Each short features everyday events that occur in Dug''s backyard, all through the exciting (and slightly distorted) eyes of our favorite talking dog.', 'A series of shorts that follows the humorous misadventures of Dug, the lovable dog from Disney and Pixar’s “Up.” Each short features everyday events that occur in Dug''s backyard, all through the exciting (and slightly distorted) eyes of our favorite talking dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5kT33XH2gX7xBFIK1uUJAvU5dj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114501'),
  ('1110374039493930190', 'Dulce Desafío', 1988, 'Drama, Soap', 'Jorge Patiño', 'Jorge Patiño', 'Adela Noriega, Eduardo Yáñez, Enrique Lizalde, Mercedes Olea, Sergio Kleiner, Olivia Collins, Beatriz Aguirre, Juan Carlos Serrán', null, 'Dulce Desafío is a Mexican telenovela starring Adela Noriega and Eduardo Yáñez.', 'Dulce Desafío is a Mexican telenovela starring Adela Noriega and Eduardo Yáñez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60nX9VFkdwLICT7O4w3IHh7lFWU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6908'),
  ('551718237399977040', 'Dulceida: a new beginning', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'In this documentary of more than a year of follow-up, we discover what''s behind her work and get to know the most personal side of the influencer. Aida is going through a major personal crisis and for the first time in her 14 years of profession she leaves social networks. In parallel, we also follow one of the most important professional actions of her life.', 'In this documentary of more than a year of follow-up, we discover what''s behind her work and get to know the most personal side of the influencer. Aida is going through a major personal crisis and for the first time in her 14 years of profession she leaves social networks. In parallel, we also follow one of the most important professional actions of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9iIkDoJwkewIm8BxI0pC1j0Gllk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:213840'),
  ('359191030366265362', 'Dumb and Dumber', 1995, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Bennett Yellin', null, 'Matt Frewer, Bill Fagerbakke', null, 'The mind-blowing adventures of America''s favorite morons take a surreal turn in this cartoon spin-off of the smash success comedy movie Dumb and Dumber. The show starts off with the duo rescuing their dognapped van, Otto, and picking up one strange pet, Kitty, a purple beaver, then hits the road for the ridiculous with the pedal to the metal. No circumstance is to strange for this show''s satire, from the mundanities of physical fitness and test piloting to the insanities of robot mailmen and speeding taco-mobiles rigged with stink bombs!', 'The mind-blowing adventures of America''s favorite morons take a surreal turn in this cartoon spin-off of the smash success comedy movie Dumb and Dumber. The show starts off with the duo rescuing their dognapped van, Otto, and picking up one strange pet, Kitty, a purple beaver, then hits the road for the ridiculous with the pedal to the metal. No circumstance is to strange for this show''s satire, from the mundanities of physical fitness and test piloting to the insanities of robot mailmen and speeding taco-mobiles rigged with stink bombs!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHZbv2ZYJ74F5Vms1QSS09Qw1tF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7972'),
  ('474963534250961466', 'DumbLand', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Lynch', 'David Lynch', 'David Lynch', 'TV-MA', 'A series of eight crudely animated shorts written, directed, and voiced by director David Lynch in 2002. The series details the daily routines of a dull-witted white trash man. The man lives in a house along with his frazzled wife and squeaky-voiced child, both of whom are nameless as is the man in the shows.', 'A series of eight crudely animated shorts written, directed, and voiced by director David Lynch in 2002. The series details the daily routines of a dull-witted white trash man. The man lives in a house along with his frazzled wife and squeaky-voiced child, both of whom are nameless as is the man in the shows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Ue7tiq1DxOiO2fMhhYBVEYFxzH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5195'),
  ('93664418152906034', 'Dummy', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Cody Heller', null, 'Anna Kendrick, Meredith Hagner, Donal Logue', 'TV-MA', 'After being discarded by her original owner, a spoiled, jealous, and manipulative sex doll named Barbara convinces aspiring writer Cody, the only one able to hear her speak, to take her home so she can help cure Cody''s writers block.', 'After being discarded by her original owner, a spoiled, jealous, and manipulative sex doll named Barbara convinces aspiring writer Cody, the only one able to hear her speak, to take her home so she can help cure Cody''s writers block.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmtDBFQfYRb2uUyUXyVPhCCldz0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89689'),
  ('184178560384143387', 'Dunaj, k vašim službám', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kristína Svarinská, Lesana Krausková, Emil Horváth, Zdena Studenková, Barbora Andrešičová, Ján Koleník, Jana Majeská, Filip Tůma', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHt0ehVLaHTgN4eulK5T1h0GcmT.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:217650'),
  ('282079647468668642', 'Dunali', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Shubham Deorukhar, Rekha Mona Sarkar, Nehal Vadoliya', null, 'Troubled by an atypical medical condition that has a direct bearing on a young boy''s sexual life, the world around him goes upside down wherein everyone tries to take advantage of his abilities. Some remain smitten while some are shocked when they find the double-trouble that he is blessed with. Watch the laugh-riot doubling its fun in Dunali.', 'Troubled by an atypical medical condition that has a direct bearing on a young boy''s sexual life, the world around him goes upside down wherein everyone tries to take advantage of his abilities. Some remain smitten while some are shocked when they find the double-trouble that he is blessed with. Watch the laugh-riot doubling its fun in Dunali.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpWxLTvREEaZaQccWZUoDRBDca2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:129155'),
  ('777956211269523491', 'Duncanville', 2020, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Amy Poehler, Julie Thacker, Mike Scully', null, 'Amy Poehler, Riki Lindhome, Joy Osmanski, Ty Burrell, Yassir Lester, Betsy Sodaro, Zach Cherry, Rashida Jones', 'TV-14', 'Like most 15-year-olds, Duncan can see adulthood on the horizon: money, freedom, cars and girls; but the reality is more like: always being broke, driving with one''s mom sitting shotgun and babysitting one''s sister. He''s not exceptional, but he has a wild imagination in which he''s never anything less than amazing.', 'Like most 15-year-olds, Duncan can see adulthood on the horizon: money, freedom, cars and girls; but the reality is more like: always being broke, driving with one''s mom sitting shotgun and babysitting one''s sister. He''s not exceptional, but he has a wild imagination in which he''s never anything less than amazing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLJ74pNLxYrAMFBNI95VSDPiOGd.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:93292'),
  ('121380889697950696', 'Dune: Prophecy', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Diane Ademu-John, Alison Schapker', null, 'Emily Watson, Olivia Williams, Travis Fimmel, Jodhi May, Sarah-Sofie Boussnina, Chloe Lea, Chris Mason, Mark Strong', 'TV-MA', 'Ten thousand years before the ascension of Paul Atreides, sisters Valya and Tula Harkonnen establish the fabled sect and female order that would become known as the Bene Gesserit to control the future of humankind.', 'Ten thousand years before the ascension of Paul Atreides, sisters Valya and Tula Harkonnen establish the fabled sect and female order that would become known as the Bene Gesserit to control the future of humankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oWVohNsxkxA3u92EzRo8fTuXIS0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:90228'),
  ('1071327965496061227', 'Dungeon People', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sayaka Senbongi, Sayumi Suzushiro, Naomi Kusumi, Nobuo Tobita, Hochu Otsuka, Mao Ichimichi, Wataru Katoh, Yuki Sakakihara', null, 'An unexplored dungeon, filled with monsters and traps. An expert thief, searching for her lost father. When Clay delves into the dungeon deeper than any adventurer has ever gone, she is offered a job by the dungeon''s caretaker! Now, instead of exploring, Clay must learn how to interview new monsters, set traps and position slimes around the dungeon. Will this new career path bring her any closer to finding her father?', 'An unexplored dungeon, filled with monsters and traps. An expert thief, searching for her lost father. When Clay delves into the dungeon deeper than any adventurer has ever gone, she is offered a job by the dungeon''s caretaker! Now, instead of exploring, Clay must learn how to interview new monsters, set traps and position slimes around the dungeon. Will this new career path bring her any closer to finding her father?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3CEjyTUy6zKX8BCyUnSfYQazP8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250597'),
  ('724969508571340360', 'Dungeons & Dragons', 1983, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Kids', 'Kevin Paul Coates, Dennis Marks', 'Karl Geurs', 'Willie Aames, Don Most, Adam Rich, Peter Cullen, Teddy Field III, Katie Leigh, Sidney Miller, Tonia Gayle Smith', 'TV-G', 'Six friends are transported into the Dungeons & Dragons realm and must try to find a way home with the help of their guide ''Dungeon Master''.', 'Six friends are transported into the Dungeons & Dragons realm and must try to find a way home with the help of their guide ''Dungeon Master''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tn1vNSYhgLAeYioZtobgfDjO5u.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:553'),
  ('86357040238378206', 'Dunkirk', 2004, 'Documentary, Drama', null, 'Neil McKay, Lisa Osborne, Alex Holmes', 'Phil Cornwell, Simon Russell Beale, Timothy Dalton, Ricci Harnett, Benedict Cumberbatch', null, 'Major factual drama telling the story of history''s greatest maritime evacuation, after the World War II Battle of Dunkirk in May and June 1940.', 'Major factual drama telling the story of history''s greatest maritime evacuation, after the World War II Battle of Dunkirk in May and June 1940.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sMOjEMsDBiJL0CZqUXTD58kZTN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:7516'),
  ('898827860153371916', 'Dunno on the Moon', 1997, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, 'Vladimir Golovanov, Sergej Ivanov', 'Yuriy Sarantsev, Klara Rumyanova, Aleksey Borzunov, Boris Shuvalov, Kristina Orbakayte, Venera Rakhimova, Svetlana Stepchenko, Mikhail Kononov', null, 'They are neither adults nor kids - somewhere in between, living in their separate boys and girls cozy dorms and doing whatever they love to do - inventors, artists, poets, mechanists, scientists and....just dreamers! These enthusiastic and creative folks enjoy their half-adult, half-childish lifestyles and entertain each other with the different tricks and practical jokes. The main hero stands out of the crowd - while the others try to live the normal life socializing as they can, he can never be rested, always coming up with the different unpredictable and unexpected moves, which always make viewers burst with laugh....', 'They are neither adults nor kids - somewhere in between, living in their separate boys and girls cozy dorms and doing whatever they love to do - inventors, artists, poets, mechanists, scientists and....just dreamers! These enthusiastic and creative folks enjoy their half-adult, half-childish lifestyles and entertain each other with the different tricks and practical jokes. The main hero stands out of the crowd - while the others try to live the normal life socializing as they can, he can never be rested, always coming up with the different unpredictable and unexpected moves, which always make viewers burst with laugh....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJYMFzMH14nuf3RQOsOqgf6QjYn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99952'),
  ('794480398090044135', 'Dünya Bu', 2023, 'Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Volkan Öge, Ozan Akyol, Erman Çağlar', 'Volkan Öge, Ozan Akyol, Erman Çağlar', null, null, 'Love, hatred, passion, inconsistency, anger, meatballs, headman, shooting scenes, necessary and unnecessary big movements, the rule of law, the desolate man in the desolate man and many more… Thirty-two different stories, one world, from the creators of KALT and Errands.', 'Love, hatred, passion, inconsistency, anger, meatballs, headman, shooting scenes, necessary and unnecessary big movements, the rule of law, the desolate man in the desolate man and many more… Thirty-two different stories, one world, from the creators of KALT and Errands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/friJpjFwENl35rpycSULVf9E09X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222533'),
  ('218815272467378534', 'Dupur Thakurpo', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Debaloy Bhattacharya, Ayan Chakroborty', null, 'Flora Saini, Soumendra Bhattacharya', 'TV-MA', 'A simple village girl - or a bombshell in disguise? Phulwa is the new Boudi in town, and she''s here to keep them awake all night!', 'A simple village girl - or a bombshell in disguise? Phulwa is the new Boudi in town, and she''s here to keep them awake all night!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8CZ6vvKceU6yMUGkcGbVXCmlod.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:74564'),
  ('908774063235121395', 'Durarara!!', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Miyuki Sawashiro, Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Mamoru Miyano, Kana Hanazawa, Hiroshi Kamiya, Daisuke Ono, Jun Fukuyama, Misaki Kuno', 'TV-14', 'Mikado Ryugamine moves to Ikebukuro at his friend’s invitation and quickly becomes entangled in the city’s dangerous underworld. After witnessing the legendary Headless Rider, he finds himself caught up in escalating violence and gang conflict that begin to throw Ikebukuro into chaos.', 'Mikado Ryugamine moves to Ikebukuro at his friend’s invitation and quickly becomes entangled in the city’s dangerous underworld. After witnessing the legendary Headless Rider, he finds himself caught up in escalating violence and gang conflict that begin to throw Ikebukuro into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2YqpHaPEMW2JHhFFnyOxgGBMNP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:42410'),
  ('548109600972984293', 'Durham County', 2007, 'Drama', 'Janis Lundman, Laurie Finstad-Knizhnik, Adrienne Mitchell', 'Laurie Finstad-Knizhnik', 'Hugh Dillon, Louis Ferreira, Helene Joy, Sonya Salomaa, Laurence Leboeuf, Greyston Holt, Kathleen Munroe, Michelle Forbes', 'TV-MA', 'Detective Mike Sweeney has just moved with his wife and daughters from Toronto to his hometown of Durham County after the death of his partner. Hoping to escape the violent world of big city police work, Mike falls into a suburban world besieged by crime, abuse and murder.', 'Detective Mike Sweeney has just moved with his wife and daughters from Toronto to his hometown of Durham County after the death of his partner. Hoping to escape the violent world of big city police work, Mike falls into a suburban world besieged by crime, abuse and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eR4USBVeJqXydBFn1g5wU9SjOgI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3386'),
  ('986373305772889631', 'Durian''s Affair', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Im Sung-han, Shin Woo-chul', 'Im Sung-han', 'Park Joo-mi, Choi Myung-gil, Kim Min-jun, Han Da-gam, Jeon No-min, Yoon Hae-young, Gee Young-san, Yoo Jung-hoo', null, 'Two women from a noble family in Joseon Dynasty get to time-travel and meet some men living in 2023. An eclipse happens when the two women mysteriously show up at the grand party in the Dan family''s vacation home. The two women''s appearance leads the Dans into a strange yet beautiful story transcending time and space. Du Ri-an and So-jeo are pure and elegant women from Joseon, and they''re mother-in-law and daughter-in-law. Their story develops as they get to meet Baek Do-yi and rich men from the Dans. How will this unique time-traveling story unfold?', 'Two women from a noble family in Joseon Dynasty get to time-travel and meet some men living in 2023. An eclipse happens when the two women mysteriously show up at the grand party in the Dan family''s vacation home. The two women''s appearance leads the Dans into a strange yet beautiful story transcending time and space. Du Ri-an and So-jeo are pure and elegant women from Joseon, and they''re mother-in-law and daughter-in-law. Their story develops as they get to meet Baek Do-yi and rich men from the Dans. How will this unique time-traveling story unfold?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vMrWUBH7bZiQfYgWTWecrQpKQ6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228965'),
  ('1057842316148311757', 'Dusk Beyond the End of the World', 2025, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shuichiro Umeda, Yui Ishikawa, Ai Kayano, Miyu Tomita, Miyuki Sawashiro, Tomori Kusunoki, Yohei Azakami, Saki Kobari', null, 'When tensions around AI spark civil unrest, Akira is caught in the crossfire when he protects his girlfriend from an assassin. Hundreds of years later, he awakens from cryogenic sleep to an unfamiliar world and bonds with the android Yuugure.', 'When tensions around AI spark civil unrest, Akira is caught in the crossfire when he protects his girlfriend from an assassin. Hundreds of years later, he awakens from cryogenic sleep to an unfamiliar world and bonds with the android Yuugure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfCA7LKaIE6JbswEVUITSrl6FiH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:294867'),
  ('647142924667106051', 'Dusk Maiden of Amnesia', 2012, 'Animation, Mystery, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Misato Fukuen, Eri Kitamura, Tsubasa Yonaga, Yumi Hara', 'TV-MA', 'The story revolves around a first-year high school student, Teiichi Niiya who had just enrolled at Seikyou Private Academy. When he gets lost in one of the school''s old building, he meets a girl named Yuuko Kanoe who reveals herself as a ghost with no memories. Teiichi then decides to investigate her death by delving deep into the infamous Seven Mysteries of the storied school along with Kirie Kanoe, Yuuko''s relative, and the oblivious second year Momoe Okonogi. Throughout the story, Teiichi and Yuuko discover the truth about these ghost stories and help those who are troubled all the while inching closer to the truth behind Yuuko''s death.', 'The story revolves around a first-year high school student, Teiichi Niiya who had just enrolled at Seikyou Private Academy. When he gets lost in one of the school''s old building, he meets a girl named Yuuko Kanoe who reveals herself as a ghost with no memories. Teiichi then decides to investigate her death by delving deep into the infamous Seven Mysteries of the storied school along with Kirie Kanoe, Yuuko''s relative, and the oblivious second year Momoe Okonogi. Throughout the story, Teiichi and Yuuko discover the truth about these ghost stories and help those who are troubled all the while inching closer to the truth behind Yuuko''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2xEALi1U4foXfLUXB2FkAqo4qC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:54930'),
  ('452874505476917529', 'Duster', 2025, 'Crime, Drama', 'J.J. Abrams, LaToya Morgan', null, 'Josh Holloway, Rachel Hilson, Asivak Koostachin, Sydney Elisabeth, Benjamin Charles Watson, Camille Guaty, Adriana Aluna Martinez, Greg Grunberg', 'TV-MA', 'In 1972, the first Black female FBI agent heads to the Southwest and recruits a gutsy getaway driver in a bold effort to take down a growing crime syndicate.', 'In 1972, the first Black female FBI agent heads to the Southwest and recruits a gutsy getaway driver in a bold effort to take down a growing crime syndicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYBsKEFU0qHdhSI9QtQjL8HELMn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:113959'),
  ('726148765872312454', 'Dutch Hope', 2014, 'Crime, Drama', 'Franky Ribbens', null, 'Marcel Hensema, Kim van Kooten, Martijn Lakemeier, Megan de Kruijf, Amber Robin Berentsen, Peter van den Begin, Hadewych Minis, Gaite Jansen', null, 'Forensic psychiatrist Fokke Augustinus makes an unexpected career change when he inherits his father''s mansion in Groningen where he becomes involved with a criminal organization with a marijuana plantation on his father''s land.', 'Forensic psychiatrist Fokke Augustinus makes an unexpected career change when he inherits his father''s mansion in Groningen where he becomes involved with a criminal organization with a marijuana plantation on his father''s land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWgCMHfsZiiXienGKzIsfxypJ6i.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61507'),
  ('149346689040621946', 'Dutton Ranch', 2026, 'Western, Drama', 'Chad Feehan', null, 'Kelly Reilly, Cole Hauser, Finn Little, Juan Pablo Raba, Jai Courtney, J.R. Villarreal, Marc Menchaca, Natalie Alyn Lind', 'TV-MA', 'Rip Wheeler and Beth Dutton gamble everything on a new life in South Texas, but the promise of building a future far from the ghosts of Yellowstone quickly collides with brutal new realities and a rival ranch that will stop at nothing to protect its empire.', 'Rip Wheeler and Beth Dutton gamble everything on a new life in South Texas, but the promise of building a future far from the ghosts of Yellowstone quickly collides with brutal new realities and a rival ranch that will stop at nothing to protect its empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfFx1bPBf2FvpxZ6FWYkFF4hWJx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:299167'),
  ('1071481036153701132', 'Duty After School', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Ha Il-kwon', 'Lee Nam-kyu', 'Kim Ki-hae, Shin Myung-sung, Shin Hyun-soo, Lim Se-mi, Ahn Do-gyu, Kim Min-chul, Kim Su-gyeom, Ro Jong-hyun', null, 'When mysterious alien spheres start invading the world, high school students are called upon to join the world''s first war against extraterrestrial forces.', 'When mysterious alien spheres start invading the world, high school students are called upon to join the world''s first war against extraterrestrial forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLeWTHccMPI60VGs8geiq1b5btV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158258'),
  ('835512837236049909', 'Dwight in Shining Armor', 2019, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Leeanne H. Adams, Brian J. Adams', null, 'Sloane Morgan Siegel, Caitlin Carmichael, Joel McCrary, Danielle Bisutti, Evan Hofer', null, 'Dwight, a 21st century teen, falls into an ancient, underground chamber and lands lip-to-lip with Gretta, a gothic princess who has been magically sleeping for a thousand years.', 'Dwight, a 21st century teen, falls into an ancient, underground chamber and lands lip-to-lip with Gretta, a gothic princess who has been magically sleeping for a thousand years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wX7CkR486uWxcJkwoUlNXOfUC38.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:89941'),
  ('516224540667501717', 'Dying for Sex', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Rosenstock, Elizabeth Meriwether', null, 'Michelle Williams, Jenny Slate, Jay Duplass, Kelvin Yu, David Rasche, Esco Jouléy, Rob Delaney, Sissy Spacek', 'TV-MA', 'After Molly Kochan receives a diagnosis of Stage IV metastatic breast cancer, she leaves her husband and explores the full breadth and complexity of her sexual desires for the first time in her life.', 'After Molly Kochan receives a diagnosis of Stage IV metastatic breast cancer, she leaves her husband and explores the full breadth and complexity of her sexual desires for the first time in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaKb3cTh8mT6fgLSXuqo4JoS0dU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241405'),
  ('924952282538123041', 'Dynamite Kiss', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kim Jae-hyun, Ha Yoon-ah, Kim Hyun-woo', null, 'Jang Ki-yong, Ahn Eun-jin, Kim Moo-joon, Woo Da-vi, Choi Gwang-il, Nam Kee-ae, Jeong Ga-hee, Cha Mi-kyeong', null, 'A passionate fling in Jeju ends abruptly — until fate reunites an heir and a young woman when she joins his company, disguised as a married mother.', 'A passionate fling in Jeju ends abruptly — until fate reunites an heir and a young woman when she joins his company, disguised as a married mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qY3ltlWUB7u3ENocrMOkbGCGYnt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:281013'),
  ('303074802854090015', 'Dynamo: Magician Impossible', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Steven Frayne', null, 'Steven Frayne', null, 'Tipped as the most exciting British magician to emerge in decades, Dynamo: Magician Impossible is the story of an ordinary boy from Bradford living an extraordinary life. The series sees the 28-year-old travelling the globe as the unassuming anti-hero who just happens to astound everyone he meets, whether it''s an international footballer or Hollywood actor. Throughout the series, Dynamo: Magician Impossible will take viewers on his magical journey before stunning them with incredible, headline-grabbing stunts beyond the realms of possibility.', 'Tipped as the most exciting British magician to emerge in decades, Dynamo: Magician Impossible is the story of an ordinary boy from Bradford living an extraordinary life. The series sees the 28-year-old travelling the globe as the unassuming anti-hero who just happens to astound everyone he meets, whether it''s an international footballer or Hollywood actor. Throughout the series, Dynamo: Magician Impossible will take viewers on his magical journey before stunning them with incredible, headline-grabbing stunts beyond the realms of possibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVG0T24CGwWBAuozCyDzYjUhAM4.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:40058'),
  ('704389459515927252', 'Dynasties', 2018, 'Documentary, Family', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-PG', 'Follow the true stories of five of the world''s most celebrated, yet endangered animals; penguins, chimpanzees, lions, painted wolves and tigers. Each in a heroic struggle against rivals and against the forces of nature, these families fight for their own survival and for the future of their dynasties.', 'Follow the true stories of five of the world''s most celebrated, yet endangered animals; penguins, chimpanzees, lions, painted wolves and tigers. Each in a heroic struggle against rivals and against the forces of nature, these families fight for their own survival and for the future of their dynasties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEu1jJ2VariPLN8JZVxTtmY3IG2.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82953'),
  ('673594631750992335', 'Dynasty', 1981, 'Soap, Drama', 'Esther Shapiro, Richard Alan Shapiro', null, 'John Forsythe, Linda Evans, Joan Collins, John James, Gordon Thomson, Michael Nader, Heather Locklear, Emma Samms', 'TV-PG', 'The saga of a wealthy Denver family in the oil business: Blake Carrington, the patriarch; Krystle, his former secretary and wife; his children: Adam, lost in childhood after a kidnapping; Fallon, pampered and spoiled; Steven, openly gay; and Amanda, hidden from him by his ex-wife, the conniving Alexis. Most of the show features the conflict between 2 large corporations, Blake''s Denver Carrington and Alexis'' ColbyCo.', 'The saga of a wealthy Denver family in the oil business: Blake Carrington, the patriarch; Krystle, his former secretary and wife; his children: Adam, lost in childhood after a kidnapping; Fallon, pampered and spoiled; Steven, openly gay; and Amanda, hidden from him by his ex-wife, the conniving Alexis. Most of the show features the conflict between 2 large corporations, Blake''s Denver Carrington and Alexis'' ColbyCo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxKEdlB4Zuq2THGqKYLnGKU37g9.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:3769'),
  ('301461300126969779', 'Dynasty', 2017, 'Drama, Soap', 'Stephanie Savage, Josh Schwartz, Sallie Patrick', null, 'Elizabeth Gillies, Grant Show, Daniella Alonso, Elaine Hendrix, Rafael de la Fuente, Sam Underwood, Michael Michele, Robert Christopher Riley', 'TV-14', 'Follows two of America’s wealthiest families, the Carringtons and the Colbys, as they feud for control over their fortune and their children focusing on Fallon Carrington, the daughter of billionaire Blake Carrington, and her soon-to-be stepmother, Cristal, a Hispanic woman marrying into this WASP family and America’s most powerful class.', 'Follows two of America’s wealthiest families, the Carringtons and the Colbys, as they feud for control over their fortune and their children focusing on Fallon Carrington, the daughter of billionaire Blake Carrington, and her soon-to-be stepmother, Cristal, a Hispanic woman marrying into this WASP family and America’s most powerful class.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVQ35erLIoV8hyh7lIKAMiChmOO.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:72002'),
