  ('886377285519144594', 'Eagle of Upper Egypt', 2018, 'Drama', null, 'Ahmed Ali Mossa, Mohamed Abdelmoati', 'Mohamed Ramadan, Wafaa Amer, Dorra Zarrouk, Mohamed Hatem, Sayed Ragab, Dina, Aaidah Riyadh, Aïcha Ben Ahmed', null, 'The police officer Zain is in a fierce confrontation with Hitler, an Upper Egyptian businessman engaged in illicit trade, the conflict between them intensifies, while Zain finds himself torn between the love of two women, one of whom is his cousin.', 'The police officer Zain is in a fierce confrontation with Hitler, an Upper Egyptian businessman engaged in illicit trade, the conflict between them intensifies, while Zain finds himself torn between the love of two women, one of whom is his cousin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whCdiyCxA2rmgvGGk9rIf2NOGHM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79643'),
