  ('1011862991539496860', 'Early Doors', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Craig Cash', 'Phil Mealey, Craig Cash', 'John Henshaw, Craig Cash, Phil Mealey, Rita May, Christine Bottomley, Peter Wight, James Quinn, Mark Benton', null, 'A sitcom set in a small pub in Manchester, “The Grapes”, where daily life is bound up in the issues of love, loneliness, and blocked urinals. Regular drinkers Joe and Duffy pass the time with landlord Ken and his police officer cronies.', 'A sitcom set in a small pub in Manchester, “The Grapes”, where daily life is bound up in the issues of love, loneliness, and blocked urinals. Regular drinkers Joe and Duffy pass the time with landlord Ken and his police officer cronies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9qbBr9W08hHB3pj5QMFv05NuEV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1865'),
  ('776395156488088955', 'Early Edition', 1996, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Ian Abrams, Patrick Q. Page, Vik Rubenfeld', null, 'Kyle Chandler, Shanésia Davis', 'TV-PG', 'Gary Hobson thinks he may even be losing his mind when tomorrow''s newspaper mysteriously arrives today giving him a disconcerting look into the future. What will he do with tomorrow''s news?', 'Gary Hobson thinks he may even be losing his mind when tomorrow''s newspaper mysteriously arrives today giving him a disconcerting look into the future. What will he do with tomorrow''s news?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uycL5H5ir0ckyyt17FXZAuSQU4p.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1716'),
  ('916031994297768117', 'Early Swallows', 2019, 'Drama', 'Yevhen Tunik', null, 'Viktoriia Lytvynenko, Oleksandr Rudynskyi, Oleh Hotsuliak, Taisiya Shchuruk, Oleksandr Begma, Anastasiia Pustovit, Serhii Kyiashko, Maksym Devizorov', null, 'Revolves around the lives of Ukrainian teenagers in a secondary school class. The teenagers struggle with bullying, including the Blue Whale Challenge, lack of parental support, suicidal behavior, LGBT identity crises-a subject that is rarely portrayed on Ukrainian television-alcoholic parents, and speech disabilities. In one of the show''s main plot lines, the main characters are stalked on the Internet by an anonymous person who pretends to be their friend.', 'Revolves around the lives of Ukrainian teenagers in a secondary school class. The teenagers struggle with bullying, including the Blue Whale Challenge, lack of parental support, suicidal behavior, LGBT identity crises-a subject that is rarely portrayed on Ukrainian television-alcoholic parents, and speech disabilities. In one of the show''s main plot lines, the main characters are stalked on the Internet by an anonymous person who pretends to be their friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZsrygJrcD9OhvbjdGM3CeYXvRp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:96256'),
  ('539829313355181439', 'Earth', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Chris Packham', null, 'There''s nothing else like it. Chris Packham reveals the epic, four-billion-year story of our home - from its dramatic creation to the arrival of human life... and whatever''s next.', 'There''s nothing else like it. Chris Packham reveals the epic, four-billion-year story of our home - from its dramatic creation to the arrival of human life... and whatever''s next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GSn1jeR1qhDDjs14l5ub4Y4TDQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230803'),
  ('477839795953735192', 'Earth 2', 1994, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Carol Flint, Billy Ray, Michael Duggan', null, 'Rebecca Gayheart, Debrah Farentino, Sullivan Walker, Clancy Brown, Joey Zimmerman, Antonio Sabàto, Jr., Jessica Steen, Rockmond Dunbar', null, 'Two centuries in the future, when pollution has forced humans to abandon Earth in favor of cramped space stations, scientist Devon Adair hijacks a spacecraft and sets out with a band of followers in search of another planet that will offer a brighter, more normal future to children like her son, Ulysses. Joining Devon and Ulysses are mechanic John Danziger and his daughter, True; team physician Julia Heller, who has her own secret agenda; Alonzo Solace, a pilot; Yale, a cyborg; and Morgan, a craven government agent, and his wife, Bess. The voyagers find their planet, but their ship crash-lands on the wrong side of the globe, forcing them to attempt an arduous and dangerous trek to their ultimate destination, New Pacifica.', 'Two centuries in the future, when pollution has forced humans to abandon Earth in favor of cramped space stations, scientist Devon Adair hijacks a spacecraft and sets out with a band of followers in search of another planet that will offer a brighter, more normal future to children like her son, Ulysses. Joining Devon and Ulysses are mechanic John Danziger and his daughter, True; team physician Julia Heller, who has her own secret agenda; Alonzo Solace, a pilot; Yale, a cyborg; and Morgan, a craven government agent, and his wife, Bess. The voyagers find their planet, but their ship crash-lands on the wrong side of the globe, forcing them to attempt an arduous and dangerous trek to their ultimate destination, New Pacifica.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJLHPptrbYimwuk8e7Q54LqVT0y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1473'),
  ('662070083456120699', 'Earth Abides', 2024, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Todd Komarnicki', null, 'Alexander Ludwig, Jessica Frances Dukes', 'TV-MA', 'When a plague of unprecedented virulence sweeps the globe, the human race is all but wiped out. In the aftermath, as the great machine of civilization slowly and inexorably breaks down, only a few shattered survivors remain to struggle against the slide into extinction.', 'When a plague of unprecedented virulence sweeps the globe, the human race is all but wiped out. In the aftermath, as the great machine of civilization slowly and inexorably breaks down, only a few shattered survivors remain to struggle against the slide into extinction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8huM0hQ5fCjGFDyUmpQW9x0xmR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:250308'),
  ('460586152552149880', 'Earth Arcade', 2022, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Reality', 'Na Yeong-seok', null, 'ANYUJIN, Mimi, Lee Young-ji, Lee Eun-ji', null, 'Four warriors who gathered to catch the moon rabbit who fled to Earth! A new concept hybrid multiverse action adventure variety that unfolds across time and space begins!', 'Four warriors who gathered to catch the moon rabbit who fled to Earth! A new concept hybrid multiverse action adventure variety that unfolds across time and space begins!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBJ0uF0WlFcjr9obZZqE6GSsKoL.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:203508'),
  ('224100598782640353', 'Earth at Night in Colour', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tom Hiddleston', 'TV-PG', 'Filmed across six continents, this docuseries uses cutting-edge camera technology to capture animals'' nocturnal lives, revealing new behaviours filmed in full color like never before.', 'Filmed across six continents, this docuseries uses cutting-edge camera technology to capture animals'' nocturnal lives, revealing new behaviours filmed in full color like never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guk68CC6hiDKtHm8LUB9tnHXCHc.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:110818'),
  ('750347066995698574', 'Earth from Space', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Chiwetel Ejiofor, Laurent Lafitte', 'NR', 'Cameras in space tell stories of life on our planet from a brand new perspective, revealing new discoveries, incredible colours and patterns, and just how fast it is changing.', 'Cameras in space tell stories of life on our planet from a brand new perspective, revealing new discoveries, incredible colours and patterns, and just how fast it is changing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssfWm8t3URLRJCkRGMgOjPB3iMe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88307'),
  ('219438661256705621', 'Earth Maiden Arjuna', 2001, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Shoji Kawamori', null, 'Mami Higashiyama, Tomokazu Seki, Aya Hisakawa, Yoko Soumi, Chiharu Suzuka, Emi Uwagawa, Hochu Otsuka, Junko Hagimori', null, 'When a girl named Ariyoshi Juna has a severe accident, her spirit turns to light and rises up out of her body into the night sky where she gets a glimpse of Earth a few months into the future. What she sees is the Earth on the brink of total destruction, ruled by the merciless demon forces called the Raajas. Then, a person named Chris Hawken gives Juna a "power stone" and tells her to use it to save the Earth. The power stone gives her the ability to call up an "aura suit", which activates and enhances a person''s dormant special powers.', 'When a girl named Ariyoshi Juna has a severe accident, her spirit turns to light and rises up out of her body into the night sky where she gets a glimpse of Earth a few months into the future. What she sees is the Earth on the brink of total destruction, ruled by the merciless demon forces called the Raajas. Then, a person named Chris Hawken gives Juna a "power stone" and tells her to use it to save the Earth. The power stone gives her the ability to call up an "aura suit", which activates and enhances a person''s dormant special powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0YVzBZythvGrrSQlgDxFqWvR3t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42698'),
  ('761335249218323216', 'Earth to Ned', 2020, 'Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Paul Rugg, Colleen Smith, Michael Oosterom, Morgana Ignis', null, 'Ned, a blue-skinned alien, and his lieutenant Cornelius, were sent to scout Earth for an eventual invasion — but instead became obsessed with popular culture. Now they host a talk show, broadcast from the bridge of their spaceship hidden deep underground, where they interview our most precious commodity — celebrities — to talk about Ned’s current pop culture obsessions.', 'Ned, a blue-skinned alien, and his lieutenant Cornelius, were sent to scout Earth for an eventual invasion — but instead became obsessed with popular culture. Now they host a talk show, broadcast from the bridge of their spaceship hidden deep underground, where they interview our most precious commodity — celebrities — to talk about Ned’s current pop culture obsessions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnyhfnDvaeJNY6LZbU75mzxL0lK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94883'),
  ('778969994551776309', 'Earth: Final Conflict', 1997, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Gene Roddenberry', null, 'Jayne Heitmeyer, Von Flores, Alan van Sprang, Melinda Deines, Guylaine St-Onge', null, 'Years ago, the Taelons came to Earth, offering friendship and technology to humanity. But there are those who believe the Taelons have more sinister motives.', 'Years ago, the Taelons came to Earth, offering friendship and technology to humanity. But there are those who believe the Taelons have more sinister motives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOcw7r57ppfPHdaTIauMnE64Npz.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2840'),
  ('143217907633485149', 'Earth: The Power of the Planet', 2007, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Iain Stewart', null, 'In each episode, geologist Dr. Iain Stewart explains the effects and importance of a specific force of nature, such as wind or volcanism. He also examines the various ways in which it shapes planet earth itself and influences life on it, often in conjunction with other natural forces, and sometimes with lifeforms, as in the ''apocalyptically'' grave case of global warming.', 'In each episode, geologist Dr. Iain Stewart explains the effects and importance of a specific force of nature, such as wind or volcanism. He also examines the various ways in which it shapes planet earth itself and influences life on it, often in conjunction with other natural forces, and sometimes with lifeforms, as in the ''apocalyptically'' grave case of global warming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enMvfrzoC2JkuCI38PhJSOg6GT6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:28877'),
  ('1132072721892536604', 'Earth''s Great Rivers', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Mark Flowers', null, 'David Oyelowo', null, 'Revealing the extraordinary animals, astonishing landscapes and remarkable people who live alongside the Amazon, Mississippi and Nile.', 'Revealing the extraordinary animals, astonishing landscapes and remarkable people who live alongside the Amazon, Mississippi and Nile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zRDUqXNZiDtRAbskg5W0kXrXEX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85428'),
  ('408296934369455005', 'Earthsounds', 2024, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Tom Hiddleston', 'TV-G', 'Immersive audio reveals the unexpected, unfamiliar, and untold ways in which animals communicate around the world.', 'Immersive audio reveals the unexpected, unfamiliar, and untold ways in which animals communicate around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lfg9REfxUx8xyCuNMalxzawYpQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247104'),
  ('1082973868256712876', 'Earthstorm', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Mimî M. Khayisa', null, 'Storm chasers, survivors and first responders recount their harrowing experiences with volcanoes, tornadoes, hurricanes and earthquakes.', 'Storm chasers, survivors and first responders recount their harrowing experiences with volcanoes, tornadoes, hurricanes and earthquakes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGP72LSNSKnSUIjOB2AeFZkaO68.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211942'),
  ('923713903462571203', 'Earthworm Jim', 1995, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', 'Doug TenNapel', null, 'Dan Castellaneta, Jeff Bennett, Jim Cummings, Kath Soucie, Charlie Adler, Edward Hibbert, Andrea Martin, John Kassir', 'TV-Y7', 'Jim was a multi-celled life form happily burrowing through the topsoil. His life changed in a flash when an extraterrestrial super-suit fell out of the sky. Instantly transformed from a 98 gram weakling into a muscular worm endowed with superpowers, extraordinary strength and the ability to leap incredible heights and distances, the suit renders him invulnerable. Earthworm Jim - daring defender of Earth, the cosmos and everything in between!', 'Jim was a multi-celled life form happily burrowing through the topsoil. His life changed in a flash when an extraterrestrial super-suit fell out of the sky. Instantly transformed from a 98 gram weakling into a muscular worm endowed with superpowers, extraordinary strength and the ability to leap incredible heights and distances, the suit renders him invulnerable. Earthworm Jim - daring defender of Earth, the cosmos and everything in between!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxZTvRjEjOlRXkIpDXz60cUtow6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6592'),
  ('610478290558142793', 'East Los High', 2013, 'Drama', 'Carlos Portugal, Kathleen Bedoya', 'Kathleen Bedoya, Luisa Leschin', 'Vannessa Vasquez, Alexandra Rodriguez, Danielle Vega, Gabriel Chavarria, Carlito Olivero, Alicia Sixtos', null, 'East Los High is not your typical high school. Dance, sex, romance, and mystery are at the heart of this inner city school in East LA where two teenage cousins—Jessie, a 16-year-old virgin and Maya, a troubled runaway with a violent past —fall in love with Jacob, a popular football player. From this forbidden love triangle, Maya, Jessie and Jacob, along with their close friends must face true-to-life decisions during a single dramatic and breath-taking year that will mark their lives forever.', 'East Los High is not your typical high school. Dance, sex, romance, and mystery are at the heart of this inner city school in East LA where two teenage cousins—Jessie, a 16-year-old virgin and Maya, a troubled runaway with a violent past —fall in love with Jacob, a popular football player. From this forbidden love triangle, Maya, Jessie and Jacob, along with their close friends must face true-to-life decisions during a single dramatic and breath-taking year that will mark their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jtyfMM3OIwtXRIk7dbfUsbXa8s.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:56964'),
  ('97293447462394134', 'East New York', 2022, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mike Flynn, William M. Finkelstein', 'Jamie Lynn Harris', 'Amanda Warren, Kevin Rankin, Elizabeth Rodriguez, Richard Kind, Olivia Luccardi, Lavel Schley, Ruben Santiago-Hudson, Jimmy Smits', 'TV-14', 'Regina Haywood is the newly promoted deputy inspector of East New York, a working-class neighborhood at the edge of Brooklyn. She leads a diverse group of officers and detectives, some of whom are reluctant to deploy her creative methods of serving and protecting in the midst of social upheaval and the early seeds of gentrification.', 'Regina Haywood is the newly promoted deputy inspector of East New York, a working-class neighborhood at the edge of Brooklyn. She leads a diverse group of officers and detectives, some of whom are reluctant to deploy her creative methods of serving and protecting in the midst of social upheaval and the early seeds of gentrification.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOos5pwq3tzPCwFohG80i2SXAgR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202296'),
  ('1072572295146901700', 'East of Eden', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, '나연숙', 'Song Seung-heon, Yeon Jeong-hun, Park Hae-jin, Lee Da-hae, Han Ji-hye, Lee Yeon-hee, Jo Min-ki, Lee Mi-sook', null, 'The fate of two brothers diverge after the murder of their coal miner father, with one joining the mob and the other becoming a successful lawyer.', 'The fate of two brothers diverge after the murder of their coal miner father, with one joining the mob and the other becoming a successful lawyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ap9qG1fJqvbyMpZn4e5Rdsdhwwj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20960'),
  ('1060366283304572949', 'East West 101', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kris Wyld, Steve Knapman', null, 'Don Hany, Susie Porter, Aaron Fa''aoso, Daniela Farinacci, Renee Lim, Matt Nable, Tasneem Roc, Joshua Consandine', 'TV-14', 'Zane Malik and the Major Crime Squad investigate crime and murder in all quarters of multicultural Sydney.', 'Zane Malik and the Major Crime Squad investigate crime and murder in all quarters of multicultural Sydney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4896OBdsDZIg0eUANQ8abMfrpJU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:14168'),
  ('301509866823936809', 'Eastbound & Down', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Danny McBride, Jody Hill, Ben Best', null, 'Danny McBride, Steve Little, Katy Mixon', 'TV-MA', 'Years after he turned his back on his hometown, a burned-out major league ballplayer returns to teach phys ed at his old middle school.', 'Years after he turned his back on his hometown, a burned-out major league ballplayer returns to teach phys ed at his old middle school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grAnpm6mv6aipoGeS0yS6RuTZSG.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:8624'),
  ('844433874677920244', 'EastEnders', 1985, 'Soap, Drama, Crime', 'Julia Smith, Tony Holland', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'The everyday lives of working-class residents of Albert Square, a traditional Victorian square of terrace houses surrounding a park in the East End of London''s Walford borough.', 'The everyday lives of working-class residents of Albert Square, a traditional Victorian square of terrace houses surrounding a park in the East End of London''s Walford borough.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4jgyI5TpoRZiJTNchkVkMrGQyz.jpg', 42, 'tmdb:tv:1871'),
  ('1003719384291299412', 'EastSiders', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kit Williamson', null, 'Van Hansis, Kit Williamson, John Halbach, Matthew McKelligon, Leith M. Burke, Stephen Guarino, Willam Belli, Max Emerson', 'TV-MA', 'What happens after the world ends? This show explores the aftermath of infidelity on a gay couple in Silver Lake, CA.', 'What happens after the world ends? This show explores the aftermath of infidelity on a gay couple in Silver Lake, CA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rXnh7Tph8QI500BzB0QjwvBYvV.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:67202'),
  ('249376344040393974', 'Eastwick', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Maggie Friedman', null, 'Rebecca Romijn, Lindsay Price, Jaime Ray Newman, Paul Gross, Sara Rue, Veronica Cartwright, Johann Urb, Ashley Benson', null, 'Three very different women find themselves drawn together by a mysterious man who unleashes unique powers in each of them, and this small New England town will never be the same.', 'Three very different women find themselves drawn together by a mysterious man who unleashes unique powers in each of them, and this small New England town will never be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WIzfyNrdovzu1gMYIUFU06faku.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18186'),
  ('164459839518202449', 'Easy', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joe Swanberg', null, null, 'TV-MA', 'This eclectic, star-studded anthology follows diverse Chicagoans fumbling through the modern maze of love, sex, technology and culture. First dates, friends with benefits, couples with kids. Whatever your relationship status is, it''s always complicated.', 'This eclectic, star-studded anthology follows diverse Chicagoans fumbling through the modern maze of love, sex, technology and culture. First dates, friends with benefits, couples with kids. Whatever your relationship status is, it''s always complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uh0pHb6JV0m6Vjmz1tGhohr9B7y.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67780'),
  ('1065905725672659348', 'Easy-Bake Battle: The Home Cooking Competition', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Antoni Porowski', 'TV-PG', 'Talented home cooks put their skills and creativity to the test making fast and easy dishes that are wildly delicious — and worthy of a big cash prize.', 'Talented home cooks put their skills and creativity to the test making fast and easy dishes that are wildly delicious — and worthy of a big cash prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5gL3f66XCah2tjHN9P6KNLtPYOb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:211084'),
  ('14341662867305540', 'Easygoing Territory Defense by the Optimistic Lord', 2026, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yumi Uchiyama, Mao Ichimichi, Mariya Ise, Yoko Hikasa, Shion Wakayama, Kenyu Horiuchi, Chikahiro Kobayashi, Makoto Furukawa', 'TV-14', 'Reborn as a marquis’ fourth son, Van was once hailed as a genius prodigy—until he’s exiled to a nameless frontier village for possessing Production Magic, a useless type of magic in this world. But when he uses his “useless” power to craft weapons, tools, and wonders beyond imagination, the village begins to thrive! What began as exile is now the start of a new life—and a world-changing adventure!', 'Reborn as a marquis’ fourth son, Van was once hailed as a genius prodigy—until he’s exiled to a nameless frontier village for possessing Production Magic, a useless type of magic in this world. But when he uses his “useless” power to craft weapons, tools, and wonders beyond imagination, the village begins to thrive! What began as exile is now the start of a new life—and a world-changing adventure!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ctXv1LyyVad5VLToS1t2ZqSCQa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:288589'),
  ('495661212256307435', 'Eat Run Love', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Arthur Chen, Sabrina Zhuang, Lin Boyang, Denny Huang, Yi Daqian, Shang Xinyue, Xiang Yu, Zhang Haolei', null, 'Campus golden boy Gan Yang falls for the hardworking Ding Zhitong, who has no time for love until his warmth wins her over. Despite their different backgrounds, their romance flourishes—until Gan Yang secretly shoulders his family’s financial downfall and breaks up with her. Heartbroken and feeling betrayed, Ding Zhitong’s life takes a drastic turn, leaving her with deep resentment. Six years later, their paths cross again in the business world, where she must secure investment from his company. With love and resentment intertwined, can they overcome the past and find their way back to each other?', 'Campus golden boy Gan Yang falls for the hardworking Ding Zhitong, who has no time for love until his warmth wins her over. Despite their different backgrounds, their romance flourishes—until Gan Yang secretly shoulders his family’s financial downfall and breaks up with her. Heartbroken and feeling betrayed, Ding Zhitong’s life takes a drastic turn, leaving her with deep resentment. Six years later, their paths cross again in the business world, where she must secure investment from his company. With love and resentment intertwined, can they overcome the past and find their way back to each other?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksZiJ8IbByqFxOTszZjdPmcRlP5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255095'),
  ('267081251832280752', 'Eat the Rich: The GameStop Saga', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Taylor Lorenz, Andrew Left, Abbe Minor, Jim Cramer, Diana Wilson, Peter Sasaki, Mikey Guggenheim, Erik Hess', 'TV-MA', 'A community of amateur traders enacts a daring plan to get rich quick and wreak havoc on the stock market. But can they beat Wall Street at its own game?', 'A community of amateur traders enacts a daring plan to get rich quick and wreak havoc on the stock market. But can they beat Wall Street at its own game?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRO7O3moovOAUQtN8eNW62NQ77v.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209663'),
  ('684367357231827159', 'EAT-MAN', 1997, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Masashi Ebara, Katsuhisa Houki, Aya Hisakawa', null, 'Bolt Crank is an "explorer"--a mercenary who only accepts jobs that fits his moral standards. Even so, explorers like him are rarely trusted, and employment both in getting and also doing the job is hazardous. However, despite the fact Bolt says it''s the only job he''s any good at, he''s also the best explorer around. Moreover, he has a unique ability. He''s able to eat anything at all, and later can reproduce it wholly intact and functional! As an enigmatic man of few words, it''s hard to understand someone who can do something so strange, and who despite it all, just wants to be normal.', 'Bolt Crank is an "explorer"--a mercenary who only accepts jobs that fits his moral standards. Even so, explorers like him are rarely trusted, and employment both in getting and also doing the job is hazardous. However, despite the fact Bolt says it''s the only job he''s any good at, he''s also the best explorer around. Moreover, he has a unique ability. He''s able to eat anything at all, and later can reproduce it wholly intact and functional! As an enigmatic man of few words, it''s hard to understand someone who can do something so strange, and who despite it all, just wants to be normal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VReN6457bUoyE9uyAsoSFdhZcG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34209'),
