  ('63350845557331391', 'Ecomoda', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fernando Gaitán', null, 'Ana María Orozco, Jorge Enrique Abello, Lorena Meritano, Geoffrey Deakin, Mario Duarte, Julián Arango, Luis Mesa, Ricardo Vélez', null, 'Betty and Armando face new challenges as leaders of Ecomoda, a company in crisis. Between rivalries, betrayals, and the return of the unforgettable "Ugly Quarters," they must balance their family life while fighting to save the company''s future.', 'Betty and Armando face new challenges as leaders of Ecomoda, a company in crisis. Between rivalries, betrayals, and the return of the unforgettable "Ugly Quarters," they must balance their family life while fighting to save the company''s future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQgvi0yufzRV8A3i4lVheMxU2RN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73481'),
  ('237470663054090166', 'ECW Hardcore TV', 1993, 'Action & Adventure', 'Tod Gordon, Eddie Gilbert', null, 'Vito LoGrasso, Steve Corino, Michael Bucci, Mark LoMonaco, Christopher Hamrick, Devon Hughes, Jerry Lawler, Scott Hall', 'TV-MA', 'No rules. No regulations. The only commandment is to be extreme. Welcome to the show that started a revolution.', 'No rules. No regulations. The only commandment is to be extreme. Welcome to the show that started a revolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sl8cqt6WD7tlXrMJMsLwI0VcsAC.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:14774'),
  ('357338429570165868', 'Ed', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rob Burnett, Jon Beckerman', null, 'Tom Cavanagh, Julie Bowen, Michael Ian Black, Lesley Boone, Jana Marie Hupp, Rachel Cronin, Mike Starr, Justin Long', null, 'After his wife leaves him and he''s fired from his job at a high-profile New York city law firm, Ed Stevens moves back to his small hometown of Stuckeyville where he buys the local bowling alley and attempts to win the heart of his high school crush.', 'After his wife leaves him and he''s fired from his job at a high-profile New York city law firm, Ed Stevens moves back to his small hometown of Stuckeyville where he buys the local bowling alley and attempts to win the heart of his high school crush.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkbqibIYSx2wtQRCF37O5Vnnjx8.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1926'),
  ('566346082584111840', 'Ed and Ryu: Mad About Seafood', 2026, 'Documentary, Reality', 'Ryu Soo-young, Edward Lee', null, 'Ryu Soo-young, Edward Lee', null, 'Ed and Ryu: Mad About Seafood is a four-part English-language series exploring South Korea’s rich seafood traditions and maritime heritage. Following Ed and Ryu as they harvest wild seaweed using ancient techniques and catch anchovies with traditional bamboo traps, the show is also about contemporary Korea: diving into the science behind K-beauty trends like salmon sperm injections and reimagining the local cuisine with seasonal seafood.', 'Ed and Ryu: Mad About Seafood is a four-part English-language series exploring South Korea’s rich seafood traditions and maritime heritage. Following Ed and Ryu as they harvest wild seaweed using ancient techniques and catch anchovies with traditional bamboo traps, the show is also about contemporary Korea: diving into the science behind K-beauty trends like salmon sperm injections and reimagining the local cuisine with seasonal seafood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncU917fLr8S051SQhQWsYUZkLUq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318761'),
  ('1054445875027140003', 'Ed Sheeran: The Sum of It All', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ed Sheeran, Cherry Seaborn', 'TV-14', 'For the first time ever, global superstar, Ed Sheeran opens the doors to a definitive and searingly honest view into his private life as he explores the universal themes that inspire his music. This series follows Ed after he learns of life changing news and reveals his hardships and triumphs during the most challenging period of his life. Featuring exclusive footage behind his iconic hits, never-before-seen personal archive with his friends and family, and epic stadium performances giving insight into Ed’s world.', 'For the first time ever, global superstar, Ed Sheeran opens the doors to a definitive and searingly honest view into his private life as he explores the universal themes that inspire his music. This series follows Ed after he learns of life changing news and reveals his hardships and triumphs during the most challenging period of his life. Featuring exclusive footage behind his iconic hits, never-before-seen personal archive with his friends and family, and epic stadium performances giving insight into Ed’s world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFkNarRn5RujHPwwLe1U8AmCUEf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:222674'),
  ('377828316287953001', 'Ed Stafford: First Man Out', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Ed Stafford', 'TV-14', 'Ed Stafford takes on a series of head-to-head challenges against some of the biggest names in survival, risking life, limb, and reputation along the way. Over miles of hostile terrain in Asia, Ed and his opponents will face high stakes survival challenges as they race to reach a predetermined extraction point, in a bid to prove they are top of their game and be the first man out.', 'Ed Stafford takes on a series of head-to-head challenges against some of the biggest names in survival, risking life, limb, and reputation along the way. Over miles of hostile terrain in Asia, Ed and his opponents will face high stakes survival challenges as they race to reach a predetermined extraction point, in a bid to prove they are top of their game and be the first man out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/77rXDebsD4QaEbFsBLeysFrsl9i.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:86479'),
  ('219884914468199671', 'Ed, Edd n Eddy', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids, Family', 'Danny Antonucci', null, 'Matt Hill, Sam Vincent, Tony Sampson, Keenan Christensen, Kathleen Barr, Janyse Jaud, Peter Kelamis, Erin Fitzgerald', 'TV-Y7', 'Three adolescent boys, Ed, Edd "Double D", and Eddy, collectively known as "the Eds", constantly invent schemes to make money from their peers to purchase their favorite confectionery, jawbreakers. Their plans usually fail though, leaving them in various predicaments.', 'Three adolescent boys, Ed, Edd "Double D", and Eddy, collectively known as "the Eds", constantly invent schemes to make money from their peers to purchase their favorite confectionery, jawbreakers. Their plans usually fail though, leaving them in various predicaments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfKenwmfmdtoXGhaYiDIftrBchw.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:606'),
