  ('738447492695853396', 'Eerie, Indiana', 1991, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jose Rivera, Karl Schaefer', null, 'Omri Katz, Justin Shenkarow, Mary-Margaret Humes, Julie Condra, Francis Guinan', 'TV-Y7', 'Teenage weirdness investigator Marshall Teller adventures through his new small-town home with his friends, geeky Simon Holmes and mysterious Dash X.', 'Teenage weirdness investigator Marshall Teller adventures through his new small-town home with his friends, geeky Simon Holmes and mysterious Dash X.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sr8CmrtnPTJSYtNyMxvWHRaweSN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4045'),
  ('119247370389900475', 'Ef: A Tale Of Memories & Melodies', 2007, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', null, null, 'Yumiko Nakajima, Koichi Tochika, Mai Gotou, Kenji Hamada, Shizuka Itoh, Toru Furusawa', 'TV-14', 'On Christmas Eve, Hiro Hirono meets a girl named Miyako Miyamura as she chases a purse snatcher. Hiro later finds out that Miyako also goes to the same school as he does and they start hanging out together. This makes Hiro''s childhood friend, Kei Shindō, feel left out, so she tries to compete with Miyako for Hiro''s affection, creating a love triangle. Meanwhile, Renji Asō meets a girl named Chihiro Shindō at an abandoned train station. He soon learns that Chihiro suffers from a type of amnesia where her memory lasts for only 13 hours. He also discovers Chihiro''s dream of writing a novel, but she has never been able to fulfill that dream due to her condition. Renji then decides to help her fulfill that dream.', 'On Christmas Eve, Hiro Hirono meets a girl named Miyako Miyamura as she chases a purse snatcher. Hiro later finds out that Miyako also goes to the same school as he does and they start hanging out together. This makes Hiro''s childhood friend, Kei Shindō, feel left out, so she tries to compete with Miyako for Hiro''s affection, creating a love triangle. Meanwhile, Renji Asō meets a girl named Chihiro Shindō at an abandoned train station. He soon learns that Chihiro suffers from a type of amnesia where her memory lasts for only 13 hours. He also discovers Chihiro''s dream of writing a novel, but she has never been able to fulfill that dream due to her condition. Renji then decides to help her fulfill that dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoxyuMX7gQqw2tdbTYaMIO6HMZ1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:27866'),
  ('618945525054153835', 'Eglimata', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Lefteris Papapetrou', null, 'Maria Kavoyianni, Kostas Koklas, Iro Mane, Ketty Konstadinou, Hristos Hatzipanagiotis, Stavros Nikolaidis, Soula Athanasiadou, Athinodoros Prousalis', null, 'Achilleas'' wife, Flora, is disappointed by her marriage and remembers nostalgia for her childhood love, Alekos. Fate brings them so they eventually reunite illegally. Alekos''s wife, however, Soso understands the illegal relationship and tries to avenge her husband for his infidelity. A series of incredible "crimes" unfolds with our heroes victims.', 'Achilleas'' wife, Flora, is disappointed by her marriage and remembers nostalgia for her childhood love, Alekos. Fate brings them so they eventually reunite illegally. Alekos''s wife, however, Soso understands the illegal relationship and tries to avenge her husband for his infidelity. A series of incredible "crimes" unfolds with our heroes victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uM0OzOMOwsx3KPfeADLVWvBMQfj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91824'),
  ('989696461222843688', 'Egoli: Place of Gold', 1992, 'Soap', 'Franz Marx', null, null, null, 'A South African television soap opera created by Franz Marx which revolves around the daily ups, downs, trials and tribulations of a handful of families in and around Johannesburg (which is often referred to as eGoli - the City of Gold)', 'A South African television soap opera created by Franz Marx which revolves around the daily ups, downs, trials and tribulations of a handful of families in and around Johannesburg (which is often referred to as eGoli - the City of Gold)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8ivo9sEkKrLYRsNeyaVmAbH0eg.jpg', 18, 'tmdb:tv:12415'),
  ('375159476538516568', 'Egypt', 2005, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Jonathan Rich', null, 'Matthew Kelly, Lynsey Baxter, Andrew Sachs, Julian Wadham, Caroline Langrishe, Alexandra Weaver, Elliot Cowan, Laurence Fox', null, 'Television drama serial about various archaeological discoveries taking place in that country''s history, with the occasional ''flashback'' scene involving actors portraying the ancient Egyptians themselves.', 'Television drama serial about various archaeological discoveries taking place in that country''s history, with the occasional ''flashback'' scene involving actors portraying the ancient Egyptians themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHhhQkhxbbKxl7P7hf8QgAlYvdJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6275'),
  ('167039426562369115', 'Egypt''s Unexplained Files', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Alisdair Simpson', null, 'Experts dive deep into the secrets of Ancient Egypt, and use cutting-edge archaeological technology to reveal the hidden truths that could potentially answer questions that have befuddled Egyptologists for generations.', 'Experts dive deep into the secrets of Ancient Egypt, and use cutting-edge archaeological technology to reveal the hidden truths that could potentially answer questions that have befuddled Egyptologists for generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oowT6JYRSPGZj5N9TbQfvuKExMC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88149'),
  ('351690294410060364', 'Eight Hours Don’t Make a Day', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', null, 'Gottfried John, Wolfried Lier, Irm Hermann, Anita Bucher, Werner Finck, Hanna Schygulla, Wolfgang Schenck, Rudolf Waldemar Brem', null, 'Eight Hours Don''t Make a Day (German: Acht Stunden sind kein Tag) is a West German television drama miniseries written and directed by Rainer Werner Fassbinder. Commissioned by Westdeutscher Rundfunk, it broadcast in five episodes between 1972 and 1973. In Cologne, West Germany, young toolmaker Jochen''s world is explored, including those around him: the woman he loves, his eccentric family, and his fellow workers, with whom he bands together to improve conditions on the factory floor.', 'Eight Hours Don''t Make a Day (German: Acht Stunden sind kein Tag) is a West German television drama miniseries written and directed by Rainer Werner Fassbinder. Commissioned by Westdeutscher Rundfunk, it broadcast in five episodes between 1972 and 1973. In Cologne, West Germany, young toolmaker Jochen''s world is explored, including those around him: the woman he loves, his eccentric family, and his fellow workers, with whom he bands together to improve conditions on the factory floor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huzN17LhXWL49myIb6nB1Iso2N4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39837'),
  ('210148406482713534', 'Eight Is Enough', 1977, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Mendelson', null, 'Dick Van Patten, Betty Buckley, Grant Goodeve, Willie Aames, Dianne Kay, Connie Needham, Lani O''Grady, Adam Rich', null, 'Eight Is Enough is an American television comedy-drama series that ran on ABC from March 15, 1977, until August 29, 1981. The show was modeled after syndicated newspaper columnist Thomas Braden, a real-life parent with eight children, who wrote a book with the same name.', 'Eight Is Enough is an American television comedy-drama series that ran on ABC from March 15, 1977, until August 29, 1981. The show was modeled after syndicated newspaper columnist Thomas Braden, a real-life parent with eight children, who wrote a book with the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grfzd62iFtkA68lRJCqMVZEVnSL.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4382'),
  ('1096134617386548029', 'Eighteen, Twenty-Nine', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Kim Kyeong-hee', 'Park Sun-young, Ryu Soo-young, Park Eun-hye, Lee Joong-moon, Shin Gu, Choi Si-won, Cho Eun-ji, Lee Sang-woo', null, 'Yu Hye Chan is 29 years old. Hye Chan is married to Kang Bong Man who is her old classmate in high school whom she despised and hated but later fell for. The story opens with her decision to get a divorce. She has a car accident on the way to the courthouse. When she wakes up at the hospital, she has no memory of her life past age 18. Her husband tries to support her since she is basically helpless now. As she recovers her memory, she also starts to recover a relationship with her husband and begins to fall for him all over again.', 'Yu Hye Chan is 29 years old. Hye Chan is married to Kang Bong Man who is her old classmate in high school whom she despised and hated but later fell for. The story opens with her decision to get a divorce. She has a car accident on the way to the courthouse. When she wakes up at the hospital, she has no memory of her life past age 18. Her husband tries to support her since she is basically helpless now. As she recovers her memory, she also starts to recover a relationship with her husband and begins to fall for him all over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VOcgbM0FD1RMkpTakF8QuElw1b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11866'),
  ('1005959741281178928', 'Eiken', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Miwa Ohshiro, Akeno Watanabe, Masumi Asano, Mai Kadowaki, Marina Oono, Emi Yabusaki, Touko Itou', 'TV-MA', 'Densuke just enrolled at the exclusive Zashono Academy. He''s eager to participate in extracurricular activities, but never expected to join the mysterious Eiken Club. Strangely enough, every other member is a busty co-ed, and many of the club activities involve bikinis. But Densuke isn''t interested in anyone but the the shy and beautiful Chiharu. Will he overcome the wall of women that stand between him and true love?', 'Densuke just enrolled at the exclusive Zashono Academy. He''s eager to participate in extracurricular activities, but never expected to join the mysterious Eiken Club. Strangely enough, every other member is a busty co-ed, and many of the club activities involve bikinis. But Densuke isn''t interested in anyone but the the shy and beautiful Chiharu. Will he overcome the wall of women that stand between him and true love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giohCfXtmSOL4z6H05tf8nMro0H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34840'),
  ('571076225301620865', 'Ein Herz und eine Seele', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Wolfgang Menge', null, 'Heinz Schubert, Helga Feddersen, Hildegard Krekel, Klaus Dahlen', 'NR', 'Ein Herz und eine Seele is a German cult sitcom based on the British sitcom Till Death Us Do Part by Johnny Speight. The show premiered on January 15, 1973 and lasted for about twenty episodes, airing its last on November 4, 1974. In 1976, the show had a short-lived revival with another four episodes. Ein Herz und eine Seele was written by Wolfgang Menge. The show was extremely successful during its initial run and it still proves very popular in reruns. Two episodes in particular, Silvesterpunsch and Rosenmontagszug have gained such popularity that they are now shown traditionally on German TV on New Year''s Eve and Rosenmontag, respectively.', 'Ein Herz und eine Seele is a German cult sitcom based on the British sitcom Till Death Us Do Part by Johnny Speight. The show premiered on January 15, 1973 and lasted for about twenty episodes, airing its last on November 4, 1974. In 1976, the show had a short-lived revival with another four episodes. Ein Herz und eine Seele was written by Wolfgang Menge. The show was extremely successful during its initial run and it still proves very popular in reruns. Two episodes in particular, Silvesterpunsch and Rosenmontagszug have gained such popularity that they are now shown traditionally on German TV on New Year''s Eve and Rosenmontag, respectively.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5WSnBLjnO4R8n8qJc9JCN1Fvx6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11578'),
  ('72809814235201297', 'Ein starkes Team', 1994, 'Drama, Crime', 'Krystian Martinek', null, 'Florian Martens, Tayfun Bademsoy, Jaecki Schwarz, Maja Maranow, Arnfried Lerche, Kai Lentrodt', 'NR', 'The unlikely police pair Verena Berthold and Otto Garber are part of a special task force investigating organized crime in Berlin. He comes from the east, she from the west of Berlin. He''s a redneck, she''s from a better background. This causes conflict. Over time, things start to sizzle between the two. Their team includes the agile German-Turkish Yücsel and the sluggish Georg, who, like Verena and Otto, are constantly bickering. The department manager is Lothar Reddemann. Sputnik is a former colleague of Otto''s from the People''s Police and is constantly coming up with new business ideas for stores and pubs where the team meets.', 'The unlikely police pair Verena Berthold and Otto Garber are part of a special task force investigating organized crime in Berlin. He comes from the east, she from the west of Berlin. He''s a redneck, she''s from a better background. This causes conflict. Over time, things start to sizzle between the two. Their team includes the agile German-Turkish Yücsel and the sluggish Georg, who, like Verena and Otto, are constantly bickering. The department manager is Lothar Reddemann. Sputnik is a former colleague of Otto''s from the People''s Police and is constantly coming up with new business ideas for stores and pubs where the team meets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrLDjgOHk0MLQNSdAs1vzUOMuQc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:41116'),
