  ('1033981450288049550', 'El Candidato', 2020, 'Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Peter Blake', null, 'James Purefoy, Eréndira Ibarra, José María de Tavira, Joaquín Cosío', 'TV-MA', 'Rookie CIA field operative Isabel Alfaro works alongside infamous CIA legend Wayne Addison to bring down Rafael Bautista, Mexico''s most vicious and brilliant narco. Her mission brings her into conflict with Eduardo Yzaguirre, her former boyfriend and the current Mayor of Mexico City, the cleanest and most inspirational politician in the country.', 'Rookie CIA field operative Isabel Alfaro works alongside infamous CIA legend Wayne Addison to bring down Rafael Bautista, Mexico''s most vicious and brilliant narco. Her mission brings her into conflict with Eduardo Yzaguirre, her former boyfriend and the current Mayor of Mexico City, the cleanest and most inspirational politician in the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7R516ljjfrr3Wh6UUStdOxJxW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106108'),
  ('799318405777933395', 'El Capo', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Gustavo Bolívar', 'Gustavo Bolívar', 'Marlon Moreno, Katherine Vélez, Óscar Borda, Maria Adelaida Puerta, Juan Carlos Vargas, Natalia Jerez, Cristina Umaña, Erika Monserrate Vélez Zambrano', 'TV-14', 'El Capo, the most wanted drug dealer in Mexico, has been intercepted while hiding with his trusted men, his wife and his lover. During his escape, he declares war on the government and his own past.', 'El Capo, the most wanted drug dealer in Mexico, has been intercepted while hiding with his trusted men, his wife and his lover. During his escape, he declares war on the government and his own past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTwfFidPtRU3BUH8mK90jWyPyBr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:31268'),
