  ('158270035554275828', 'El Clon', 2010, 'Drama', 'Hugo León Ferrer', null, 'Mauricio Ochmann, Sandra Echeverría, Luz Stella Luengas, Lucy Martínez, Roberto Moll, Juan Pablo Raba, Andrea López, Saúl Lisazo', 'TV-14', 'Lucas falls for a young Arab girl named Jade. She is caught between modern values and her Islamic upbringing. They separate and two decades pass. Then a strange turn of luck brings the pair together. Then Jade meets a clone, who is just like Lucas, but twenty years younger. She must choose between the man she loved and the memory she cherishes.', 'Lucas falls for a young Arab girl named Jade. She is caught between modern values and her Islamic upbringing. They separate and two decades pass. Then a strange turn of luck brings the pair together. Then Jade meets a clone, who is just like Lucas, but twenty years younger. She must choose between the man she loved and the memory she cherishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9byDszGYWJtHhZo88s5q3tW3FY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15842'),
