  ('522816011033337095', 'El Conde: Amor y Honor', 2024, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Fernando Colunga, Ana Brenda Contreras, Marjorie de Sousa, Sergio Sendel, Chantal Andere, Víctor González, Helena Rojo, Omar Fierro', 'TV-14', 'A wrongful conviction changes the life of Alejandro Gaitán and separates him from the woman he loves, Mariana Zambrano. After 17 years in jail, he becomes a count with the help of another prisoner and seeks revenge on those who turned on him.', 'A wrongful conviction changes the life of Alejandro Gaitán and separates him from the woman he loves, Mariana Zambrano. After 17 years in jail, he becomes a count with the help of another prisoner and seeks revenge on those who turned on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwcTD8hRx5Ch4sAmjNHmWigkaND.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247174'),
