  ('188459446591163818', 'El Dorado', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, 'John Cockrell, Terry Cunningham, Scott Jenkins', 'Shane West, Natalie Martinez, Luke Goss, Elden Henson, Julio Oscar Mechoso, Vanessa Saba, Giovanni Ciccia', 'TV-14', 'Archeologist Jack Wilder stumbles upon clues to the whereabouts of the fabled Incan city of El Dorado. He finds himself tracked by a deadly mercenary and captured by the corrupt Peruvian army. He is rescued by an ex-lover, Maria Martinez, who joins him on his quest to find the legendary golden city.', 'Archeologist Jack Wilder stumbles upon clues to the whereabouts of the fabled Incan city of El Dorado. He finds himself tracked by a deadly mercenary and captured by the corrupt Peruvian army. He is rescued by an ex-lover, Maria Martinez, who joins him on his quest to find the legendary golden city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynUyeNw4aCj5uW2swj7YYb1yGyR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39245'),
  ('589485555192277738', 'El Dragón: Return of a Warrior', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Arturo Pérez-Reverte', null, 'Sebastián Rulli, Renata Notni, Roberto Mateos, Irina Baeva, Juan Pablo Gil, Sofía Castro, Jean Paul Leroux, Marcelo Buquet', 'TV-MA', 'A Tokyo business man returns to his home country of Mexico where he must battle rivals to replace his grandfather as the head of a cartel.', 'A Tokyo business man returns to his home country of Mexico where he must battle rivals to replace his grandfather as the head of a cartel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1eKrOjS7OSOjgmEIdCNmKEEItKJ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94154'),
  ('409581861440435729', 'El Encanto del Águila', 2011, 'Documentary, War & Politics, Drama', 'Leopoldo Gómez, Bernardo Gómez, Pedro Torres', null, 'Ignacio López Tarso, Andrés Montiel, Tenoch Huerta Mejía, Cecilia Suárez, Carlos Corona, Emilio Echevarría, Juan Carlos Colombo, Mario Zaragoza', 'TV-PG', 'A detailed dramatization of historical events during the time of the Revolution in Mexico. Using never-before-known historical documents, details about what happened during the period from 1910 to 1928 are revealed.', 'A detailed dramatization of historical events during the time of the Revolution in Mexico. Using never-before-known historical documents, details about what happened during the period from 1910 to 1928 are revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDJswCEdnfOFFMIp0L6Uzd0IDoD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110072'),
  ('763713310013243554', 'El Estilista', 2014, 'Drama', 'Nubia Barreto', 'Nubia Barreto, Verner Duarte', 'Sebastián Boscán, Orlando Valenzuela, Sebastián Martínez, Angélica Blandón, Rafael Zea, Camilo Trujillo, Jennifer Leivovici, Aída Morales', 'NR', 'On Gabriel''s birthday, he and his friend Jorge Mario are kidnapped by guerrillas who have infiltrated his rice farm. Isolated in the middle of nowhere and with no news of his desperate family, Gabriel must survive however he can and becomes the stylist for the commanders and soldiers. Gabriel insinuates himself into the circles of power to eavesdrop on the commanders'' conversations, gathering critical information and trying to find a way to contact his brother in the military so he can regain his freedom.', 'On Gabriel''s birthday, he and his friend Jorge Mario are kidnapped by guerrillas who have infiltrated his rice farm. Isolated in the middle of nowhere and with no news of his desperate family, Gabriel must survive however he can and becomes the stylist for the commanders and soldiers. Gabriel insinuates himself into the circles of power to eavesdrop on the commanders'' conversations, gathering critical information and trying to find a way to contact his brother in the military so he can regain his freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hzHnQqqRVg9m9H4iZZRim2vspm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118839'),
  ('487109008652690071', 'El extraño retorno de Diana Salazar', 1988, 'Drama, Soap', 'Carlos Téllez, Margarita Villaseñor, Carlos Olmos', null, 'Lucía Méndez, Jorge Martínez, Alejandro Camacho, Adriana Roel, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Carlos Cámara, Chela Nájera, Fernando Sáenz', null, 'El extraño retorno de Diana Salazar is a 1988 Mexican telenovela starring Lucía Méndez and Jorge Martinez. It is an unusual example of a telenovela which addresses supernatural topics.', 'El extraño retorno de Diana Salazar is a 1988 Mexican telenovela starring Lucía Méndez and Jorge Martinez. It is an unusual example of a telenovela which addresses supernatural topics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45ZLhHKvywU72Jd2W5G8CJYYyDu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19918'),
  ('661914044968895174', 'El extraño retorno de Diana Salazar', 2024, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Carlos Algara', null, 'Angelique Boyer, Sebastián Rulli, Arap Bethke, Cassandra Sánchez Navarro, Sergio Mur, Sergio Reynoso, Mónica Dionne, Rubén Sáenz', null, 'In the 17th century, Leonor and Eduardo''s forbidden love ends tragically when she is executed for witchcraft. Centuries later their souls reincarnate in Diana and Mario, but they face the fear of being discovered for their true selves.', 'In the 17th century, Leonor and Eduardo''s forbidden love ends tragically when she is executed for witchcraft. Centuries later their souls reincarnate in Diana and Mario, but they face the fear of being discovered for their true selves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqaAgRgBtFfaTUNwzpTee8zM3G2.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:252701'),
  ('38331169173198163', 'El final del paraíso', 2019, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Gregorio Pernía, Catherine Siachoque, Fabián Ríos, Juan Pablo Gamboa, Kimberly Reyes, Carmen Villalobos', 'TV-MA', 'In this new era, Catalina, now head of the DEA in Colombia, has a new challenge: to track down a criminal organization that is trafficking a new synthetic drug. What she ignores is that her daughter is part of the Cartel that traffics them and that Yésica, her worst enemy, is infiltrated in the DEA.', 'In this new era, Catalina, now head of the DEA in Colombia, has a new challenge: to track down a criminal organization that is trafficking a new synthetic drug. What she ignores is that her daughter is part of the Cartel that traffics them and that Yésica, her worst enemy, is infiltrated in the DEA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1B2upXyWC74tRmg6UEtuvIm08rQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:95439'),
  ('664218821566722115', 'El Gallo de Oro', 2023, 'Drama', 'Juan Rulfo', null, 'Lucero, José Ron, Plutarco Haza, Adriana Williams, Anilú Pardo, Alejandro Ávila, Luis Felipe Tovar, Alberto Estrella', 'TV-MA', 'The story of a passionate love between La Caponera, a palenque singer, and possessor of a gift that gives luck to the man who accompanies her, and Dionisio, a strange and introverted town crier, as they wander from fair to fair through the center of the country.', 'The story of a passionate love between La Caponera, a palenque singer, and possessor of a gift that gives luck to the man who accompanies her, and Dionisio, a strange and introverted town crier, as they wander from fair to fair through the center of the country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iixsFHb2Y6BEjc7d6gThe5fwbfY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:236086'),
