  ('996426872502196124', 'Emil of Lönneberga', 1975, 'Family, Comedy', 'Astrid Lindgren', null, 'Jan Ohlsson, Lena Wisborg, Emy Storm, Allan Edwall, Maud Hansson, Björn Gustafson', null, 'Emil i Lönneberga is a Swedish television adaptation of Astrid Lindgren''s Emil i Lönneberga books', 'Emil i Lönneberga is a Swedish television adaptation of Astrid Lindgren''s Emil i Lönneberga books', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFOdbBJrbwyuoaYQCuYqDFtvn7e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40903'),
  ('864464196066169567', 'Emily in Paris', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Darren Star', null, 'Lily Collins, Philippine Leroy-Beaulieu, Ashley Park, Lucas Bravo, Samuel Arnold, Bruno Gouery, Lucien Laviscount, Eugenio Franceschini', 'TV-MA', 'New passions. New fashions. New Emily? A plucky American marketing whiz spreads her wings in life and love after landing her dream job in Paris.', 'New passions. New fashions. New Emily? A plucky American marketing whiz spreads her wings in life and love after landing her dream job in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0bkO416OU7YGdOFktk45H8REgL.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:82596'),
  ('1045640388920071857', 'Emily Owens, M.D.', 2012, 'Drama', 'Jennie Snyder Urman', null, 'Mamie Gummer, Justin Hartley, Michael Rady, Aja Naomi King, Necar Zadegan, Kelly McCreary', null, 'At long last, Emily Owens feels like she is an actual grown-up. She''s graduated from medical school and is now a first-year intern at Denver Memorial Hospital. So why does everyone keep warning her that the hospital is just like high school?', 'At long last, Emily Owens feels like she is an actual grown-up. She''s graduated from medical school and is now a first-year intern at Denver Memorial Hospital. So why does everyone keep warning her that the hospital is just like high school?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebpGigbHjHE8zVLrCUZacfnhua0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45298'),
  ('18253879047177603', 'Emma', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jim O''Hanlon', 'Sandy Welch', 'Romola Garai, Michael Gambon, Jonny Lee Miller, Tamsin Greig, Jodhi May, Robert Bathurst, Louise Dylan, Valerie Lilley', null, 'Emma Woodhouse is a congenial young lady who delights in meddling in other people’s affairs. She is perpetually trying to unite men and women who are utterly wrong for each other. Despite her interest in romance, Emma is clueless about her own feelings, and her relationship with gentle Mr. Knightley.', 'Emma Woodhouse is a congenial young lady who delights in meddling in other people’s affairs. She is perpetually trying to unite men and women who are utterly wrong for each other. Despite her interest in romance, Emma is clueless about her own feelings, and her relationship with gentle Mr. Knightley.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwTYHGzc4wtf8uFWwXAaUQH94Jx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18156'),
  ('1005707135734481720', 'Emma: A Victorian Romance', 2005, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Yumi Touma, Tokuyoshi Kawashima', 'TV-Y7', 'In 19th-century London, class lines are sharply drawn, and the social standing to which people are born dictates the path their lives will follow. Emma, an honest and hardworking young maid, never felt her place in life to be a burden. But then she met William, a member of the gentry and the eldest son of a wealthy family. His warm smile and earnest affection threaten to capture her heart... but can love truly conquer all?', 'In 19th-century London, class lines are sharply drawn, and the social standing to which people are born dictates the path their lives will follow. Emma, an honest and hardworking young maid, never felt her place in life to be a burden. But then she met William, a member of the gentry and the eldest son of a wealthy family. His warm smile and earnest affection threaten to capture her heart... but can love truly conquer all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbEsRPkypIVezOh6h5fZZN7LjUw.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:29310'),
  ('683360240137220824', 'Emmerdale', 1972, 'Soap, Drama', 'Kevin Laffan', null, null, 'TV-PG', 'The lives of several families in the Yorkshire Dales revolve around a farm and the nearby village. With murders, affairs, lies, deceit, laughter and tears, it''s all there in the village.', 'The lives of several families in the Yorkshire Dales revolve around a farm and the nearby village. With murders, affairs, lies, deceit, laughter and tears, it''s all there in the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szh6mSPgeAqs7Ijp7YHC90oGzkt.jpg', 55, 'tmdb:tv:2527'),
  ('344451510225168991', 'Empathie', 2025, 'Drama', 'Florence Longpré', 'Florence Longpré', 'Florence Longpré, Thomas Ngijol, Adrien Bletton, Benoît Brière', null, 'Suzanne, a former criminologist turned psychiatrist, starts a new job at the Mont-Royal Psychiatric Institute, where she meets Mortimer, an intriguing intervention officer with whom she strikes up a friendship, and fascinating patients.', 'Suzanne, a former criminologist turned psychiatrist, starts a new job at the Mont-Royal Psychiatric Institute, where she meets Mortimer, an intriguing intervention officer with whom she strikes up a friendship, and fascinating patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HGhzruSv399nvZmLJ3Sns9ntRP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284656'),
  ('670847096287897944', 'Emperatriz', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Hector Forero, José Ignacio Cabrujas, Mauricio Somuano', null, 'Gabriela Spanic, Bernie Paz, Sergio Bustamante, Adriana Louvier, Rafael Sánchez Navarro, Julieta Egurrola, Marimar Vega, Alberto Guerra', 'NR', 'Emperatriz is a Mexican telenovela produced by Fides Velasco for Azteca. It stars Gabriela Spanic as the title character, while Bernie Paz as the male lead. Other casts include Sergio de Bustamante, Julieta Egurrola, Adriana Louvier, Marimar Vega, Miriam Higareda, Alberto Guerra, Rafael Sanchez Navarro and Carmen Delgado. Omar Fierro made special appearance in the first five episodes, and later returns in the final part of the series.[1] The filming process took place between 17 March 2011 - 30 September 2011. The series premiered on 5 April 2011, 19 days after filming the first scene, at 8:30pm, occupying Prófugas del Destino''s slot, and ended on 8 November 2011. Emperatriz is also known as most selling telenovela of 2011.', 'Emperatriz is a Mexican telenovela produced by Fides Velasco for Azteca. It stars Gabriela Spanic as the title character, while Bernie Paz as the male lead. Other casts include Sergio de Bustamante, Julieta Egurrola, Adriana Louvier, Marimar Vega, Miriam Higareda, Alberto Guerra, Rafael Sanchez Navarro and Carmen Delgado. Omar Fierro made special appearance in the first five episodes, and later returns in the final part of the series.[1] The filming process took place between 17 March 2011 - 30 September 2011. The series premiered on 5 April 2011, 19 days after filming the first scene, at 8:30pm, occupying Prófugas del Destino''s slot, and ended on 8 November 2011. Emperatriz is also known as most selling telenovela of 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bPylpGwAPs5qI9sBc6JHfUMspT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:38983'),
  ('740023352378583560', 'Emperor of Ocean Park', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Stephen Carter', null, 'Forest Whitaker, Grantham Coleman, Tiffany Mack, Paulina Lule, Henry Simmons, Bryan Greenberg', 'TV-MA', 'Set in the worlds of politics, Ivy League academia, and the beaches of Martha’s Vineyard. It centers on Talcott Garland, an Ivy League law professor whose quiet life is shattered when his father, Judge Oliver Garland, dies of an apparent heart attack. The nature of the judge’s death is questioned by Tal’s sister, Mariah, a former journalist and inveterate conspiracy theorist, who believes that the judge, a failed Black nominee to the Supreme Court, met with foul play.', 'Set in the worlds of politics, Ivy League academia, and the beaches of Martha’s Vineyard. It centers on Talcott Garland, an Ivy League law professor whose quiet life is shattered when his father, Judge Oliver Garland, dies of an apparent heart attack. The nature of the judge’s death is questioned by Tal’s sister, Mariah, a former journalist and inveterate conspiracy theorist, who believes that the judge, a failed Black nominee to the Supreme Court, met with foul play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/an8gG0KBoCLeTaZBoSIhYNKHnP0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225265'),
  ('870429834621116984', 'Emperor of the Sea', 2004, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, War & Politics', 'Choi In-ho', 'Hwang Ju-ha', 'Song Il-gook, Kim Kap-soo, Park Young-kyu, Chae Jung-an, Choi Soo-jong, Soo Ae, Bae Soo-bin, Kim A-joong', null, 'Emperor of the Sea is a South Korean television drama series directed by Kang Il-soo and Kang Byung-taek and starring Choi Soo-jong, Chae Shi-ra, Song Il-gook and Soo Ae. It aired on KBS2 from November 24, 2004 to May 25, 2005 on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:50 for 51 episodes. The historical drama is based on Choi In-ho''s novel of the same title, which depicts the life of Jang Bogo, who rises from a lowly slave to a powerful maritime figure who dominated the East Asia seas and international trade during the Unified Silla Dynasty. The drama was received extremely well, holding the number one spot in the ratings for majority of the weeks it aired. It was also exported to eight countries earning approximately US$1.8 million in profits. The filming set in Wando County, South Jeolla Province also became a tourist attraction.', 'Emperor of the Sea is a South Korean television drama series directed by Kang Il-soo and Kang Byung-taek and starring Choi Soo-jong, Chae Shi-ra, Song Il-gook and Soo Ae. It aired on KBS2 from November 24, 2004 to May 25, 2005 on Wednesdays and Thursdays at 21:50 for 51 episodes. The historical drama is based on Choi In-ho''s novel of the same title, which depicts the life of Jang Bogo, who rises from a lowly slave to a powerful maritime figure who dominated the East Asia seas and international trade during the Unified Silla Dynasty. The drama was received extremely well, holding the number one spot in the ratings for majority of the weeks it aired. It was also exported to eight countries earning approximately US$1.8 million in profits. The filming set in Wando County, South Jeolla Province also became a tourist attraction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqXcK9bbR8jcY25eehi1cG0WnDi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14234'),
  ('1040688790200315625', 'Empire', 2005, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Tom Wheeler, Chip Johannessen, William Wheeler', null, 'Christopher Egan, Emily Blunt, James Frain, Jonathan Cake, Michael Maloney, Santiago Cabrera, Vincent Regan, Colm Feore', null, 'As Conqueror Julius Caesar is drawing his last breath, he swears Tyrannus—Rome''s finest warrior—to an oath to protect his successor, Octavius, his 18-year-old nephew. Tyrannus and Octavius are forced into exile to protect the young man from those who want to sever Caesar''s bloodline once and for all.', 'As Conqueror Julius Caesar is drawing his last breath, he swears Tyrannus—Rome''s finest warrior—to an oath to protect his successor, Octavius, his 18-year-old nephew. Tyrannus and Octavius are forced into exile to protect the young man from those who want to sever Caesar''s bloodline once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5p7en3Ct3bdwYyECA4oHkjSfJim.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11918'),
  ('400424733448387758', 'Empire', 2014, 'Soap, Drama', 'Aguinaldo Silva', 'Rodrigo Ribeiro, Márcia Prates, Brunno Pires', 'Alexandre Nero, Lília Cabral, Leandra Leal, Marina Ruy Barbosa, Drica Moraes, Marjorie Estiano, Caio Blat, Andréia Horta', null, 'Heartbreak forever changed the fate of the young and humble José Alfredo. Years later, he became the Lord Alfredo, a successful owner of a jewelry empire and a man obsessed with power. Temperamental and cunning, he tries to balance his turbulent marriage, an extramarital love affair, and the dispute between his children over succession in his business. One day, however, the unexpected appearance of a possible daughter, of whom he was unaware, causes upheaval in his life and takes his familial conflicts to a whole new level.', 'Heartbreak forever changed the fate of the young and humble José Alfredo. Years later, he became the Lord Alfredo, a successful owner of a jewelry empire and a man obsessed with power. Temperamental and cunning, he tries to balance his turbulent marriage, an extramarital love affair, and the dispute between his children over succession in his business. One day, however, the unexpected appearance of a possible daughter, of whom he was unaware, causes upheaval in his life and takes his familial conflicts to a whole new level.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdLoCTgidFSVzzKthQwzmNcAVS0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64500'),
  ('566679185320889207', 'Empire', 2015, 'Drama, Soap', 'Danny Strong, Lee Daniels', null, 'Terrence Howard, Taraji P. Henson, Bryshere Y. Gray, Trai Byers, Gabourey Sidibe, Ta''Rhonda Jones, Serayah, Nicole Ari Parker', 'TV-14', 'A powerful family drama about the head of a music empire whose three sons and ex-wife all battle for his throne.', 'A powerful family drama about the head of a music empire whose three sons and ex-wife all battle for his throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTrzYR6gWMhQ8yINW9JCLeoJHvf.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:61733'),
  ('597497369525806324', 'Empire Falls', 2005, 'Drama', null, 'Richard Russo', 'Ed Harris, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Helen Hunt, Paul Newman, Robin Wright, Aidan Quinn, Joanne Woodward, Dennis Farina', null, 'The humorous, poignant story of a declining New England town and its inhabitants, whose lives are deeply rooted in and influenced by the Knox River and its vacant mills, their class differences, and ghosts of the past.', 'The humorous, poignant story of a declining New England town and its inhabitants, whose lives are deeply rooted in and influenced by the Knox River and its vacant mills, their class differences, and ghosts of the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sW9cZcM3KnWOQKoRl0Lh58G0bT3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14968'),
  ('109520521779930326', 'Empire is Under Attack', 2000, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime, War & Politics', null, null, 'Igor Livanov, Valentin Bukin, Denis Zaytsev, Anatoliy Maksimov', null, 'In this TV-series the events of the beginning of the 20th century in Russia are highlighted. Revolutioners, terrorists, spies - and investigator Putilovskii and his team fight them as best they can.', 'In this TV-series the events of the beginning of the 20th century in Russia are highlighted. Revolutioners, terrorists, spies - and investigator Putilovskii and his team fight them as best they can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atXqoqQPvQ7TerAoYX4stD1CW5l.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76222'),
  ('444913717183916377', 'Empire of the Tsars: Romanov Russia with Lucy Worsley', 2016, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Lucy Worsley', 'TV-PG', 'Lucy Worsley travels to Russia to tell the extraordinary story of the dynasty that ruled the country for more than three centuries - the Romanovs.', 'Lucy Worsley travels to Russia to tell the extraordinary story of the dynasty that ruled the country for more than three centuries - the Romanovs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3sbQsBIxgYb1xipquKCzmIir9h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73212'),
  ('581701672814195434', 'Empire with David Olusoga', 2025, 'Documentary', 'David Olusoga', null, 'David Olusoga', null, 'How did a small island once rule over a quarter of the world''s population? This shared history still shapes us today - and billions of people are part of its story.', 'How did a small island once rule over a quarter of the world''s population? This shared history still shapes us today - and billions of people are part of its story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LKKR14qoJ3ylaNGBYStML1yfyD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:305099'),
  ('101603223645304583', 'Empress Ki', 2013, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Han Hee', 'Jang Young-cheol, Jung Gyeong-sun', 'Ha Ji-won, Ju Jin-mo, Ji Chang-wook, Jin Yi-han, Baek Jin-hee, Jeon Kuk-hwan, Im Joo-eun, Lee Won-jong', 'TV-14', 'A woman born in Korea navigates her way through love, war, politics and national loyalties to become a powerful empress in China''s Yuan dynasty.', 'A woman born in Korea navigates her way through love, war, politics and national loyalties to become a powerful empress in China''s Yuan dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cH9PMmBkhtVMlCdi8fgvMqekNKi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61148'),
  ('1047896620111305642', 'Empresses in the Palace', 2011, 'Drama', null, 'Liu Lianzi, Xiaoping Wang', 'Sun Li, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Jiang Xin, Lan Xi, Tao Xinran, Chen Jianbin, Li Dongxue, Zhang Xiaolong', 'TV-14', 'Zhen Huan, a 17-year-old innocent introduced into the imperial court as the latest concubine of Emperor Yong Zheng. Her dreams of a new life of love and prosperity are swiftly dashed as she enters a dog-eat-dog world of treachery and corruption.', 'Zhen Huan, a 17-year-old innocent introduced into the imperial court as the latest concubine of Emperor Yong Zheng. Her dreams of a new life of love and prosperity are swiftly dashed as she enters a dog-eat-dog world of treachery and corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLJ1d3OHxYOkiBCNNPJA1lzehjI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50878'),
  ('60513995113226675', 'Empresses in the Palace', 2015, 'Drama', null, 'Xiaoping Wang, Liu Lianzi', 'Sun Li, Lan Xi, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Tao Xinran, Li Dongxue, Jiang Xin, Zhang Xiaolong, Tang Yixin', null, 'An epic tale of love, betrayal and scandal set in 1722 during the Qing Dynasty and told from inside the Imperial Harem - the story of one emperor and his countless women. In a world filled with treachery and corruption, who will truly win the Emperor''s heart and reign supreme?', 'An epic tale of love, betrayal and scandal set in 1722 during the Qing Dynasty and told from inside the Imperial Harem - the story of one emperor and his countless women. In a world filled with treachery and corruption, who will truly win the Emperor''s heart and reign supreme?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtofvlC0szN7r2xq8Dkb2csINn5.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203125'),
  ('1050066052608440744', 'Empty Nest', 1988, 'Family, Comedy', 'Susan Harris', null, 'Richard Mulligan, Dinah Manoff, David Leisure, Park Overall, Marsha Warfield, Estelle Getty', null, 'Widowed pediatrician Harry Weston is a miracle worker when it comes to dealing with his young patients, but he''s more challenged by the other people surrounding him: daughters Barbara and Carol; his wisecracking office assistant, nurse LaVerne Todd; and obnoxious neighborhood mooch Charley Dietz. Thank goodness he always finds a friendly shoulder (and a warm, wet tongue) in Dreyfuss, his enormous dog.', 'Widowed pediatrician Harry Weston is a miracle worker when it comes to dealing with his young patients, but he''s more challenged by the other people surrounding him: daughters Barbara and Carol; his wisecracking office assistant, nurse LaVerne Todd; and obnoxious neighborhood mooch Charley Dietz. Thank goodness he always finds a friendly shoulder (and a warm, wet tongue) in Dreyfuss, his enormous dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99I4RHS7Vh9dPrYhKyYp2i1lOcn.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:2823'),
