  ('235521946019959017', 'Enigma', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Patha Thongpan', 'Patha Thongpan', 'Metawin Opas-iamkajorn, Chanikarn Tangkabodee, Kanyarat Ruangrung, Sureeyares Yakares, Preeyaphat Lawsuwansiri', 'TV-14', 'There is something wrong with Fa''s high school, strange events have been happening around her. In which way is it related to the new teacher, Ajin?', 'There is something wrong with Fa''s high school, strange events have been happening around her. In which way is it related to the new teacher, Ajin?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zRc14Pp1z051bThJgJDzuiD1ME.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229778'),
