  ('1004869224323697801', 'Érase Una Vez', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', null, null, 'Enrique Rocha, Valentina Acosta', 'NR', 'The story is shown from a dark and sophisticated point of view. The first season consists of 12 episodes, each with a beginning of plot and closing. In the first season they tell classic stories such as Little Red Riding Hood, Snow White, The Boy Who Cried Wolf, The Prince and the Pauper, Puss in Boots, Goldilocks and the Three Bears, Beauty and the Beast, The Three Little Pigs, Sleeping Beauty,Pinnochio, and Hansel & Gretel each of these stories will be adapted to the present.', 'The story is shown from a dark and sophisticated point of view. The first season consists of 12 episodes, each with a beginning of plot and closing. In the first season they tell classic stories such as Little Red Riding Hood, Snow White, The Boy Who Cried Wolf, The Prince and the Pauper, Puss in Boots, Goldilocks and the Three Bears, Beauty and the Beast, The Three Little Pigs, Sleeping Beauty,Pinnochio, and Hansel & Gretel each of these stories will be adapted to the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umXTyzh2ASpfo9OaNBoIVCJzbAV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83701'),
  ('263101366723468320', 'Erased', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Kei Sambe', null, 'Yuki Furukawa, Tomoka Kurotani, Mio Yuki, Shigeyuki Totsugi, Masato Yano, Hidekazu Mashima, Noriko Eguchi, Jin Shirasu', 'TV-14', 'After finding his mom killed, Satoru''s time-traveling ability takes him back 18 years for a chance to prevent her death and those of three classmates.', 'After finding his mom killed, Satoru''s time-traveling ability takes him back 18 years for a chance to prevent her death and those of three classmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PKJjw3dxZlBjJekuEvjl1hUUPV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74939'),
  ('932753734526796062', 'ERASED', 2016, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Tao Tsuchiya, Minami Takayama', 'TV-14', 'Satoru Fujinuma is a struggling manga artist who has the ability to turn back time and prevent deaths. When his mother is killed he turns back time to solve the mystery, but ends up back in elementary school, just before the disappearance of his classmate Kayo.', 'Satoru Fujinuma is a struggling manga artist who has the ability to turn back time and prevent deaths. When his mother is killed he turns back time to solve the mystery, but ends up back in elementary school, just before the disappearance of his classmate Kayo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EljUwZJhpuYfVuSfqY8Pt1xxpH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65249'),
  ('846564937068537447', 'Eren the Southpaw', 2026, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Yumi Uchiyama, Yui Ishikawa, Akira Sekine, Kazuyuki Okitsu, Yurina Amami, Koji Yusa, Tarusuke Shingaki', null, 'As high school reaches its midpoint, Koichi Asakura—who dreams of studying design at art school—has his plans shaken by explosive graffiti on a museum wall. The artist is Eren Yamagishi, a left-handed girl who buried her talent after a past incident. Drawn together by art, Koichi pursues design as Eren returns to painting, but fear, ambition, and old scars threaten their paths.', 'As high school reaches its midpoint, Koichi Asakura—who dreams of studying design at art school—has his plans shaken by explosive graffiti on a museum wall. The artist is Eren Yamagishi, a left-handed girl who buried her talent after a past incident. Drawn together by art, Koichi pursues design as Eren returns to painting, but fear, ambition, and old scars threaten their paths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkhxnKGDcNKikr1xDP4mi1wpfEr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:305567'),
