  ('243436846917456447', 'Esref''s Dream', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ethem Özışık', 'Ethem Özışık', 'Çağatay Ulusoy, Demet Özdemir, Büşra Develi, Necip Memili, Ahmet Rıfat Şungar, Tolga Tekin, Görkem Sevindik, Ceren Benderlioğlu', null, 'As a child, Eşref fell in love from afar with a girl he called “Rüya” and spent years searching for her, only to become a powerful mafia figure along the way. Meanwhile, Nisan, an idealistic musician, finds herself in grave danger after performing at a wedding held at Eşref’s hotel. Eşref falls for Nisan, unaware that she is both the long-lost Rüya he has been chasing for years and a police informant. Trapped in a whirlwind of love, betrayal, and power struggles, Eşref is forced into a brutal reckoning—both with his criminal empire and his own emotions.', 'As a child, Eşref fell in love from afar with a girl he called “Rüya” and spent years searching for her, only to become a powerful mafia figure along the way. Meanwhile, Nisan, an idealistic musician, finds herself in grave danger after performing at a wedding held at Eşref’s hotel. Eşref falls for Nisan, unaware that she is both the long-lost Rüya he has been chasing for years and a police informant. Trapped in a whirlwind of love, betrayal, and power struggles, Eşref is forced into a brutal reckoning—both with his criminal empire and his own emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeFYLgiRFaG3bKx1qLyC7YOdHJz.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:283123'),
  ('468607407007391642', 'Estab-Life: Great Escape', 2022, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Goro Taniguchi', null, 'Tomomi Mineuchi, Rie Takahashi, Maria Naganawa, Show Hayami, Shin-ichiro Miki, Kappei Yamaguchi, Wataru Takagi, Takeshi Kusao', null, 'The distant future. After reaching its peak, Earth''s population fell into decline. AI was developed to help preserve the species and manage the ecosystem; a grand experiment in human diversity. Through genetic engineering, a diverse array of peoples, including beastfolk, magical beings, and more, was created to live in a diverse city separated into walled "clusters". Each cluster developed a unique culture, befitting of the people that lived there. Their lives, and the system, is continually maintained by the AI to ensure survival.', 'The distant future. After reaching its peak, Earth''s population fell into decline. AI was developed to help preserve the species and manage the ecosystem; a grand experiment in human diversity. Through genetic engineering, a diverse array of peoples, including beastfolk, magical beings, and more, was created to live in a diverse city separated into walled "clusters". Each cluster developed a unique culture, befitting of the people that lived there. Their lives, and the system, is continually maintained by the AI to ensure survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2gYUsPnzcY8caQGWoTUrpQYypu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:134580'),
  ('1067948040847523157', 'Estonia', 2023, 'Drama', 'Miikko Oikkonen', 'Andris Feldmanis, Livia Ulman, Miikko Oikkonen', 'Jussi Nikkilä, Claes Hartelius', null, 'Estonia tells the story of the tragic accident of the car-ferry MS Estonia, which deeply shocked the world in the autumn of 1994. Through the moving personal stories of victims, survivors, loved ones and investigators, the eight-part series explores how it is possible that 852 people lost their lives and no one is held accountable.', 'Estonia tells the story of the tragic accident of the car-ferry MS Estonia, which deeply shocked the world in the autumn of 1994. Through the moving personal stories of victims, survivors, loved ones and investigators, the eight-part series explores how it is possible that 852 people lost their lives and no one is held accountable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gC9AfdIkKkCBRMaHwDF7bvHkv6V.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218711'),
  ('526477633892502502', 'Estonia - fyndet som ändrar allt', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Henrik Evertsson', null, 'Lars Borgnäs', null, 'In 1994, M/S Estonia sinks during its route from Tallinn to Stockholm. 852 people sink with the ship. For 26 years, survivors and relatives to the victims have asked one question: what truly happened to Estonia?', 'In 1994, M/S Estonia sinks during its route from Tallinn to Stockholm. 852 people sink with the ship. For 26 years, survivors and relatives to the victims have asked one question: what truly happened to Estonia?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvEldJ40ndNR87sVr3nswOWHUad.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:110170'),
  ('82891518766095316', 'Estoy vivo', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Crime', 'Daniel Écija', null, 'Javier Gutiérrez, Alejo Sauras, Jesús Castejón, Fele Martínez, Alfonso Bassave, Anna Castillo, Cristina Plazas, Lucía Caraballo', 'TV-PG', 'A policeman dies chasing a serial killer and is reincarnated in another policeman five years later, granted immortality in exchange of never revealing his true identity.', 'A policeman dies chasing a serial killer and is reincarnated in another policeman five years later, granted immortality in exchange of never revealing his true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHUJlJxBYQIgqS8rMeqgLPFR4sy.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:73778'),
  ('624108486301578164', 'Eta Amaderi Golpo', 2025, 'Family, Reality', 'Mohammad Mostafa Kamal Raz', null, 'Khairul Basar, Deepa Khandakar, Irfan Sajjad, Keya Payel', null, 'Eta Amaderi Golpo” (This Is Our Story) is a Bangladeshi drama series that portrays the real-life struggles, emotions, and relationships of ordinary people. The story mainly focuses on friendship, love, family bonds, and social challenges faced by young adults in modern society. The series shows how different characters deal with dreams, failures, misunderstandings, and personal growth. Through their journeys, it highlights themes such as honesty, sacrifice, trust, and the importance of standing by loved ones during difficult times. Each episode reflects relatable situations from everyday life, making the audience emotionally connected to the characters.', 'Eta Amaderi Golpo” (This Is Our Story) is a Bangladeshi drama series that portrays the real-life struggles, emotions, and relationships of ordinary people. The story mainly focuses on friendship, love, family bonds, and social challenges faced by young adults in modern society. The series shows how different characters deal with dreams, failures, misunderstandings, and personal growth. Through their journeys, it highlights themes such as honesty, sacrifice, trust, and the importance of standing by loved ones during difficult times. Each episode reflects relatable situations from everyday life, making the audience emotionally connected to the characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mfm7sw4nzUodmDSFH0hI0QOFPt.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:312658'),
  ('971189981225959255', 'Eternal Boys', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuko Noichi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Daisuke Namikawa, Daisuke Hirakawa, Katsuyuki Konishi, Jun Fukuyama, Nozomu Sasaki, Haruka Chisuga', 'TV-14', '“The Mature Idol Project” - The latest project proposed by Manpuku Entertainment Productions, in a bid to revive the company. Experienced in the successes and failures of the business world, 6 middle-aged men now face the many hurdles of age and physical ability, whilst pursuing their goal to become idols. In an effort to prove that old dogs can learn new tricks, and that you can still learn to shine no matter your age, these middle-aged men, at the end of their ropes, are taking a stand!', '“The Mature Idol Project” - The latest project proposed by Manpuku Entertainment Productions, in a bid to revive the company. Experienced in the successes and failures of the business world, 6 middle-aged men now face the many hurdles of age and physical ability, whilst pursuing their goal to become idols. In an effort to prove that old dogs can learn new tricks, and that you can still learn to shine no matter your age, these middle-aged men, at the end of their ropes, are taking a stand!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFYOFJEacvGTrAPH34QqxOHHYi8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195288'),
  ('881564417070914385', 'Eternal Brotherhood', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, War & Politics, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Tian Liangliang', 'Yang Xuwen, Liu Yuning, Zhang Ming''en, Li Mozhi, Joyin Cai, Ma Shaohua, Huang Haoyue, Li Guo', null, 'In the war-ravaged land of Zichuan, a heroic general and his sworn brothers battle internal rebellion and an invading enemy. As they fight to protect their homeland and loved ones, they forge a powerful tale of loyalty, sacrifice, and the pursuit of peace.', 'In the war-ravaged land of Zichuan, a heroic general and his sworn brothers battle internal rebellion and an invading enemy. As they fight to protect their homeland and loved ones, they forge a powerful tale of loyalty, sacrifice, and the pursuit of peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkeNsHn8DBjkfuL5EzMNPwP0qbW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:247590'),
  ('250988474530745218', 'Eternal Butler', 2024, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Joe Tsai', 'Kevin Chang, Eden Chen, Lawrence Lo, Sing Hom', null, 'Ever 4, an AI butler, and Luo Bu Shi, a spoiled heir, form an unlikely bond that challenges what it means to connect.', 'Ever 4, an AI butler, and Luo Bu Shi, a spoiled heir, form an unlikely bond that challenges what it means to connect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWbnk48MqSrvIFCwBqgAh2xH1aW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:258963'),
  ('132329497973154714', 'Eternal Call', 1976, 'Drama', 'Vladimir Krasnopolskiy, Valeriy Uskov', 'Anatoliy Ivanov', 'Yuri Smirnov, Ivan Lapikov, Andrey Martynov, Nikolay Ivanov, Tamara Syomina, Efim Kopelyan, Valeri Khlevinsky, Pyotr Velyaminov', null, 'A saga about the life of the Siberian Savelyev family during the period 1902 through the 1960s as they survive through three wars, a revolution, and Soviet government approval.', 'A saga about the life of the Siberian Savelyev family during the period 1902 through the 1960s as they survive through three wars, a revolution, and Soviet government approval.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWFbh63Mrw5OYHsPjeR4ijRH6HB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:54454'),
  ('38746911230256031', 'Eternal Faith', null, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mo Xiang Tong Xiu', null, 'Zhai Xiaowen, Zhang Linghe, Xiao Kaizhong, Cai Yao, Li Fancheng, Zheng Yibin, Chang Huasen, Tian Xuning', null, 'Xie Lian, the crown prince of Xian Le Kingdom, successfully ascends to Heaven during his third trial in spite of successive demotions. However, he accidentally breaks the Gold Palace of heavenly officials. With no human worshiping him, Xie Lian has to descend to the secular world to exorcise ghosts, which may help him sustain his divinity.', 'Xie Lian, the crown prince of Xian Le Kingdom, successfully ascends to Heaven during his third trial in spite of successive demotions. However, he accidentally breaks the Gold Palace of heavenly officials. With no human worshiping him, Xie Lian has to descend to the secular world to exorcise ghosts, which may help him sustain his divinity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9TOQQt4ZNEdKvgkBCOQ8bcC36C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:130019'),
  ('1004735127355640627', 'Eternal Love', 2017, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Hong Qiu', 'Yang Mi, Mark Chao You-Ting, Ken Chang Tzu-Yao, Dilraba Dilmurat, Gao Weiguang, Lian Yiming, Maggie Huang, Vin Zhang', null, 'Three hundred years ago, Bai Qian stood on the Zhu Xian Terrace, turned around and jumped off without regret. Ye Hua stood by the bronze mirror to witness with his own eyes her death. Three hundred years later, in the East Sea Dragon Palace, the two meet unexpectedly. Another lifetime another world, after suffering betrayal Bai Qian no longer feels anything, yet she can''t seem to comprehend Ye Hua''s actions. Three lives three worlds, her and him, are they fated to love again?', 'Three hundred years ago, Bai Qian stood on the Zhu Xian Terrace, turned around and jumped off without regret. Ye Hua stood by the bronze mirror to witness with his own eyes her death. Three hundred years later, in the East Sea Dragon Palace, the two meet unexpectedly. Another lifetime another world, after suffering betrayal Bai Qian no longer feels anything, yet she can''t seem to comprehend Ye Hua''s actions. Three lives three worlds, her and him, are they fated to love again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paeDktO7Bx2lmv9mEDiHtneoYrF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69316'),
  ('207107508188535277', 'Eternal Love of Dream', 2020, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Liang Zhenhua', 'Dilraba Dilmurat, Gao Weiguang, Liu Ruilin, Liu Yuefei, Wang Xiao, Li Dongheng, Yuan Yuxuan, Huang Junjie', null, 'Having been saved by Emperor Dong Hua from a vicious monster attack, Princess of Qingqiu, Bai Fengjiu becomes immensely indebted to him. To repay him, Fengjiu follows Donghua around on his adventures to eliminate evil but unwittingly realizes that her feelings of gratitude towards him has turned to romantic. However, after a hundred thousand years of fighting evil, Donghua has long forgotten the meaning of “love". To protect Fengjiu, Dong Hua sends her to the human world but accidentally causes the death of Fengjiu’s friend. Fengjiu enters the dream of Ah Lan Ruo to search for the fruit that will be able to resurrect her friend. However, Fengjiu ends up getting trapped in the dream. Dong Hua comes to rescue, and realizes he has fallen in love with Fengjiu…', 'Having been saved by Emperor Dong Hua from a vicious monster attack, Princess of Qingqiu, Bai Fengjiu becomes immensely indebted to him. To repay him, Fengjiu follows Donghua around on his adventures to eliminate evil but unwittingly realizes that her feelings of gratitude towards him has turned to romantic. However, after a hundred thousand years of fighting evil, Donghua has long forgotten the meaning of “love". To protect Fengjiu, Dong Hua sends her to the human world but accidentally causes the death of Fengjiu’s friend. Fengjiu enters the dream of Ah Lan Ruo to search for the fruit that will be able to resurrect her friend. However, Fengjiu ends up getting trapped in the dream. Dong Hua comes to rescue, and realizes he has fallen in love with Fengjiu…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kS1Q6FFKTs7rxcAYjskJEnfK7SC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81141'),
  ('374986144892564940', 'Eternal Yesterday', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Eda Yuuri', null, 'Rio Komiya, Inoue Sora, Karen Otomo, Taisuke Niihara, Yui Narumi, Yuichi Nakamura, Daichi Asai, Rie Kitahara', null, 'After an accident, no one can see the once-popular Koichi — except for loner Mitsuru, whose fondness for his classmate blooms into a haunting romance.', 'After an accident, no one can see the once-popular Koichi — except for loner Mitsuru, whose fondness for his classmate blooms into a haunting romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKAV4lHxhmYZUsjkP6enXnBz4op.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209881'),
  ('929040999030763495', 'Eternally Confused and Eager for Love', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Rahul Nair', 'Rahul Nair', 'Vihaan Samat, Jim Sarbh, Rahul Bose, Suchitra Pillai, Dalai, Ankur Rathee', 'TV-MA', 'Often (mis)guided by a cheeky imaginary wizard, an awkward and lonely 20-something struggles to get out of his own way in his quest for a girlfriend.', 'Often (mis)guided by a cheeky imaginary wizard, an awkward and lonely 20-something struggles to get out of his own way in his quest for a girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ae73rDfVc8gKLXybi68roaZK9Hz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157932'),
