  ('15941059972282151', 'Euphoria', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sam Levinson', null, 'Zendaya, Hunter Schafer, Sydney Sweeney, Jacob Elordi, Alexa Demie, Maude Apatow, Eric Dane, Martha Kelly', 'TV-MA', 'A group of high school students navigate love and friendships in a world of drugs, sex, trauma, and social media.', 'A group of high school students navigate love and friendships in a world of drugs, sex, trauma, and social media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvVt4xPUDR6SglHvUa8ECg8uREV.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:85552'),
  ('666042536705095570', 'Euphoria (US)', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Zendaya, Hunter Schafer, Sydney Sweeney', 'TV-MA', 'A group of teenagers experience the ups and downs of love and friendship in a world of social networks, sex, drugs, and violence.', 'A group of teenagers experience the ups and downs of love and friendship in a world of social networks, sex, drugs, and violence.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FzvVt4xPUDR6SglHvUa8ECg8uREV.jpg', 3, 'plex:tv:euphoria-us'),
  ('1150623476631178412', 'Eureeka''s Castle', 1989, 'Kids, Comedy', 'R.L. Stine, Judy Katschke', 'R.L. Stine, Michael Holman', 'Noel MacNeal, Pam Arciero, Lynn Hippen, James J. Kroupa, Brian Muehl, Cheryl Blaylock', null, 'Eureeka''s Castle is an American children''s television series that aired on Nickelodeon from September 4, 1989 to June 30, 1995.', 'Eureeka''s Castle is an American children''s television series that aired on Nickelodeon from September 4, 1989 to June 30, 1995.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yg9FX5LfZmbib88NkU5sM0y4wnD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:403'),
  ('305249101198624570', 'Eureka', 2006, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Jaime Paglia, Andrew Cosby', null, 'Colin Ferguson, Salli Richardson-Whitfield, Joe Morton, Erica Cerra, Neil Grayston, Niall Matter', 'TV-14', 'The sleepy Pacific Northwest town of Eureka is hiding a mysterious secret. The government has been relocating the world''s geniuses and their families to this rustic town for years where innovation and chaos have lived hand in hand. U.S. Marshal Jack Carter stumbles upon this odd town after wrecking his car and becoming stranded there. When the denizens of the town unleash an unknown scientific creation, Carter jumps in to try to restore order and consequently learns of one of the country''s best kept secrets.', 'The sleepy Pacific Northwest town of Eureka is hiding a mysterious secret. The government has been relocating the world''s geniuses and their families to this rustic town for years where innovation and chaos have lived hand in hand. U.S. Marshal Jack Carter stumbles upon this odd town after wrecking his car and becoming stranded there. When the denizens of the town unleash an unknown scientific creation, Carter jumps in to try to restore order and consequently learns of one of the country''s best kept secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2l5hUk63hPqYTucnFy2HmElFV0.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:4620'),
  ('1113634881551370599', 'Eureka Seven', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Drama', 'Dai Sato, Kazuhiko Shimamoto', null, 'Yutaro Honjo, Kanako Miyamoto, Ayaka Ohashi, Chiaki Omigawa, Kaori Nazuka', 'TV-14', 'Renton Thurston desires to leave his home behind and join the mercenary group known as Gekkostate, hoping to find some adventure. When a robot crashes through Renton''s garage the meeting sparks the beginning of Renton''s involvement with Gekkostate as he takes off alongside the young girl Eureka as the co-pilot of the Nirvash.', 'Renton Thurston desires to leave his home behind and join the mercenary group known as Gekkostate, hoping to find some adventure. When a robot crashes through Renton''s garage the meeting sparks the beginning of Renton''s involvement with Gekkostate as he takes off alongside the young girl Eureka as the co-pilot of the Nirvash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Hq9bEoRasVUmIOmtY8HJHqB6FH.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:889'),
  ('873879580431264298', 'Eureka!', 2022, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Ruth Righi, Renée Elise Goldsberry, Lil Rel Howery, Javier Muñoz, Kai Zen, Devin Trey Campbell, Fred Tatasciore', 'TV-Y', 'The story of a young girl inventor who is way ahead of her time. Utilizing creative out-of-the-box thinking, she designs inventions and contraptions in the hopes of making the world a better place and moving her prehistoric community into a more modern era. With the help of her supportive parents, teacher, best friends — Pepper and Barry — and beloved pet mammoth Murphy, Eureka is learning to embrace that she is not ordinary — she''s extraordinary.', 'The story of a young girl inventor who is way ahead of her time. Utilizing creative out-of-the-box thinking, she designs inventions and contraptions in the hopes of making the world a better place and moving her prehistoric community into a more modern era. With the help of her supportive parents, teacher, best friends — Pepper and Barry — and beloved pet mammoth Murphy, Eureka is learning to embrace that she is not ordinary — she''s extraordinary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZdhIzWnwJ8QsBRxBigj6J57SPf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156608'),
  ('463906729767783449', 'Europe from Above', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Using the very latest in drone and aerial photographic technology, tour across countries and their seasons, getting a unique view from above.', 'Using the very latest in drone and aerial photographic technology, tour across countries and their seasons, getting a unique view from above.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IvGas2kdTh70Xi6XNy1MYTedqz.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:95755'),
  ('1117506194299564713', 'Europe Outside Your Tent', 2022, 'Reality', 'Kang Gung', null, 'Ra Mi-ran, Kwak Sun-young, Lee Se-young, Lee Ju-bin', null, 'Yoo Hae-jin for ''Three Meals a Day: Fishing Village'' demonstrates his hidden aspects as a camping master introducing to the audience a new paradigm of traveling Europe. Along with Jin Seon-kyu, Park Ji-hwan, and Yoon Kyun-sang, the four brothers travel Europe as the wheels roll.', 'Yoo Hae-jin for ''Three Meals a Day: Fishing Village'' demonstrates his hidden aspects as a camping master introducing to the audience a new paradigm of traveling Europe. Along with Jin Seon-kyu, Park Ji-hwan, and Yoon Kyun-sang, the four brothers travel Europe as the wheels roll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9OsKbLzLZp0GkKWX4PkzRDj27w.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:206247'),
  ('349788094356528929', 'Eurotrash', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Peter Stuart', null, 'Antoine de Caunes, Adriana Karembeu, Emily Booth, Kate Robbins', null, 'The likes of Antoine de Caunes, Jean Paul Gaultier, Davina McCall, and Lolo Ferrari are your guides to the weird and wonderful in Europe and beyond. How else would you learn about pubic hairdressers, the Penis Olympics, or the latest Japanese sex toys?', 'The likes of Antoine de Caunes, Jean Paul Gaultier, Davina McCall, and Lolo Ferrari are your guides to the weird and wonderful in Europe and beyond. How else would you learn about pubic hairdressers, the Penis Olympics, or the latest Japanese sex toys?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMiz6Dy91DZyDzsKvO6Sxwz3NkT.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:5439'),
  ('186532478431614893', 'Eurovision Song Contest', 1956, 'Reality, Talk', null, null, 'Victoria Swarovski, Michael Ostrowski', null, 'The Eurovision Song Contest is an international song competition, organised annually by the European Broadcasting Union (EBU) and featuring participants representing primarily European countries. Each participating country submits an original song to be performed on live television and radio, transmitted to national broadcasters via the EBU''s Eurovision and Euroradio networks, with competing countries then casting votes for the other countries'' songs to determine the winner.', 'The Eurovision Song Contest is an international song competition, organised annually by the European Broadcasting Union (EBU) and featuring participants representing primarily European countries. Each participating country submits an original song to be performed on live television and radio, transmitted to national broadcasters via the EBU''s Eurovision and Euroradio networks, with competing countries then casting votes for the other countries'' songs to determine the winner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kG2UO5pT91NckAe3tS6WrgxOB3P.jpg', 70, 'tmdb:tv:28032'),
  ('526448975218717844', 'Eva Lasting', 2023, 'Drama', 'Dago García', null, 'Emmanuel Restrepo, Francisca Estevez, Sara Pinzón, Sergio Palau, Julián Cerati, Brandon Figueredo, Mateo García, Santiago Alarcón', 'TV-MA', 'A mysterious teen girl arrives at an all-boys school in 1970s Colombia, breaking stereotypes, rules... and a few hearts.', 'A mysterious teen girl arrives at an all-boys school in 1970s Colombia, breaking stereotypes, rules... and a few hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nd0zhdvXyIdAqlc1ulYAMeWiEvO.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:219063'),
  ('501721569837142469', 'Eva Longoria: Searching for France', 2026, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, 'Eva Longoria', null, 'Eva Longoria explores French cuisine and culture.', 'Eva Longoria explores French cuisine and culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWPyWuHKQCE7Hn6rL8gVQMKlotl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:291518'),
  ('612929611649089869', 'Eva Luna', 2010, 'Drama', null, null, 'Blanca Soto, Vanessa Villela, Anna Silvetti, Guy Ecker, Susana Dosamantes, Jorge Lavat, Julián Gil, Liz Coleandro', 'TV-PG', 'A young woman’s quest for happiness is marred by the secrets and deceptions perpetuated by an evil family. Eva González (Blanca Soto) came to Los Angeles with her father and sister in search of a better life. She goes to work as the personal attendant to Julio Arismendi, the ailing founder of Publicidad Arismendi, unknowingly becoming a pawn to kill him by his wife, Marcela (Susana Dosamantes). When the beautiful Eva catches the eye of Julio’s son, Leonardo Arismendi (Julian Gil), and his best friend, Daniel Villanueva (Guy Ecker), she becomes the target of Victoria (Vanessa Villela), who is Leonardo’s sister and Daniel’s girlfriend. But Daniel leaves Victoria for Eva, and on the day of Eva and Daniel’s wedding, Eva’s father is killed in a hit-and-run accident. Can her future husband be responsible? “Eva Luna” is a 2010 telenovela produced by Venevisión International in collaboration with Univision Studios. It is a remake of the 1997 Telemundo telenovela “Aquamarina.”', 'A young woman’s quest for happiness is marred by the secrets and deceptions perpetuated by an evil family. Eva González (Blanca Soto) came to Los Angeles with her father and sister in search of a better life. She goes to work as the personal attendant to Julio Arismendi, the ailing founder of Publicidad Arismendi, unknowingly becoming a pawn to kill him by his wife, Marcela (Susana Dosamantes). When the beautiful Eva catches the eye of Julio’s son, Leonardo Arismendi (Julian Gil), and his best friend, Daniel Villanueva (Guy Ecker), she becomes the target of Victoria (Vanessa Villela), who is Leonardo’s sister and Daniel’s girlfriend. But Daniel leaves Victoria for Eva, and on the day of Eva and Daniel’s wedding, Eva’s father is killed in a hit-and-run accident. Can her future husband be responsible? “Eva Luna” is a 2010 telenovela produced by Venevisión International in collaboration with Univision Studios. It is a remake of the 1997 Telemundo telenovela “Aquamarina.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQELQXB1l5BqkPxFco1z1J6zzGz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37743'),
  ('324254797944979248', 'Eve', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Meg DeLoatch', null, 'Eve, Jason George, Ali Landry, Natalie Desselle-Reid, Brian Hooks, Sean Maguire', null, 'Eve is an American sitcom starring Eve, Jason Winston George, Ali Landry, Natalie Desselle-Reid, Brian Hooks and Sean Maguire. It aired on the UPN network from September 15, 2003 to May 11, 2006, with 66 episodes produced spanning 3 seasons. The series follows Shelly, a beautiful and intelligent woman of the new generation trying to navigate the exhilarating world of 21st century love, romance and career. The series was nominated in 2004 for Teen Choice Award for Choice Breakout TV Show and had seven nominations in major awards.', 'Eve is an American sitcom starring Eve, Jason Winston George, Ali Landry, Natalie Desselle-Reid, Brian Hooks and Sean Maguire. It aired on the UPN network from September 15, 2003 to May 11, 2006, with 66 episodes produced spanning 3 seasons. The series follows Shelly, a beautiful and intelligent woman of the new generation trying to navigate the exhilarating world of 21st century love, romance and career. The series was nominated in 2004 for Teen Choice Award for Choice Breakout TV Show and had seven nominations in major awards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgZgKdFU2pkY3XrtCvTk2MZLNgc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1994'),
  ('1097642156844481676', 'Eve', 2015, 'Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Poppy Lee Friar, Eubha Akilade, Elijah Ayite, Oliver Woollford, Ben Cartwright, Jane Asher', null, 'Drama combining sci-fi mystery adventure with fish-out-of-water comedy. Eve is the world''s first fully sentient ''artificial person''. She seems human, but under the surface she''s a robot capable of amazing feats - if she can navigate her way through the perils of teenage life first.', 'Drama combining sci-fi mystery adventure with fish-out-of-water comedy. Eve is the world''s first fully sentient ''artificial person''. She seems human, but under the surface she''s a robot capable of amazing feats - if she can navigate her way through the perils of teenage life first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76CfgYtNgTHMRFf9p0RGGt1x0JX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64675'),
  ('1002446898868533590', 'Eve', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Yoon Young-mi', 'Seo Yea-ji, Park Byung-eun, Yu Seon, Lee Sang-yeob, Lee Il-hwa, Lee Ha-yul, Son So-mang, Kim Yae-eun', null, 'The Republic of Korea is overturned by 2 trillion-won divorce scandal of a chaebol caused by one ordinary woman. It is about getting into the truth of the scandal and the top 1% rich couple who made it. Surprisingly, Lee Ra-el, a nobody who''s not rich nor famous has caused the divorce. But Ra-el is a charming and intelligent woman who''s mastered art, psychology, and even economics. if she wants to, she can get any kind of man with her looks and brain.', 'The Republic of Korea is overturned by 2 trillion-won divorce scandal of a chaebol caused by one ordinary woman. It is about getting into the truth of the scandal and the top 1% rich couple who made it. Surprisingly, Lee Ra-el, a nobody who''s not rich nor famous has caused the divorce. But Ra-el is a charming and intelligent woman who''s mastered art, psychology, and even economics. if she wants to, she can get any kind of man with her looks and brain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xvIRR50lDzFRWLFCAwSzEkoEu3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138251'),
  ('1122021035504805892', 'Eve of Destruction', 2013, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Richard Beattie', 'Steven Weber, Christina Cox, Treat Williams, Aleks Paunovic, Colin Lawrence, Jess McLeod, Leah Gibson, Katharine Isabelle', 'TV-14', 'When two scientists attempt to discover unlimited energy, their experiment is sabotaged by eco-terrorists. The result is a dark energy black hole that could destroy the planet.', 'When two scientists attempt to discover unlimited energy, their experiment is sabotaged by eco-terrorists. The result is a dark energy black hole that could destroy the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4hk8x7cFHoyZQ2n9eE7THm3LKIG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73328'),
  ('989149661690284442', 'Even a Replica Can Fall in Love', 2026, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Sumire Morohoshi, Ryota Suzuki, Yuuki Takada, Kaori Nazuka, Jun Fukuyama, Rina Hidaka, Shugo Nakamura', null, 'Nao is a replica created to be Sunao Aikawa’s perfect double, stepping in whenever Sunao skips school. She studies, plays sports, and lives each day for the original—until one day, Nao falls in love. Suddenly, her quiet, borrowed life blooms with secret dates and shy promises. But the more she cherishes them, the more she must hide from Sunao, who’s starting to notice the changes in her replica.', 'Nao is a replica created to be Sunao Aikawa’s perfect double, stepping in whenever Sunao skips school. She studies, plays sports, and lives each day for the original—until one day, Nao falls in love. Suddenly, her quiet, borrowed life blooms with secret dates and shy promises. But the more she cherishes them, the more she must hide from Sunao, who’s starting to notice the changes in her replica.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mL33JeCwLMg1tHJHV8Be2cxADL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284568'),
  ('924316801603114442', 'Even Given the Worthless "Appraiser" Class, I''m Actually the Strongest', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Kikunosuke Toya, Hikaru Tono, Sayumi Suzushiro, Yu Serizawa, Minami Tsuda, Kana Ichinose, Aimi, Takeo Otsuka', null, 'In a world where heroes are born, not made, Ein’s god-given gift is the weakest: the power to appraise things. Treated cruelly by his peers, Ein spends his days in self-abasement—until he meets Yuri, the spirit of the World Tree. Yuri and her protector, Ursula, bless Ein with the Spirit Eye, unlocking new strength. As his abilities grow, Ein embarks on a journey to uncover his true purpose.', 'In a world where heroes are born, not made, Ein’s god-given gift is the weakest: the power to appraise things. Treated cruelly by his peers, Ein spends his days in self-abasement—until he meets Yuri, the spirit of the World Tree. Yuri and her protector, Ursula, bless Ein with the Spirit Eye, unlocking new strength. As his abilities grow, Ein embarks on a journey to uncover his true purpose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUAGrruGGj2PB6CYkw6tGLQD41G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:270474'),
  ('427792374753642168', 'Even Stevens', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Matt Dearborn', null, 'Christy Carlson Romano, Shia LaBeouf, Nick Spano, Tom Virtue, Donna Pescow', 'TV-G', 'The Stevens are a middle-class family living in Sacramento, CA. Husband and father Steve is a successful attorney. Wife and mother Eileen is a state Senator. Their oldest child Donnie ia a high-school sports legend. Ren, an 8th-grader, is just about the perfect daughter. She makes the best grades, she''s popular, she does volunteer work and other extracurricular tasks by the score. Her brother Louis, in the 7th grade, is her opposite. He likes to sleep late, he''s messy, his grades are not good, he''s frequently in detention and he seems to take nothing seriously. But he is serious about finding something of his own that he can do to put himself on a par with the rest of his overachieving family. Though he and Ren occasionally soften their attitudes toward each other, at any given moment the''re likely to be fighting like mongoose and cobra.', 'The Stevens are a middle-class family living in Sacramento, CA. Husband and father Steve is a successful attorney. Wife and mother Eileen is a state Senator. Their oldest child Donnie ia a high-school sports legend. Ren, an 8th-grader, is just about the perfect daughter. She makes the best grades, she''s popular, she does volunteer work and other extracurricular tasks by the score. Her brother Louis, in the 7th grade, is her opposite. He likes to sleep late, he''s messy, his grades are not good, he''s frequently in detention and he seems to take nothing seriously. But he is serious about finding something of his own that he can do to put himself on a par with the rest of his overachieving family. Though he and Ren occasionally soften their attitudes toward each other, at any given moment the''re likely to be fighting like mongoose and cobra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6wdftSHL6EF8sevUFJSVOnEBOHT.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3200'),
  ('1067569433078130390', 'Even Sun', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Noppanut Guntachai, Warut Chawalitrujiwong, Lee Long Shi, Nathas Tunjaroen, Papungkorn Sakunsong, Chitsanupong Soeksiri, Parinya Angsanan, Tanawat Hudchaleelaha', null, 'To save his father from bankruptcy, failing debt collector Sun tracks an elusive target to a private island, sparking a chaotic romance.', 'To save his father from bankruptcy, failing debt collector Sun tracks an elusive target to a private island, sparking a chaotic romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixWWtYCW2RMy08HQnePGKn4P4Rv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204489'),
  ('909296448602408082', 'Even tot Hier', 2019, 'News, Comedy', null, null, 'Jeroen Woe, Niels van der Laan', null, 'Niels van der Laan and Jeroen Woe literally make a performance of the week every week.', 'Niels van der Laan and Jeroen Woe literally make a performance of the week every week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BxWQELbDiFSF46EaUcMyHc92BQ.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:114910'),
  ('670727353957886558', 'Evening Drink Style', 2022, 'Drama', 'Yosuke Masaike', null, 'Chiaki Kuriyama, Kouhei Takeda, Nagiko Tsuji, Hajime Okayama, Hiroyuki Baba', null, '"Evening Drink Style" (Banshaku no Ryugi) is a popular Japanese drama about Miyuki Izawa''s ritual of crafting the perfect meal to pair with her end-of-day drink, often beer, emphasizing simple pleasures, moderation, home cooking, and work-life balance, a concept resonating with viewers seeking relaxing, relatable content with culinary inspiration. It''s known for its calming vibe, focus on delicious food pairings (like lamb with soy-ginger sauce), and promoting a healthy approach to enjoying alcohol.', '"Evening Drink Style" (Banshaku no Ryugi) is a popular Japanese drama about Miyuki Izawa''s ritual of crafting the perfect meal to pair with her end-of-day drink, often beer, emphasizing simple pleasures, moderation, home cooking, and work-life balance, a concept resonating with viewers seeking relaxing, relatable content with culinary inspiration. It''s known for its calming vibe, focus on delicious food pairings (like lamb with soy-ginger sauce), and promoting a healthy approach to enjoying alcohol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNS1j8CEeHMcbmCpBwnEcWjFOrY.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:202396'),
  ('1043439476948441585', 'Evening Shade', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Linda Bloodworth-Thomason', null, 'Burt Reynolds, Marilu Henner, Hal Holbrook, Charles Durning, Ann Wedgeworth, Michael Jeter, Jay R. Ferguson, Ossie Davis', null, 'Evening Shade is an American sitcom television series that aired on CBS from 1990 to 1994. The series stars Burt Reynolds as Wood Newton, an ex-professional football player for the Pittsburgh Steelers, who returns to rural Evening Shade, Arkansas to coach a high school football team with a long losing streak. Reynolds personally requested to use the Steelers as his former team because he is a fan. The general theme of the show is the appeal of small town life. Episodes ended with a closing narration by Ossie Davis summing up the events of the episode, always closing with "... in a place called Evening Shade." The show''s final episode saw the guest appearances of Willie Nelson and Buzz Aldrin as escaped convicts on the run from authorities, the final scene being a spectacular shoot-out reminiscent of the final scene of Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid. The opening segment included clips from around Arkansas, including the famous McClard''s Bar-be-que, which is situated on Albert Pike Blvd. and South Patterson St. in Hot Springs National Park.', 'Evening Shade is an American sitcom television series that aired on CBS from 1990 to 1994. The series stars Burt Reynolds as Wood Newton, an ex-professional football player for the Pittsburgh Steelers, who returns to rural Evening Shade, Arkansas to coach a high school football team with a long losing streak. Reynolds personally requested to use the Steelers as his former team because he is a fan. The general theme of the show is the appeal of small town life. Episodes ended with a closing narration by Ossie Davis summing up the events of the episode, always closing with "... in a place called Evening Shade." The show''s final episode saw the guest appearances of Willie Nelson and Buzz Aldrin as escaped convicts on the run from authorities, the final scene being a spectacular shoot-out reminiscent of the final scene of Butch Cassidy and the Sundance Kid. The opening segment included clips from around Arkansas, including the famous McClard''s Bar-be-que, which is situated on Albert Pike Blvd. and South Patterson St. in Hot Springs National Park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46x0EFL5Sw6G5d7ak8mHgTz8bmJ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:390'),
  ('596964964295934438', 'Evening Urgant', 2012, 'Talk, Comedy, News', 'Denis Rtischev, Pavel Avetikov', 'Denis Rtishev, Pavel Avetikov', 'Ivan Urgant', null, 'Evening show Ivan Urgant. Movies, sports, new gadgets, art. What is happening in the country and in the world? Actual characters discussing the day''s events and new music.', 'Evening show Ivan Urgant. Movies, sports, new gadgets, art. What is happening in the country and in the world? Actual characters discussing the day''s events and new music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnrYoHQJdO91MLv1nECp3W8P36q.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:46010'),
  ('219709123710494785', 'Ever After High', 2013, 'Kids, Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Family', null, null, 'Erin Fitzgerald, Jonquil Goode', 'TV-Y7', 'The students of all the fairytale characters attend Ever After High, where they are either Royals (students who want to follow in their parent''s footsteps) or Rebels (students who wish to write their own destiny).', 'The students of all the fairytale characters attend Ever After High, where they are either Royals (students who want to follow in their parent''s footsteps) or Rebels (students who wish to write their own destiny).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvpazrEM6TRMx2vqj5NUaztYcGv.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:61775'),
  ('117782169425600119', 'Ever Decreasing Circles', 1984, 'Comedy', 'John Esmonde, Bob Larbey', null, 'Penelope Wilton, Richard Briers, Peter Egan, Geraldine Newman, Stanley Lebor', null, 'Martin Bryce lives in a quiet suburban close with his wife Anne. He does his best to "organise" the leisure time of all of the other inhabitants of the close, running umpteen societies and doing "good works". He''s is quite happy with his lot until Paul Ryman moves in next door.', 'Martin Bryce lives in a quiet suburban close with his wife Anne. He does his best to "organise" the leisure time of all of the other inhabitants of the close, running umpteen societies and doing "good works". He''s is quite happy with his lot until Paul Ryman moves in next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3F5iUrHyMLy6mElwQ2ITlGmUpCy.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:73'),
  ('351673463214839684', 'Ever Night', 2018, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Mao Ni', null, 'Dylan Wang, Ireine Song, Sun Zujun, Cheng Taishen', null, 'As the lone survivor of his kingdom, Ning Que joins a martial arts academy and must fight to protect his beloved, who''s prophesied to bring about chaos.', 'As the lone survivor of his kingdom, Ning Que joins a martial arts academy and must fight to protect his beloved, who''s prophesied to bring about chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8kBDPvFvEOdCqCC2ZkdPpb7xKo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83612'),
  ('359276333301105053', 'Everest', 2008, 'Drama', null, null, 'Leslie Hope, William Shatner, Jason Priestley, Eric Johnson, Ted Atherton, John Pyper-Ferguson', 'NR', 'Based on the true story of the first Canadians to ever make it to the top of the world''s tallest and most historic peak. A proud moment for Canadians and an adventure that is filled with bitterness, broken relationships and the bodies of four dead men.', 'Based on the true story of the first Canadians to ever make it to the top of the world''s tallest and most historic peak. A proud moment for Canadians and an adventure that is filled with bitterness, broken relationships and the bodies of four dead men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Nvz7K0QscrOTXzKF2fmo2Y7iEK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58950'),
  ('1143054622711403810', 'Everlasting Classics', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Sa Beining, Zhen Kang, Changyong Liao', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBVtY8hs3isvFuDqTiismjcMXYk.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:79201'),
  ('886441529633609972', 'Everlasting Longing', 2025, 'Drama', null, 'Wang Meng Yao', 'AngelaBaby, Song Weilong, Ren Hao, Bai Bingke, Yao Chi, Wang Yiting, Yi Fan, Tao Wu', null, 'When the business prodigy meets a domineering man, their story begins. The eldest daughter of a merchant family has been living with two identities. To outsiders, Jun Qiluo is Jun Feifan, the illegitimate son of the family. She was taken to Beixuan at the age of 20 years old. Jun Qiluo experiences many hardships in a foreign land. She is accused of being a spy, humiliated, and mistreated. Qiluo finds a chance to escape but discovers that while she is away from home, the prince has colluded with her brother-in-law and his mistress to steal their family fortune. Jun Qiluo takes her aging father, erniang, and two younger sisters with her as she fights to rebuild the family business.', 'When the business prodigy meets a domineering man, their story begins. The eldest daughter of a merchant family has been living with two identities. To outsiders, Jun Qiluo is Jun Feifan, the illegitimate son of the family. She was taken to Beixuan at the age of 20 years old. Jun Qiluo experiences many hardships in a foreign land. She is accused of being a spy, humiliated, and mistreated. Qiluo finds a chance to escape but discovers that while she is away from home, the prince has colluded with her brother-in-law and his mistress to steal their family fortune. Jun Qiluo takes her aging father, erniang, and two younger sisters with her as she fights to rebuild the family business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cLthAkAHzuzd6251G4nl3IrGjb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229213'),
  ('1123246297988112047', 'Everwood', 2002, 'Drama, Family', 'Greg Berlanti', null, 'Treat Williams, Gregory Smith, Emily VanCamp, Debra Mooney, John Beasley, Vivien Cardone, Chris Pratt, Stephanie Niznik', 'TV-14', 'After the death of his wife, world-class neurosurgeon Dr. Andrew Brown leaves Manhattan and moves his family to the small town of Everwood, Colorado. There he becomes a small-town doctor and learns parenting on the fly as he raises his talented but resentful 15-year-old son Ephram and his 9-year-old daughter Delia.', 'After the death of his wife, world-class neurosurgeon Dr. Andrew Brown leaves Manhattan and moves his family to the small town of Everwood, Colorado. There he becomes a small-town doctor and learns parenting on the fly as he raises his talented but resentful 15-year-old son Ephram and his 9-year-old daughter Delia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuWIIIjT6hyCLGQTVG0cwLfubb9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1950'),
  ('106103426606673717', 'Every Minute Counts', 2024, 'Drama', 'Jorge Michel Grau', null, 'Osvaldo Benavides, Maya Zapata, Antonio de la Vega, Miriam Balderas, Jesús Zavala, Azalia Ortiz, Luis Fernando Peña, Gabriela Cartol', null, 'In 1985 Mexico City, a catastrophic earthquake buries thousands. A doctor with a dark past, a journalist chasing fame, and a family in distress risk their lives in rescue attempts. Their efforts become chances to change their own lives.', 'In 1985 Mexico City, a catastrophic earthquake buries thousands. A doctor with a dark past, a journalist chasing fame, and a family in distress risk their lives in rescue attempts. Their efforts become chances to change their own lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2R98auOoUk43Ub6OOVfV2M1kqo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:270605'),
  ('889392148659736451', 'Every Move You Make', 2010, 'Drama', 'Yuk-On Tsui', null, 'Bowie Lam Bo-Yee, Bosco Wong Chung-Chak, Kristal Tin Yui-Nei, Aimee Chan, Chris Lai, Susan Tse Suet-Sum, Henry Yu Yang, Raymond Cho Wing-Lim', null, 'Every Move You Make is a 2010 Hong Kong police procedural television serial drama produced by TVB. The 20-episode drama originally aired five days a week, running from 4 to 29 October 2010 on the TVB Jade channel. In the show, Senior Inspector Linus Yiu and his colleagues of West Kowloon Police Headquarter''s CID unit use the Facial Action Coding System, body language study, microexpression interpretations, and applied psychology to solve and assist in criminal investigations. The human''s gesture, can be pretended by the cerebrum, but when facing unusual events happening all of a sudden, or being questioned unawares,then the human''s gesture will finally tell the truth.', 'Every Move You Make is a 2010 Hong Kong police procedural television serial drama produced by TVB. The 20-episode drama originally aired five days a week, running from 4 to 29 October 2010 on the TVB Jade channel. In the show, Senior Inspector Linus Yiu and his colleagues of West Kowloon Police Headquarter''s CID unit use the Facial Action Coding System, body language study, microexpression interpretations, and applied psychology to solve and assist in criminal investigations. The human''s gesture, can be pretended by the cerebrum, but when facing unusual events happening all of a sudden, or being questioned unawares,then the human''s gesture will finally tell the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBXLKbWxlW5lbBncXY62UUk10Hy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:33925'),
  ('326248343261149081', 'Every Week Has a Friday', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Eyad Ibrahim', 'Eyad Ibrahim, Samar Abdelnaser, Mohamed Hesham Obeya', 'Menna Shalabi, Asser Yassin, Sawsan Badr, Abdelaziz Makhyoun, Ahmed Khalid Saleh, Roshdy El Shamy, Arefa Abdul Rasoul, May Elghety', 'TV-MA', 'Hoping to leave her past behind and start anew, Laila strikes a deal that prompts her to marry and live with Emad, a mentally-challenged man. However, their life together gets complicated when henious crimes take place at their living place each Friday.', 'Hoping to leave her past behind and start anew, Laila strikes a deal that prompts her to marry and live with Emad, a mentally-challenged man. However, their life together gets complicated when henious crimes take place at their living place each Friday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFvtgo4uVxd3c4G0g5wjpCDnr7w.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98793'),
  ('222660233513785614', 'Every Witch Way', 2014, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Mariela Romero, Catharina Ledeboer', null, 'Paola Andino, Nick Merico, Paris Smith, Daniela Nieves, Tyler Alvarez, Denisea Wilson, Autumn Wendel, Zoey Burger', 'TV-G', 'The series follows 14-year-old Emma Alonso, as she moves to Miami and her life turns upside-down. Not only does she discover that she is a witch, she also has a crush on the boy next door, Daniel. But Daniel’s ex-girlfriend Maddie, who is an ''evil witch'' and leader of the school clique the ''Panthers'', is still willing to fight for the boy she loves.', 'The series follows 14-year-old Emma Alonso, as she moves to Miami and her life turns upside-down. Not only does she discover that she is a witch, she also has a crush on the boy next door, Daniel. But Daniel’s ex-girlfriend Maddie, who is an ''evil witch'' and leader of the school clique the ''Panthers'', is still willing to fight for the boy she loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7jSP3RCz5OFFBnTIWJ0DvkYxWV.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:60998'),
  ('361055540556533202', 'Everybody Hates Chris', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Chris Rock, Ali LeRoi', null, 'Tyler James Williams, Tichina Arnold, Terry Crews, Imani Hakim, Tequan Richmond, Vincent Martella, Chris Rock', 'TV-PG', 'Chris is a teenager growing up as the eldest of three children in Brooklyn, New York during the early 1980s. Uprooted to a new neighborhood and bused to a predominantly white middle school two-hours away by his strict, hard-working parents, Chris struggles to find his place while keeping his siblings in line at home and surmounting the challenges of junior high.', 'Chris is a teenager growing up as the eldest of three children in Brooklyn, New York during the early 1980s. Uprooted to a new neighborhood and bused to a predominantly white middle school two-hours away by his strict, hard-working parents, Chris struggles to find his place while keeping his siblings in line at home and surmounting the challenges of junior high.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zX0xZnyReJxtGAqDOS3WcsgpOgx.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:252'),
  ('192152131489420840', 'Everybody Loves Diamonds', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Gianluca Maria Tavarelli', 'Michele Astori', 'Kim Rossi Stuart, Anna Foglietta, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Carlotta Antonelli, Leonardo Lidi, Johan Heldenbergh, Kim Mousa, Issam Dakka', 'TV-MA', 'A team of small-time Italian thieves who manage to deceive top-level security to steal millions of dollars'' worth of precious stones from the Antwerp Diamond Centre.', 'A team of small-time Italian thieves who manage to deceive top-level security to steal millions of dollars'' worth of precious stones from the Antwerp Diamond Centre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHopyCXA5LNOOFuJkoKNmC7ENGB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229183'),
  ('454721599171702877', 'Everybody Loves Raymond', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Phil Rosenthal', null, 'Ray Romano, Patricia Heaton, Brad Garrett, Madylin Sweeten, Sawyer Sweeten, Sullivan Sweeten, Doris Roberts, Peter Boyle', 'TV-PG', 'Ray Barone is a successful sportswriter living on Long Island with his wife Debra, daughter Ally, and twin sons, Geoffrey and Michael. Ray''s meddling parents, Frank and Marie, and brother, Robert, live directly across the street.', 'Ray Barone is a successful sportswriter living on Long Island with his wife Debra, daughter Ally, and twin sons, Geoffrey and Michael. Ray''s meddling parents, Frank and Marie, and brother, Robert, live directly across the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcCnVVggEBfNpzHrqzDJqhE6tGP.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:2140'),
  ('1093595385309351845', 'Everybody Stand By', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Chen Kaige, Zhang Ziyi, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Wang Zhifei, Wang Liyun, Yang Xiaopei, Bu Guanjin', null, '50 different actors and actresses come together to get tested their acting abilities, while 4 esteemed directors will be coaching and challenging them to see who advances to the next stage! Who will survive until the end to become "The Best Actor"?', '50 different actors and actresses come together to get tested their acting abilities, while 4 esteemed directors will be coaching and challenging them to see who advances to the next stage! Who will survive until the end to become "The Best Actor"?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypWBoNatDwm0Sl6kIfp0rTiaxjc.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:94772'),
  ('368937734611596603', 'Everybody Still Hates Chris', 2024, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Sanjay Shah', null, 'Chris Rock, Terry Crews, Tichina Arnold, Ozioma Akagha, Tim Johnson Jr., Terrence Little Gardenhigh, Gunnar Sizemore', 'TV-14', 'A re-imagined animated version of Chris Rock''s beloved autobiographical family comedy Everybody Hates Chris.', 'A re-imagined animated version of Chris Rock''s beloved autobiographical family comedy Everybody Hates Chris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQPfd11QelonAL333AiL0hbl0np.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207318'),
  ('369922794915276351', 'Everybody''s Somebody''s Favourite', 1988, null, null, null, 'Woo Fung, Fiona Leung Ngai-Ling, Gary Chan Ga-Fai, Yeung Ling, Lam Lei, Aaron Kwok, Kit-wah Leung, Nam Hung', null, 'Set in a time of explosive change, new things and fashion are endless. "Everybody''s Somebody''s Favourite" portrays the stories of three families, reflecting the "grassroots", "middle-class", and "wealthy" classes. The head of the "grassroots" family, Yang Wenzheng, is conservative and timid, while his wife Yin Yuping is a new-era housewife. The series depicts different aspects of society and its unique phenomena through a light and humorous touch.', 'Set in a time of explosive change, new things and fashion are endless. "Everybody''s Somebody''s Favourite" portrays the stories of three families, reflecting the "grassroots", "middle-class", and "wealthy" classes. The head of the "grassroots" family, Yang Wenzheng, is conservative and timid, while his wife Yin Yuping is a new-era housewife. The series depicts different aspects of society and its unique phenomena through a light and humorous touch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEqPE0eg5LzeivUUTGJQhz2zfJk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225599'),
  ('696864071149845961', 'Everyday Italian', 2003, null, null, null, 'Giada De Laurentiis', 'TV-G', 'Everyday Italian is a Food Network show hosted by Giada De Laurentiis. In the show, De Laurentiis focuses for her viewers on traditional Italian cuisine with an American flair, such as herb-crusted lamb and chocolate-ricotta pie.', 'Everyday Italian is a Food Network show hosted by Giada De Laurentiis. In the show, De Laurentiis focuses for her viewers on traditional Italian cuisine with an American flair, such as herb-crusted lamb and chocolate-ricotta pie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iU9UOa2MXkm5WFhE6zTWLGvhJ3R.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:2945'),
  ('572688553589866322', 'Everyone Else Burns', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Dillon Mapletoft, Oliver Taylor', null, 'Simon Bird, Kate O''Flynn, Amy James-Kelly, Kadiff Kirwan, Ali Khan, Al Roberts, Paddy Young', null, 'Meet the Lewises: your average, everyday Manchester family who belong to an ultra-religious order. Oh, and they reckon the world''s going to end in the next 10 years.', 'Meet the Lewises: your average, everyday Manchester family who belong to an ultra-religious order. Oh, and they reckon the world''s going to end in the next 10 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2HhbbskGM4ty4u13o7gV1JVQQu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:218086'),
  ('199238809916198997', 'Everyone Is Doing Great', 2021, 'Comedy', null, null, 'James Lafferty, Stephen Colletti, Alexandra Park, Cariba Heine, Karissa Lee Staples, Tom Fugedi, Bob Turton, Matthew Atkinson', null, 'Seth and Jeremy enjoyed relative success from ''Eternal'', a hit television vampire drama. Five years after their show has ended, they lean on each other as they struggle to reclaim their previous level of success and relevance, awkwardly navigating the perils of life and love amidst a humorously painful coming of age.', 'Seth and Jeremy enjoyed relative success from ''Eternal'', a hit television vampire drama. Five years after their show has ended, they lean on each other as they struggle to reclaim their previous level of success and relevance, awkwardly navigating the perils of life and love amidst a humorously painful coming of age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePOMnujKaCmA4xpQnRQfWDGgnjK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116600'),
  ('312792524056781312', 'Everyone Loves Me', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Qiao Yao', 'Zhao Cong, Xu Ting', 'Lin Yi, Zhou Ye, Tang Mengjia, Jiang Yiming, Hong Yao, Liu Meihan, Zhan Yu, Wang Xiaoyunzi', null, 'On the day Yue Qianling resigned, she coincidentally crossed paths with her secret crush, Gu Xun, who had just joined as the head of the 9th Business Unit. She didn''t hesitate to return to the company to boldly pursue Gu Xun, but he remained indifferent. He even harshly rejected her confession in front of the entire school. Little did she know, Gu Xun had long fallen for his fearless online friend "Sticky Dough Twist". Who would have expected that his online friend turned out to be Yue Qianling herself? Upon discovering the truth, Gu Xun had no choice but to embark on a humorous and heartwarming "reverse pursuit" journey.', 'On the day Yue Qianling resigned, she coincidentally crossed paths with her secret crush, Gu Xun, who had just joined as the head of the 9th Business Unit. She didn''t hesitate to return to the company to boldly pursue Gu Xun, but he remained indifferent. He even harshly rejected her confession in front of the entire school. Little did she know, Gu Xun had long fallen for his fearless online friend "Sticky Dough Twist". Who would have expected that his online friend turned out to be Yue Qianling herself? Upon discovering the truth, Gu Xun had no choice but to embark on a humorous and heartwarming "reverse pursuit" journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgWR52ebu4rRCgJjYxCliCITh7H.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:247453'),
  ('296037169479669173', 'Everything About Secretary Li', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Chen Si, Fang Jin', null, 'Elite headhunter Li Weixi goes undercover as a sweet, unassuming secretary to expose CEO Jia He for a past betrayal. But Jia He sees through her disguise and keeps her close, turning their tense cat-and-mouse game into something far more complicated. As hidden truths and unexpected emotions surface, both are drawn into a collision of revenge, vulnerability, and redemption.', 'Elite headhunter Li Weixi goes undercover as a sweet, unassuming secretary to expose CEO Jia He for a past betrayal. But Jia He sees through her disguise and keeps her close, turning their tense cat-and-mouse game into something far more complicated. As hidden truths and unexpected emotions surface, both are drawn into a collision of revenge, vulnerability, and redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eys8x6I1mHUqjtY8zIgFSedFNYd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:306671'),
  ('68922727891121618', 'Everything and Nothing', 2011, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Jim Al-Khalili, Carlos Frenk, Simon Schaffer, Ian Stewart', null, 'Two-part documentary which deals with two of the deepest questions there are - what is everything, and what is nothing? Professor Jim Al-Khalili searches for an answer to these questions as he explores the true size and shape of the universe and delves into the amazing science behind apparent nothingness.', 'Two-part documentary which deals with two of the deepest questions there are - what is everything, and what is nothing? Professor Jim Al-Khalili searches for an answer to these questions as he explores the true size and shape of the universe and delves into the amazing science behind apparent nothingness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9hJOY7kMy4xJIeARdqGgvUmijl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67473'),
  ('916336371635394366', 'Everything Calls for Salvation', 2022, 'Drama', 'Francesco Bruni', null, 'Federico Cesari, Andrea Pennacchi', 'TV-MA', 'A young man spends a week in a psychiatric ward, where he meets five other patients and must contend with research-happy doctors and cynical nurses.', 'A young man spends a week in a psychiatric ward, where he meets five other patients and must contend with research-happy doctors and cynical nurses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6sStp97Dikq5GkBpxPXnHbCt7V.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:134057'),
  ('737758496707757926', 'Everything for Demon King Evelogia', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shun Horie, Hitomi Nabatame, Takuya Sato, Hiroki Yasumoto', null, 'Gozu dies, wakes up in his favorite game, and falls for the Demon King. Together, they set out to conquer the world—and each other.', 'Gozu dies, wakes up in his favorite game, and falls for the Demon King. Together, they set out to conquer the world—and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4KSCo3y6zYFJzrCpqx8atl8qMVy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118824'),
  ('149463595934590573', 'Everything Ghibli Special Short Shorts', 1992, null, 'Hayao Miyazaki, Yoshifumi Kondo, Yoshiyuki Momose', null, null, null, 'Treasured animated shorts from Studio Ghibli available for the first time ever! Includes all 32 of their short works ranging from Studio Ghibli''s first ever short film from 1992 "Sora Iro no Tane" to their latest animated music videos. Be sure to catch the animations from your favorite commercials by House Foods and Asahi Beverage Company.', 'Treasured animated shorts from Studio Ghibli available for the first time ever! Includes all 32 of their short works ranging from Studio Ghibli''s first ever short film from 1992 "Sora Iro no Tane" to their latest animated music videos. Be sure to catch the animations from your favorite commercials by House Foods and Asahi Beverage Company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nvYVipbACjxQYt0Tjv9HXTQ6utz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212514'),
  ('468923261367339163', 'Everything I Know About Love', 2022, 'Drama', 'Dolly Alderton', null, 'Emma Appleton, Bel Powley, Aliyah Odoffin, Marli Siu', null, 'In a 2012 London house-share, childhood best friends Maggie and Birdy — now in their 20s — experience bad dates, heartaches and humiliation. With flashbacks to suburban adolescence in the early noughties, the series begs the question: can platonic love survive romantic love as we grow up?', 'In a 2012 London house-share, childhood best friends Maggie and Birdy — now in their 20s — experience bad dates, heartaches and humiliation. With flashbacks to suburban adolescence in the early noughties, the series begs the question: can platonic love survive romantic love as we grow up?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxR3Yskt1Lc2lXRmxMK8YrzmbKs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:202432'),
  ('321182956787527985', 'Everything Is Fine', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Camille de Castelnau', null, 'Virginie Efira, Nicole Garcia, Sara Giraudeau, Aliocha Schneider, Bernard Le Coq, Yannik Landrein, Eduardo Noriega, Mehdi Nebbou', null, 'An ordinary family faces a catastrophe: the serious illness of one of its children. Each member of the family sees their personal life impacted by this ordeal. Disasters make people more human, though not necessarily better.', 'An ordinary family faces a catastrophe: the serious illness of one of its children. Each member of the family sees their personal life impacted by this ordeal. Disasters make people more human, though not necessarily better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnClHiuu8TWPzWOVVHC8S94Hzlx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208920'),
  ('361619888278994824', 'Everything Now', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ripley Parker', null, 'Sophie Wilde, Lauryn Ajufo, Harry Cadby, Noah Thomas, Sam Reuben, Niamh McCormack, Jessie Mae Alonzo, Robert Akodoto', 'TV-MA', 'After months in recovery for an eating disorder, 16-year-old Mia devises a bucket list of quintessential teen experiences to make up for lost time.', 'After months in recovery for an eating disorder, 16-year-old Mia devises a bucket list of quintessential teen experiences to make up for lost time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDKff19c5PVECPbIpcVxO3gwPnB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234239'),
  ('237920299890805133', 'Everything Sucks!', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael Mohan, Ben York Jones', null, 'Peyton Kennedy, Jahi Di''Allo Winston, Quinn Liebling, Rio Mangini, Sydney Sweeney, Elijah Stevenson, Patch Darragh, Claudine Mboligikpelani Nako', 'TV-14', 'It''s 1996 in a town called Boring, Oregon, where high school misfits in the AV and drama clubs brave the ups and downs of teenage emotions in the VHS era.', 'It''s 1996 in a town called Boring, Oregon, where high school misfits in the AV and drama clubs brave the ups and downs of teenage emotions in the VHS era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1u1Ff43QnMCecao2lzx5wpR7Xg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76438'),
  ('496861239369742738', 'Everything Will Be Fine', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Diego Luna', null, 'Lucía Uribe, Flavio Medina, Pierre Louis, Mercedes Hernández', 'TV-MA', 'A separated couple live together for their child''s sake in this satirical dramedy about what it means to be a good parent and spouse in today''s world.', 'A separated couple live together for their child''s sake in this satirical dramedy about what it means to be a good parent and spouse in today''s world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGUEKs6jUgfGu4jqZjuCid5lDE6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129675'),
  ('1023051660155898818', 'Everything''s Gonna Be All White', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'A deep dive into America''s past and present through the experiences of people of color. The docuseries marries humor with history as it confronts the facets of racism, exploitation and discrimination that contributed to the formation of America.', 'A deep dive into America''s past and present through the experiences of people of color. The docuseries marries humor with history as it confronts the facets of racism, exploitation and discrimination that contributed to the formation of America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyk74ulRfBrbBkk9budWzJfdwRV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157312'),
  ('181018508622396469', 'Everything''s Gonna Be Okay', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Josh Thomas', null, 'Kayla Cromer, Maeve Press, Josh Thomas, Adam Faison, Lillian Carrier', null, 'Nicholas, a neurotic 25-year-old, hasn’t been particularly present in his siblings’ lives, but when their single dad reveals that he is terminally ill, the girls have to cope with not only a devastating loss but also the realization that Nicholas is the one who will have to rise to the occasion, move in and hold it all together.', 'Nicholas, a neurotic 25-year-old, hasn’t been particularly present in his siblings’ lives, but when their single dad reveals that he is terminally ill, the girls have to cope with not only a devastating loss but also the realization that Nicholas is the one who will have to rise to the occasion, move in and hold it all together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2izUWhDaBGwGyJp4rvNsrzrNNQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91980'),
  ('912386627977163168', 'Evil', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Michelle King, Robert King', null, 'Katja Herbers, Mike Colter, Aasif Mandvi, Michael Emerson, Brooklyn Shuck, Skylar Gray, Maddy Crocco, Dalya Knapp', 'TV-MA', 'Skeptical forensic psychologist Kristen Bouchard joins priest-in-training David Acosta and technology expert Ben Shakir as they investigate supposed miracles, demonic possessions, and other extraordinary occurrences to assess for a scientific explanation or if something truly supernatural is at work.', 'Skeptical forensic psychologist Kristen Bouchard joins priest-in-training David Acosta and technology expert Ben Shakir as they investigate supposed miracles, demonic possessions, and other extraordinary occurrences to assess for a scientific explanation or if something truly supernatural is at work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/auRAAVxlyT6YACql96UdtnpFHy3.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:86848'),
  ('336364408917828856', 'Evil', 2023, 'Drama', 'Fredrik T Olsson, Jan Guillou', 'Fredrik T Olsson', 'Isac Calmroth, Thea Sofie Loch Næss, Gustaf Skarsgård, Ruth Vega Fernandez, Jens Hultén, Alexander Gustavsson, Christian Sundgren, Saga Sarkola', null, 'It follows 16-year-old Erik, who is used to violence both at home and in the schoolyard. After being expelled from his school in Stockholm due to his violent behavior, he is transferred to the boarding school Stjernsberg. It is his last chance to continue his education and break with his previous life, but at Stjernsberg, the violence is worse than at home. While there, he also engages in a forbidden love relationship with Marja, a member of the kitchen staff.', 'It follows 16-year-old Erik, who is used to violence both at home and in the schoolyard. After being expelled from his school in Stockholm due to his violent behavior, he is transferred to the boarding school Stjernsberg. It is his last chance to continue his education and break with his previous life, but at Stjernsberg, the violence is worse than at home. While there, he also engages in a forbidden love relationship with Marja, a member of the kitchen staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYVBildUmR84p0gfyhbw1htufgf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:228034'),
  ('1067775064398224699', 'Evil Con Carne', 2003, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Maxwell Atoms', null, 'Phil LaMarr, Grey DeLisle, Armin Shimerman, Frank Welker, Jesse Corti, Maxwell Atoms', 'TV-Y7', 'After a failed attempt at world domination, a rich playboy/evil genius is resurrected and resumes his quest for power -- along with a search for his other body parts.', 'After a failed attempt at world domination, a rich playboy/evil genius is resurrected and resumes his quest for power -- along with a search for his other body parts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9Q8Iu7SjcgEbpHqZPMuSjkpA7L.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4246'),
  ('745928694664342136', 'Evil Genius', 2018, 'Documentary, Crime, Mystery', null, 'Barbara Schroeder', 'Kevin G. Calkins, Marjorie Diehl-Armstrong, Trey Borzillieri', 'TV-MA', 'This baffling true crime story starts with the grisly death of a pizza man who robs a bank with a bomb around his neck - and gets weirder from there.', 'This baffling true crime story starts with the grisly death of a pizza man who robs a bank with a bomb around his neck - and gets weirder from there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXaq7vl7sXynXFBVLPrNzj6CGUp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79126'),
  ('296623828150522824', 'Evil Lives Here', 2016, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'The true stories of people who lived with a killer. How well do you really know your family? Would you recognize the warning signs? Or would you become entangled in evil?', 'The true stories of people who lived with a killer. How well do you really know your family? Would you recognize the warning signs? Or would you become entangled in evil?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PVjtXwWhwKTQUdfbkpZRwFxNMq.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:70249'),
  ('1025397413518773557', 'Evil Minds', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Chen Ruoxuan, Wang Longzheng, Han Yezhou, Zhang Xiang, Liu Yong, Guo Yilin', null, 'A gifted criminal profiler lost someone important to him while he was helping the police solve a bizarre campus serial killing. The lost crippled his mind and left him unable to profile again. But when another serial killing threatened the city, he had to confront his inner demon in order to track down the serial killer.', 'A gifted criminal profiler lost someone important to him while he was helping the police solve a bizarre campus serial killing. The lost crippled his mind and left him unable to profile again. But when another serial killing threatened the city, he had to confront his inner demon in order to track down the serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4FL7HY3pK8s9HojrOOy1aAG6FGX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69714'),
  ('253325280089413292', 'Evilive', 2023, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Kim Jeong-min', 'Jung Seo-hee', 'Shin Ha-kyun, Shin Jae-ha, Kim Young-kwang, Song Young-chang, Ju Jin-mo, Choi Byung-mo, Choi Jeong-in, Jo Dal-hwan', null, 'A hardworking lawyer who randomly selects prisoners to visit and find jobs for himself meets a former baseball player who is also the second in command of a criminal organization. Will he be able to resist the temptations of evil?', 'A hardworking lawyer who randomly selects prisoners to visit and find jobs for himself meets a former baseball player who is also the second in command of a criminal organization. Will he be able to resist the temptations of evil?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiS3kubWLnsQgLyiP06jXlP7gnz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:229955'),
  ('514282761443637267', 'Ewoks', 1985, 'Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'George Lucas, Raymond Jafelice, Paul Dini', null, 'Alyson Court, Jim Henshaw, Don Francks, Esther Scott, Cree Summer, Dan Hennessey, George Buza, John Stocker', 'NR', 'The Ewok Wicket and his friends from the Bright Tree Village go on many magical adventures.', 'The Ewok Wicket and his friends from the Bright Tree Village go on many magical adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gu7FdhTki8lBiGceQlsL7H6o3ky.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3478'),
  ('902685639726977592', 'Ex on the Beach', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, null, null, 'Smoking hot singles think they are running away to a tropical island for a once in a lifetime romantic vacation of fun and sun. But just as the party is getting starting, some unwanted guests arrive to break up their good time.', 'Smoking hot singles think they are running away to a tropical island for a once in a lifetime romantic vacation of fun and sun. But just as the party is getting starting, some unwanted guests arrive to break up their good time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adCkFsWQKt0yBWFGCYsmdY77Tp6.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:60867'),
  ('476362457609082317', 'Ex on the Beach', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kamie Crawford', 'TV-MA', 'In this social experiment, smoking-hot celebrity singles think they''re running away to paradise for a once-in-a-lifetime romantic vacation full of fun and sun. But just as the party is getting started, unwanted guests arrive to break up their good time.', 'In this social experiment, smoking-hot celebrity singles think they''re running away to paradise for a once-in-a-lifetime romantic vacation full of fun and sun. But just as the party is getting started, unwanted guests arrive to break up their good time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSEDvRzt0KdEmwE4Gw94jMijIEz.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:78976'),
  ('476728240299409266', 'Ex On the Beach Brazil', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Allan Arnold, Rico Melquiades, Neguin, Lary Bottino, Maju Mazalli, Marina Gregory, Gabily, Tarso Brant', null, 'A reality show with 5 women and 5 men who will enjoy paradise together in a luxurious mansion. The expectation is to find new affairs and, who knows, maybe true love. However, peace is interrupted when exes of the participants begin to appear unexpectedly in each episode. They appear on the beach, a place that is feared by everyone, since the participants never know who can appear and when it will happen. Whose ex is next?', 'A reality show with 5 women and 5 men who will enjoy paradise together in a luxurious mansion. The expectation is to find new affairs and, who knows, maybe true love. However, peace is interrupted when exes of the participants begin to appear unexpectedly in each episode. They appear on the beach, a place that is feared by everyone, since the participants never know who can appear and when it will happen. Whose ex is next?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSYlNoUWagwR1jpftExIVeMm3Kc.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:68603'),
  ('766978281291139737', 'Ex on the Beach: Double Dutch', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Marc-Junior Dufour, Chantal Kuyt, Dani, Demi Kersten, Jonna Tshinkobo, Marianne, Nick, Shaniqua Albertus', null, 'Eight hot, sexy singles off to paradise for a summer of love ... Or so they think. They party, dating and flirting under sweltering temperatures in a tropical setting. The perfect conditions for budding romances, (a) one-night stand (s) or maybe finding true (holiday) love. When they least expect,there will be unexpected visit from their exes. Some want revenge, others hope to win back their ex. One thing is certain; hiding is pointless. Because nobody knows where and whenever a new ex will arrive.', 'Eight hot, sexy singles off to paradise for a summer of love ... Or so they think. They party, dating and flirting under sweltering temperatures in a tropical setting. The perfect conditions for budding romances, (a) one-night stand (s) or maybe finding true (holiday) love. When they least expect,there will be unexpected visit from their exes. Some want revenge, others hope to win back their ex. One thing is certain; hiding is pointless. Because nobody knows where and whenever a new ex will arrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvt2693jO1mwkU3FRJYKWGYFNUR.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:67607'),
  ('20966840739360112', 'Ex-Arm', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Crime', null, 'Tommy Morton', 'Soma Saito, Mikako Komatsu, Akari Kito, Daisuke Namikawa, Sumire Uesaka, Yui Ishikawa, Taku Yashiro, Shoumaru Zouza', 'TV-14', '2014: Akira Natsume seems to almost have a phobia of electrical devices while also being very good at diagnosing them. He resolves to change himself for the better and get a girlfriend like his older brother did. …But then Akira suddenly dies in an accident. 16 years later a special policewoman and her android partner retrieve and activate a highly advanced AI and superweapon called EX-ARM and put it into full control of their ship as a last resort. Turns out the AI is actually just Akira’s brain!', '2014: Akira Natsume seems to almost have a phobia of electrical devices while also being very good at diagnosing them. He resolves to change himself for the better and get a girlfriend like his older brother did. …But then Akira suddenly dies in an accident. 16 years later a special policewoman and her android partner retrieve and activate a highly advanced AI and superweapon called EX-ARM and put it into full control of their ship as a last resort. Turns out the AI is actually just Akira’s brain!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjsebpk01OZBGuVKhJm68oYxM4t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92401'),
  ('33813724998680115', 'Ex-Girlfriend Club', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kwon Seok-jang', 'Lee Jin-mae', 'Byun Yo-han, Song Ji-hyo, Lee Yoon-ji, Ryu Hwa-young, Do Sang-woo, Shin Dong-mi, Kim Sa-Kwon, Shin Dong-mi', null, 'A popular webtoon writer writes about his ex-girlfriends. While his webtoon is being made into a movie, he meets a female film producer.', 'A popular webtoon writer writes about his ex-girlfriends. While his webtoon is being made into a movie, he meets a female film producer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdAJs1vtNPeeG1aYwlnWgAmhjME.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62461'),
  ('805317477956148024', 'Exatlon Hungary', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Palik László, Gelencsér Tímea', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4rBs3GUqG2FOCMOuoPyTdTCqnD.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:85632'),
  ('174812794131395397', 'Excel Saga', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Koshi Rikudo', null, 'Satomi Korogi, Wataru Takagi, Takehito Koyasu, Omi Minami, Kotono Mitsuishi, Shinichi Watanabe, Yuko Mizutani, Ryotaro Okiayu', 'TV-MA', 'Hyperactive Excel does anything and everything to try to please her lord, Il Palazzo, who wants to take over the planet. Excel’s misadventures takes her and her partner, the ever-dying Hyatt, all over the world, meeting several strange people as they go. Everything is bizarre and goofy, as any kind of anime or entertainment genre gets mocked and spoofed.', 'Hyperactive Excel does anything and everything to try to please her lord, Il Palazzo, who wants to take over the planet. Excel’s misadventures takes her and her partner, the ever-dying Hyatt, all over the world, meeting several strange people as they go. Everything is bizarre and goofy, as any kind of anime or entertainment genre gets mocked and spoofed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sr5nHUOuGDmysbANKJN1eV2wzrX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9519'),
  ('871388979697150665', 'exception', 2022, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', null, null, 'Takahiro Sakurai, Atsumi Tanezaki, Yuhko Kaida, Chikahiro Kobayashi, Takanori Hoshino', 'TV-MA', 'In a distant future where humans are forced to leave Earth, a spacecraft carrying a 3D-printed crew of specialists is sent to terraform a new planet.', 'In a distant future where humans are forced to leave Earth, a spacecraft carrying a 3D-printed crew of specialists is sent to terraform a new planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NnrjWKuHnsgKZMAdXeBOLq6CbW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127325'),
  ('129871623110088974', 'Exclusiv - Das Star-Magazin', 1994, 'News, Documentary, Talk', null, null, 'Frauke Ludowig', 'NR', 'Exclusiv: das Starmagazin reports on the latest news and topics from the world of celebrities on a regular weekly basis. It covers the latest headlines relating to the stars as well as rumors and insights into the everyday lives of famous personalities around the globe. In addition to the 15-minute weekday magazine, there is a particularly detailed one-hour weekend edition on Sundays with additional reports and background reports on the celebrities.', 'Exclusiv: das Starmagazin reports on the latest news and topics from the world of celebrities on a regular weekly basis. It covers the latest headlines relating to the stars as well as rumors and insights into the everyday lives of famous personalities around the globe. In addition to the 15-minute weekday magazine, there is a particularly detailed one-hour weekend edition on Sundays with additional reports and background reports on the celebrities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9MYh8E3YED3koL7mlRcRipRJWc.jpg', 31, 'tmdb:tv:115472'),
  ('472702434424899709', 'Exclusive Fairytale', 2023, 'Drama, Family', null, 'Yi Jin', 'Jun, Zhang Miaoyi, Xiong Aobo, Lv Zhao, Hao Zhuyu, Tan Jiatai, Cheryn Lin', null, 'Ling Chao and Xiao Tu have been childhood rivals and inseparable friends since kindergarten. Despite his brilliance and perfectionism, Ling Chao always lived in the shadow of Xiao Tu in his mother’s eyes. As they grow up together, their playful rivalry turns into something more.', 'Ling Chao and Xiao Tu have been childhood rivals and inseparable friends since kindergarten. Despite his brilliance and perfectionism, Ling Chao always lived in the shadow of Xiao Tu in his mother’s eyes. As they grow up together, their playful rivalry turns into something more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yxAS3aEaZMmytwILyQr4aOLf3D.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231306'),
  ('356771103733610961', 'Exclusive Love', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Parker Mao, Chang Chia-sheng, Wayne Hsu, Pu Jing-heng, Sun Mai-chieh, Leo Cheng, Yu Kehong, Hsin-Ling Chi', null, 'Forced to train at his family’s funeral home, a wannabe singer clashes with a cold director as love unfolds between death and vows.', 'Forced to train at his family’s funeral home, a wannabe singer clashes with a cold director as love unfolds between death and vows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sk8KAL7tZRICT7HNneoQMY51oom.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262664'),
  ('766540612669867534', 'Exes & Ohs', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Michelle Paradise, Lee Friedlander', null, 'Michelle Paradise, Marnie Alton, Angela Featherstone, Heather Matarazzo, Megan Cavanagh, Darby Stanchfield, Chelah Horsdal, Stacy Grant', null, 'Meet Jennifer, a documentary filmmaker with a vivid fantasy life and a floundering career. Jennifer wants to find Ms. Right. but first she must navigate the rules of lesbian life, most of which she learns the hard way. Fortunately, her friends are there to help. Surviving singlehood, couplehood - and each other - has never looked quite like this.', 'Meet Jennifer, a documentary filmmaker with a vivid fantasy life and a floundering career. Jennifer wants to find Ms. Right. but first she must navigate the rules of lesbian life, most of which she learns the hard way. Fortunately, her friends are there to help. Surviving singlehood, couplehood - and each other - has never looked quite like this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPWDwfh8UYg13W9KI4fwb2n2IV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12783'),
  ('882432480729702548', 'Exhibit A', 2019, 'Crime, Documentary, Mystery', 'Kelly Loudenberg', null, 'Martin Grimes, Arthur Young, David Rossi, Grant Fredericks, Kanika Jones, Norma Jean Clark, George Powell III, Izzy Fried', 'TV-14', 'This true crime series shows how innocent people have been convicted with dubious forensic techniques and tools such as touch DNA and cadaver dogs', 'This true crime series shows how innocent people have been convicted with dubious forensic techniques and tools such as touch DNA and cadaver dogs', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCsmw3zXm6omNhGRCEGoRhCd4iu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90725'),
  ('1037846997950171396', 'Exile', 2011, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Daniel Brocklehurst, Paul Abbott', null, 'John Simm, Jim Broadbent, Olivia Colman, Nico Mirallegro, Claire Goose, Daryl Fishwick, Shaun Dooley', null, 'Exile is a British psychological thriller television series created by Paul Abbott and Danny Brocklehurst for BBC One. The three-part serial stars John Simm as London journalist Tom Ronstadt, whose world falls apart as a result of his own actions. Upon returning to his Lancashire hometown after 18 years, he finds his father, Sam, in the grips of Alzheimer''s disease. During the course of the series, Tom begins to unravel the mystery of his childhood that drove him away many years earlier. Trying to extract information from Sam causes Tom to grow frustrated with his father''s inability to remember. Tom continues on his quest for the truth, unaware he is unearthing a devastating crime that will reveal unimaginable secrets. The series received varying reviews, with praise for the script and performances but criticism for the clichés. Simm received a BAFTA nomination for his lead role, as did director John Alexander.', 'Exile is a British psychological thriller television series created by Paul Abbott and Danny Brocklehurst for BBC One. The three-part serial stars John Simm as London journalist Tom Ronstadt, whose world falls apart as a result of his own actions. Upon returning to his Lancashire hometown after 18 years, he finds his father, Sam, in the grips of Alzheimer''s disease. During the course of the series, Tom begins to unravel the mystery of his childhood that drove him away many years earlier. Trying to extract information from Sam causes Tom to grow frustrated with his father''s inability to remember. Tom continues on his quest for the truth, unaware he is unearthing a devastating crime that will reveal unimaginable secrets. The series received varying reviews, with praise for the script and performances but criticism for the clichés. Simm received a BAFTA nomination for his lead role, as did director John Alexander.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8wwPUIFw9853z9ioHb53hZyIUH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37760'),
  ('1058734957868212219', 'Exit', 2019, 'Drama', 'Øystein Karlsen', 'Øystein Karlsen', 'Tobias Santelmann, Pål Sverre Hagen, Jon Øigarden, Agnes Kittelsen, Simon J. Berger', null, 'Exit is based on the true stories of four men in their mid-30s, who all became multi-millionaires before the age of thirty. Attempting to escape from their obligations, expectations and families, they employ drugs, prostitutes, and their very own set of morals.', 'Exit is based on the true stories of four men in their mid-30s, who all became multi-millionaires before the age of thirty. Attempting to escape from their obligations, expectations and families, they employ drugs, prostitutes, and their very own set of morals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRnNTiwwQG6rtjh2QUPEuINY1HR.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:94137'),
  ('1122361627153085872', 'EXO Next Door', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Chanyeol, Mun Ka-young, Doh Kyung-soo, Baekhyun, Sehun, Jang Yoo-sang, Jeon Soo-jin, Kim Hee-jung', null, 'Ji Yeon-hee is an extremely shy, introverted 23-year-old girl with zero dating experience and a tendency to blush when talking to someone she likes. One day, four young men move into the house right next door to Yeon-hee''s home, and to her surprise, they turn out to be Chanyeol, D.O, Baekhyun, and Sehun from her favorite boy band EXO, who are looking to lay low for a while. They hire her to clean their house part-time during the winter vacation and that''s when Yeon-hee found out that Chanyeol was her long lost childhood friend and crush "Chan" and is the grandson of the house owner. As the story goes on, Yeon-hee soon becomes involved in a love triangle with Chanyeol and D.O.', 'Ji Yeon-hee is an extremely shy, introverted 23-year-old girl with zero dating experience and a tendency to blush when talking to someone she likes. One day, four young men move into the house right next door to Yeon-hee''s home, and to her surprise, they turn out to be Chanyeol, D.O, Baekhyun, and Sehun from her favorite boy band EXO, who are looking to lay low for a while. They hire her to clean their house part-time during the winter vacation and that''s when Yeon-hee found out that Chanyeol was her long lost childhood friend and crush "Chan" and is the grandson of the house owner. As the story goes on, Yeon-hee soon becomes involved in a love triangle with Chanyeol and D.O.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLdmI6Hp4sr325NwPVHmxiA7VpC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64127'),
  ('673500919114240499', 'Exorcist', 2017, 'Comedy, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Bartosz Walaszek', 'Bartosz Walaszek', null, 'Bogdan Boner is a true jack-of-all-trades: handyman, house painter, lawn mower... and self-taught exorcist. He has yet to met a demon he can''t kill.', 'Bogdan Boner is a true jack-of-all-trades: handyman, house painter, lawn mower... and self-taught exorcist. He has yet to met a demon he can''t kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ChombTRxbrJbSXPE6ZS9yr0uFW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:74857'),
  ('89208369343195291', 'Exosquad', 1993, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Action & Adventure', 'Jeff Segal', null, 'Michael Donovan, Garry Chalk, Teryl Rothery, Richard Newman, Janyse Jaud, Rob Morton, Michael Benyaer, Lisa Ann Beley', 'TV-Y7', 'Sometime in the 22nd century, humans have fully terraformed and colonized Venus and Mars. The Neosapiens, an artificially engineered race created to be slaves for the Terrans, have turned against their masters and formed the Neosapien Order/Empire/Commonwealth. Under the rule of the calculating Governor General Phaeton, the Neosapiens have launched an invasion of Earth and Venus. The ExoFleet, the Homeworlds'' space navy (in particular, Able Squad, a group of Exo-Frame pilots led by Lieutenant J.T. Marsh), fight against the invasion in an interplanetary war to protect the Terrans.', 'Sometime in the 22nd century, humans have fully terraformed and colonized Venus and Mars. The Neosapiens, an artificially engineered race created to be slaves for the Terrans, have turned against their masters and formed the Neosapien Order/Empire/Commonwealth. Under the rule of the calculating Governor General Phaeton, the Neosapiens have launched an invasion of Earth and Venus. The ExoFleet, the Homeworlds'' space navy (in particular, Able Squad, a group of Exo-Frame pilots led by Lieutenant J.T. Marsh), fight against the invasion in an interplanetary war to protect the Terrans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnrESNGYTVsSZrT3Q5oJFgoNzSC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:699'),
  ('206599109802311337', 'Expats', 2024, 'Drama', 'Lulu Wang', null, 'Nicole Kidman, Sarayu Blue, Ji-young Yoo, Brian Tee, Tiana Gowen, Bodhi del Rosario, Ruby Ruiz, Amelyn Pardenilla', 'TV-MA', 'Set against the complex tapestry of Hong Kong residents, a multifaceted group of women sets off a chain of life-altering events that leaves everyone navigating the intricate balance between blame and accountability.', 'Set against the complex tapestry of Hong Kong residents, a multifaceted group of women sets off a chain of life-altering events that leaves everyone navigating the intricate balance between blame and accountability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKAkT96TIf3Mh8q2FXV6GqcuJab.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:95556'),
