  ('794207022376662329', 'Exploding Kittens', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Shane Kosakowski, Matthew Inman', 'Maggie Gottlieb', 'Tom Ellis, Ally Maki, Mark Proksch, Sasheer Zamata, Suzy Nakamura, Kenny Yates, Tom Kenny', 'TV-14', 'It''s the ultimate fight between good and evil when God and his nemesis, the spawn of Satan, are sent to Earth to live with humans — as talking cats.', 'It''s the ultimate fight between good and evil when God and his nemesis, the spawn of Satan, are sent to Earth to live with humans — as talking cats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WctqRtusYpTLHNkuVjQe4R51DZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219532'),
