  ('782855751182130417', 'Fear Thy Neighbor', 2014, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'Tish Iceton', 'TV-14', 'These are the terrifying tales of the unwanted neighbors who turn home sweet home into home sweet hell. A look inside the lives of horrific neighborly disputes and what happens when a simple issue turns into the worst night of a family''s life. Do you really know who lives next door? This true-crime series tells the chilling tales of those with the misfortune to unwittingly take up residence within a stone’s throw of a psycho or killer.', 'These are the terrifying tales of the unwanted neighbors who turn home sweet home into home sweet hell. A look inside the lives of horrific neighborly disputes and what happens when a simple issue turns into the worst night of a family''s life. Do you really know who lives next door? This true-crime series tells the chilling tales of those with the misfortune to unwittingly take up residence within a stone’s throw of a psycho or killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwND5lLcfdufhTMajPrj2U9Gnhq.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:62416'),
  ('83432395410785578', 'Fearless', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Frank Salinas, Andrew Fried', null, 'Grant Crookes, Ty Hurley, Ty Murray, Silvano Alves, Adriano Moraes, João Ricardo Vieira, Guilherme Marchi, Kaique Pacheo', null, 'On a journey from Brazil to the Las Vegas championships, professional bull riders risk it all to earn money, respect and titles.', 'On a journey from Brazil to the Las Vegas championships, professional bull riders risk it all to earn money, respect and titles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vR25hfuw5eWfulfzctYVbYW832h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67351'),
  ('1070866865976383083', 'Fearless', 2017, 'Drama, Crime, War & Politics, Mystery', 'Patrick Harbinson', 'Patrick Harbinson', 'Helen McCrory, Jonathan Forbes, Sam Swainsbury, Wunmi Mosaku, Rebecca Callard, Catherine Steadman, John Bishop, Rick Warden', 'TV-MA', 'Emma Banville, a human rights lawyer known for defending lost causes, sets out to prove the innocence of Kevin Russell, who was convicted for the murder of a school girl 14 years earlier.', 'Emma Banville, a human rights lawyer known for defending lost causes, sets out to prove the innocence of Kevin Russell, who was convicted for the murder of a school girl 14 years earlier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqs7TM6sffX70TEri957KOINeqU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72289'),
  ('96737247302141858', 'Fearless Whispers', 2020, 'Drama', 'Wang Wei', 'Chen huang, Wei Pu', 'Li Yifeng, Jin Chen, Wang Longzheng, Niu Junfeng, Shi Shi, Li Qiang, Wang Xiaoyi, Han Yezhou', null, 'In post-war Shanghai, idealistic law graduate Gu Yaodong becomes a policeman, only to face corruption and political turmoil. Caught between the Communists and Nationalists, he teams up with unexpected allies and sets out on a path of resistance, determined to fight for justice.', 'In post-war Shanghai, idealistic law graduate Gu Yaodong becomes a policeman, only to face corruption and political turmoil. Caught between the Communists and Nationalists, he teams up with unexpected allies and sets out on a path of resistance, determined to fight for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYZkFnR0BeWk8b3UuyqL1DPdXWt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112703'),
  ('328094524219995472', 'Feather Flies to the Sky', 2017, 'Drama', null, 'Shen Jie', 'Zhang Yi, Yin Tao, Tao Zeru, Karlina Zhang, Wu Qijiang, Kun Hua, Cheng Shi, Lin Yiting', null, 'Chen Jianghe is an orphan, picked up and taken home by Chen Jinshui. While growing up, he picked up various business strategies from the adults around him. Now an adult, he nurtures this business acumen by travelling throughout China. It is during these travels where he meets Lu Yuzhu who shares a similar situation in life, as well as Yang Shiu, a wealthy girl who just returned from living abroad.', 'Chen Jianghe is an orphan, picked up and taken home by Chen Jinshui. While growing up, he picked up various business strategies from the adults around him. Now an adult, he nurtures this business acumen by travelling throughout China. It is during these travels where he meets Lu Yuzhu who shares a similar situation in life, as well as Yang Shiu, a wealthy girl who just returned from living abroad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15qwQ2RVVcBhYJc0eVMKkVCbKq2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90483'),
  ('740925577819666481', 'Feed the Beast', 2016, 'Drama', 'Clyde Phillips', null, 'David Schwimmer, Jim Sturgess, Michael Gladis, Lorenza Izzo, Elijah Jacob, John Doman, Christine Adams', 'TV-14', 'For two friends on the brink of losing everything, a dusty pipe dream of opening up an upscale restaurant in their hometown of the Bronx is all they have left to turn their lives around. Together, they take on the insanity of the New York restaurant world, and navigate its underbelly of petty criminals, corrupt officials and violent mobsters.', 'For two friends on the brink of losing everything, a dusty pipe dream of opening up an upscale restaurant in their hometown of the Bronx is all they have left to turn their lives around. Together, they take on the insanity of the New York restaurant world, and navigate its underbelly of petty criminals, corrupt officials and violent mobsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Mhojt4czfAlUkrkcdtIrS3Nmzc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66316'),
  ('760576069383731718', 'Feedback', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', null, 'Kacper Wysocki', 'Arkadiusz Jakubik, Jakub Sierenberg, Dominika Bednarczyk, Nel Kaczmarek, Juliusz Chrząstowski, Agata Wątróbska, Przemysław Bluszcz, Kamil Studnicki', 'TV-MA', 'A rock star with memory issues due to his alcoholism goes on a wild search to find his missing son.', 'A rock star with memory issues due to his alcoholism goes on a wild search to find his missing son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8O9N4hPNKmHhWdP6EYlSE0AwbhR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:230370'),
  ('644042888309077769', 'Feel Good', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mae Martin, Joe Hampson', null, 'Mae Martin, Charlotte Ritchie, Phil Burgers', 'TV-MA', 'Recovering addict and comedian Mae tries to control the addictive behaviors and intense romanticism that permeate every facet of their life. Life is further complicated by a new and all-consuming relationship with their new girlfriend George.', 'Recovering addict and comedian Mae tries to control the addictive behaviors and intense romanticism that permeate every facet of their life. Life is further complicated by a new and all-consuming relationship with their new girlfriend George.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ri3dx91b3QeRGB35gnEiHGhXxdP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:99610'),
  ('403885371385690136', 'Feel What You Feel', 2026, 'Drama', 'Nilv Zhuren, Li Fangxiong', 'Li Fangxiong', 'Liang Beiyi, Sun Caizhen, Huang Huaiting, Cheng Hao, Zhou Qianxiao', 'TV-MA', 'Two law students with opposite personalities find their lives forever changed as they navigate hidden feelings and a slow-burn romance.', 'Two law students with opposite personalities find their lives forever changed as they navigate hidden feelings and a slow-burn romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diploePW5IQkCTXbGPjN15aMRLd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:316795'),
  ('350858308162976717', 'Felicity', 1998, 'Drama, Soap', 'J.J. Abrams, Matt Reeves', null, 'Keri Russell, Scott Speedman, Tangi Miller, Greg Grunberg, Amanda Foreman, Ian Gomez, Scott Foley', 'TV-14', 'Felicity Porter, a sensitive and intelligent girl from the San Francisco Bay Area, decides to give up a slot at Stanford University''s pre-med program to follow her long time crush to college in New York City. Things get even more complicated when she meets her dorm''s resident advisor and they fall in love.', 'Felicity Porter, a sensitive and intelligent girl from the San Francisco Bay Area, decides to give up a slot at Stanford University''s pre-med program to follow her long time crush to college in New York City. Things get even more complicated when she meets her dorm''s resident advisor and they fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6gZ7fVpLBK3l5FkxCzMtEtT7Bz.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2822'),
