  ('174544161829438222', 'Fem myror är fler än fyra elefanter', 1984, 'Family, Comedy, Kids', 'Lasse Haglund, Bengt Linné', null, 'Eva Remaeus, Brasse Brännström, Magnus Härenstam', null, 'Fem myror är fler än fyra elefanter or Fem myror was a 1973–75 Swedish TV-series for children, hosted by Magnus Härenstam, Brasse Brännström and Eva Remaeus. The TV-series included songs and sketches with education about letters, numbers, positions, etc. Fem myror är fler än fyra elefanter was broadcast first on 19 November 1973 on TV2 by Sveriges Television and it was also broadcast as Julkalendern 27 November –24 December 1977. Fem myror is able to buy on VHS and DVD and there are also PC games.', 'Fem myror är fler än fyra elefanter or Fem myror was a 1973–75 Swedish TV-series for children, hosted by Magnus Härenstam, Brasse Brännström and Eva Remaeus. The TV-series included songs and sketches with education about letters, numbers, positions, etc. Fem myror är fler än fyra elefanter was broadcast first on 19 November 1973 on TV2 by Sveriges Television and it was also broadcast as Julkalendern 27 November –24 December 1977. Fem myror is able to buy on VHS and DVD and there are also PC games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MRZxkRTXrVYvcmuUqa5nEDi42b.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:43165'),
  ('395986872986715389', 'Femme Fatales', 2011, 'Drama', 'Mark A. Altman, Steven Kriozere', null, 'Tanit Phoenix', 'TV-14', 'This provocative hit series tells the stories of dangerous women who find extraordinary ways of coping with their problems, channeling their survival instincts and bringing out their inner guile.', 'This provocative hit series tells the stories of dangerous women who find extraordinary ways of coping with their problems, channeling their survival instincts and bringing out their inner guile.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUE2ceDcYaz53okDNFNeLIlXaek.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:39388'),
  ('650339738532219699', 'Fena: Pirate Princess', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Asami Seto, Ryota Suzuki, Takahiro Sakurai, Aoi Yuuki, Gen Sato, Ryota Osaka, Jun Osuka, Shintaro Tanaka', 'TV-MA', 'Fena Houtman remembers little about her childhood. Orphaned and raised as a servant in a brothel, her life changes when she escapes to an island of pirates where she discovers the truth behind her family. With Fena being the only one able to unlock her family’s secrets, and a formidable crew of female pirates on her tail, she must take her place as captain of her Samurai crew for a high seas adventure!', 'Fena Houtman remembers little about her childhood. Orphaned and raised as a servant in a brothel, her life changes when she escapes to an island of pirates where she discovers the truth behind her family. With Fena being the only one able to unlock her family’s secrets, and a formidable crew of female pirates on her tail, she must take her place as captain of her Samurai crew for a high seas adventure!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49ZnZEHVVXOMyiICCpCMDxWc0ku.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106480'),
  ('783937402177340635', 'Fenris', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Simen Alsvik, Magnus Monn-Iversen', 'Simen Alsvik, Maren Skolem, Nikolaj Scherfig', 'Ida Elise Broch, Cengiz Al, Julia Schacht, Ane Ulimoen Øverli, Jan Gunnar Røise, Jonas Strand Gravli, Ingjerd Egeberg, Magnus Krepper', null, 'When Emma hears that her father has stopped doing his job as a wolf researcher, she takes her son Leo to Østbygda to find out what''s going on. At the same time, a young boy disappears without a trace from the village.', 'When Emma hears that her father has stopped doing his job as a wolf researcher, she takes her son Leo to Østbygda to find out what''s going on. At the same time, a young boy disappears without a trace from the village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEDnTD8uYhAdQn8Y23D61CJcgDM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209577'),
