  ('494868796317376179', 'Fermat Kitchen', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Ryosuke Tomita, Taito Ban', 'TV-14', 'The story centers on Gaku Kitada, a talented mathematics scholar, and Kai Asakura, a young but similarly talented chef. After Gaku suffers setbacks on his dream of becoming a mathematician, he meets Kai as he is running his own food business, and joins Kai in an attempt at something new.', 'The story centers on Gaku Kitada, a talented mathematics scholar, and Kai Asakura, a young but similarly talented chef. After Gaku suffers setbacks on his dream of becoming a mathematician, he meets Kai as he is running his own food business, and joins Kai in an attempt at something new.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CrSIqyoZIVk0UsbBPaJlMkCxcM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:283704'),
