  ('1022496621364725601', 'Fernando', 2020, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Fernando Alonso', null, 'The documentary series shows Alonso''s passion for competing at the highest level and his determination to win. Documented last year, from his presence on the most important circuits, like the Indianapolis 500 or the 24 hours of Le Mans, until his climax with his debut on the Dakar last January, Fernando offers access in his life.', 'The documentary series shows Alonso''s passion for competing at the highest level and his determination to win. Documented last year, from his presence on the most important circuits, like the Indianapolis 500 or the 24 hours of Le Mans, until his climax with his debut on the Dakar last January, Fernando offers access in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKmHxrhlQPLz9TaLhvlzMVrRtQj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:107543'),
