  ('1055907700594791483', 'Festa é Festa', 2021, 'Soap, Comedy', 'Roberto Pereira', null, 'Maria do Céu Guerra, Pedro Teixeira, Ana Guiomar, Pedro Alves, Ana Brito e Cunha, Sílvia Rizzo, Manuel Marques, José Carlos Pereira', 'NR', 'A village in the interior of Portugal is preparing the best village festival ever, in the year that marks the centenary of its greatest benefactor. Everyone does their best in organizing the party always with something in mind: the inheritance of the elderly woman.', 'A village in the interior of Portugal is preparing the best village festival ever, in the year that marks the centenary of its greatest benefactor. Everyone does their best in organizing the party always with something in mind: the inheritance of the elderly woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rlQlfiBR0zY1ucBIvB2neYUVfFP.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:124201'),
