  ('268782434341847085', 'Fetch! with Ruff Ruffman', 2006, 'Kids, Animation', 'Kate Taylor', 'Glen Berger, Jim Conroy', 'Jim Conroy', 'TV-Y', 'Fetch! with Ruff Ruffman, sometimes shortened as Fetch!, is a children''s television series for children ages 6–12 on PBS during the PBS Kids Go! block of educational programming. It is a game show/reality show that is hosted by an animated anthropomorphic dog named Ruff Ruffman who dispenses challenges to the show''s real-life contestants. The series ran for five seasons and 100 episodes from May 29, 2006 to November 4, 2010 on PBS, with 30 contestants in that time. In June 2010, WGBH announced that the series would end due to lack of funding. In June 2008, the series received its first Emmy for Best Original Song for its theme.', 'Fetch! with Ruff Ruffman, sometimes shortened as Fetch!, is a children''s television series for children ages 6–12 on PBS during the PBS Kids Go! block of educational programming. It is a game show/reality show that is hosted by an animated anthropomorphic dog named Ruff Ruffman who dispenses challenges to the show''s real-life contestants. The series ran for five seasons and 100 episodes from May 29, 2006 to November 4, 2010 on PBS, with 30 contestants in that time. In June 2010, WGBH announced that the series would end due to lack of funding. In June 2008, the series received its first Emmy for Best Original Song for its theme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dWqDKbWTeK5oZG1cDzAHvrgQK4P.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:521'),
  ('425089794225333032', 'FEUD', 2017, 'Drama', 'Ryan Murphy, Jaffe Cohen, Michael Zam', null, 'Tom Hollander, Naomi Watts, Diane Lane, Chloë Sevigny, Calista Flockhart, Demi Moore, Molly Ringwald, Treat Williams', 'TV-MA', 'Anthology series of famous feuds with the first season based on the legendary rivalry between Bette Davis and Joan Crawford which began early on their careers, climaxed on the set of "Whatever Happened to Baby Jane?" and evolved into an Oscar vendetta.', 'Anthology series of famous feuds with the first season based on the legendary rivalry between Bette Davis and Joan Crawford which began early on their careers, climaxed on the set of "Whatever Happened to Baby Jane?" and evolved into an Oscar vendetta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5wn2eLRN3naOB1JxEbDIApRN2T.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69851'),
  ('174522347886923274', 'FEUD', 2025, 'Drama', 'Zhao Na', null, 'Bai Lu, Joseph Zeng, He Ruixian, Chen Xinhai, Liang Yongqi, Zheng Kai, Crystal Huang Yi', null, 'Li Qingyue, the Four Spirit Immortal, and Bai Jiusi, the powerful Dacheng Lord, are caught in a turbulent love-hate relationship. As hidden truths come to light, they overcome their misunderstandings and join forces to protect the world from impending danger.', 'Li Qingyue, the Four Spirit Immortal, and Bai Jiusi, the powerful Dacheng Lord, are caught in a turbulent love-hate relationship. As hidden truths come to light, they overcome their misunderstandings and join forces to protect the world from impending danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fx7KQNaFUx5DaXMRm0pznHoLe04.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252320'),
  ('406374372683011688', 'Feuer & Flamme', 2017, 'Documentary, Reality', null, null, null, null, 'This documentary series follows emergency services from various fire stations in the Ruhr area up close and portrays the people in their grueling everyday working life.', 'This documentary series follows emergency services from various fire stations in the Ruhr area up close and portrays the people in their grueling everyday working life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kURevdhdZoZOjtM47uKKoeKvhqs.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:72926'),
  ('270410135031257211', 'FIA WEC', 2012, null, null, null, null, null, 'Established in 2012, the FIA World Endurance Championship (FIA WEC) represents the international pinnacle of the long-distance discipline, in which races last anything from six hours up to 24.', 'Established in 2012, the FIA World Endurance Championship (FIA WEC) represents the international pinnacle of the long-distance discipline, in which races last anything from six hours up to 24.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qW6oSzfAMvjvmIokQcKCrfvqFVw.jpg', 15, 'tmdb:tv:305251'),
  ('760951840985776777', 'Fiasco', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Igor Gotesman, Pierre Niney', null, 'Pierre Niney, François Civil, Géraldine Nakache, Pascal Demolon, Leslie Medina, Louise Coldefy, Djimo Salim, Juliette Gasquet', 'TV-PG', 'When disaster strikes the set of a first-time director, a behind-the-scenes film crew captures everything as mishaps, blackmail and sabotage ensue.', 'When disaster strikes the set of a first-time director, a behind-the-scenes film crew captures everything as mishaps, blackmail and sabotage ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxzF3PMICswCoPxHmkQVYV7XRkU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:221120'),
  ('622382657915921686', 'Fievel''s American Tails', 1992, 'Western, Animation, Family', 'David Kirschner', null, 'Phillip Glasser, Lloyd Battista, Gerrit Graham, Dom DeLuise, Kenneth Mars', 'NR', 'Fievel''s American Tails is an American/Canadian animated television series, produced by Steven Spielberg''s Amblimation animation studio, Nelvana, and Universal Cartoon Studios. It aired for one season in 1992, and continued Fievel''s adventures from the film An American Tail: Fievel Goes West. In 1993 and 1994, MCA/Universal Home Video released twelve episodes on six VHS video-cassettes, two Laserdisc volumes. These have been the only home video releases of the cartoon, at least in the United States. In the United Kingdom, 12 episodes were released on six video-cassettes in 1995, but were in a different episode order to the United States and Vol.4 features the only episode that hasn''t been released in the United States. Episodes have been released on DVD in France, Germany, and Italy. Universal currently has no plans to release the show on DVD in the United States, as of November 19, 2009.', 'Fievel''s American Tails is an American/Canadian animated television series, produced by Steven Spielberg''s Amblimation animation studio, Nelvana, and Universal Cartoon Studios. It aired for one season in 1992, and continued Fievel''s adventures from the film An American Tail: Fievel Goes West. In 1993 and 1994, MCA/Universal Home Video released twelve episodes on six VHS video-cassettes, two Laserdisc volumes. These have been the only home video releases of the cartoon, at least in the United States. In the United Kingdom, 12 episodes were released on six video-cassettes in 1995, but were in a different episode order to the United States and Vol.4 features the only episode that hasn''t been released in the United States. Episodes have been released on DVD in France, Germany, and Italy. Universal currently has no plans to release the show on DVD in the United States, as of November 19, 2009.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msWEkhcsqi0gfrIIpOonKumOkkT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:74'),
  ('58577434974399012', 'FIFA Uncovered', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Sepp Blatter, Michel Platini, Gianni Infantino, Juca Kfouri, Jérôme Valcke, Ricardo Teixeira', 'TV-14', 'From power struggles to global politics, an exploration of FIFA reveals the organization''s checkered history — and what it takes to host a World Cup.', 'From power struggles to global politics, an exploration of FIFA reveals the organization''s checkered history — and what it takes to host a World Cup.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajJl0eZfZCxeWiPoudfu4PgCAO4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:213193'),
  ('182619752959189356', 'Fifteen-Love', 2023, 'Drama', 'Hania Elkington', 'Hania Elkington', 'Ella Lily Hyland, Aidan Turner, Harmony Rose Bremner, Tom Varey, Lorenzo Richelmy, Manon Azem, Jess Darrow, Steffan Rhodri', 'TV-PG', 'A former tennis prodigy makes an explosive allegation against her former coach. After the allegation, everyone is forced to reconsider what they thought they knew about their past success.', 'A former tennis prodigy makes an explosive allegation against her former coach. After the allegation, everyone is forced to reconsider what they thought they knew about their past success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cB97X0ZspRUyiU0ZBkAtjmDITq6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:219993'),
  ('339203719078292360', 'Fifth Gear', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Mark McQueen', null, 'Vicki Butler-Henderson, Jason Plato, Rory Reid, Grace Webb, Jimmy de Ville', null, 'Getting viewers up to speed on all the latest automotive information, with new car reviews, second hand bargains and industry tidbits being the focus of this magazine show.', 'Getting viewers up to speed on all the latest automotive information, with new car reviews, second hand bargains and industry tidbits being the focus of this magazine show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAxMzWGCuQI1adyPOGNefZHLOIy.jpg', 29, 'tmdb:tv:1592'),
  ('86220121234446971', 'Fifty Fifty (50-50)', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Elena Solomou, Vassilis Risvas, Dimitra Sakali', 'Vassilis Risvas, Elena Solomou, Dimitra Sakali', 'Petros Filippidis, Pavlos Haikalis, Sakis Boulas, Ava Galanopoulou, Maria Androutsou, Vana Rambota, Pigmalion Dadakaridis, Thanos Tokakis', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6oAAjh2SS4ZsTY4cF3f52K3VxVJ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:51773'),
  ('455068824439903823', 'Fight for Love', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Victoria Song, Ding Yuxi, Fu Xinbo, Joe Chen, Liang Xuefeng, Cao Jun, Zhou Jieqiong, Zhou Dawei', null, 'After her father''s death in battle and a mysterious warning from her injured brother, Chu Yu vows to uncover the truth. She marries into the defeated Wei family as Wei Jun’s widow to investigate, where she meets the sole survivor, Wei Yun. Though initially guarded, Wei Yun grows fond of Chu Yu, and mutual feelings emerge. Despite the obstacle of their "in-law" relationship, they face dangers together, uncover secrets, and protect their homeland side by side.', 'After her father''s death in battle and a mysterious warning from her injured brother, Chu Yu vows to uncover the truth. She marries into the defeated Wei family as Wei Jun’s widow to investigate, where she meets the sole survivor, Wei Yun. Though initially guarded, Wei Yun grows fond of Chu Yu, and mutual feelings emerge. Despite the obstacle of their "in-law" relationship, they face dangers together, uncover secrets, and protect their homeland side by side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iCkfB9SGJbfmUmuoJDxcb9BnLC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:263044'),
  ('758880458015853502', 'Fight for My Way', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lim Sang-choon', null, 'Park Seo-jun, Kim Ji-won, Ahn Jae-hong, Song Ha-yoon, Kim Seung-o, Jin Hee-kyung, Lee Elijah, Kim Gun-woo', 'TV-14', 'A former taekwondo champion and an information desk worker aspire to chase their dreams in a world that isn''t kind to those with mediocre credentials.', 'A former taekwondo champion and an information desk worker aspire to chase their dreams in a world that isn''t kind to those with mediocre credentials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55w33JzFKBkz1evjBjqeF0enDd1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70813'),
  ('263788801369529159', 'Fight Like a Girl', 2020, 'Reality', null, null, 'Stephanie McMahon Levesque', null, 'Ten women. Paired with WWE Superstars. Together they find the strength, courage, and ability to transform themselves both on the inside and out.', 'Ten women. Paired with WWE Superstars. Together they find the strength, courage, and ability to transform themselves both on the inside and out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEbT1ust07jlWnVpcXtnZCHkWO4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99300'),
  ('37213120110611338', 'Fight Night: The Million Dollar Heist', 2024, 'Drama, Crime', 'Shaye Ogbonna', null, 'Kevin Hart, Samuel L. Jackson, Taraji P. Henson, Don Cheadle', 'TV-MA', 'The story of how on the night of Ali’s defeat of Jerry Quarry, which came after he was banned from boxing for refusing to enter the military draft, hundreds of guests at an after-party were robbed at gunpoint, becoming one of the largest armed robberies the country has ever seen.', 'The story of how on the night of Ali’s defeat of Jerry Quarry, which came after he was banned from boxing for refusing to enter the military draft, hundreds of guests at an after-party were robbed at gunpoint, becoming one of the largest armed robberies the country has ever seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucxvu9kRykTd23m1omktBJZG2Q1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:241485'),
  ('965884072648133832', 'Fight or Love?', 2012, 'Soap, Comedy', 'Silvio de Abreu', 'Silvio de Abreu, Daniel Ortiz', 'Irene Ravache, Tony Ramos, Mariana Ximenes, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Glória Pires, Edson Celulari, Bianca Bin, Luana Piovani', null, 'An inheritance of millions brings the fun-loving Charlô (Irene Raveche) and her bad-tempered cousin Otávio (Tony Ramos) closer than they ever expected. The inheritance, which includes a mansion and a chain of clothing stores, stipulates that the assets remain in the family. And since no one is willing to give up their part they decide to share the mansion and the business, despite the mortal hatred they harbor for each other. Charlô’s adopted son Felipe (Edson Celulari) also becomes caught up in the situation. However, he turns against his mother and becomes Otávio’s right-hand man at the company.', 'An inheritance of millions brings the fun-loving Charlô (Irene Raveche) and her bad-tempered cousin Otávio (Tony Ramos) closer than they ever expected. The inheritance, which includes a mansion and a chain of clothing stores, stipulates that the assets remain in the family. And since no one is willing to give up their part they decide to share the mansion and the business, despite the mortal hatred they harbor for each other. Charlô’s adopted son Felipe (Edson Celulari) also becomes caught up in the situation. However, he turns against his mother and becomes Otávio’s right-hand man at the company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6i4O50PaSEyAP7abxUPbAFGq58q.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48892'),
  ('314144029898064651', 'Fight! Kickers', 1986, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Tomiko Suzuki, Kazue Ikura, Noriko Tsukase, Masako Watanabe, Ikue Otani, Shinobu Adachi, Urara Takano, Kyoko Tongu', 'TV-Y7', 'The Kitahara Kickers are a soccer who struggle to win a game, with a run of 22 consecutive losses. But then a newcomer joins the team whose attitude brings back the passion for soccer that his teammates have forgotten.', 'The Kitahara Kickers are a soccer who struggle to win a game, with a run of 22 consecutive losses. But then a newcomer joins the team whose attitude brings back the passion for soccer that his teammates have forgotten.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NjsEwjdP2TiScGDr2vDujC2F8T.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64049'),
  ('145692785304519855', 'Fighter of the Destiny', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, 'Lu Han, Gulnezer Bextiyar, Janice Wu, Joseph Zeng, Gao Hanyu, Amelie Xu, Johnny Zhang, Zhai Tianlin', null, 'Chun Changsheng was abandoned in a flowing river and plucked up by a Taoist monk. He’s actually the fourth Prince of the Chen’s Royal bloodline. He’s plagued with an incurable illness, fated not to live past the age of 20. To find a cure, he leaves his temple, armed with a promise of marriage scroll, to become a student at a famous academy. He meets Xu Yourong and they slowly fall in love after hopping through the trials and tribulations of his journey.', 'Chun Changsheng was abandoned in a flowing river and plucked up by a Taoist monk. He’s actually the fourth Prince of the Chen’s Royal bloodline. He’s plagued with an incurable illness, fated not to live past the age of 20. To find a cure, he leaves his temple, armed with a promise of marriage scroll, to become a student at a famous academy. He meets Xu Yourong and they slowly fall in love after hopping through the trials and tribulations of his journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkXwxhiDTfx4AV8zwp02SZ6EufZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71419'),
  ('191129455271763347', 'Fighting Foodons', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Chika Sakamoto, Chisa Yokoyama, Hidenobu Kiuchi, Hikaru Tokita, Jin Nishimura, Masami Iwasaki, Megumi Nasu, Shintaro Ohata', null, 'In the land of Fighting Foodons, regular recipes turn in to meal monsters when the art of culinary combat''s concocted. King Gorgeous Gorge and his Fatties have cooked up a devious plan to rule the world and they sprinkled an extra dash of destruction. They plan to rule the world by kidnapping the best chefs & forcing them to make powerful Foodons. A boy named Chase, a young apprentice chef with an appetite for action, thinks he has what it takes to become an Elite Master Chef like his dad, Chef Jack. Chase believes that he, his friends, family, and Foodons can change the world, even if it involves going into battle against the Glutton Gormandizers, King Gorgeous Gorge''s Big 4, and King Gorgeous Gorge''s female cat-like servant, Clawdia.', 'In the land of Fighting Foodons, regular recipes turn in to meal monsters when the art of culinary combat''s concocted. King Gorgeous Gorge and his Fatties have cooked up a devious plan to rule the world and they sprinkled an extra dash of destruction. They plan to rule the world by kidnapping the best chefs & forcing them to make powerful Foodons. A boy named Chase, a young apprentice chef with an appetite for action, thinks he has what it takes to become an Elite Master Chef like his dad, Chef Jack. Chase believes that he, his friends, family, and Foodons can change the world, even if it involves going into battle against the Glutton Gormandizers, King Gorgeous Gorge''s Big 4, and King Gorgeous Gorge''s female cat-like servant, Clawdia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0i2GdnRajfTONevOHAViBzHpwL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16098'),
  ('616518867845117621', 'Fighting General Daimos', 1978, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Tadao Nagahama', null, 'Kazuyuki Sogabe, Tamio Ohki, Akira Kamiya, Shozo Iizuka, Yo Inoue, Tessyo Genda, Osamu Ichikawa, Miyuki Ueda', null, 'The survivors of Planet Baam and the Earth people want to sign a peace treaty, so General Lion and the renowned scientist Dr. Ryūzaki head out to have a reunion. But Lion dies in odd circumstances, his vengeful son Richter kills Dr. Ryūzaki—and war starts. Dr. Ryūzaki''s son, young martial artist Kazuya, decides to defend Earth with Dr. Izumi''s powerful robot: Tōshō Daimos...', 'The survivors of Planet Baam and the Earth people want to sign a peace treaty, so General Lion and the renowned scientist Dr. Ryūzaki head out to have a reunion. But Lion dies in odd circumstances, his vengeful son Richter kills Dr. Ryūzaki—and war starts. Dr. Ryūzaki''s son, young martial artist Kazuya, decides to defend Earth with Dr. Izumi''s powerful robot: Tōshō Daimos...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zBSFAORAhKYbcK6g5R8yPZaKCN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8996'),
  ('722134511671728151', 'Fighting Spirit', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Action & Adventure', null, 'Tatsuhiko Urahata', 'Kohei Kiyasu, Rikiya Koyama, Wataru Takagi, Keiji Fujiwara, Jurota Kosugi, Hidenobu Kiuchi, Hisao Egawa, Shin-ichiro Miki', 'TV-PG', 'Makunouchi Ippo is an ordinary high school student in Japan. Since he spends most of his time away from school helping his mother run the family business, he doesn''t get to enjoy his younger years like most teenagers. Always a target for bullying at school (the family fishing business grants him a distinct odor), Ippo''s life is one of hardship. One of these after-school bullying sessions turns Ippo''s life around for the better, as he is saved by a boxer named Takamura. He decides to follow in Takamura''s footsteps and train to become a boxer, giving his life direction and purpose. Ippo''s path to perfecting his pugilistic prowess is just beginning...', 'Makunouchi Ippo is an ordinary high school student in Japan. Since he spends most of his time away from school helping his mother run the family business, he doesn''t get to enjoy his younger years like most teenagers. Always a target for bullying at school (the family fishing business grants him a distinct odor), Ippo''s life is one of hardship. One of these after-school bullying sessions turns Ippo''s life around for the better, as he is saved by a boxer named Takamura. He decides to follow in Takamura''s footsteps and train to become a boxer, giving his life direction and purpose. Ippo''s path to perfecting his pugilistic prowess is just beginning...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LApB9C9kEkh2ZU2vzAhurNDipl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:42705'),
  ('588618931666330509', 'Fighting Youth', 2021, 'Drama', null, 'Chen Lan', 'Wu Jinyan, Yin Tao, Zuo Xiaoqing, Liu Mintao, Peter Ho, Hong Yao, Zhang Tao, Zhang Nan', null, 'Zhang Xiaoyu, a rookie in the corporate world, becomes the secretary of Lin Rui, a top sales director at a renowned cosmetics company. As Lin Rui faces a power struggle against her rival, Fang Jing, Zhang Xiaoyu gets entangled in office politics. Despite the challenges, she proves her talent, grows in her career, and finds love.', 'Zhang Xiaoyu, a rookie in the corporate world, becomes the secretary of Lin Rui, a top sales director at a renowned cosmetics company. As Lin Rui faces a power struggle against her rival, Fang Jing, Zhang Xiaoyu gets entangled in office politics. Despite the challenges, she proves her talent, grows in her career, and finds love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YLW2jiBuWfCxrswlqyDwGkoffw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117476'),
  ('816966484721051895', 'Fights Break Sphere', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Liu Sanmu, Liu Yuxuan, Wan Suwan, Zhu Jun, Chen Yiwen, Yang Menglu, Meme Yan, Xia Lei', 'TV-14', 'In a land where no magic is present. A land where the strong make the rules and weak have to obey. A land filled with alluring treasures and beauty, yet also filled with unforeseen danger. Three years ago, Xiao Yan, who had shown talents none had seen in decades, suddenly lost everything. His powers, his reputation, and his promise to his mother. What sorcery has caused him to lose all of his powers? And why has his fiancee suddenly shown up?', 'In a land where no magic is present. A land where the strong make the rules and weak have to obey. A land filled with alluring treasures and beauty, yet also filled with unforeseen danger. Three years ago, Xiao Yan, who had shown talents none had seen in decades, suddenly lost everything. His powers, his reputation, and his promise to his mother. What sorcery has caused him to lose all of his powers? And why has his fiancee suddenly shown up?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9bJPlezCXF6u0siDxf7cZaSXaJ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:79481'),
  ('793229973399400626', 'Fights Break Sphere', 2018, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, 'Liu An Qi', null, null, 'Once a prodigy, Xiao Yan loses all his powers and becomes the shame of his family—until he awakens a master from his mother’s ring, unlocking his true potential and setting out on a journey of revenge and redemption in the martial world.', 'Once a prodigy, Xiao Yan loses all his powers and becomes the shame of his family—until he awakens a master from his mother’s ring, unlocking his true potential and setting out on a journey of revenge and redemption in the martial world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quF64x6cR0dk38v2Y2kTJKJWU1H.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:81500'),
  ('912818662285700069', 'Fightworld', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Frank Grillo', 'TV-MA', 'Actor and fight enthusiast Frank Grillo travels the world, immersing himself in different fight cultures to understand their traditions and motivations.', 'Actor and fight enthusiast Frank Grillo travels the world, immersing himself in different fight cultures to understand their traditions and motivations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vokgs8npB47yjZmdEhQ4te9BC2y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83061'),
  ('776023898621794799', 'Figure It Out', 1997, 'Comedy, Family', 'Magda Liolis, Kevin Kay', null, 'Jeff Sutphen', null, 'A group of four different panelists popular on Nickelodeon programs try to figure out the talents of different guests. They are given clues that they can feel, see, taste, and also given to them through charades.', 'A group of four different panelists popular on Nickelodeon programs try to figure out the talents of different guests. They are given clues that they can feel, see, taste, and also given to them through charades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiBRp0EIOgTT7i0F2SNz6UO5z8u.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4244'),
  ('195472512065979423', 'Files of the Unexplained', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime, Mystery', null, null, 'Tijuana Ricks', 'TV-14', 'Eerie encounters, bizarre disappearances, haunting events and more perplexing phenomena are explored in this chilling investigative docuseries.', 'Eerie encounters, bizarre disappearances, haunting events and more perplexing phenomena are explored in this chilling investigative docuseries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVj14gwU0bDGTnBC7rA91l60AKh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:248795'),
  ('933611188007229303', 'Filinta: An Ottoman Policeman', 2014, 'Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Altuğ Küçük', null, 'Onur Tuna, Cem Uçan, Kamil Güler, Berrak Tüzünataç, Asena Tuğal, Bülent Alkış, Hakan Yufkacıgil, Suavi Eren', null, '"Carbine" The first Ottoman crime show of television history, -Filinta- is a show that presents notions of rights, justice, camaraderie, fellowship and love. Mustafa is a very smart, skillful, handsome young man. He serves as a policeman with his best friend Ali, who is also an orphan like Mustafa. Kadı Gıyaseddin is a -kadı- (judge) who belongs to a well-established family, and was trained in Damascus, Bukhara, Cairo and Konya from an early age. He is of an easy-going and coolheaded temperament. He shows us his refined wisdom in every scene. He also has trained sultans sons at the palace. He is a former mentor of the Sultan. Our story begins with a conspiracy against Mustafa and Ali.', '"Carbine" The first Ottoman crime show of television history, -Filinta- is a show that presents notions of rights, justice, camaraderie, fellowship and love. Mustafa is a very smart, skillful, handsome young man. He serves as a policeman with his best friend Ali, who is also an orphan like Mustafa. Kadı Gıyaseddin is a -kadı- (judge) who belongs to a well-established family, and was trained in Damascus, Bukhara, Cairo and Konya from an early age. He is of an easy-going and coolheaded temperament. He shows us his refined wisdom in every scene. He also has trained sultans sons at the palace. He is a former mentor of the Sultan. Our story begins with a conspiracy against Mustafa and Ali.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v2WXNBzsXcL21s5V76cBI0uKKlp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:63030'),
  ('929037346644525219', 'Filled With Love', 2010, 'Comedy, Soap', 'Angelli Nesma Medina', null, 'Valentino Lanús, Ariadne Díaz, Gabriela Goldsmith, Diego Amozurrutia, Eduardo Liñán, Raúl Magaña, Michelle Renaud', 'TV-14', 'Llena de amor is a Mexican Spanish-language soap opera, produced by Televisa, that began airing in 2010. It is a remake of the 2002–2003 Venezuelan telenovela Mi Gorda Bella, which itself was inspired by the 1999–2001 Colombian telenovela Yo soy Betty, la fea. Llena de amor is about Marianela, an overweight girl, played by Ariadne Díaz, who is caught up in a set of family intrigues when she moves in with her aunt and uncle after becoming an orphan. The show premiered on May 3, 2010 in Mexico. It is produced by Angelli Nesma Medina. It formally aired in the United States on Univision at 7pm/6pm central from August 9, 2010 to April 19, 2011, replacing Mi Pecado.', 'Llena de amor is a Mexican Spanish-language soap opera, produced by Televisa, that began airing in 2010. It is a remake of the 2002–2003 Venezuelan telenovela Mi Gorda Bella, which itself was inspired by the 1999–2001 Colombian telenovela Yo soy Betty, la fea. Llena de amor is about Marianela, an overweight girl, played by Ariadne Díaz, who is caught up in a set of family intrigues when she moves in with her aunt and uncle after becoming an orphan. The show premiered on May 3, 2010 in Mexico. It is produced by Angelli Nesma Medina. It formally aired in the United States on Univision at 7pm/6pm central from August 9, 2010 to April 19, 2011, replacing Mi Pecado.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znqgav7dkAOxs4OpEz6PedaWxEd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32213'),
  ('919669075895346079', 'Fillmore!', 2002, 'Animation, Mystery, Kids, Comedy', 'Scott M. Gimple', null, 'Orlando Brown, Tara Strong, Horatio Sanz, Wendie Malick, Danny Tamberelli, Kyle Sullivan, Lauren Tom, Jeff Probst', 'TV-Y7', 'Former delinquent Cornelius Fillmore saw the light, and now fights on the side of justice at X Middle School. Joining him is Ingrid Third, who has a photographic memory. Together, Fillmore and Third fight all those who attempt to break the rules at X, all while keeping Jr. Commissioner Vallejo off their backs and trying to please the school''s overly-image-conscious Principal Folsom. Fillmore! is an American animated television series which was produced by Walt Disney Television Animation. The series was created by Scott M. Gimple and directed by Christian Roman. It was the last series produced by Walt Disney Television Animation alone, without association with Disney Channel.', 'Former delinquent Cornelius Fillmore saw the light, and now fights on the side of justice at X Middle School. Joining him is Ingrid Third, who has a photographic memory. Together, Fillmore and Third fight all those who attempt to break the rules at X, all while keeping Jr. Commissioner Vallejo off their backs and trying to please the school''s overly-image-conscious Principal Folsom. Fillmore! is an American animated television series which was produced by Walt Disney Television Animation. The series was created by Scott M. Gimple and directed by Christian Roman. It was the last series produced by Walt Disney Television Animation alone, without association with Disney Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Vl2aYjQ1QlrT5QkfbR1aaDZPtf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1547'),
  ('142895344157656154', 'Film Club', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Aimee Lou Wood, Ralph Davis', null, 'Aimee Lou Wood, Nabhaan Rizwan, Suranne Jones, Adam Long, Liv Hill, Ralph Davis', null, 'Friday night. 7pm. Film Club Week 198. Evie hasn''t left the house in six months after a ''wobble'', and Film Club is her escape. A weekly chance to create a world of wonder, deck the garage out in whatever the movie calls for and spend a few uninterrupted hours with Noa - her best friend and one of the few mates who still shows up. But tonight, things are different. Noa''s got big news. A dream job is taking him across the other side of the country, which means that all of this is ending.', 'Friday night. 7pm. Film Club Week 198. Evie hasn''t left the house in six months after a ''wobble'', and Film Club is her escape. A weekly chance to create a world of wonder, deck the garage out in whatever the movie calls for and spend a few uninterrupted hours with Noa - her best friend and one of the few mates who still shows up. But tonight, things are different. Noa''s got big news. A dream job is taking him across the other side of the country, which means that all of this is ending.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5koeXuj7klU2vfVEbLqYUfd0gqK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276643'),
  ('289806963297932947', 'Film Theory', null, 'Talk, Comedy', 'Matthew Patrick, Tommy Cook', null, null, null, 'Hello Internet! Welcome to FILM THEORY! If you want to learn the secrets of your favorite movies and tv shows, then grab your popcorn because it’s about to get epic! Our blockbuster theories include finding how to survive the scariest film monsters, exploring iconic superhero lore, and diving into the creepiest indie-horror series. Whether it’s streaming on Netflix, straight out of YouTube, or playing in a theater near you, we’re covering the nerdy world of film theories.', 'Hello Internet! Welcome to FILM THEORY! If you want to learn the secrets of your favorite movies and tv shows, then grab your popcorn because it’s about to get epic! Our blockbuster theories include finding how to survive the scariest film monsters, exploring iconic superhero lore, and diving into the creepiest indie-horror series. Whether it’s streaming on Netflix, straight out of YouTube, or playing in a theater near you, we’re covering the nerdy world of film theories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eACzJr2wbR8xB57tPRnHGnxwlTH.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:118234'),
  ('366320956201834215', 'Filter', 2025, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, 'Tong Hua', 'Tan Jianci, Li Landi, Gao Hanyu, Huang Sirui, Chang Long, Jia Ze', null, 'The "Filter Bracelet" allows Su Chengcheng to transform her appearance and use her new identities to help others. As she navigates these changes, she and Tang Qi work together to develop a unique Chinese beauty brand, promoting "natural, confident, real beauty." Through their journey, Su Chengcheng learns that true beauty lies in authenticity and facing challenges with determination.', 'The "Filter Bracelet" allows Su Chengcheng to transform her appearance and use her new identities to help others. As she navigates these changes, she and Tang Qi work together to develop a unique Chinese beauty brand, promoting "natural, confident, real beauty." Through their journey, Su Chengcheng learns that true beauty lies in authenticity and facing challenges with determination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ewcBphUcNqzl5TLJJk4kowMFm35.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243081'),
  ('1109156080604139897', 'Filthy Envy', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carolina Cuervo', null, 'Carolina Cuervo, Ana María Orozco, Cecilia Navia, Yeimy Paola Vargas, Santiago Alarcón, Jacques Toukhmanian, Víctor Mallarino, Claudio Cataño', 'TV-14', 'Four great friends turn a celebration dinner into a complete nightmare; things turn toxic when friendship and envy sit together at the table.', 'Four great friends turn a celebration dinner into a complete nightmare; things turn toxic when friendship and envy sit together at the table.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZ4YjPaYkv57PpwtU8u1EsSkQHV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:210793'),
  ('457010899663499159', 'Filthy Rich', 2020, 'Drama', 'Tate Taylor', null, 'Kim Cattrall, Melia Kreiling, Aubrey Dollar, Corey Cott, Benjamin Levy Aguilar, Mark L. Young, Olivia Macklin, Steve Harris', null, 'When the patriarch of a mega-rich Southern family, famed for creating a wildly successful Christian television network, dies in a plane crash, his wife and family are stunned to learn that he fathered three illegitimate children, all of whom are written into his will, threatening their family name and fortune.', 'When the patriarch of a mega-rich Southern family, famed for creating a wildly successful Christian television network, dies in a plane crash, his wife and family are stunned to learn that he fathered three illegitimate children, all of whom are written into his will, threatening their family name and fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df999yXdxdX5IOeUoEORoLwJrqY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89499'),
  ('55368909617878295', 'Filthy Rich & Catflap', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Ben Elton', null, 'Nigel Planer, Rik Mayall, Adrian Edmondson', null, 'Richie causes trouble in his pursuit of TV fame with Eddie, his alcoholic minder, and Filthy, his sponging agent.', 'Richie causes trouble in his pursuit of TV fame with Eddie, his alcoholic minder, and Filthy, his sponging agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQiMn7gq2QQJmCxT4lKPJK1DH50.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4451'),
  ('511343089165541748', 'Final Approach', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Daisuke Kishio, Sakura Nogawa, Yukari Tamura, Miyu Matsuki, Yuko Minaguchi, Chiaki Takahashi', null, 'Ryou Mizuhara is a normal high school student, living alone with his younger sister Akane. They were very happy together, at least until a mysterious girl crashes into their lives who introduces herself as Ryou''s new fiancée.', 'Ryou Mizuhara is a normal high school student, living alone with his younger sister Akane. They were very happy together, at least until a mysterious girl crashes into their lives who introduces herself as Ryou''s new fiancée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdOVk6FhLdxB8SZ8BEl1ndhVgvC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:25917'),
