  ('996709673072886658', 'First Wave', 1998, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chris Brancato', null, 'Rob LaBelle, Sebastian Spence', null, 'Framed for murder and on the run, a former thief struggles to expose the vanguard of an alien invasion with the help of a conspiracy theorist and newly discovered prophecies of Nostradamus.', 'Framed for murder and on the run, a former thief struggles to expose the vanguard of an alien invasion with the help of a conspiracy theorist and newly discovered prophecies of Nostradamus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/os8qvB3iGLbOGgmHacDLaf1QrHx.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2203'),
  ('1125119083596229237', 'First Wives Club', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Tracy Oliver', null, 'Michelle Buteau, Jill Scott, Mark Tallman, RonReaco Lee, Michelle Mitchenor', null, 'Three women band together after their first marriages fall apart, and find strength in their sisterhood - and of course a little revenge. Based on the 1996 film.', 'Three women band together after their first marriages fall apart, and find strength in their sisterhood - and of course a little revenge. Based on the 1996 film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPuRZBGvrMBbjweAFZ420T6BRwl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:79085'),
  ('185044965764424206', 'Fish Hooks', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Noah Z. Jones', null, 'Kyle Massey, Chelsea Kane, Justin Roiland, Dana Snyder, Alex Hirsch, Tommy Lister Jr., John DiMaggio, Rachel Dratch', 'TV-G', 'This inventive animated comedy series, set inside a giant fish tank in Bud''s Pet Shop, presents high school life as seen through the eyes of three BFFs (best fish friends), Bea, Milo and Oscar. Together they experience the typical life challenges and triumphs, including friendship, dating and sports, along with more atypical situations such as giant lobster attacks and, with the use of special land suits, school field trips to the hamster cages. The series was created by children''s book illustrator Noah Z. Jones and features a notable voice cast. It''s produced using an innovative mixture of digital animation and photo collage', 'This inventive animated comedy series, set inside a giant fish tank in Bud''s Pet Shop, presents high school life as seen through the eyes of three BFFs (best fish friends), Bea, Milo and Oscar. Together they experience the typical life challenges and triumphs, including friendship, dating and sports, along with more atypical situations such as giant lobster attacks and, with the use of special land suits, school field trips to the hamster cages. The series was created by children''s book illustrator Noah Z. Jones and features a notable voice cast. It''s produced using an innovative mixture of digital animation and photo collage', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sejbZwyIgotzTRH9BdYqMKgtgIp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:31499'),
  ('795911764428771554', 'Fish Upon The Sky', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'JittiRain', null, 'Phuwin Tangsakyuen, Naravit Lertratkosum, Sahaphap Wongratch, Thanawin Teeraphosukarn, Trai Nimtawat, Chayapol Jutamas, Thanaset Suriyapornchaikul, Kittiphop Sereevichayasawat', null, 'Total opposites Pi and Mork are love rivals and compete endlessly for the attention of their crush, Nan. Because of this, they get along like water and oil. But what if Nan was never Mork''s real target to begin with?', 'Total opposites Pi and Mork are love rivals and compete endlessly for the attention of their crush, Nan. Because of this, they get along like water and oil. But what if Nan was never Mork''s real target to begin with?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbrZuf9SUGxGjDnUOcePykblRtv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:122017'),
  ('390902113221035516', 'Fishbowl Wives', 2022, 'Drama', 'Ryô Kurosawa', null, 'Ryoko Shinohara, Takanori Iwata, Masanobu Ando, Kyoko Hasegawa, Wakana Matsumoto, Shizuka Nakamura, Saori Seto, Anna Ishii', 'TV-MA', 'Due to an accident, Sakura Hiraga gave up on her dream. She is now married and her husband runs a hair salon. They live in a luxurious penthouse apartment. Her life seems glamorous and she is envied by everyone. What everyone does not know is that Sakura Hiraga is abused physically and verbally by her husband. She is unable to leave her situation. Sakura Hiraga considers herself a goldfish in a fishbowl. One day, due to a goldfish, she meets a man.', 'Due to an accident, Sakura Hiraga gave up on her dream. She is now married and her husband runs a hair salon. They live in a luxurious penthouse apartment. Her life seems glamorous and she is envied by everyone. What everyone does not know is that Sakura Hiraga is abused physically and verbally by her husband. She is unable to leave her situation. Sakura Hiraga considers herself a goldfish in a fishbowl. One day, due to a goldfish, she meets a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2wt5obMk1u0McCiRSL7exFsPmYL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154861'),
  ('456578468507436068', 'Fisher', 2023, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime', null, 'Natalia Kapustina, Sergey Kalvarsky', 'Ivan Yankovsky, Aleksandr Yatsenko, Irina Starshenbaum, Aleksandra Rebenok, Alexey Agranovich, Stepan Devonin, Boris Kamorzin, Dasha Vereshchagina', null, '1986. Teenagers are killed one by one in the area of the government dachas on Rublevskoye Shosse. Intelligent investigator Valery Kozyrev, his audacious partner from Rostov Evgeny Bokov and very young investigator Natalia Dobrovolskaya begin the investigation, not even knowing how much it will change the fate of each of them. The only witness capable of identifying the maniac - schoolboy Igor, whose parents are not at all happy about his son''s contact with the police.', '1986. Teenagers are killed one by one in the area of the government dachas on Rublevskoye Shosse. Intelligent investigator Valery Kozyrev, his audacious partner from Rostov Evgeny Bokov and very young investigator Natalia Dobrovolskaya begin the investigation, not even knowing how much it will change the fate of each of them. The only witness capable of identifying the maniac - schoolboy Igor, whose parents are not at all happy about his son''s contact with the police.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hhiiKNjUofYdcVbukYYgT5itnn.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:220018'),
  ('887166106322435247', 'Fisherman Sanpei', 1980, 'Animation', null, null, 'Masako Nozawa, Nachi Nozawa, Keiko Yamamoto, Kohei Miyauchi, Fuyumi Shiraishi', null, 'Mihira Sanpei talks with a Tohou accent and is a down-to-earth boy with a cheerful and optimistic personality. However, when it comes to fishing, he becomes very serious and is a youth who enjoys fishing more than anything else. The village where he lives in is a natural environment which provides different kinds of fishing challenges. Despite his lack of experience, Sanpei has a first-rate sense with regards to fishing and decides to maxmise his potential by entering into different fishing contests. As he faces various challenges, he learns to solve difficult problems and learn from his mistakes to the extent that he is able to fish anything out of the waters. Along the way, he encounters all kinds of rivals and companions who increase his experience points and help him in his growth.', 'Mihira Sanpei talks with a Tohou accent and is a down-to-earth boy with a cheerful and optimistic personality. However, when it comes to fishing, he becomes very serious and is a youth who enjoys fishing more than anything else. The village where he lives in is a natural environment which provides different kinds of fishing challenges. Despite his lack of experience, Sanpei has a first-rate sense with regards to fishing and decides to maxmise his potential by entering into different fishing contests. As he faces various challenges, he learns to solve difficult problems and learn from his mistakes to the extent that he is able to fish anything out of the waters. Along the way, he encounters all kinds of rivals and companions who increase his experience points and help him in his growth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUyLQczJ1MwAPB1dRbtdguYaFV0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44033'),
  ('277662584223876544', 'Fishing with John', 1991, 'Comedy, Documentary', 'John Lurie', null, 'John Lurie, Robb Webb', null, 'Musician John Lurie knows nothing about fishing, but that doesn''t stop him from embarking on fishing in exotic locations with friends.', 'Musician John Lurie knows nothing about fishing, but that doesn''t stop him from embarking on fishing in exotic locations with friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OwogHlnDsBe2FztirmWIhVHOb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61820'),
  ('931612453081776948', 'Fisk', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kitty Flanagan, Vincent Sheehan', null, 'Kitty Flanagan, Colette Mann, Miki Oikawa', null, 'When Helen Tudor-Fisk''s life falls apart, she takes a job in a small suburban firm specialising in wills and probate assuming that, because the clients are dead she won''t have to deal with people.', 'When Helen Tudor-Fisk''s life falls apart, she takes a job in a small suburban firm specialising in wills and probate assuming that, because the clients are dead she won''t have to deal with people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KM6EDVSjqABv1xN6NGtUBrRN6C.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:121040'),
  ('743705014379233437', 'Fist of Fury', 1995, 'Action & Adventure', 'Lung Shiu-Kee', null, 'Donnie Yen, Joey Man Yee-Man, Eddy Ko Hung, Berg Ng Ting-Yip, Eric Wan Tin-Chiu, David Lau Chi-Wing, Yeung Chak-Lam, Philip Keung Ho-Man', null, 'Fist of Fury is a 1995 Hong Kong television series adapted from the 1972 film of the same title. Produced by ATV and STAR TV, the series starred Donnie Yen as Chen Zhen, a role previously played by Bruce Lee in Fist of Fury and Jet Li in Fist of Legend. The series is also related to the 2010 film Legend of the Fist: The Return of Chen Zhen, in which Yen reprises his role. This series was edited into a 225 minute movie titled Sworn Revenge for the US market in 2002.', 'Fist of Fury is a 1995 Hong Kong television series adapted from the 1972 film of the same title. Produced by ATV and STAR TV, the series starred Donnie Yen as Chen Zhen, a role previously played by Bruce Lee in Fist of Fury and Jet Li in Fist of Legend. The series is also related to the 2010 film Legend of the Fist: The Return of Chen Zhen, in which Yen reprises his role. This series was edited into a 225 minute movie titled Sworn Revenge for the US market in 2002.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekvTjXxMVT9oSW6VkkmSnt58bwk.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:21643'),
  ('458312525639633559', 'Fist of the Blue Sky', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Koichi Yamadera, Yumi Touma, Sumire Uesaka, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Akeno Watanabe, Tomohisa Aso', 'TV-MA', 'Shanghai in the 1930s is a dangerous place. Foreign governments and Chinese factions have carved the city into different quarters, each with its own laws and government, and all rife with corruption. As the major powers vie for political control, the streets are left to local gangs. Life is cheap, and death is always near. In days past, one man walked these mean streets battling the forces of evil. He was known only as Yan Wang, "the King of Death." Few knew who he really was, but many knew that he was a master of Hokuto Shinken - Fist of the North Star - a lethal martial art. He disappeared years ago after dispatching the city''s worst gangsters, and is now rumored to be in Japan. Various people have come to Japan in search of him, but who will find him first?', 'Shanghai in the 1930s is a dangerous place. Foreign governments and Chinese factions have carved the city into different quarters, each with its own laws and government, and all rife with corruption. As the major powers vie for political control, the streets are left to local gangs. Life is cheap, and death is always near. In days past, one man walked these mean streets battling the forces of evil. He was known only as Yan Wang, "the King of Death." Few knew who he really was, but many knew that he was a master of Hokuto Shinken - Fist of the North Star - a lethal martial art. He disappeared years ago after dispatching the city''s worst gangsters, and is now rumored to be in Japan. Various people have come to Japan in search of him, but who will find him first?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60cBEHTmtRZATniXenBV3rHS6x3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:68203'),
  ('400600798564828243', 'Fist of the North Star', 1984, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Akira Kamiya, Takeshi Aono, Koji Totani, Kaneto Shiozawa, Yusaku Yara, Banjo Ginga, Takaya Hashi, Yuriko Yamamoto', 'TV-MA', 'In the year 199X, human civilization has been all but destroyed by a nuclear holocaust.', 'In the year 199X, human civilization has been all but destroyed by a nuclear holocaust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yypGXmBPvyJiD7pOeD2R3q84FlA.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:56387'),
  ('797246569176614730', 'Fist of the North Star: HOKUTO NO KEN', 2026, 'Action & Adventure, Animation', null, null, 'Shunsuke Takeuchi, Daiki Yamashita, Mao Ichimichi, Wataru Takagi, Tsuguo Mogami, Taiten Kusunoki', null, 'In the year 199X, the world was engulfed in nuclear fire!! Yet...humanity somehow survived!! A lone man with seven scars on his chest emerges. His name is Kenshiro, heir to Hokuto Shinken. In a world where only the strong survive, Kenshiro forges a path with his iron fists!', 'In the year 199X, the world was engulfed in nuclear fire!! Yet...humanity somehow survived!! A lone man with seven scars on his chest emerges. His name is Kenshiro, heir to Hokuto Shinken. In a world where only the strong survive, Kenshiro forges a path with his iron fists!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/volCKl2AP5v9oEVOLwQ8pSbF7fA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:295357'),
  ('591980592861622313', 'Fit for TV: The Reality of the Biggest Loser', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Skye Borgman', null, 'Bob Harper, Alison Sweeney, Rob Huizenga, J.D. Roth, Caroline Rhea, Jillian Michaels, Aubrey Gordon', null, 'Takes an inside look at the making of the hit reality TV competition, exploring the good, the bad, and the complicated. Featuring interviews with former contestants, trainers, producers, and health professionals, the documentary examines the show''s approach to transformation, the support systems in place, and the unique challenges of filming reality television.', 'Takes an inside look at the making of the hit reality TV competition, exploring the good, the bad, and the complicated. Featuring interviews with former contestants, trainers, producers, and health professionals, the documentary examines the show''s approach to transformation, the support systems in place, and the unique challenges of filming reality television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxf5rfk5f0qYf3aH7vgh5zwh5Y7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:296549'),
  ('1070290437073881948', 'Five Bedrooms', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nathan Mayfield, Christine Bartlett, Michael Lucas', null, 'Stephen Peacocke, Kat Stewart, Roy Joseph, Katie Robertson, Doris Younane', 'TV-14', 'Five different people at different times of their lives bond at a wedding after being seated together at the singles table. After a few too many drinks, the solution to all of their problems seems to be buying a five-bedroom house together.', 'Five different people at different times of their lives bond at a wedding after being seated together at the singles table. After a few too many drinks, the solution to all of their problems seems to be buying a five-bedroom house together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dY5EXIKFBvB61zaYWvZOIm8up0A.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:89602'),
  ('155210091445121022', 'Five Came Back', 2017, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, 'Mark Harris', 'Meryl Streep, Steven Spielberg, Lawrence Kasdan, Francis Ford Coppola, Paul Greengrass, Guillermo del Toro', 'TV-MA', 'Five acclaimed contemporary directors tell the story of five legendary Hollywood filmmakers who enlisted in the armed forces to document World War II.', 'Five acclaimed contemporary directors tell the story of five legendary Hollywood filmmakers who enlisted in the armed forces to document World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQI1J0MvFmB6pREOyyBaAQpuSAE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70508'),
  ('124469877784537395', 'Five Days', 2007, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Hugh Bonneville, Patrick Malahide, Penelope Wilton, Edward Woodward, David Oyelowo, Sarah Smart, Richard Harrington, Charlie Creed-Miles', 'TV-MA', 'Thriller series which tracks five 24-hour periods in a police investigation.', 'Thriller series which tracks five 24-hour periods in a police investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnRh1Jcn6KAhgVyfVPDLJwgaOSu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4170'),
  ('755430342814156063', 'Five Days at Memorial', 2022, 'Drama', 'Carlton Cuse, John Ridley', null, 'Vera Farmiga, Cherry Jones, Cornelius Smith, Jr., Robert Pine, Adepero Oduye, Julie Ann Emery, Michael Gaston, Molly Hager', 'TV-MA', 'When the floodwaters rose, power failed, and heat soared, exhausted caregivers at a New Orleans hospital were forced to make profound, heart-wrenching decisions.', 'When the floodwaters rose, power failed, and heat soared, exhausted caregivers at a New Orleans hospital were forced to make profound, heart-wrenching decisions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLx44hdSpt9GhP67JafP5sMEoMB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108664'),
  ('455678529719188484', 'Fix You', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ki Min-soo', null, 'Shin Ha-kyun, Jung So-min, Park Ye-jin, Jang Yoo-sang, Jung Hae-kyun, Joo Min-kyung, Choi Jung-woo, Park Soo-young', null, 'A psychiatrist who is passionate about helping his patients does everything he can to help them heal their emotional wounds and find happiness.', 'A psychiatrist who is passionate about helping his patients does everything he can to help them heal their emotional wounds and find happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMI6EzXTEElLJOd6xBeXCdbghYM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:101906'),
  ('824046458064427926', 'Fixer', 2008, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Ben Richards, Neil Cross', null, 'Peter Mullan, Tamzin Outhwaite, Jody Latham, Andrew Buchan', 'TV-PG', 'The Fixer is a British drama television series, produced by Kudos for ITV. Set in modern Britain, it follows the life of John Mercer, an ex-British Special Forces soldier, arrested by police for killing his aunt and uncle following his discovery of their abuse of his sister, Jess Mercer. John Mercer is released early from prison to serve in a covert state security squad as a government-backed assassin responsible for eliminating criminals and renegade police officers that the law cannot apprehend.', 'The Fixer is a British drama television series, produced by Kudos for ITV. Set in modern Britain, it follows the life of John Mercer, an ex-British Special Forces soldier, arrested by police for killing his aunt and uncle following his discovery of their abuse of his sister, Jess Mercer. John Mercer is released early from prison to serve in a covert state security squad as a government-backed assassin responsible for eliminating criminals and renegade police officers that the law cannot apprehend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQFGiQHmbYgeHLDnvq57uDUqFW9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:7151'),
  ('679383761996876064', 'Fixer Upper', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'Chip Gaines, Joanna Gaines', 'TV-G', 'Renovation, design and real estate pros Chip and Joanna Gaines are paired with Waco/Dallas, Texas-area buyers to renovate the wrong house that''s in the right location.', 'Renovation, design and real estate pros Chip and Joanna Gaines are paired with Waco/Dallas, Texas-area buyers to renovate the wrong house that''s in the right location.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mpxlr6yMBBA9VlzMcJTP2KZZBN1.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:60911'),
  ('326470190265023517', 'Flack', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Oliver Lansley', null, 'Anna Paquin, Sophie Okonedo, Rufus Jones, Rebecca Benson, Lydia Wilson, Genevieve Angelson, Meghan Treadway', 'TV-MA', 'Robyn, the sharp and witty publicity maven, is an expert at her craft but a complete self-saboteur when it comes to her personal life. Robyn’s work as a crisis PR strategist is fast-paced and unpredictable, as she counsels high-profile personalities in entertainment, fashion and sports.', 'Robyn, the sharp and witty publicity maven, is an expert at her craft but a complete self-saboteur when it comes to her personal life. Robyn’s work as a crisis PR strategist is fast-paced and unpredictable, as she counsels high-profile personalities in entertainment, fashion and sports.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2bW3nZE8iThEgqNYjaxAz3qZoo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86632'),
  ('613448377156081053', 'Flaked', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Will Arnett, Mark Chappell', null, 'Will Arnett, David Sullivan, Ruth Kearney, George Basil', 'TV-MA', 'In his funky California beach enclave, Chip''s the go-to guy for personal insights. But he isn''t quite as enlightened when it comes to his own baggage.', 'In his funky California beach enclave, Chip''s the go-to guy for personal insights. But he isn''t quite as enlightened when it comes to his own baggage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8zzGClqvkpPUc2wxZLrA89sSjB.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65315'),
  ('297775487943671832', 'Flame of Recca', 1997, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Nobuyuki Anzai', 'Kousuke Okano, Yuki Masuda, Akiko Hiramatsu, Hikaru Midorikawa, Nobuo Tobita, Motoko Kumai, Ryotaro Okiayu, Kotono Mitsuishi', null, 'Recca was an average ordinary boy, who happened to like ninjas. One day as an dark and mysterious women enters his life, Recca finds that he has some extraordinary powers. Now he must use these powers to protect his friends and himself from a long lost brother, who holds a hatred against him.', 'Recca was an average ordinary boy, who happened to like ninjas. One day as an dark and mysterious women enters his life, Recca finds that he has some extraordinary powers. Now he must use these powers to protect his friends and himself from a long lost brother, who holds a hatred against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vywtHxLB4CnB2hVrevZ9eEqh33s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42692'),
  ('1104804768965619209', 'FLAMES', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kunal Aneja, Apoorv Singh Karki', 'Swarnadeep Biswas, Saket sharma', 'Ritwik Sahore, Tanya Maniktala, Sunakshi Grover, Shivam Kakar, Deepesh Sumitra Jagdish', null, 'The story of a young romance unfolding as a chemical reaction. There is no such love as ''First Love''.', 'The story of a young romance unfolding as a chemical reaction. There is no such love as ''First Love''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8Nq7YiYcgbLdcBMbxUmHfcYBwM.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:76369'),
  ('831290259845518157', 'Flaming Brothers', 1999, 'Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Michael Tao Tai-Yu, Kristy Yang Rongru, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Patrick Tam Yiu-Man, Deanie Ip, Shek Sau, Nina Paw Hei-Ching, Lawrence Lau Sek-Yin', null, 'Lai Siu Tin is the spoilt son of a very rich woman who is not his real mother. Ming Chi Git is the son of Ming Sing, a poor, uneducated woman who came from China. Both of this men would never have known each other if not for the fact that they both share the same mother and father. Set in modern Hong Kong, it is a tale of rivalry, jealousy, bitter hatred of two brothers and their mother who is caught between her love for two sons.', 'Lai Siu Tin is the spoilt son of a very rich woman who is not his real mother. Ming Chi Git is the son of Ming Sing, a poor, uneducated woman who came from China. Both of this men would never have known each other if not for the fact that they both share the same mother and father. Set in modern Hong Kong, it is a tale of rivalry, jealousy, bitter hatred of two brothers and their mother who is caught between her love for two sons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VcbDfb0CzX0UzNEg6QEUruXXnK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48173'),
  ('1102893198944182560', 'Flaming Feasts', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Set your appetite ablaze as Chris ‘Flamebaster’ Roberts cooks his way across Wales. From top restaurants to local takeaways, it''s all about fire, food and fusion.', 'Set your appetite ablaze as Chris ‘Flamebaster’ Roberts cooks his way across Wales. From top restaurants to local takeaways, it''s all about fire, food and fusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lw2tSb4jUrcQTqWfI6NWhXS8NQ6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:316976'),
  ('1051645502929806948', 'Flaming Rugby Boy: Dodge Danpei', 1991, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXi2AzHsWuxN6Wf6FzPM8HrVIoS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:37450'),
  ('722534303829105962', 'Flamingo Road', 1981, 'Soap, Drama', 'Rita Lakin, Robert Wilder', null, 'John Beck, Woody Brown, Howard Duff, Morgan Fairchild, Mark Harmon, Kevin McCarthy, Cristina Raines, Barbara Rush', null, 'Flamingo Road is an American prime time soap opera that aired on NBC. It was first seen as a TV movie on May 12, 1980, and as a series on January 6, 1981, after a rebroadcast of the pilot on December 30, 1980. The show is based on the 1949 movie starring Joan Crawford, which is, in turn, based on the novel by Robert Wilder. Flamingo Road was created to compete against CBS''s Dallas and Knots Landing, nighttime dramas that were inspired by the daily afternoon soap operas that had been a staple of TV for years. The character of Constance Weldon ranked at #16 on E!''s list of The 50 Most Wicked Women in Primetime.', 'Flamingo Road is an American prime time soap opera that aired on NBC. It was first seen as a TV movie on May 12, 1980, and as a series on January 6, 1981, after a rebroadcast of the pilot on December 30, 1980. The show is based on the 1949 movie starring Joan Crawford, which is, in turn, based on the novel by Robert Wilder. Flamingo Road was created to compete against CBS''s Dallas and Knots Landing, nighttime dramas that were inspired by the daily afternoon soap operas that had been a staple of TV for years. The character of Constance Weldon ranked at #16 on E!''s list of The 50 Most Wicked Women in Primetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSwMFcAmzHAj6WX45GBwLE2SncG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2006'),
  ('1078441251722190072', 'Flash Gordon', 1979, 'Animation', null, null, 'Robert Ridgely, Vic Perrin, Bob Holt, Alan Oppenheimer, Diane Pershing, Melendy Britt', null, 'The New Adventures of Flash Gordon, also known as The Adventures of Flash Gordon, is an animated television series. The series is actually called Flash Gordon but the expanded title is used in official records to distinguish it from previous versions. Filmation produced the series in 1979, partly as a reaction to the mammoth success of Star Wars Episode IV: A New Hope in 1977. The series was a homage to the original Flash Gordon comic strip and featured most of the original characters, including Flash''s girlfriend Dale Arden, and the scientist Hans Zarkov. The series is still regarded as one of the most faithful adaptations, and one of Filmation''s finest overall efforts. The basic story follows Flash and his companions as they travel to Mongo, where they are forced into battle by its ruler, Ming the Merciless, his daughter Princess Aura, and his army of Metal Men. To help their cause the heroes lead the formation of an alliance beginning with King Thun, leader of the Lion People; Prince Barin, ruler of Arboria; and King Vultan, leader of the Hawkmen. The original project was produced as a made-for-television feature film. When NBC saw the finished work, it was decided to turn the work into an animated TV series. The change in format resulted in the story being significantly expanded with a subplot of Ming secretly giving military technology to Hitler being dropped, as well as being set in the present day rather during World War II. When the series was cancelled after its 2nd season, the original footage was reassembled with the original soundtrack, including the final role of Ted Cassidy, and aired on primetime in 1982 as a TV movie, Flash Gordon: The Greatest Adventure of All.', 'The New Adventures of Flash Gordon, also known as The Adventures of Flash Gordon, is an animated television series. The series is actually called Flash Gordon but the expanded title is used in official records to distinguish it from previous versions. Filmation produced the series in 1979, partly as a reaction to the mammoth success of Star Wars Episode IV: A New Hope in 1977. The series was a homage to the original Flash Gordon comic strip and featured most of the original characters, including Flash''s girlfriend Dale Arden, and the scientist Hans Zarkov. The series is still regarded as one of the most faithful adaptations, and one of Filmation''s finest overall efforts. The basic story follows Flash and his companions as they travel to Mongo, where they are forced into battle by its ruler, Ming the Merciless, his daughter Princess Aura, and his army of Metal Men. To help their cause the heroes lead the formation of an alliance beginning with King Thun, leader of the Lion People; Prince Barin, ruler of Arboria; and King Vultan, leader of the Hawkmen. The original project was produced as a made-for-television feature film. When NBC saw the finished work, it was decided to turn the work into an animated TV series. The change in format resulted in the story being significantly expanded with a subplot of Ming secretly giving military technology to Hitler being dropped, as well as being set in the present day rather during World War II. When the series was cancelled after its 2nd season, the original footage was reassembled with the original soundtrack, including the final role of Ted Cassidy, and aired on primetime in 1982 as a TV movie, Flash Gordon: The Greatest Adventure of All.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/phFEsFPIT5DCQGdOSrtgJrLsSxK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:11844'),
  ('264154370529394276', 'Flash Gordon', 2007, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Peter Hume', null, 'Eric Johnson, Gina Holden, Karen Cliche, Jody Racicot, John Ralston', null, 'Flash Gordon is an American science fiction television series that debuted on Sci Fi in the United States on August 10, 2007 and continued airing new episodes through February 8, 2008. It has also appeared on the United Kingdom Sci Fi Channel and SPACE in Canada. The series was developed by Peter Hume, who served as executive producer/show runner and wrote the first and last episodes, among others.', 'Flash Gordon is an American science fiction television series that debuted on Sci Fi in the United States on August 10, 2007 and continued airing new episodes through February 8, 2008. It has also appeared on the United Kingdom Sci Fi Channel and SPACE in Canada. The series was developed by Peter Hume, who served as executive producer/show runner and wrote the first and last episodes, among others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kKqbxsXSzW1H6Se46mOcZm7Rhy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1225'),
  ('808463914850646517', 'FlashForward', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'David S. Goyer, Brannon Braga', 'Jacob Cooney', 'Joseph Fiennes, John Cho, Courtney B. Vance, Dominic Monaghan, Sonya Walger, Jack Davenport, Brían F. O''Byrne, Zachary Knighton', 'TV-14', 'When the entire world blacks out for two minutes and seventeen seconds, everyone sees a flash of their own future 6 months from the present. For some, the future is hopeful, while for others, it is unexpected. For a few, it doesn''t seem to exist. Knowing their fate will alter each person''s life, destinies will be changed.', 'When the entire world blacks out for two minutes and seventeen seconds, everyone sees a flash of their own future 6 months from the present. For some, the future is hopeful, while for others, it is unexpected. For a few, it doesn''t seem to exist. Knowing their fate will alter each person''s life, destinies will be changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7iu2HJ8ZSNbBgFLi42JNcuPjBax.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19092'),
  ('485283271904841990', 'Flashpoint', 2008, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Stephanie Morgenstern, Mark Ellis', null, 'David Paetkau, Enrico Colantoni, Amy Jo Johnson, Hugh Dillon, Sergio Di Zio, Tattiawna Jones, Jack Knight, Oluniké Adeliyi', 'TV-14', 'The Strategic Response Unit (SRU) is an elite team of cops who specialize in high-risk critical incidents. Trained in tactics and psychology, they deal with extreme situations, where split-second decisions could save a life...or cost one.', 'The Strategic Response Unit (SRU) is an elite team of cops who specialize in high-risk critical incidents. Trained in tactics and psychology, they deal with extreme situations, where split-second decisions could save a life...or cost one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Bp3vJrPxnrN8iRDaclsVUPwgWa.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:5829'),
  ('651678537743870874', 'Flatbush Misdemeanors', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kevin Iso, Dan Perlman', null, 'Kevin Iso, Dan Perlman, Hassan Johnson, Kristin Dodson, Kareem Green', 'TV-MA', 'Neighborhood best friends and urban millennials Dan and Kevin hilariously climb the ladder to nowhere in Flatbush, Brooklyn. But even inside the losing, they find there are little wins that come from tackling hipsters, mental health issues and the rising tide of gentrification.', 'Neighborhood best friends and urban millennials Dan and Kevin hilariously climb the ladder to nowhere in Flatbush, Brooklyn. But even inside the losing, they find there are little wins that come from tackling hipsters, mental health issues and the rising tide of gentrification.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxvxx9NjQbl3nPCIP1v6uu2xx6T.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:111500'),
  ('583210812391584677', 'Flavor of Love', 2006, 'Reality', 'Mark Cronin, Cris Abrego', null, 'Flavor Flav', null, 'Twenty single women move into a mansion in Los Angeles and compete for the affections of Flavor Flav, who decides who is his one true love.', 'Twenty single women move into a mansion in Los Angeles and compete for the affections of Flavor Flav, who decides who is his one true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3MuUDvrjkgyl6bUODTslZMgl32.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1776'),
  ('291952785972150142', 'Flavorful Origins', 2019, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Yang Chen', 'TV-G', 'Embark on a delightful journey through the culinary traditions of China and uncover the stories of the people who create and cherish its dishes.', 'Embark on a delightful journey through the culinary traditions of China and uncover the stories of the people who create and cherish its dishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgoiOgmQ0zi3Eq5q3FxxGy8gBbF.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:86742'),
  ('261191914708012224', 'FLCL', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jun Mizuki, Mayumi Shintani, Izumi Kasagi', 'TV-14', 'Naota is a normal boy who kills some time with a normal girl by a stream that flows underneath a bridge. Nothing unusual happens in this town. The fact that Haruhara Haruko crashes into the main character with her Vespa a short while later and subsequently hits him over the head with her Rickenbacker 4003 bass guitar doesn’t really make any difference to any other day here. The at first glance unconnected, bizarre events that don’t seem to follow any pattern whatsoever don’t change anything about Naota’s boring life, either – because nothing incredible ever happens in this town.', 'Naota is a normal boy who kills some time with a normal girl by a stream that flows underneath a bridge. Nothing unusual happens in this town. The fact that Haruhara Haruko crashes into the main character with her Vespa a short while later and subsequently hits him over the head with her Rickenbacker 4003 bass guitar doesn’t really make any difference to any other day here. The at first glance unconnected, bizarre events that don’t seem to follow any pattern whatsoever don’t change anything about Naota’s boring life, either – because nothing incredible ever happens in this town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FkgA8CcmiLJGVCRYRQ2g2UfVtF.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:5895'),
  ('90475101679521416', 'Fleabag', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Phoebe Waller-Bridge', null, 'Phoebe Waller-Bridge, Sian Clifford, Andrew Scott', 'TV-MA', 'A portrait into the mind of a dry-witted, sexual, angry, porn-watching, grief-riddled woman, trying to make sense of the world. As she hurls herself headlong at modern living, Fleabag is thrown roughly up against the walls of contemporary London, with all its frenetic energy, late nights, and bright lights.', 'A portrait into the mind of a dry-witted, sexual, angry, porn-watching, grief-riddled woman, trying to make sense of the world. As she hurls herself headlong at modern living, Fleabag is thrown roughly up against the walls of contemporary London, with all its frenetic energy, late nights, and bright lights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27vEYsRKa3eAniwmoccOoluEXQ1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67070'),
  ('335693071250212510', 'Fleeting Lies', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nerea Castro', null, 'Elena Anaya, Pilar Castro, Hugo Silva, Quim Gutiérrez, Susi Sánchez, María Botto, Pedro Casablanc, Estefanía de los Santos', null, 'It follows Lucía an executive of a high-tech company who has fought to get as far away from her humble origins as possible. On the day of her promotion, she is accused of espionage and fired.', 'It follows Lucía an executive of a high-tech company who has fought to get as far away from her humble origins as possible. On the day of her promotion, she is accused of espionage and fired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etkB5WuxoVuZPs7FSHxfSUAP7lU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:224673'),
  ('185845909369765364', 'Fleishman Is in Trouble', 2022, 'Drama', 'Taffy Brodesser-Akner', null, 'Jesse Eisenberg, Claire Danes, Lizzy Caplan, Adam Brody, Meara Mahoney Gross, Maxim Swinton', 'TV-MA', 'Recently separated forty-something Toby Fleishman dives into the brave new world of app-based dating with the kind of success he never had dating in his youth. But just at the start of his first summer of sexual freedom, his ex-wife disappears, leaving him with the kids and no hint of where she is or whether she plans to return.', 'Recently separated forty-something Toby Fleishman dives into the brave new world of app-based dating with the kind of success he never had dating in his youth. But just at the start of his first summer of sexual freedom, his ex-wife disappears, leaving him with the kids and no hint of where she is or whether she plans to return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxDaeEiH3JeACOTQdiZys8tse7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:156401'),
  ('42853798611815816', 'Fleming', 2014, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, null, 'Dominic Cooper, Lara Pulver, Samuel West, Anna Chancellor, Rupert Evans, Lesley Manville, Pip Torrens, Camilla Rutherford', 'TV-MA', 'Set at the outbreak of WWII – mischievous playboy Ian Fleming is untroubled by the specter of impending war – chasing women, collecting rare books and living off his family fortune. Forever in the shadow of his brother Peter, and an eternal disappointment to his formidable mother Eve, Fleming dreams of becoming the ‘ultimate’ man – a hero, a lover, a brute and the one who always gets the girl. He is finally given some direction in his life when he’s recruited by the Director of Naval Intelligence to help in the effort against the Nazis. Suddenly, Fleming finds his chance to shine and prove his worth.', 'Set at the outbreak of WWII – mischievous playboy Ian Fleming is untroubled by the specter of impending war – chasing women, collecting rare books and living off his family fortune. Forever in the shadow of his brother Peter, and an eternal disappointment to his formidable mother Eve, Fleming dreams of becoming the ‘ultimate’ man – a hero, a lover, a brute and the one who always gets the girl. He is finally given some direction in his life when he’s recruited by the Director of Naval Intelligence to help in the effort against the Nazis. Suddenly, Fleming finds his chance to shine and prove his worth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ap2RdhXi8mEGsGrgfPpsVF01mSZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60602'),
  ('275700862322510124', 'Flesh and Blood', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Sarah Williams', 'Sarah Williams', 'Imelda Staunton, Francesca Annis, Claudie Blakley, Russell Tovey, Lydia Leonard, Stephen Rea, Sharon Small, Keir Charles', 'TV-14', 'Three adult siblings find their family thrown into disarray when their recently widowed mother, Vivien, declares she is in love with a new man. The tension his presence creates threatens to drag the whole family towards tragedy, and perhaps crime.', 'Three adult siblings find their family thrown into disarray when their recently widowed mother, Vivien, declares she is in love with a new man. The tension his presence creates threatens to drag the whole family towards tragedy, and perhaps crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MZv8kEMPWkpjECLbg5S1dQzYnE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:31035'),
  ('394297989208029257', 'Flesh and Bone', 2015, 'Drama', 'Moira Walley-Beckett', 'Moira Walley-Beckett, Jami O''Brien, Bronwyn Garrity', 'Sarah Hay, Irina Dvorovenko, Raychel Diane Weiner, Emily Tyra, Ben Daniels, Damon Herriman, Tina Benko, Clifton Duncan', 'TV-MA', 'Claire, a talented but emotionally troubled dancer, joins a company in New York City, and soon finds herself immersed in the tough and often cutthroat world of professional ballet. The dark and gritty series will unflinchingly explore the dysfunction and glamour of the ballet world.', 'Claire, a talented but emotionally troubled dancer, joins a company in New York City, and soon finds herself immersed in the tough and often cutthroat world of professional ballet. The dark and gritty series will unflinchingly explore the dysfunction and glamour of the ballet world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yP4vPgb7Inpmhxgy9iTEsy1faSy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62516'),
  ('475458747577522348', 'Fletchers'' Family Farm', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Kelvin Fletcher', null, 'Kelvin Fletcher and his family share an intimate insight into rural life.', 'Kelvin Fletcher and his family share an intimate insight into rural life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ifc1eZqBtVlgZN16RZblkWggzj.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:237758'),
  ('387598198008210034', 'Flex x Cop', 2024, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Action & Adventure', 'Lee Ok-gyu', 'Kim Ba-da', 'Ahn Bo-hyun, Park Ji-hyun, Kang Sang-jun, Kim Shin-bi, Kwak Si-yang, Choi Dong-goo, Jeon Hye-jin, Lee Shi-a', null, 'A chaebol cop joins forces with a gritty detective to take down criminals with a touch of wealth and a whole lot of wit.', 'A chaebol cop joins forces with a gritty detective to take down criminals with a touch of wealth and a whole lot of wit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEuuCZb7PsVzRYJ1DiWJZ7QYFqn.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:220074'),
  ('1064756627822534358', 'Flight 29 Down', 2005, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Stan Rogow, D.J. MacHale', null, 'Allen Alvarado, Corbin Bleu, Hallee Hirsh, Jeremy Kissner, Johnny Pacar, Kristy Wu, Lauren Storm', 'TV-Y7', 'Some teenagers are stranded on a desert island in Micronesia. Their plane crashed and led them into a one-in-a-lifetime eco-adventure. They will have to learn to navigate the challenges that come before them in the tropical paradise in Hawaii using intelligence, wit, and instincts. They also have to learn to live with each other.', 'Some teenagers are stranded on a desert island in Micronesia. Their plane crashed and led them into a one-in-a-lifetime eco-adventure. They will have to learn to navigate the challenges that come before them in the tropical paradise in Hawaii using intelligence, wit, and instincts. They also have to learn to live with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gNI4PCGldy4kzi0nD5FQrLBuL5d.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1732'),
  ('1010867962787447267', 'Flight HS13', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Elle van Rijn', 'Katja Schuurman, Daniël Boissevain, Jeroen Spitzenberger, Annelies Appelhof, Reinout Bussemaker, Roos Ouwehand, Ali Ben Horsting, Sachli Gholamalizad', null, 'Mourning the death of her husband Simon, supposedly killed in a plane crash, Liv is shocked to discover that Simon lied to her and was not a passenger on the tragic flight. Seeking the truth surrounding her husband’s mysterious disappearance, Liv uncovers secrets that threaten to destroy her entire family…', 'Mourning the death of her husband Simon, supposedly killed in a plane crash, Liv is shocked to discover that Simon lied to her and was not a passenger on the tragic flight. Seeking the truth surrounding her husband’s mysterious disappearance, Liv uncovers secrets that threaten to destroy her entire family…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mD9Aao94K4AkGfqbIw9odk5PWd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67729'),
  ('177481304360564353', 'Flight of the Conchords', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Jemaine Clement, Bret McKenzie, James Bobin', null, 'Bret McKenzie, Jemaine Clement, Rhys Darby, Kristen Schaal', 'TV-MA', 'The trials and tribulations of a two man, digi-folk band who have moved from New Zealand to New York City in the hope of forging a successful music career. So far they''ve managed to find a manager (whose "other" job is at the New Zealand Consulate), one fan (a married obsessive) and one friend (who owns the local pawn shop) -- but not much else.', 'The trials and tribulations of a two man, digi-folk band who have moved from New Zealand to New York City in the hope of forging a successful music career. So far they''ve managed to find a manager (whose "other" job is at the New Zealand Consulate), one fan (a married obsessive) and one friend (who owns the local pawn shop) -- but not much else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynboK8qiOTz0X44r59LpfF8jBP5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2742'),
  ('663437184940928019', 'Flikken', 1999, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Pierre De Clercq, Erwin Provoost', null, 'Mark Tijsmans, Jo De Meyere, Ludo Hellinx, Ianka Fleerackers, Pascale Michiels, Roel Vanderstukken', null, 'Flikken was a popular Flemish-Belgian TV series about a police-department located in Ghent. The show started in 1999 and ended recently on 19 April 2009. In the series, a team of six police officers solved various crimes, petty crimes as well as organised crime. The series always aimed at showing the policework in a realistic way - though a little personal drama was never far off. Of all the actors that came along during the ten seasons, only Mark Tijsmans and Ludo Hellinx appeared throughout the entire series. Flikken was produced by the VRT and broadcast on Belgian public channel Eén and TROS in the Netherlands. Flikken is very popular in Belgium and the Netherlands. The show has had very high ratings of up to 1.8 million viewers during the last season. Every year the VRT organises the Flikkendag, a family day where the public can meet the actors of the show. There are many games, demonstrations of the real police and other safety organisations and performances of singers. On 18 April 2009, a special farewell party was organised in Ghent, in which the actors and crew said goodbye to their fans - thousands had assembled to watch the show on stage.', 'Flikken was a popular Flemish-Belgian TV series about a police-department located in Ghent. The show started in 1999 and ended recently on 19 April 2009. In the series, a team of six police officers solved various crimes, petty crimes as well as organised crime. The series always aimed at showing the policework in a realistic way - though a little personal drama was never far off. Of all the actors that came along during the ten seasons, only Mark Tijsmans and Ludo Hellinx appeared throughout the entire series. Flikken was produced by the VRT and broadcast on Belgian public channel Eén and TROS in the Netherlands. Flikken is very popular in Belgium and the Netherlands. The show has had very high ratings of up to 1.8 million viewers during the last season. Every year the VRT organises the Flikkendag, a family day where the public can meet the actors of the show. There are many games, demonstrations of the real police and other safety organisations and performances of singers. On 18 April 2009, a special farewell party was organised in Ghent, in which the actors and crew said goodbye to their fans - thousands had assembled to watch the show on stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2PX8TBybnWPajHER2qU7zX56ctV.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:12908'),
  ('394089312267831628', 'Flikken Maastricht', 2007, 'Crime, Action & Adventure', 'Reinout Oerlemans', null, 'Angela Schijf, Oda Spelbos, Sergio Romero IJssel, Irma Hartog', 'NR', 'Former Amsterdam police detective Floris Wolfs has been transferred to the police department of the south-Dutch country town Maastricht. His metropolitan experience nicely complements the local expertise of his new country colleagues, who know the folks. Slowly he fits in, while solving countless crimes together with his female partner Eva van Dongen.', 'Former Amsterdam police detective Floris Wolfs has been transferred to the police department of the south-Dutch country town Maastricht. His metropolitan experience nicely complements the local expertise of his new country colleagues, who know the folks. Slowly he fits in, while solving countless crimes together with his female partner Eva van Dongen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lUoL2MxJJJlV8O35bwfUANdrsb6.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:26324'),
  ('608009170310794762', 'Flikken Rotterdam', 2016, 'Crime', null, null, 'Mark van Eeuwen, Cees Geel, Huub Stapel, Ortál Vriend, Anneke Sluiters', null, 'Flikken Rotterdam takes place in Rotterdam, and is after Flikken Maastricht the second Dutch spin-off of the Flemish show Flikken.', 'Flikken Rotterdam takes place in Rotterdam, and is after Flikken Maastricht the second Dutch spin-off of the Flemish show Flikken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jFvhgG7je9LwQQ7YkevnipXbyhL.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:64175'),
  ('652546314677589732', 'Flinch', 2019, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Lloyd Griffith, Seann Walsh', 'TV-PG', 'Harrowing and hilarious tests await the brave and foolhardy, as well as the judges, in this comedy game show. If they flinch, they feel the pain.', 'Harrowing and hilarious tests await the brave and foolhardy, as well as the judges, in this comedy game show. If they flinch, they feel the pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4XmsoAY91wEyPH1DhEc1bAXLjb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:89005'),
  ('1032795909300013068', 'Flinderella', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Soap', 'Cris Morena', 'Walter Ferreyra Ramos, Gabriela Fiore, Solange Keoleyan', 'Florencia Bertotti, Benjamín Rojas, Fabio Di Tomaso, Isabel Macedo, Stéfano de Gregorio, Lali Espósito, Henny Trayles, Agustín Sierra', 'NR', 'Florencia is a singer and orphan, who falls in love with Federico, a businessman. They will be able to overcome all obstacles, but their love will take an unexpected turn.', 'Florencia is a singer and orphan, who falls in love with Federico, a businessman. They will be able to overcome all obstacles, but their love will take an unexpected turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHpGf342KoTemqxiGCtZw0pejqm.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:1446'),
  ('463446690554759093', 'Flint Town', 2018, 'Documentary, Crime, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Timothy Johnson, Bridgette Balasko, Devon Bernritter, John Boismier, Esther Campbell, Robert Frost, Dion Reed, Maria Reed', 'TV-MA', 'Over a two-year period, filmmakers embedded with cops in Flint, Michigan, reveal a department grappling with volatile issues in untenable conditions.', 'Over a two-year period, filmmakers embedded with cops in Flint, Michigan, reveal a department grappling with volatile issues in untenable conditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkQja9qgd4GB0ZdZBk7uYp9SlLI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77591'),
  ('644447883695007469', 'Flip Flappers', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Minami Takahashi, Mao Ichimichi, Ayaka Ohashi, Airi Toshino, Sayaka Inoue, Jun Fukushima, Kenjiro Tsuda, Yoko Hikasa', 'TV-14', 'How does the world look in your eyes? Papika and Cocona, the heroines of the story, hold the keys to open the door. When the two girls meet, their adventures in a different time and different overlapping dimension called "Pure Illusion" begin. Many things in Pure Illusion will stand in the girls'' way on their search for the mysterious crystal called the "Shard of Mimi," an item that is said to grant any wish. However, when the girls find themselves in danger, the Shard of Mimi shines, and they are able to transform.', 'How does the world look in your eyes? Papika and Cocona, the heroines of the story, hold the keys to open the door. When the two girls meet, their adventures in a different time and different overlapping dimension called "Pure Illusion" begin. Many things in Pure Illusion will stand in the girls'' way on their search for the mysterious crystal called the "Shard of Mimi," an item that is said to grant any wish. However, when the girls find themselves in danger, the Shard of Mimi shines, and they are able to transform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMtCTs0ZRA4rRGne5PPO2iZm4SP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68272'),
  ('413078697537102635', 'Flip or Flop', 2013, 'Reality', null, null, 'Tarek El Moussa, Christina Hall', 'TV-G', 'Tarek and Christina El Moussa buy distressed properties -- foreclosures, short sales and bank-owned homes -- remodel them and sell them at a profit. At least, that''s the way it''s supposed to work. Track the El Moussas'' roller-coaster journey in each episode, beginning with a cash purchase at auction of a home -- often sight unseen -- and the fix-it-up process, to the nail-biting wait to find a buyer.', 'Tarek and Christina El Moussa buy distressed properties -- foreclosures, short sales and bank-owned homes -- remodel them and sell them at a profit. At least, that''s the way it''s supposed to work. Track the El Moussas'' roller-coaster journey in each episode, beginning with a cash purchase at auction of a home -- often sight unseen -- and the fix-it-up process, to the nail-biting wait to find a buyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgbymM0HJrXZVFHPCSXD6XmKkUo.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:62618'),
  ('652648863956624759', 'Flipped', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Steve Mallory, Damon Jones', null, 'Will Forte, Kaitlin Olson, Arturo Castro, Andy Garcia, Eva Longoria', 'TV-MA', 'Chronically underemployed couple Jann and Cricket Melfi are self-proclaimed home renovation “experts” who are more than confident they are television’s next great home design celebrity duo. The clueless pair''s dreams of basic cable fame and glory are derailed when they get themselves kidnapped by members of a drug cartel and are forced to renovate their sprawling homes.', 'Chronically underemployed couple Jann and Cricket Melfi are self-proclaimed home renovation “experts” who are more than confident they are television’s next great home design celebrity duo. The clueless pair''s dreams of basic cable fame and glory are derailed when they get themselves kidnapped by members of a drug cartel and are forced to renovate their sprawling homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vdak857enxBFq19mlNYsNx04SiQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98923'),
  ('128266005550282599', 'Flipper', 1964, 'Action & Adventure, Family, Drama', 'Ricou Browning, Jack Cowden', null, 'Luke Halpin, Brian Kelly, Tommy Norden, Andy Devine', 'TV-G', 'Flipper, from Ivan Tors Films in association with Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Television, is an American television program first broadcast on NBC from September 19, 1964, until April 15, 1967. Flipper, a bottlenose dolphin, is the companion animal of Porter Ricks, Chief Warden at fictional Coral Key Park and Marine Preserve in southern Florida, and his two young sons, Sandy and Bud. The show has been dubbed an "aquatic Lassie", and a considerable amount of juvenile merchandise inspired by the show was produced during its first-run.', 'Flipper, from Ivan Tors Films in association with Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Television, is an American television program first broadcast on NBC from September 19, 1964, until April 15, 1967. Flipper, a bottlenose dolphin, is the companion animal of Porter Ricks, Chief Warden at fictional Coral Key Park and Marine Preserve in southern Florida, and his two young sons, Sandy and Bud. The show has been dubbed an "aquatic Lassie", and a considerable amount of juvenile merchandise inspired by the show was produced during its first-run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/20EltUp6f3dqY3YQBcVY8T2scuH.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:2886'),
  ('222586842094804418', 'Flipper', 1995, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Ernie Wallengren, Michael Nankin, Reuben Leder', null, 'Whip Hubley, Anja Coleby, Gus Mercurio, Darrin Klimek, Tiffany Lamb, Craig Marriott, Laura Donaldson, Skye Patch', 'TV-G', 'Flipper is a 1995–2000 American family adventure drama series developed by E.F. Wallengren, Michael Nankin and Reuben Leder, a sequel to Jack Cowden''s 1964–67 NBC series of the same name. In and around the Bal Harbor Institute, a marine mammal research facility in beautiful Florida Keys, groundbreaking studies are being conducted on dolphin behavior and everyone''s favorite dolphin finds adventure.', 'Flipper is a 1995–2000 American family adventure drama series developed by E.F. Wallengren, Michael Nankin and Reuben Leder, a sequel to Jack Cowden''s 1964–67 NBC series of the same name. In and around the Bal Harbor Institute, a marine mammal research facility in beautiful Florida Keys, groundbreaking studies are being conducted on dolphin behavior and everyone''s favorite dolphin finds adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqlE8PFHg7trmNoN02pmGre87iK.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:6223'),
  ('820169645669152523', 'Flipper and Lopaka', 1999, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Family, Comedy', null, null, 'Keith Scott', null, 'Flipper and Lopaka follows the adventures of Lopaka, a boy granted the ability to speak with marine animals, on his tribe''s island home and the undersea city of Quetzo.', 'Flipper and Lopaka follows the adventures of Lopaka, a boy granted the ability to speak with marine animals, on his tribe''s island home and the undersea city of Quetzo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRtWbh8xXEvzwnvQvdYQDpcTZLs.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:16614'),
  ('510016279602301506', 'Flipping Out', 2007, 'Reality, Family', null, null, 'Jeff Lewis, Jenni Pulos', null, 'Flipping Out is an American reality television series centered on designer Jeff Lewis in Los Angeles, California, and his entourage that consists of his project manager Jenni, housekeeper Zoila, business manager and boyfriend Gage and his other assistant and helper.', 'Flipping Out is an American reality television series centered on designer Jeff Lewis in Los Angeles, California, and his entourage that consists of his project manager Jenni, housekeeper Zoila, business manager and boyfriend Gage and his other assistant and helper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lk9XTcvn4oymQxgtdi3ktKmPXmE.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:13050'),
  ('733152282175330874', 'Flodder', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Family', 'Dick Maas', null, 'Nelly Frijda, Coen van Vrijberghe de Coningh, Stefan de Walle, Tatjana Simić, Herman Passchier, Lou Landré', null, 'The misadventures of the anti-social Flodder family living in a upscale suburban neighborhood.', 'The misadventures of the anti-social Flodder family living in a upscale suburban neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5nisBeDOlsH1MOzCcE0iqRP12l.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:22657'),
  ('665019556130084155', 'Floor Is Lava', 2020, 'Reality, Family, Kids', 'Megan McGrath, Irad Eyal', null, 'Rutledge Wood', 'TV-PG', 'Teams compete to navigate rooms flooded with lava by leaping from chairs, hanging from curtains and swinging from chandeliers.', 'Teams compete to navigate rooms flooded with lava by leaping from chairs, hanging from curtains and swinging from chandeliers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvEISymvZ9qc2cgQuhQAifYPilU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:104999'),
  ('520055240132277639', 'Florentina', 2026, 'Soap, Family', null, 'Daphne Agten', 'Joke Emmers, Inge Paulussen, Britt Hellinx, Frederik Brom, Yannick Jozefzoon, Eva Kamanda, Manou Kersting, Rob van der Auwera', null, 'Florentina: a charming woman with a lot to offer, but who has never really felt accepted. It doesn''t help that she works in her mother''s wellness and fitness empire - where a slim figure is always central - but does not meet the classic beauty ideals herself. Her life is turned upside down when her fiancé leaves her and she unexpectedly inherits a secret nightclub. But the latter turns out to be a gift from heaven. She makes new friends, she is surrounded by colorful outsiders who inspire her. She learns to love herself and a new world opens up for her. But can Florentina now also resist the expectations of her mother and the toxic family business? And will she ultimately find true love?', 'Florentina: a charming woman with a lot to offer, but who has never really felt accepted. It doesn''t help that she works in her mother''s wellness and fitness empire - where a slim figure is always central - but does not meet the classic beauty ideals herself. Her life is turned upside down when her fiancé leaves her and she unexpectedly inherits a secret nightclub. But the latter turns out to be a gift from heaven. She makes new friends, she is surrounded by colorful outsiders who inspire her. She learns to love herself and a new world opens up for her. But can Florentina now also resist the expectations of her mother and the toxic family business? And will she ultimately find true love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8siha2TPIPm9XwvzxAk12etrxY6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:290211'),
  ('1013815163058727292', 'Floribella', 2005, 'Comedy, Kids', 'Jaqueline Vargas, Patrícia Moretzsohn', null, 'Juliana Silveira, Maria Carolina Ribeiro, Suzy Rêgo, Gustavo Leão, Johnny Massaro, Letícia Colin, João Vithor Oliveira, Bruno Padilha', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9u6dFJLOhWQ9SKMRqc6O2AEU1YN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:195859'),
  ('469486319090582611', 'Florida Man', 2023, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama', 'Donald Todd', null, 'Edgar Ramírez, Abbey Lee, Otmara Marrero, Lex Scott Davis, Emory Cohen, Isaiah Johnson, Anthony LaPaglia, Lauren Buglioli', 'TV-MA', 'A disgraced cop in debt is forced to return to his home state of Florida for a shady mission only to get swept up in a wild — and deadly — treasure hunt.', 'A disgraced cop in debt is forced to return to his home state of Florida for a shady mission only to get swept up in a wild — and deadly — treasure hunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bn4qHIxbmZOC4AqlDUbgcKYld7r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123856'),
  ('889289874955129498', 'Floris', 1969, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Paul Verhoeven, Gerard Soeteman', 'Gerard Soeteman', 'Rutger Hauer, Jos Bergman', null, 'A Dutch television series about an exiled knight and his Indian friend. Together they try to get his birthright papers back from an evil Lord. During their quest, they get help from a nobleman who offers them a place in his castle. Written by Gerard Soeteman starring Rutger Hauer and Jos Bergman and directed by Paul Verhoeven.', 'A Dutch television series about an exiled knight and his Indian friend. Together they try to get his birthright papers back from an evil Lord. During their quest, they get help from a nobleman who offers them a place in his castle. Written by Gerard Soeteman starring Rutger Hauer and Jos Bergman and directed by Paul Verhoeven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUUhRBBxF3fYZEaSMvTqpt5Z4md.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1560'),
  ('743947262904414515', 'Flourished Peony', 2025, 'Drama', 'Zhang Yuan''ang, Ma Yu Xin, Jia Binbin', 'Ma Yu Xin', 'Yang Zi, Li Xian, Miles Wei, Zhang Yaqin, Tu Songyan, Guan Yue, Amelie Xu, Shen Mengchen', null, 'He Weifang, the daughter of a merchant, partners with the infamous Jiang Changyang to run a flower business, empowering women and challenging societal norms. As their bond deepens, He Weifang uncovers Jiang Changyang''s true identity and is inspired to focus on ventures that benefit the greater good.', 'He Weifang, the daughter of a merchant, partners with the infamous Jiang Changyang to run a flower business, empowering women and challenging societal norms. As their bond deepens, He Weifang uncovers Jiang Changyang''s true identity and is inspired to focus on ventures that benefit the greater good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Kuw2vKrYaw6hBAL2IE3LNtvEzU.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:243083'),
  ('86392708203816751', 'Flower and Asura', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Minori Fujidera, Miyuri Shimabukuro', null, 'The story is set in Tonakishima, a small island with a population of 600. Hana, a high school girl who lives on the island, loves recitals, and holds regular reading sessions for the island''s children. Mizuki, the president of the Broadcasting Club, senses Hana''s power to attract people through her reading and invites her to join the club. Hana joins the Broadcasting Club and experiences many firsts with the other members.', 'The story is set in Tonakishima, a small island with a population of 600. Hana, a high school girl who lives on the island, loves recitals, and holds regular reading sessions for the island''s children. Mizuki, the president of the Broadcasting Club, senses Hana''s power to attract people through her reading and invites her to join the club. Hana joins the Broadcasting Club and experiences many firsts with the other members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WUfHP1VrHKFBXbKuCDoB6hSUa9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256744'),
  ('159196228466935745', 'Flower Angel', 1979, 'Animation, Drama, Kids', null, null, 'Reiko Suzuki, Keaton Yamada, Natsuko Kawaji, Fuyumi Shiraishi, Mari Okamoto, Michie Kita, Takuzō Kamiyama, Toru Furuya', null, 'The King of the Flower Planet is dying, but his heir can''t take up the throne until the legendary Seven Color Flower, symbol of the King''s power, is found. The Angels Cateau and Noveau are sent to Earth to find the Flower Girl, a young female who descends from both humans and Flower Angels (who once inhabited Earth, long ago) - and they find Lunlun in France. They convince her to go in a long journey to find the Flower - she''ll know the good and bad sides of humans and Flower Angels (incarnated in the ambitious Togenishia and her sidekick Boris), and will fall in love with Serge Flora, a man who holds a great secret.', 'The King of the Flower Planet is dying, but his heir can''t take up the throne until the legendary Seven Color Flower, symbol of the King''s power, is found. The Angels Cateau and Noveau are sent to Earth to find the Flower Girl, a young female who descends from both humans and Flower Angels (who once inhabited Earth, long ago) - and they find Lunlun in France. They convince her to go in a long journey to find the Flower - she''ll know the good and bad sides of humans and Flower Angels (incarnated in the ambitious Togenishia and her sidekick Boris), and will fall in love with Serge Flora, a man who holds a great secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nISfuXfMTC0XTzUWdx5auLCipI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68343'),
  ('671664896772895014', 'Flower Boy Next Door', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Park Shin-hye, Yoon Shi-yoon, Kim Ji-hoon, Park Soo-jin, Kim Yoon-hye, Go Kyung-pyo, Kouki Mizuta, Kim Jung-san', 'NR', 'Go Dok Mi doesn''t spend all day dreaming about her knight in shining armor — she’s too busy spying on her neighbors who all happen to be hot, "flower-boy" types, including cartoon artist Oh Jin Rak. But when Enrique Geum, the new pretty boy next door, catches her, Dok Mi is finally forced to face the consequences - without the safety of binoculars and curtains. Will he be able to convince this “urban Rapunzel” to let her hair down? Whether you’re a lover or a fighter, this sensitive man will captivate your sensibilities.', 'Go Dok Mi doesn''t spend all day dreaming about her knight in shining armor — she’s too busy spying on her neighbors who all happen to be hot, "flower-boy" types, including cartoon artist Oh Jin Rak. But when Enrique Geum, the new pretty boy next door, catches her, Dok Mi is finally forced to face the consequences - without the safety of binoculars and curtains. Will he be able to convince this “urban Rapunzel” to let her hair down? Whether you’re a lover or a fighter, this sensitive man will captivate your sensibilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qk6EWrC0vsW8umHikq33sBDFfst.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46550'),
  ('566299447905589370', 'Flower Boy Ramen Shop', 2011, 'Comedy', null, 'Yoon Nan-joong', 'Jung Il-woo, Lee Chung-ah, Lee Ki-woo, Park Min-woo, Soo-Ho, Joo Hyun, Seo Bum-suk, Jo Yoon-woo', null, 'Yang Eun-bi is a college student preparing for her civil service exam with the dream of being a high school teacher. She accidentally encounters Cha Chi-soo, the arrogant son of the biggest food conglomerate in Korea. Both of them end up working at a ramen shop run by the lazy Choi Kang-hyuk.', 'Yang Eun-bi is a college student preparing for her civil service exam with the dream of being a high school teacher. She accidentally encounters Cha Chi-soo, the arrogant son of the biggest food conglomerate in Korea. Both of them end up working at a ramen shop run by the lazy Choi Kang-hyuk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99d5gnU6CxC2JsNeTqfUtXOm8WI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44550'),
  ('949718736323524405', 'Flower Crew: Joseon Marriage Agency', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kim Yi Rang', 'Kim Yi Rang', 'Kim Min-jae, Gong Seung-yeon, Seo Ji-hoon, Park Ji-hoon, Byeon Woo-seok, Go Won-hee, Park Ho-san, Jeong Jae-seong', 'TV-14', 'When he becomes king, Lee Soo hires the Flower Crew matchmaking agency to make a noble woman out of his first love, Gae-Ddong. Ma Hoon, Young-soo and Do Joon try to fulfill their client''s request.', 'When he becomes king, Lee Soo hires the Flower Crew matchmaking agency to make a noble woman out of his first love, Gae-Ddong. Ma Hoon, Young-soo and Do Joon try to fulfill their client''s request.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLGLRySmfI8Us6IFOfziT1cQeJF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92732'),
  ('34781623046397200', 'Flower Fairy', 2014, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yang Menglu, Huang Ying, Xia Lei, Zhu Jun, Yang Ou, Shen Dawei, Yixiao Wen', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZbAwmAHva2lfMj26n6RHfyHr5A.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:232571'),
  ('899765100789009924', 'Flower of Evil', 2020, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Yoo Jung-hee, Kim Cheol-kyu', null, 'Lee Joon-gi, Moon Chae-won, Jang Hee-jin, Seo Hyun-woo, Jung Seo-yeon, Nam Kee-ae, Son Jong-hak, Jo Kyung-sook', 'NR', 'Hiding a twisted past, a man maintains his facade as the perfect husband to his detective wife — until she begins investigating a series of murders.', 'Hiding a twisted past, a man maintains his facade as the perfect husband to his detective wife — until she begins investigating a series of murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozPDfBmsrJDFF9ZhwQNxcGLXvzm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99494'),
  ('586439436364301293', 'Flowers', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Will Sharpe', null, 'Olivia Colman, Julian Barratt, Sophia Di Martino, Daniel Rigby, Will Sharpe', 'TV-MA', 'Dark comedy about the eccentric members of the Flowers family. Maurice and Deborah are barely together but yet to divorce. They live with Maurice''s batty mother and their maladjusted twin children.', 'Dark comedy about the eccentric members of the Flowers family. Maurice and Deborah are barely together but yet to divorce. They live with Maurice''s batty mother and their maladjusted twin children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7w6t1Rj49awAOfdepo1nkCw3xGC.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66230'),
  ('122188104929537576', 'Flowers in the Attic: The Origin', 2022, 'Drama', 'Paul Sciarrotta, Amy Rardin, Conner Good', null, 'Jemima Rooper, Max Irons, Kelsey Grammer, Harry Hamlin, Kate Mulgrew, Paul Wesley, Luke Fetherston, Evelyn Miller', null, 'After a whirlwind romance, Olivia finds herself as the mistress of the imposing Foxworth Hall, where she soon discovers that the fairy tale life she expected has quickly become a nightmare.', 'After a whirlwind romance, Olivia finds herself as the mistress of the imposing Foxworth Hall, where she soon discovers that the fairy tale life she expected has quickly become a nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMbGo8zmkYngFL4M9dsbc7xrq9b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:203728'),
  ('438512818195447457', 'Flowers of Evil', 2013, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Shinichiroh Ueda, Mariya Ise, Yoko Hikasa', 'TV-MA', 'The corrupt pure-love story revolves around Kasuga Takao, a bookish boy who loves the poems of Charles Baudelaire (the original author of the poetry collection "Les Fleurs du mal" or "Flowers of Evil"). One day after school, he discovers and steals the gym clothes of Saeki Nanako, the girl he has a crush on. However, he learns that Nakamura Sawa, a girl he loathes, happens to catch him in the act. Nakamura blackmails Kasuga into a contract, or else she will reveal his secret.', 'The corrupt pure-love story revolves around Kasuga Takao, a bookish boy who loves the poems of Charles Baudelaire (the original author of the poetry collection "Les Fleurs du mal" or "Flowers of Evil"). One day after school, he discovers and steals the gym clothes of Saeki Nanako, the girl he has a crush on. However, he learns that Nakamura Sawa, a girl he loathes, happens to catch him in the act. Nakamura blackmails Kasuga into a contract, or else she will reveal his secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RsLvxekEHDVxNc12HjNTXuBDNA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:55006'),
  ('396208770334086092', 'Flowers Over The Inferno', 2023, 'Crime', 'Carlo Carlei', null, 'Giuseppe Spata, Gianluca Gobbi, Luigi Petrucci, Lorenzo Acquaviva, Elena Sofia Ricci', null, 'Teresa Battaglia sets out to track down a serial vigilante who kills to protect defenceless kids, while also dealing with her Alzheimer''s diagnosis.', 'Teresa Battaglia sets out to track down a serial vigilante who kills to protect defenceless kids, while also dealing with her Alzheimer''s diagnosis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgzzdM5Ks5HTpFy5zcByGRNNvl1.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:220485'),
  ('78054084892250194', 'Fluffy Paradise', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ai Kakuma, Genki Okawa, Taketora, Tomoaki Maeno, Kenji Nomura, Shin-ichiro Miki, Shuichiro Umeda, Haruki Iwata', 'TV-14', 'When this overworked office lady finally meets her maker, she''s reborn with an adorable ability. Midori is reincarnated in another world as a young girl, Nema, and must help decide if the humans there should continue to exist. In return, she gains the power to be loved by all nonhuman creatures. From fantasy beasts to mythical monsters, she’s free to pet any animal to her heart''s content!', 'When this overworked office lady finally meets her maker, she''s reborn with an adorable ability. Midori is reincarnated in another world as a young girl, Nema, and must help decide if the humans there should continue to exist. In return, she gains the power to be loved by all nonhuman creatures. From fantasy beasts to mythical monsters, she’s free to pet any animal to her heart''s content!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRUPoUZ1M5jGcIzlKdHpOSvRwyh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205672'),
  ('990673228039448077', 'Fly Me to the Moon', 2024, 'Drama', null, null, 'Michelle Chen Yan-Hsi, Peter Ho, Jiang Shan, Peng Guanying, Hou Yong, Lv Yi, Ni Hongjie, Ti Chih-Chieh', null, 'Deng Lijun''s journey starts from her childhood in a Taiwanese military village. Despite her father''s opposition, she balances helping him with his street vendor business and nurturing her singing talent to pursue her dream and gain recognition.', 'Deng Lijun''s journey starts from her childhood in a Taiwanese military village. Despite her father''s opposition, she balances helping him with his street vendor business and nurturing her singing talent to pursue her dream and gain recognition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBlVOA6H1mo0V4vN1wPAYiwhyqd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231990'),
  ('85326881852907204', 'Fly Tales', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Lewis Trondheim, Samuel Kaminka', 'Samuel Kaminka', 'Brigitte Lecordier', null, 'Short adventures of a ball shaped fly. The Fly would come into sticky situations but always somehow manage to escape. The theme featured The Fly flying through several commonplace areas such as the kitchen.', 'Short adventures of a ball shaped fly. The Fly would come into sticky situations but always somehow manage to escape. The theme featured The Fly flying through several commonplace areas such as the kitchen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpCIjeyiy5MGDTQEcmtwet68urF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15911'),
  ('962090202612378824', 'Flying Tiger III', 2021, 'Mystery, Crime', null, 'Louis Wong Chi Pong', 'Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Bosco Wong Chung-Chak, Ron Ng Cheuk-Hai, Joe Ma Tak-Chung, Eddie Cheung Siu-Fai, Moses Chan Ho, Roger Kwok Chun-On, Michael Wong', null, 'The terrorist organization "Waganbu" infiltrated Hong Kong and set off a battle for chemical weapons in Hong Kong. Fan Shaofeng, the commander of the Flying Tigers, was ordered to fight against the terrorists. The Flying Tigers are trapped in the ruthless killing of Wagambu, the Special Service Superintendent Zhan Bowen convenes the police elites Zhang Weihua, Zhang Jiaxuan and Gao Zile to form a secret counter-terrorism team S Team . Faced with many crises, with the assistance of Interpol Xu Junfei, the two generations of China and Youth finally put aside their grievances and feuds and joined forces to prevent the spread of the chemical weapons virus in Hong Kong.', 'The terrorist organization "Waganbu" infiltrated Hong Kong and set off a battle for chemical weapons in Hong Kong. Fan Shaofeng, the commander of the Flying Tigers, was ordered to fight against the terrorists. The Flying Tigers are trapped in the ruthless killing of Wagambu, the Special Service Superintendent Zhan Bowen convenes the police elites Zhang Weihua, Zhang Jiaxuan and Gao Zile to form a secret counter-terrorism team S Team . Faced with many crises, with the assistance of Interpol Xu Junfei, the two generations of China and Youth finally put aside their grievances and feuds and joined forces to prevent the spread of the chemical weapons virus in Hong Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pG1ThLroUznNT8HHlRENBjHbtBE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:153613'),
  ('957160533081202578', 'Flying Witch', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Minami Shinoda, Eri Suzuki, Shinsuke Sugawara, Shiori Mikami, Kana Aoi, Mari Hino, Ai Kayano, Ayane Sakura', 'TV-PG', 'Makoto Kowata is a little flighty, in multiple ways. With no sense of direction, but the ability to fly on a broom, this witch-in-training has a lot to learn; about magic, her relatives, and the world around her.', 'Makoto Kowata is a little flighty, in multiple ways. With no sense of direction, but the ability to fly on a broom, this witch-in-training has a lot to learn; about magic, her relatives, and the world around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pS6SnKZd4DDeh4yj5YKKIorxXse.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:65934'),
  ('604321674459703538', 'FM', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Oliver Lansley, Ian Curtis', null, 'Chris O''Dowd, Kevin Bishop, Nina Sosanya, Ophelia Lovibond, Oliver Lansley, O-T Fagbenle', null, 'FM is an ITV2 sitcom created and written by Ian Curtis and Oliver Lansley, and starring Chris O''Dowd, Kevin Bishop and Nina Sosanya. The series followed the lives of two DJs and their producer on their FM radio programme, Skin 86.5 FM. The series also features music from real-life artists and guest stars from the music industry.', 'FM is an ITV2 sitcom created and written by Ian Curtis and Oliver Lansley, and starring Chris O''Dowd, Kevin Bishop and Nina Sosanya. The series followed the lives of two DJs and their producer on their FM radio programme, Skin 86.5 FM. The series also features music from real-life artists and guest stars from the music industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZDmUBWa8tuPlbTlGVk1xEQiq70.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:17561'),
  ('973818602143577005', 'Fog Hill of Five Elements', 2020, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Lin Hun', null, 'Hao Xianghai, Chang Rongshan, Ye Zhiqiu, Meme Yan, Sheng Guo, Baomu Zhongyang, Liu Cong, Lin Hun', null, 'A legend tells that a long time ago, monsters could give the ability to certain elected officials to master the five elements. But for that, you have to go through the dangerous foggy mountains... We follow the adventures of one of these elected officials.', 'A legend tells that a long time ago, monsters could give the ability to certain elected officials to master the five elements. But for that, you have to go through the dangerous foggy mountains... We follow the adventures of one of these elected officials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/txl5QH4S5ZfwteAVBY4nteYxzxD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:102788'),
