  ('781871725764920234', 'Follow the Money', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jeppe Gjervig Gram, Jannik Tai Mosholt', 'Jeppe Gjervig Gram', 'Esben Smed, Thomas Hwan, Maria Rich', 'TV-14', '''Follow the Money'' is a crime drama that explores what happens to people who are corrupted by greed and ambition. The series shows viewers the complex world of economic crime that takes place in banks, the stock exchange, and in boardrooms.', '''Follow the Money'' is a crime drama that explores what happens to people who are corrupted by greed and ambition. The series shows viewers the complex world of economic crime that takes place in banks, the stock exchange, and in boardrooms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ctXttZoinJeCm44t3IVRfWOyrNb.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64726'),
  ('513195511886629288', 'Follow This', 2018, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Follow the reporters at BuzzFeed as they probe topics ranging from quirky internet crazes to safe injection spaces for opioid users.', 'Follow the reporters at BuzzFeed as they probe topics ranging from quirky internet crazes to safe injection spaces for opioid users.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmlKSwjoYuzj1ygdmfqzeZN2vQT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81852'),
  ('1016705154534321831', 'Follow Your Heart', 2024, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Luo Yunxi, Song Yi, Chen Yao, Ryan Cheng, Huang Riying, Gu Zicheng, Guan Zijing, Deng Kai', null, 'While secretly investigating a case, Jiang Xinbai, a proud prince and the head constable who suffers from face blindness, accidentally meets the unorthodox Yan Nanxing, a female doctor who changes her appearance every month. They were at odds when they met and in order to keep their respective secrets hidden, they experience "three marriages" and "three separations" together. The two eventually join hands to eliminate the scourge of Wuxiang.', 'While secretly investigating a case, Jiang Xinbai, a proud prince and the head constable who suffers from face blindness, accidentally meets the unorthodox Yan Nanxing, a female doctor who changes her appearance every month. They were at odds when they met and in order to keep their respective secrets hidden, they experience "three marriages" and "three separations" together. The two eventually join hands to eliminate the scourge of Wuxiang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijMvGty3AiJnt2bN7Y4pkadaY0y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252396'),
  ('687840489906203257', 'Followers', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mika Ninagawa', 'Yuri Kanchiku, Mika Ninagawa', 'Miki Nakatani, Elaiza Ikeda, Mari Natsuki, Yuka Itaya, Komuai, Mika Nakashima, Tadanobu Asano, Shuhei Uesugi', 'TV-MA', 'When an aspiring actress hits it big thanks to a candid Instagram post, the lives of several Tokyo women cross as they struggle to define happiness IRL.', 'When an aspiring actress hits it big thanks to a candid Instagram post, the lives of several Tokyo women cross as they struggle to define happiness IRL.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvlLzHf8GhzJ7YSlClkgg0xGcaY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98772'),
