  ('202988906286805041', 'Fred: The Show', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Lucas Cruikshank', null, 'Lucas Cruikshank, Jake Weary, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Daniella Monet, Stephanie Courtney', 'TV-G', 'Fred is back again! And this time, he''s here to stay. ''Cause now he''s got his VERY. OWN.SHOW!!! For Fred Figglehorn, every day is a new adventure. And no adventure is complete without a mess of confuddling mix-ups and mayhem. Gahhh! Good thing he''s got his pal Bertha by his side to help out when things get totally bonkers. Whether he''s stuck babysitting Grandma or busy dodging his nemesis, Kevin, Fred''s got a whole new bundle of blunders to share with everyone!', 'Fred is back again! And this time, he''s here to stay. ''Cause now he''s got his VERY. OWN.SHOW!!! For Fred Figglehorn, every day is a new adventure. And no adventure is complete without a mess of confuddling mix-ups and mayhem. Gahhh! Good thing he''s got his pal Bertha by his side to help out when things get totally bonkers. Whether he''s stuck babysitting Grandma or busy dodging his nemesis, Kevin, Fred''s got a whole new bundle of blunders to share with everyone!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tF1MUSRDTZzGmVc2UdKBTSTNP4O.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:44794'),
  ('1060002086884060431', 'Freddie', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Bruce Rasmussen, Bruce Helford, Conrad Jackson', null, 'Freddie Prinze Jr., Jacqueline Obradors, Brian Austin Green, Jenny Gago, Chloe Bridges, Mädchen Amick', 'TV-PG', 'Freddie Moreno had finally escaped from the raucous house of women with whom he grew up. Having achieved some success as head chef at a trendy Chicago restaurant, he''s ready for love and everything else that single life has to offer, including hanging out with his best friend and neighbor, Chris. Unfortunately, there''s one slight hitch: After the death of his older brother and the collapse of his sister''s marriage, goodhearted Freddie took in his impulsive sister-in-law, his pragmatic sister with her 13-year-old daughter and their irascible grandma, who refuses to speak English and only responds in Spanish – even though she understands every word. But while the members of this unconventional brood may test Freddie''s patience endlessly, they also support and take care of one another, just as they always have. Now all Freddie has to do is figure out how to maintain his thriving bachelor lifestyle in a house overflowing with estrogen.', 'Freddie Moreno had finally escaped from the raucous house of women with whom he grew up. Having achieved some success as head chef at a trendy Chicago restaurant, he''s ready for love and everything else that single life has to offer, including hanging out with his best friend and neighbor, Chris. Unfortunately, there''s one slight hitch: After the death of his older brother and the collapse of his sister''s marriage, goodhearted Freddie took in his impulsive sister-in-law, his pragmatic sister with her 13-year-old daughter and their irascible grandma, who refuses to speak English and only responds in Spanish – even though she understands every word. But while the members of this unconventional brood may test Freddie''s patience endlessly, they also support and take care of one another, just as they always have. Now all Freddie has to do is figure out how to maintain his thriving bachelor lifestyle in a house overflowing with estrogen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9bQCwHHQ58TCK24voky5ZUMZAf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204'),
  ('15089365742709414', 'Freddy''s Nightmares', 1988, 'Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Wes Craven, Jeff Freilich', null, 'Robert Englund', 'TV-14', 'The evil, sinister killer of the "Nightmare On Elm Street" movies, Freddy Krueger, hosts this show, where each week, he shows us a tale of evil and death about the lives of people who live in Springwood.', 'The evil, sinister killer of the "Nightmare On Elm Street" movies, Freddy Krueger, hosts this show, where each week, he shows us a tale of evil and death about the lives of people who live in Springwood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tISTXELQn3ZFC8mgBwEH77xKXkZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4346'),
  ('806785400240667876', 'Free 19', 2016, 'Talk', '이정환', null, 'Oh Sang-jin, Han Suk-joon, Jeon Hyun-moo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYE37cDeDyq7kLIJ8oxuEFvIWNH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111593'),
  ('727978377460086393', 'Free Agents', 2011, 'Comedy', 'John Enbom, Chris Niel', null, 'Hank Azaria, Kathryn Hahn, Anthony Stewart Head, Mo Mandel, Natasha Leggero, Al Madrigal, Joe Lo Truglio', 'TV-14', 'The trials and tribulations of finding love and companionship — the second time around. Newly divorced Alex, who is missing his kids and trying to keep himself together. Alex''s co-worker Helen thinks she has it together, but she drinks too much in order to cope with her fiance''s untimely death. It''s no surprise then when these two overworked public relations executives share an ill-fated night of passion and are forced to cope with the awkward aftermath.', 'The trials and tribulations of finding love and companionship — the second time around. Newly divorced Alex, who is missing his kids and trying to keep himself together. Alex''s co-worker Helen thinks she has it together, but she drinks too much in order to cope with her fiance''s untimely death. It''s no surprise then when these two overworked public relations executives share an ill-fated night of passion and are forced to cope with the awkward aftermath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcCnT9YoJmTSVhyCsYg3wLp7ypF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39292'),
  ('455121601935070741', 'Free Bert', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Jarrad Paul, Andrew Mogel, Bert Kreischer', 'Bert Kreischer, Andrew Mogel, Jarrad Paul', 'Bert Kreischer, Arden Myrin, Ava Ryan, Lilou Lang, Mandell Maughan, Chris Witaske, Braxton Alexander, Matthew Del Negro', 'TV-MA', 'A gloriously messy dad and his equally unfiltered family cause chaos when they try to fit in with the snobby crowd at their elite new school.', 'A gloriously messy dad and his equally unfiltered family cause chaos when they try to fit in with the snobby crowd at their elite new school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/18jsL1sUIDL3ice67KoNkq22K6m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:307534'),
