  ('627344186923113192', 'Free Rein', 2017, 'Family, Kids, Drama', 'Kirstie Falkous, Anna McCleery, Vicki Lutas', null, 'Jaylen Barron, Céline Buckens, Freddy Carter, Manpreet Bambra, Carla Woodcock, Kerry Ingram', 'TV-G', 'A 15-year-old from LA spends the summer at her mom''s childhood home on an island off the coast of England, where she bonds with a mysterious horse.', 'A 15-year-old from LA spends the summer at her mom''s childhood home on an island off the coast of England, where she bonds with a mysterious horse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3DccaRLKOiNPHnH88sxGIL943B.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:72462'),
  ('714674112272180344', 'Free!', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Nobunaga Shimazaki, Daisuke Hirakawa, Akeno Watanabe, Kenjiro Tsuda, Mamoru Miyano, Hiroshi Yanaka, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Satsuki Yukino', 'TV-PG', 'The story revolves around Haruka Nanase, a boy who has always loved to be immersed in water, and to swim in it. Before graduating from elementary school, he participated in a swimming tournament along with his fellow swimming club members, Makoto Tachibana, Nagisa Hazuki, and Rin Matsuoka. After achieving victory, each of the boys went their separate ways. Time passed, and in the middle of their uneventful high school lives Rin appears and challenges Haruka to a match, showing Haruka his overwhelming power. Not wanting it to end like this, Haruka, gathers together Makoto and Nagisa once again and brings a new member named Rei Ryugazaki to create the Iwatobi High School Swimming Club in order to defeat Rin.', 'The story revolves around Haruka Nanase, a boy who has always loved to be immersed in water, and to swim in it. Before graduating from elementary school, he participated in a swimming tournament along with his fellow swimming club members, Makoto Tachibana, Nagisa Hazuki, and Rin Matsuoka. After achieving victory, each of the boys went their separate ways. Time passed, and in the middle of their uneventful high school lives Rin appears and challenges Haruka to a match, showing Haruka his overwhelming power. Not wanting it to end like this, Haruka, gathers together Makoto and Nagisa once again and brings a new member named Rei Ryugazaki to create the Iwatobi High School Swimming Club in order to defeat Rin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izvAe9NLb2TV0OT1BaBYyjcP5Qg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61456'),
  ('1056828680517740629', 'Freedom', 2006, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Showtaro Morikubo, Kappei Yamaguchi, Seizo Kato, Takuya Kirimoto, Dai Matsumoto, Kohei Fukuhara', null, 'In the year 2267, more than 160 years after the Skyport orbital station fell to Earth and wiped out all of humanity, Eden is a thriving lunar colony home to young Takeru, who tries to make the most of the brief hiatus of freedom granted to the colony''s inhabitants between the end of compulsory education and the rite of becoming a full citizen.', 'In the year 2267, more than 160 years after the Skyport orbital station fell to Earth and wiped out all of humanity, Eden is a thriving lunar colony home to young Takeru, who tries to make the most of the brief hiatus of freedom granted to the colony''s inhabitants between the end of compulsory education and the rite of becoming a full citizen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcnG3nLJyiU6f4XQX5BvlEnfxyc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60424'),
  ('1026870398112376807', 'Freedom Fighters: The Ray', 2017, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Russell Tovey, Jason Mitchell, Dilshad Vadsaria', null, 'Reporter Raymond "Ray" Terrill is investigating a group of government scientists who are developing a weapon using light, when he is attacked with a "genetic light bomb" that ends up bestowing him with light-based super powers.', 'Reporter Raymond "Ray" Terrill is investigating a group of government scientists who are developing a weapon using light, when he is attacked with a "genetic light bomb" that ends up bestowing him with light-based super powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45sUIqQEt0XGNVMyQ9hxcdLjaq5.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:75486'),
  ('226140646486431726', 'Freeridge', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Jamie Dooner, Jamie Uyeshiro, Eddie Gonzalez', null, 'Keyla Monterroso Mejia, Bryana Salaz, Tenzing Norgay Trainor, Ciara Riley Wilson, Peggy Blow , Michael Solomon', 'TV-14', 'Four teen friends work to reverse a curse after a peculiar old box seems to bring misfortune — and more — into their lives.', 'Four teen friends work to reverse a curse after a peculiar old box seems to bring misfortune — and more — into their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14dtUdFPXmjLNNOjkYCHCNOg01d.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136394'),
  ('632714798708193884', 'Freezing', 2011, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Ami Koshimizu, Aya Uchida, Mitsuhiro Ichiki, Eri Kitamura, Akeno Watanabe, Mamiko Noto', 'TV-MA', 'Eager to follow in the footsteps of his fallen sister, Kazuya enrolls at West Genetics Academy, a training facility for buxom heroes known as Pandoras. These courageous schoolgirls are genetically-enhanced with enough sex appeal to cripple a man – and the superhuman strength to slaughter aliens by the dozen. Kazuya’s role is that of Limiter, a Pandora’s battle partner, and he quickly sets his sights on the most feared beauty in school, Satellizer el Bridget. This full-figured annihilator of aliens is as desirable as she is deadly, but rubbing her the wrong way could lead to gross bodily harm. Can Kazuya forge a bond with his new partner and rise to the top of the ranks at West Genetics? Or will he fall victim to the mysterious bloodlust lurking within Satellizer?', 'Eager to follow in the footsteps of his fallen sister, Kazuya enrolls at West Genetics Academy, a training facility for buxom heroes known as Pandoras. These courageous schoolgirls are genetically-enhanced with enough sex appeal to cripple a man – and the superhuman strength to slaughter aliens by the dozen. Kazuya’s role is that of Limiter, a Pandora’s battle partner, and he quickly sets his sights on the most feared beauty in school, Satellizer el Bridget. This full-figured annihilator of aliens is as desirable as she is deadly, but rubbing her the wrong way could lead to gross bodily harm. Can Kazuya forge a bond with his new partner and rise to the top of the ranks at West Genetics? Or will he fall victim to the mysterious bloodlust lurking within Satellizer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1jVlUUpjdSB9TjcjiFcDGL6QmA.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:38441'),
  ('155363257665971125', 'French & Saunders', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Jennifer Saunders, Dawn French', null, 'Dawn French, Jennifer Saunders', null, 'French and Saunders is a British sketch comedy television series written by and starring comic duo Dawn French and Jennifer Saunders. It is also the name by which the performers are known on the occasions when they appear elsewhere as a double act.', 'French and Saunders is a British sketch comedy television series written by and starring comic duo Dawn French and Jennifer Saunders. It is also the name by which the performers are known on the occasions when they appear elsewhere as a double act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcWD8oqasrJCqhRrscVsscp9yL7.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:905'),
  ('949385555663570594', 'Frequency', 2016, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, Mystery', 'Jeremy Carver', null, 'Peyton List, Riley Smith, Devin Kelley, Mekhi Phifer, Lenny Jacobson, Anthony Ruivivar, Daniel Bonjour, Britt McKillip', 'TV-14', 'Detective Raimy Sullivan is stunned when a voice suddenly crackles through her father’s old, long-broken ham radio – it’s Frank Sullivan, somehow transmitting over the airwaves and through the decades from 1996. Separated by twenty years, father and daughter have reunited on a frequency only they can hear, but can they rewrite the story of their lives without risking everyone they love?', 'Detective Raimy Sullivan is stunned when a voice suddenly crackles through her father’s old, long-broken ham radio – it’s Frank Sullivan, somehow transmitting over the airwaves and through the decades from 1996. Separated by twenty years, father and daughter have reunited on a frequency only they can hear, but can they rewrite the story of their lives without risking everyone they love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8A0dLBJn7JkxJpu8M7wwfLe9Kd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66894'),
