  ('519344792182066338', 'From bully to best friend', 2020, 'Reality', 'Maren Teien Rørvik', null, 'Maren Teien Rørvik', null, 'Dog trainer Maren Teien Rørvik helps the owners of six dogs with problematic behaviours.', 'Dog trainer Maren Teien Rørvik helps the owners of six dogs with problematic behaviours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pLgMnBASbfFLoP2LpqUwjyyz4iE.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:97204'),
  ('793532843372016462', 'From Bureaucrat to Villainess: Dad''s Been Reincarnated!', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kazuhiko Inoue, Mao Ichimichi, Akira Sekine, Kaito Ishikawa, Ryota Suzuki, Yuuichirou Umehara, Takuma Nagatsuka', 'TV-14', 'After being struck by a car, 52-year-old civil servant Kenzaburou Tondabayashi finds himself reincarnated as the villainess of his daughter’s favorite video game! Committed to his role as the haughty and arrogant Grace Auvergne, Kenzaburou plays out Grace’s part in the game’s story… Except his kind nature and elegant Japanese manners accidentally turn the unlikeable Grace into the most admired girl in school instead.', 'After being struck by a car, 52-year-old civil servant Kenzaburou Tondabayashi finds himself reincarnated as the villainess of his daughter’s favorite video game! Committed to his role as the haughty and arrogant Grace Auvergne, Kenzaburou plays out Grace’s part in the game’s story… Except his kind nature and elegant Japanese manners accidentally turn the unlikeable Grace into the most admired girl in school instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gkWFukI6zs2brCGvEy5ZNlfjgJp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260822'),
  ('56814437561606833', 'From Darkness', 2015, 'Crime, Drama', 'Katie Baxendale', 'Katie Baxendale', 'Anne-Marie Duff, Richard Rankin, Johnny Harris, Elina Alminas, Gerry McLaughlin, Luke Newberry, Leanne Best', null, 'The story of Claire Church, a former police officer who moves away to the remote Western Isles in an attempt to escape the past and violence that still haunts her. Soon, Claire is pulled back into an investigation she thought she long left behind, by her former lover and colleague DCI John Hind and his new DS Anthony Boyce.', 'The story of Claire Church, a former police officer who moves away to the remote Western Isles in an attempt to escape the past and violence that still haunts her. Soon, Claire is pulled back into an investigation she thought she long left behind, by her former lover and colleague DCI John Hind and his new DS Anthony Boyce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPFZcaRSfQKd1Dwjmmfalm8RcW9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63021'),
  ('193081392702716539', 'From Dusk Till Dawn: The Series', 2014, 'Crime, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Robert Rodriguez', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'D.J. Cotrona, Zane Holtz, Eiza González, Jamie Tisdale, Jesse García, Wilmer Valderrama, Brandon Soo Hoo, Madison Davenport', 'TV-14', 'The horror and crime thriller genres collide in this new original series from Robert Rodriguez, based on his cult grindhouse classic about bank-robbing brothers on the run, a lawman bent on bringing them to justice, the devout family caught in the cross-fire, and an ancient evil eager to feast on them all.', 'The horror and crime thriller genres collide in this new original series from Robert Rodriguez, based on his cult grindhouse classic about bank-robbing brothers on the run, a lawman bent on bringing them to justice, the devout family caught in the cross-fire, and an ancient evil eager to feast on them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAfTOb7lHvRlTa86jw99nM8iU3K.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:60626'),
  ('800559184746511548', 'From El Haram Street To...', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Heba Mishari Hamada', 'Huda Hussain, Ahmed Iraj, Nour Al-Ghandour, Khaled Al-Buraiki, Layla Abdullah, Lulwa Al-Mulla, Farah Al-Saraf, Mohamed Al-Ramadan', null, 'Unable to return home, a cunning wedding dancer stays back at the groom’s family home but soon gets too comfortable as she tries to gain the upper hand.', 'Unable to return home, a cunning wedding dancer stays back at the groom’s family home but soon gets too comfortable as she tries to gain the upper hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5otwc3aMkEHvO4SbUcsDIIAuFT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195504'),
  ('312677475480619270', 'From Me to You: Kimi ni Todoke', 2009, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Mamiko Noto, Daisuke Namikawa, Miyuki Sawashiro, Yuko Sanpei, Yuichi Nakamura, Mamoru Miyano', 'TV-14', 'Nicknamed "Sadako" for her spooky appearance, high schooler Sawako begins to break out of her shell when she befriends popular boy Kazehaya.', 'Nicknamed "Sadako" for her spooky appearance, high schooler Sawako begins to break out of her shell when she befriends popular boy Kazehaya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLUAZzJc6vfyE2TeY56AGGb3E5K.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:68854'),
  ('1052108803030636749', 'From Me to You: Kimi ni Todoke', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Sara Minami, Ouji Suzuka, Kaito Sakurai, Rinka Kumada, Riho Nakamura, Naho Toda, Hiroyuki Hirayama, Shohei Miura', 'TV-14', 'With her gloomy demeanor, Sawako has a hard time fitting in. But when an outgoing classmate approaches her, life takes a turn for the better.', 'With her gloomy demeanor, Sawako has a hard time fitting in. But when an outgoing classmate approaches her, life takes a turn for the better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJAoN9zQmMqZc6NdY4CPhEylp5y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:209648'),
  ('100930195875898513', 'From Now On, Showtime!', 2022, 'Comedy, Mystery', null, 'Ha Yoon-ah', 'Park Hae-jin, Jin Ki-joo, Ko Kyu-pil, Jung Jun-ho, Kim Hee-jae, Jeong Seok-yong, Jang Ha-eun, Cha Mi-kyeong', null, 'In addition to the romance between Cha Cha-woong, a magician and employer who handles and manages ghosts, and a passionate female police officer with occult powers, the characters will have to solve a case they coincidentally get swept up in by cooperating with ghosts to uncover clues.', 'In addition to the romance between Cha Cha-woong, a magician and employer who handles and manages ghosts, and a passionate female police officer with occult powers, the characters will have to solve a case they coincidentally get swept up in by cooperating with ghosts to uncover clues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IlPh7kbjNNQ0AMB7mrAQMn7Xyd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194820'),
  ('461967245502703683', 'From Old Country Bumpkin to Master Swordsman', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiroaki Hirata, Nao Toyama, Yuuki Hirose, Hinaki Yano, Hitomi Ueda, Chiwa Saito, Kaito Ishikawa, Arisa Nakada', 'TV-14', 'Beryl Gardenant, a middle-aged swordsman running a dojo in the backwaters, lives a quiet life, until Allucia, former student and Commander of the Royal Order of Knights, appears! Beryl’s life is about to change dramatically! City life. Old students. New friends and formidable foes. It’s all too much. But after years of training, he has mad skills, and he’s been dubbed “the backwater swordmaster.”', 'Beryl Gardenant, a middle-aged swordsman running a dojo in the backwaters, lives a quiet life, until Allucia, former student and Commander of the Royal Order of Knights, appears! Beryl’s life is about to change dramatically! City life. Old students. New friends and formidable foes. It’s all too much. But after years of training, he has mad skills, and he’s been dubbed “the backwater swordmaster.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujQp5egkJOkDHx4TehlgHePFcRv.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:260823'),
  ('1060980861071512134', 'From Rock Star to Killer', 2025, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Lio, Anne-Sophie Jahn, Richard Kolinka, Michelle Fines, Bernard Marc, Jérôme Bonet, Andrius Leliuga, Agnès Tassel', 'TV-MA', 'In 2003, rock singer Bertrand Cantat killed his partner, actress Marie Trintignant. This documentary revisits the case that divided a nation.', 'In 2003, rock singer Bertrand Cantat killed his partner, actress Marie Trintignant. This documentary revisits the case that divided a nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWLgbzLEpYxYuli0NvaxQsOlKEd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287131'),
  ('782582516381554449', 'From Scratch', 2022, 'Drama', 'Attica Locke', 'Jason Coffey, Attica Locke, Amy Wang', 'Zoe Saldaña, Eugenio Mastrandrea, Danielle Deadwyler, Judith Scott, Kellita Smith, Roberta Riganò, Keith David, Paride Benassai', 'TV-MA', 'An artist finds romance with a chef in Italy and embarks on a life-changing journey of love, loss, resilience and hope across cultures and continents.', 'An artist finds romance with a chef in Italy and embarks on a life-changing journey of love, loss, resilience and hope across cultures and continents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8D32MA8NlNgixnAIxVbmt9cazX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:207717'),
  ('662273834223246896', 'From the Earth to the Moon', 1998, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Tom Hanks, Brian Grazer, Ron Howard', 'Andrew Chaikin', 'Tom Hanks', 'TV-PG', 'The story of the United States'' space program, from its beginnings in 1961 to the final moon mission in 1972.', 'The story of the United States'' space program, from its beginnings in 1961 to the final moon mission in 1972.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSnYvoVT2PYWJbF0aWdUFvLqKhR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3556'),
  ('215317141072191152', 'From the New World', 2012, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Risa Taneda, Yuki Kaji, Aya Endo', 'TV-14', 'Born into a world 1000 years in our future, Saki and her friends live in utopia. Not only is their idyllic community overflowing with resources, but technology is obsolete, thanks to a magical power that grants the ability to materialize anything. However, when Saki discovers a lost artifact, the facade is shattered! Faced with a startling truth about their town, Saki and her companions face dangers they never knew existed, and their choices may change the fate of everyone.', 'Born into a world 1000 years in our future, Saki and her friends live in utopia. Not only is their idyllic community overflowing with resources, but technology is obsolete, thanks to a magical power that grants the ability to materialize anything. However, when Saki discovers a lost artifact, the facade is shattered! Faced with a startling truth about their town, Saki and her companions face dangers they never knew existed, and their choices may change the fate of everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywghUXAMWJ2uY43bPUgRCPnusJF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:53052'),
  ('1079130176435171411', 'From There to Here', 2014, 'Drama', 'Peter Bowker', null, 'Philip Glenister, Steven Mackintosh, Saskia Reeves, Bernard Hill, Morven Christie, Ben-Ryan Davies, Leon Harrop, Liz White', null, 'From There To Here is set in the aftermath of the 1996 Arndale bombing and follows Daniel Cotton, a Manchester family man who is torn between the life he wants and the life he could have.', 'From There To Here is set in the aftermath of the 1996 Arndale bombing and follows Daniel Cotton, a Manchester family man who is torn between the life he wants and the life he could have.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IglDxHghp9Yyx4cni0dy4ivVUe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61609'),
  ('824118227680297659', 'From Today, It''s My Turn!!', 1993, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Hiroyuki Nishimori', null, 'Yasunori Matsumoto, Hideyuki Hori, Ai Orikasa, Fumie Kusachi, Yusaku Yara, Masami Kikuchi, Kazuki Yao, Nobuyuki Hiyama', null, 'This story follows the adventures of Takashi and Itō. At first they are enemies but soon become friends. They are may seem like normal students, but really aren''t all that normal. They are the two known troublemakers. They get into many fights with people.', 'This story follows the adventures of Takashi and Itō. At first they are enemies but soon become friends. They are may seem like normal students, but really aren''t all that normal. They are the two known troublemakers. They get into many fights with people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pv2EZfVjEPxaVd8oHj9pO9D1AVA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66041'),
  ('449777341279298860', 'From Today, It''s My Turn!!', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Hiroyuki Nishimori', null, 'Kento Kaku, Kentaro Ito, Nana Seino, Kanna Hashimoto, Taiga Nakano, Yuma Yamoto, Yumi Wakatsuki, Nobuyuki Suzuki', null, 'Two transfer students, Takashi Mitsuhashi and Shinji Itō, tired of their boring normal life and unpopularity, decide to take their arrival at a new school as an opportunity to reinvent their image, and become delinquents. The duo set out on various misadventures to become the greatest delinquents in all Japan!', 'Two transfer students, Takashi Mitsuhashi and Shinji Itō, tired of their boring normal life and unpopularity, decide to take their arrival at a new school as an opportunity to reinvent their image, and become delinquents. The duo set out on various misadventures to become the greatest delinquents in all Japan!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQMuknQw3XMdWnYgsp3FtOktz6h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83119'),
  ('1137536728223608905', 'From Tomorrow', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Daniel Écija', null, 'Marta Hazas, Álex González, Denisse Peña, Gabriel Guevara, Ramón Barea, Pablo Derqui, Cristina Marcos, Nuria Herrero', 'TV-MA', 'Gabriela and Andrés, a doctor and a detective, must face a series of supernatural phenomena that disrupt their lives and those of their loved ones. Together, they have the opportunity to change their destinies.', 'Gabriela and Andrés, a doctor and a detective, must face a series of supernatural phenomena that disrupt their lives and those of their loved ones. Together, they have the opportunity to change their destinies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsaOWbVklGlGhMxRcRqPEi5QZIW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:249670'),
  ('285530541366504552', 'Frontier', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Peter Blackie, Rob Blackie, Brad Peyton', null, 'Jason Momoa, Landon Liboiron, Alun Armstrong, Jessica Matten, Zoe Boyle, Allan Hawco, Christian McKay, William Belleau', 'TV-MA', 'In 18th-century North America, ruthless trappers and entrepreneurs fight to wrest control of the fur trade from the mighty Hudson''s Bay Company.', 'In 18th-century North America, ruthless trappers and entrepreneurs fight to wrest control of the fur trade from the mighty Hudson''s Bay Company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhIeCeYgG4WJHNzaw2EyRpvmGX8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64555'),
  ('287744754405872726', 'Frontline', 1983, 'Documentary, News', 'David Fanning', null, 'Will Lyman', 'TV-PG', 'Since it began in 1983, Frontline has been airing public-affairs documentaries that explore a wide scope of the complex human experience. Frontline''s goal is to extend the impact of the documentary beyond its initial broadcast by serving as a catalyst for change.', 'Since it began in 1983, Frontline has been airing public-affairs documentaries that explore a wide scope of the complex human experience. Frontline''s goal is to extend the impact of the documentary beyond its initial broadcast by serving as a catalyst for change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88Rqa5oOrlEI8z0ALmDgeNWthBm.jpg', 45, 'tmdb:tv:4384'),
  ('910500254043834605', 'Frostbitten', 2023, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Anya Mirokhina', null, 'Yan Tsapnik, Svetlana Ivanova, Vladislav Konoplev, Denis Vasilev, Savely Naumov, Ярослав Заргаров, Emiliya Spivak, Daniil Spivakovskiy', null, 'Four bandits in the late nineties come to knock money out of the debtor, but accidentally fall into the cryocamera and end up in 2022. Phil, Chuck, Whizz and Massa do not immediately realize that during this time Moscow has radically changed, their lifestyle has become very outdated, and people around have a lot of unfamiliar devices and strange habits. The worst thing is that their loved ones have grown older, and now someone will have to rebuild their relationship with their son, who has become his age, and someone will have to win the heart of an already much older girlfriend. Now the four friends must find themselves in a new incomprehensible world and take revenge on their former boss, who sent them to the cryocamera.', 'Four bandits in the late nineties come to knock money out of the debtor, but accidentally fall into the cryocamera and end up in 2022. Phil, Chuck, Whizz and Massa do not immediately realize that during this time Moscow has radically changed, their lifestyle has become very outdated, and people around have a lot of unfamiliar devices and strange habits. The worst thing is that their loved ones have grown older, and now someone will have to rebuild their relationship with their son, who has become his age, and someone will have to win the heart of an already much older girlfriend. Now the four friends must find themselves in a new incomprehensible world and take revenge on their former boss, who sent them to the cryocamera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUq1IWohBFb3O6MTOMIQ8hsN8wZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:238700'),
  ('117960240159000071', 'Frozen Love', 2017, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kim Jung-hyun, Han Seon-hwa, Cha Joo-young, Kim Hee-chan, Jung Ga-ram, Han Seon-hwa, An Kil-kang, Nam Kee-ae', null, 'After being frozen for 33 years, Man Soo finds himself awake in a cold body but he has enormous love in his heart. He meets Ha Da, who has turned into a cold-hearted human being after living in the city. Now that Man Soo is awake from his slumber, he embarks on a search for his long-lost love through time while Ha Da, whom he encountered, is discovering warmth in her heart.Will either of them find love? This TV show aims to weave a beautiful story of romance to uplift viewers who are dealing with a depressed economy and dim job prospects in a harsh society of today. (Source: MBC)', 'After being frozen for 33 years, Man Soo finds himself awake in a cold body but he has enormous love in his heart. He meets Ha Da, who has turned into a cold-hearted human being after living in the city. Now that Man Soo is awake from his slumber, he embarks on a search for his long-lost love through time while Ha Da, whom he encountered, is discovering warmth in her heart.Will either of them find love? This TV show aims to weave a beautiful story of romance to uplift viewers who are dealing with a depressed economy and dim job prospects in a harsh society of today. (Source: MBC)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glfI2qdo8V80YFkeWiJYZmvZgSC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79281'),
  ('966667438043960171', 'Frozen Planet', 2011, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-PG', 'David Attenborough travels to the end of the earth, taking viewers on an extraordinary journey across the polar regions of our planet.', 'David Attenborough travels to the end of the earth, taking viewers on an extraordinary journey across the polar regions of our planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mD2SDmB4iTvWlFH1izphQ80GfKq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:8724'),
  ('966646822328428213', 'Frozen Planet II', 2022, 'Documentary, Family', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-G', 'Ten years on from the original Frozen Planet, this documentary series takes audiences back to the wildernesses of the Arctic and Antarctica and tells the complete story of the entire frozen quarter of our planet that’s locked in ice and blanketed in snow.', 'Ten years on from the original Frozen Planet, this documentary series takes audiences back to the wildernesses of the Arctic and Antarctica and tells the complete story of the entire frozen quarter of our planet that’s locked in ice and blanketed in snow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3hSdvuPfx7AXgOk7Ut1Spin6FJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116155'),
